INSERT INTO `room` VALUES (0,19,-7,-1,'The Void','  You are in a large thick void.  Its nothingness extends to the edges\nof its boundaries.  Its boundaries are nothing.  Funny how that works.\n',0,139264,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',2),
(1,9,-3,-1,'Imperia','  You are in a truly blessed place.  This is the entryway to the immortal\nworld.  There is a comfortable lounge to the east of here and a laboratory\nto the west.  The walls resonate with the combined beauty and wisdom of\nevery god who has graced this hallowed space.\n',1,174209,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(2,9,-2,-1,'Builder\'s Lounge','This lounge is small and comfortable.  This is where the builders of\nSneezyMUD can meet and discuss their craft.\n',-1,174209,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(3,0,0,0,'<c>Bump\'s House of Donuts<z>','  <r>The bloody mangled head of Bump lies here.<z>\n<g>In the far corner of the room is an impressive stack of law books,\nwhich are currently being used to display jelly donuts.  A small clock\nis hanging from the east wall.  Next to the clock is a \"<h> Illustrated\nCalendar.\"<z> <b> This room is way too cold.<z>\n',1,139593,60,0,0,0,0,0,25,10,0,'',NULL),
(4,0,0,0,'<G>A Clearing in a Small Meadow<z>','<g>Sunlight beams into the meadow from above, dancing on the yellow and orange\npetals of the wildflowers that claim a home here.  Dark shades of green mingle\nand mix all around in bunches, highlighting the subtle green hues of the grasses\nand mosses growing on the ground.  A faint splashing sound comes from the middle\nof the meadow.<z>\n',0,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,200,0,'',NULL),
(5,0,0,0,'Brutius\' Office','  Brutius\' office is kept neat as a pin.  You feel honored to be standing\nin it.  You see sports posters on the wall.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6,-17,24,-3,'The Judgement Gate','Here you stand, peering down into the depths of the void.  Behind, an angry,\nsizzling vortex of energy shifts and swirls, forming a tear in the fabric of\nreality.  Before you lies the last edge of the material plane.  The final\nstretch of space still goverened by the laws of nature as you understand them.\nYou can feel your mind slowly unravelling as you are pulled towards the edge.\nBeyond this point lies the unknown, where even gods and demons dare not go.\n',-1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(7,0,0,0,'Stargazer\'s Office','  This is a spacious room carved out of the center of a diamond.  An odd\noutside light refracts strange colors around you.  Twisting pillars of red,\ngrey and black smoke dance in the air above, bouncing off of the high ceiling.\nIts seems bizarre, but the many facets of the diamond appear to have images in\nthem.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(8,10,-3,-1,'Immortal Lounge','  This comfortable room is designed for immortal pleasures.\n',1,174721,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9,8,-3,-1,'Lab','  The lab is set up for the use of immortal-testing.  Please, don\'t let your\nmobs wander...\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(10,0,0,0,'Vasco\'s Office','This is your office and your first building project.\n',0,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,25,120,0,'',NULL),
(11,0,0,0,'Pobre\'s office','You have been granted an office for all your hard work!\nKeep it up. :)\n',0,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(12,0,0,0,'Legato\'s Wannabe Pants Party','<z>This is the epicenter of the copy-cat action.  This is where shit happens, yo.\nThis...  is where <P>shirts go wild!<z>  A disco ball hangs from the ceiling, and\nthe music is blaring.  Shirts off, party on!\n',0,139529,54,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(13,0,0,0,'The Secret Batopr Cave','  You have entered a dark and foreboding cave.  Strange noises come at you from\nall directions, your voice echoes off many distant objects.  A sense of dread\noverwhelms you.  Then you notice the video game parlor carefully hidden behind\na copse of stalactites.  On closer examination, the endless drop off with wisps\nof steam arising from it you first thought stood right before you turns out to\nbe a Jacuzzi with its lights off giving the water that bottomless sensation.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(14,0,0,0,'<P>A Cotton Candy Cloud<1>','A miasma of cottony pastels billows in the wind, obscuring the World below.  \n',0,131072,34,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(15,-17,24,-3,'Damescena\'s Garden','Flowers of all seasons bloom in abundance.  Roses climb a delicate looking\nframe, trellised to create an enclosed area.  Delicate columbines, violets,\nflowers sunny, yellow, broad and diminutive cluster thickly together.  Flox,\nlilies, creeping carpet of snow, fill the area.  The colors dazzle you,\nmingling scents of such healthy blooms inundate your senses.  A wrought iron\ngate is to the south.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(16,0,0,0,'Cavernous Underworld','You find yourself standing upon a molten island of rock amidst\nan unbearable inferno.  As you look around, waves of heat sting\nyour eyes as an ocean of magma bubbles, froths, and hisses\nrelentlessly in what surely must be the Underworld.  Large\ncolumns of molten rock tower all around, lifting off to an\ninvisible ceiling to this gigantic cavern far above.\n',1,160073,64,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(17,0,0,0,'Phenohol\'s Office','  This is Phenohol\'s office.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,9999,0,'',NULL),
(18,0,0,0,'Messiah\'s Office',' A location where empowered fantasy-oriented team members have constructive\ndialogue to achieve total quality and add dynamic value to the process of\nappreciation formation of MUDs without sacrificing customer focus.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(20,0,0,0,'Marsh\'s Marshy Swamp','As you step into this room you immediately look down at your feet which seem\nto have sunk into the mud covering the ground.  The boundaries of this room\nare defined by huge trees and though it\'s a dim atmosphere, something very\nbright catches your eye.  In the far corner an incredible diamond throne\nseems to be floating on the muck of this swampy marsh.  This must be the\nhome of your favorite goddess and swamp queen, Marsh.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(21,0,0,0,'Demo\'s Office','  This is your office and your first building project.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(22,0,0,0,'An Intersection of Space and Time','  With awe and fascination you gaze upon the scene set before you.  On all sides\nyou are surrounded by an indescribable, ethereal whiteness of serenity such\nas you have never before beheld.  Boundaries or limits on the space before you\nare unperceivable and you realize that your notion of reality has been forever\naltered.  Suddenly, you notice your heart beat sounds louder then it has before.\nSpeak softly, for this is the workshop of the heart and the mind of Tandth.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,10,100,0,'',NULL),
(23,0,0,0,'Kechara\'s Office','  You are in an exquisite boudoir.  A huge canopy bed draped in sapphire\nvelvet lies in the southeast corner, inviting you to take a nap.  A plush\nsapphire carpet covers the floor.  The walls are painted snow white.  The\nnorthern wall is completely obscured by an ornate bookcase full of novels\nand figurines.  A cherry wood desk sits against the west wall, covered with\npapers.  Above the desk hangs a beautiful painting.  The southern wall holds\na pink marble fireplace, where a fire is burning strongly, warming the room.\nLarge, overstuffed throw pillows lie here on the floor, inviting you to\nlounge on the carpet and warm yourself by the fire.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,480,0,'',NULL),
(24,0,0,0,'Dirk\'s Lounge','   What astounds you about this place is the efficient use of space and\nfabric that makes this the most relaxing place you\'ve ever seen.  Off\nin the corner is a professional looking stereo playing some James\nTaylor, while a ferret scurries under the couch along the far wall.\nA computer blinks on the desk, something about \'Mech combat...  whatever.\nA few pictures of Don Quixote line the walls, as well as a picture of\nthe cutest girl you can imagine...  maybe it\'s all part of Dirk\'s\nimagination...\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(25,0,0,0,'Matel\'s Plush Office','   You are in a dimly lit room.  You see an ornate wooden desk which has\na Hi-tech computer console with multiple monitors and lots of lights.\nYou dare not touch anything...  it appears that an elaborate security\nsystem may go off at the slightest move.\nYou see diplomas from Arizona State on the walls.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(26,0,0,0,'Cosmo\'s Vortex','   You are in a room swirling with images and sounds.  You are confused\nyet comfortable.  There is a fine mist surrounding you which highlights\nyour confusion and adds an unearthly light to everything you see.  You can\nnot put your finger on the nature or extent of your surroundings.\nHowever, you instinctively know that you are in one of the safe areas of\nthe cosmos.  After awhile, you start to pick out and temporarily recognize\nimages and sounds as they cascade around you before they disappear quickly\ninto the chaos.  If you make a great effort, you may be able to freeze and\nlook at some of these images by looking at any direction.  If you blink, the\nvista might change again.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27,0,0,0,'Dolgan\'s Workshop','  You find yourself in the middle of a large room.  <C>Racks of tools<z>\ncover the north and west walls, the south and east walls are covered with\nnumerous <C>memos and drawings<z>.  Several large <C>shapes<z> in the middle of\nthe floor are covered with <C>sheets<z>.  The air smells of sawdust and hot\nmetal.  A <C>framed photo<1> dominates the middle of the south wall, while a\n<C>large sign<1> hangs on the north wall.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28,0,0,0,'Mithros\' Lair','   You look around to discover that you are standing in a vast subterranean\ncave.  As you look upward you notice that it is impossible to see the ceiling,\nyou begin to wonder if one even exists.  To one side of the room there are\npiles of metallic coins, diamonds, and glowing swords and suits of armor.\nOne of the piles has been groomed to provide a bed for some enormous\ncreature.  Within the center of the cavern you spot a large hole in the floor\nwhich seems to be the source of the rooms <r>reddish glow<1>.  As you turn to\nlook to the other side of the room a large mithril throne catches your eye.\nThe walls of the cavern are covered with large fantastic paintings of some\nmajestic world which seem to lend a peacefulness to your soul.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(30,0,0,0,'Augusta National C.C.','A sprawling sea of green explodes into sight! Majestic views of this ancient\ngolf course rip the very air from your lungs.  As you approach the first tee\nbox you shake with fear of hitting the ball deep into the massive trees that\nline this narrow fairway.  You winch in agony as Armagedon crushes his ball\nwith a slight draw three hundred and twenty yards right down the middle for\na perfect lie.  A small covered golf cart sits quietly on the path waiting\nfor use, your caddy hands you your driver, your shot...\n',1,135873,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31,0,0,0,'Onslaught Adobe','  The burning incense makes you feel very comfortable and relaxed to be in\nthis room.  A gigantic bookcase filled with chemical journals covers the\nnorthern wall.  This room is very large and in its exact center there are\nfour large couches facing one another with a perfectly round table of\nexquisitely hand-crafted Haon-Dor Redwood between them.  A long elbow bar\nmade of obsidian runs long the east wall and the barkeep is always on duty.\nAbove the barkeep is a perfectly preserved head of the Stone Giant.  As you\npeer around the rest of the room you take notice of a heavy punching bag made\nfrom cyclops hide adjacent a thick rug used to practice grappling.  There are\nold bloodstains on the carpet that Onslaught has never bothered to get out.\n',1,196617,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,999,0,'',NULL),
(32,-18,23,-3,'<C>Dash\'s Pad<1>','  This small room is cluttered, yet comfortable.  The room radiates a\ndeep feeling of welcome and comfort.  Nearly every vertical surface in\nthe room is covered with a stunning array of posters, pictures, cards,\npapers, drawings, paintings and more.  The windows on the south wall\nlook out onto a breathtaking view.  There is a fairly small, but cozy\nlooking bed lofted high above the floor, and below it someone has hung\na comfortable looking hammock.  There is a desk near the center of the\nroom, and a fairly nice monitor and stereo setup take up most of the\nspace.  Under the desk is a bookshelf - jam packed full of books of so\nmany sizes and colors.  A scuffed pair of metallic grey rollerblades\nleans against the bed, along with a few golf clubs and a hockey stick.\nThere is an olive green bookbag hanging from one bedpost, and a large\nstained glass rose hangs in one window.  The stereo system is currently\nblasting some sort of funky Caribbean music, and the name \"Jimmy\nBuffett\" suddenly comes to mind.  There is a door to the east.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,9999,0,'',NULL),
(33,0,0,0,'The Collector\'s Room','  <c>You look around in stunned amazement, never have you seen so many artifacts.\nArmor of the finest make, surely blessed buy the gods is set upon the eastern\nwall.  Shields etched in runes of various shapes and sized are held upon the\nwestern wall.  Weapons of destruction call to you to wield them from the\nnorthern wall.  Upon the southern wall Is the largest axe you have ever seen.\nIf only these artifacts could talk, you are sure they could tell you stories\nthat would make you retch.<Z>\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(34,0,0,0,'Smyrke\'s Lavish Abode','  You nearly bump your head as you enter this marvelously decorated house.\nPictures of noble hobbits are on the west wall.  High on the wall rests a\nbeautiful jeweled and ornamented short sword, and the mantle above the red\nbrick fireplace is lined with various exotic beer steins.  The bed on the\neast wall looks soft, and extremely comfortable.  This is the home of Michelob,\nthe most notorious hobbit in all the lands.  (And if you don\'t believe it,\njust ask him.)\n',2,174269,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(35,0,0,0,'Cathedral of Trees','  This quiet, calm, open glade is enveloped by a ring of trees.  Oak,\ncherry, apple, and silver birch share in the glory of surrounding the\ngrassy area.  The sweet smell of leaves and blossoms fill the air.  In the\nshimmering moonlight, petals from the blossoms dance along the moonbeams.\nA large rock sits in the center of the glade, water bubbling up from\na spring in the center and trickling down the sides.\n',1,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(36,0,0,0,'The Shell of a Derelict Cathedral','The walls and rafters are burnt and the roof is partially collapsed.\nWhat\'s left of the pews have been  shoved to the sides and\nthe back. Facing the dais in the center to the floor is what was once the\naltar to a long forgotten deity. Now it is proscribed to life as a desk\nfor the building\'s current occupant. Hanging from the wall at the back of\nthe apse covering what must have been a grand stained glass window, is\nfloor to ceiling canvas covered in hand drawn maps and landscapes of\nstrange and exotic places.\n',0,139273,60,0,0,0,0,-1,0,360,0,'',NULL),
(37,0,0,0,'Stone\'s Abode','   As you enter this room you feel right at home.  A cozy stone <r>fireplace<1>\nin the northwest wall warms the room.  A small <c>wooden table<1> and <p>couch <1>are\nthe only furnishings.  A homemade <o>bookshelf<1> struggles to support an impressive\ncollection of alchemist journals and <p>elven scrolls<1>.  A large map portraying\nthe town and terrain of <Y>Trinsic<1> in perfect detail hangs from the west wall.\nOnly a well-traveled adventurer could appreciate the months of painstaking labor\nrequired to create such a fine piece of work.  A large alcove along the east wall\nharbors a large <G>chest made of jade<1> carved to perfection.  Above the\n<r>fireplace<1> mantle, rests the <k>Axe of the Dwarven Warlords<1>.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(38,0,0,0,'Finch\'s Haven','   Darkness.  Everywhere you look there is total and utter darkness.  There\'s\nnot a source of light to be found.  Your eyes struggle helplessly to adjust\ncausing your head to spin.  It\'s then when you realize your feet aren\'t\ntouching anything.  Everything is void.  You can\'t feel anything.  Is this\nreality? Is it a dream? How do you get out? You realize very quickly you are\nnot in control.  You\'ve become completely helpless.  No magic.  No secret door.\nNothing.  Perhaps you\'re not as significant as you thought.  This is not a place\nfor mortals and you know it.  You find yourself desperate to feel solid\nground.  Perhaps this whole ordeal will be over shortly...or perhaps it has\njust begun.\n',1,139433,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(39,0,0,0,'<o>On the Deck of a Large Ship<z>','<b>  A brisk breeze blows across this huge galleon, sending crisp salty ocean\nair into your nose.  From time to time a light spray of sea water tickles your\nskin as a larger wave hits the bow of the boat.  Two large white sails flap in\nthe winds high above you on the thick, sturdy masts.  The breeze and water help\nto reduce the effects of the bright sun above you.  The stern of this large\nboat has a door leading down into a covered area and the quarters of the\ncaptain, but you are not allowed there.  As you peer around you see vast blue\nocean all around except for a mist-shrouded, verdant island towards the bow of\nthe ship, slightly to port -- oddly enough the ship does not seem to be getting\nany closer to the island despite an apparently rapid course over the water.\n<y>A bright sun hangs in the sky.<z>\n',-1,401417,21,500,39,0,0,0,0,200,0,'',NULL),
(40,0,0,0,'Cathedral of Diamonds','  Golden rays of light bathe this hall in a nearly overwhelming pattern.  \nIn all directions a warm glow pervades.  Ornate stained-glass windows depict\nscenes of great victories allowing a million colors to bask on the tiled, \nivory floor below.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,9999,0,'',NULL),
(41,0,0,0,'Hylidan\'s Office','  This is your office and your first building project.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(42,0,0,0,'Deirdre\'s Pants Party','<z>This is the epicenter of the action.  This is where the magic happens.\nThis...  is where <P>pants go wild!<z>  A disco ball hangs from the ceiling, and\nthe music is blaring.  Party on!\n',0,139529,54,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(43,-16,23,-3,'Jesus\'s HANGout','\n      <R>Jesus Fucking Christ!<z><W>\n              ____\n             |    |\n             |    |\n    _________|    |_________\n   |                        |\n   |_________      _________|\n             |    |\n             |    |\n             |    |\n             |    |\n             |    |\n             |    |\n             |    |\n             |    |\n             |    |\n             |____|\n<z> \n',-1,408009,60,0,0,0,0,0,25,120,0,'',NULL),
(44,-17,24,-3,'<Y>Macross\'s Playpen<z>','<Y>This large yellow-mesh padded box is full of all sorts of nerdy, techno-hip\ngeek gadgets.  Only here will you find Macross, in the sanctity of his playpen,\nwith a device sticking out of his ear to boss around the rest of The World.\nAssorted kids toys are scattered here and there.  In the corner is a laptop\nthat will never close.<z>\n\n',0,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(45,-17,23,-3,'<p>A Comfortable Lounge<1>','<z>  This place has many purposes, it acts as a sort of informal meeting place, \nan area to relax, and as an anteroom to the offices here.  There are four exits,\nwooden doors to the west, south, east, and a wrought iron gate to the north.\nApparently this room is also used as a workplace, for there are various bits\nand pieces of paper scattered around, with strange equations and notes written\non them. There is a little sign on each door, and on the gate.<1>\n',0,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,25,120,0,'',NULL),
(46,0,0,0,'Moath\'s Praxeum','This dusty spellcasting chamber is lit by globes of continual light.  The\nstench of sulfur and brimstone assaults your nostrils as a strange chill\nclings to your skin.  On the floor is etched a mystic sigil.  The ceiling\nis adorned with black scorch marks.  The glow from the blast-proof walls\nindicate that they have had recent exposure to intense heat.  It seems that\nspell backfires occur a lot in this room.  It is hard to determine whether\npeople are brought here as guests or test subjects.  At the center of the\nroom lies a thick leather-bound book atop an old bookstand.  A sign hovers\nabove you as if welcoming you to this eerie abode of Moath the Dark Mage.\n',1,139305,60,0,0,0,0,0,25,120,0,'',NULL),
(47,0,0,0,'Staffa\'s Office','  This is your first building project.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,9999,0,'',NULL),
(48,0,0,0,'An Island Which Floats in the Nothing About You','  You stand upon an island that is floating in the ethereal nothing around\nyou.  In every direction the metallic churn of the sky can be seen with its\ndeep blood red highlights giving off the light from which you see.  Lightning\ncan be spotted on the horizon and the sound of rolling thunder drifts in from\nall directions.  While traversing the edge of this grand island you sneak a\npeek at the downwards plunge into oblivion.  This rather odd office belongs\nto the Immortal Mortal Lapsos.\n',1,172221,31,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(49,0,0,0,'Pappy\'s Small Burrow','  The surrounding earth opens up into a spherical room.  All of the walls are\ndraped with ivory cloth.  Above, the dry dirt is smooth except for a small\nprotruding root.  The floor is covered in a black iridescent velvet rug and a\nsmall oak desk rests along the north wall.\n',1,143689,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(50,0,0,0,'Alyria\'s Underwater Temple','  A watery shaft of sunlight seems to have found its way through the\nquiet <b>blue<z> of the ocean.  By some magical force, you find you can\nbreathe the water quite easily here.  Tall strands of <g>kelp<z> rise on\nall sides of you, waving gently in the underwater currents.  A small\n<B>blue <z>and <Y>yellow<z> fish darts quickly past your face leaving a tiny trail\nof bubbles that rise quickly to the surface which shimmers far above you.\nA great peace surrounds you as you relax in the underwater solitude.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,25,120,0,'',NULL),
(51,0,0,0,'Training Room','  You are in a sparsely furnished room.  The floor is made of polished\noak boards from the fabled Haon-Dor forest.  There are large tapestries\nhanging from each of the four walls.  Weapon racks also line the sides\nof the room.  A small table rests near the north wall with cushions\nplaced around it.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,25,120,0,'',NULL),
(53,0,0,0,'Gringar\'s Humble Office','  Before you lies the small, quaint office of Gringar.  A grand oak desk\nlies before you with a black, leather swivel chair behind it.  On the desk\nare books about anatomy, physiology, and pathology.  There is an\nanatomical poster on the wall behind the desk.  You get the feeling that\nthis fool is trying to be a doctor.  What\'s he thinking?  A large, soft\nblack leather sofa is by the east wall.  Here\'s where Gringar crashes\nafter an exam.  Above the sofa are various martial weapons.  A training\nmat lies here in front of the desk.  This is where the Grandmaster\npractices his art of being a monk.  You get the impression that he\'s not\nonly capable of breaking you in two, but he also might fix you if you\'re\nnice to him.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(54,0,0,0,'Claw\'s Office','  This is your office and your first building project.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,25,120,0,'',NULL),
(55,0,0,0,'<Y>Glint\'s <R>Blood<Y> Spattered Laboratory<1>','  This once pristine laboratory has been stained by the crude experiments of\nits current occupent.  Large puddles of semi-congealed<R> Blood<1> dot the \nfloor and metal countertops.  The operating table in the center of the room \nis so fouled with blood that the metal surface beneath isn\'t visible.  Layer \nupon layer of <G>ichor<1> has coated the tables surface.  On the northern wall \nis a <w><W>schematic<1><1> of some bizzare creature with its belly sliced open, exposing \nits internal organs.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,25,120,0,'',NULL),
(57,0,0,0,'Inside the Abandoned Owl\'s Nest','  Inside the Great Oak, this chamber seems oddly clean for an abandoned\nowl\'s nest.  Looking about, though, you realize that someone must be living\nhere.  The thick sheets of webbing that made the entrance appear abandoned\nfrom the outside are actually being used as curtains to filter out light\nand ward away bad weather.  Their silky folds ripple in an elegant dance\nas a light breeze passes through them and up a small hole in the ceiling,\nproviding ventilation.  Even so, the rich scent of oak permeates the air\nand caresses your nostrils as you take a deep breath.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,24,0,'',NULL),
(59,0,0,0,'Stark Laboratories','This is the sprawling laboratory hidden deep underneath the\nfacilities of Stark Enterprises.  You see numerous suits of\nIronman armor lining the walls, each customized for various\nenvironments and combat situations.  There are tables covered\nwith parts and various inventions in different stages of\ncompletion.  At the far south end of the hall, you see a fully\ncomputerized command station, complete with satellite linkups\nto every news organization and crime-fighting network in The\nWorld.  This is Ironman\'s home and personal headquarters,\nall are welcome within the sanctity of his domain.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(60,0,0,0,'Jacobian\'s Office','  This is your office and your first building project.\n',1,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,25,120,0,'',NULL),
(61,0,0,0,'Sidartha\'s Office','  If you\'d like to make a call, please hang up and call again.\n',1,131113,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(62,-17,22,-3,'Peel\'s Office','This is your office and your first building project.\n',0,139273,60,0,0,0,0,0,25,120,0,'',NULL),
(63,-16,22,-3,'Coral\'s Cloud','The highest cloud in The World, it is always bright and windy.  There are\nno walls of any kind, and the only ceiling available is the sky itself.  The\nhorizon extends below, almost touchable.  There is no human creation that\ncan be seen from here, except for Peel\'s Office, an unfinished construction\nto the west.\n',0,131073,60,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(64,0,0,0,'Mercury\'s Office','Just another cluttered office.  There are many things here one could\ndescribe, but why describe them?  It\'s not like people can\'t envision a\ncluttered office without naming the various and sundry items that abound.  I\nmean stacks of papers and stacks of books and folders and binders and dust...\nIs there something unique about these things that would make one want to wax\nessayist?  No.  These are just the accumulated treasures of the cluttered\noffice bearer.  Have a problem with it?  Deal, cause the office isn\'t getting\ncleaned and the clutter will remain. Edition Finite. \n',0,9,60,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(65,0,0,0,'Arutha\'s Office','  This is more like a wide open forest than an office.  Special magic has \nbeen used to create an illusiong of trees and a waterfall.  You can see\nvarious animals wandering around forraging for food, completely oblivious\nto your presense.  There is however one rather large squirrel that seems very\ninterested in you.  He scurries over to you, hands you a menu of whats on tap\nand asks for your order.  You suddenly feel thirsty.\n',1,131072,60,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(66,0,0,0,'Banished!','  Lightning tears across the empty sky with the frequency of a heartbeat.\nThe ground is barren and cracked, thirsting for any source of life.  Endless\nin all directions this place leaves you with a sense of hopelessness.\n',1,139393,60,0,0,0,0,-1,6,-1,0,'',NULL),
(67,0,0,0,'A Norwegian Fjord','  Your senses are overcome by the sound of water crashing\ndown from the cliffs above onto this small rocky island.\nThe <C>blue-green waters<z> of the ocean churn all around you.\n',1,139593,4,0,0,0,10,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(68,0,0,0,'Eliar\'s Office','This is your office. Make up something nice, use redit or edit desc to make a new description and then rsave 1 to \nsave it.  Tell Deirdre when you\'re done so she can move your new room description.\n',0,9,60,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(69,0,0,0,'Chat Room','  This room is made of smooth, black stone that emits a faint humming sound.\nYou are in The World of the gods, where even the greatest magic and\nswordsmanship can\'t dictate your fate.\n',1,141485,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(70,0,0,0,'Hell','  You are in Hell.  Yep, it\'s just like it is on TV.  It is dark, with flames\nshooting out from all over.  Of course, you hear the background noises of\ntorture, evil laughter, crying and screaming.\n',1,167409,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(71,0,0,0,'Storage','This is the storage room for holding items of people when they lose their\nlink during combat.\n',0,178685,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,200,0,'',NULL),
(72,0,0,0,'Polymorph Room','  The inactive bodies of polymorphed mages are held here.  Do not purge them.\n',1,174589,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(73,0,0,0,'Corpse Storage Room','  This is the storage room for holding corpses when the game crashes.\nCorpses will only appear when people login.\n',1,174269,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(74,0,0,0,'Nocturnal/Diurnal Room','  The inactive bodies of nocturnal and diurnal mobiles are held here.  Do\nnot purge them.\n',1,141565,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(76,0,0,0,'Quest Storage Room','  This room is to store characters that have screwed up while questing.\nA god will be with you momentarily to punish you for your foolish roleplaying\nand then let you out.  Don\'t hassle the gods, they are probably busy dealing\nwith the questers who showed intelligence.  Next time, use your brains.\n',1,175293,60,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(77,0,0,0,'Slap on the Wrist','You have been bad!  Not bad enough to warrant being thrown in Hell where you\nwould rot forever, but enough that you are being given a little time-out for\nyou to consider your crimes.  Perhaps you insulted a god, perhaps you were\ndoing something illegal, perhaps you were using shout to ask something that\nyou should have been finding out via exploration/talking to other PC\'s.\nWhatever the case, you are here now and will remain here for about 10 minutes.\n',-1,175357,60,950,100,1,0,0,0,200,0,'',NULL),
(80,0,0,0,'Ante room','You find yourself in the ante room to the immortal conference area,\nwhere you\'re arrival won\'t disturb any conferences in progress.\nThe main conference room lies to the east.\n',1,172221,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(81,0,0,0,'Immortal Conference Room','You are in the immortal conference room, a most unusual room thats\nactual size seems more determined by the number of people in the\nroom than by its physical dimensions.  The center of the room is\ndominated by a large conference table, covered with empty Mountain\nDew cans and used coffee cups.  A number of chairs line the walls,\nsomehow there always seems to an extra when you need one.  The\nante room out of the complex is to the west, a small kitchenette is\nthe east, and sub-committee rooms are to the north and south.\n',1,172221,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(82,0,0,0,'Sub-Committee Room #1','This smaller sub-committee room is designed for use by smaller\ngroups, who wish to have conversations on specific issues without\ndisturbing the main meeting.\n',1,172221,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(83,0,0,0,'Refreshment Center','Food and drink is provided here for the mortal members of the\nconference, so they don\'t have to interrupt their work and return\nto the real world just because they forgot to bring nourishment\nalong with them.\n',1,172221,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(84,0,0,0,'Sub-Committee Room #2','This smaller sub-committee room is designed for use by smaller\ngroups, who wish to have conversations on specific issues without\ndisturbing the main meeting.\n',1,172221,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(85,6,2,0,'The Business Office of the <h> Herald','  This room is the main business office of the <h> Herald, where\nwanted and classified ads are placed for the next issue of the paper.\nA large wooden counter dominates the center of the room, and separates\nthe visitors\' area from the desks of the reporters in the main part of\nthe room.  From somewhere in the back, you hear the sound of a printing\npress cranking out tomorrow\'s issue.  A door to the east leads to the\nstreet.\n',1,164029,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(86,0,0,0,'Aldric\'s Temple to Spunky','  As you look around you see sparkling marble walls covered with banners won\non the field of battle. The floor is covered in a thick grey carpet which\nmuffles any footsteps. The middle of the room is dominated by a huge oak\ndesk covered with To-Do lists. Set in the middle of the southern wall is\nan impressive fireplace with a steal mesh to stop sparks from hitting the\ncarpet. Above the fireplace, in a position of honor is the legendary weapon\nWyrmsclaw, made from the talon of a fallen silver dragon.\n',1,204809,21,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(91,0,0,0,'The Meat Locker','  Hanging from the ceiling are dozens of sides of the best Black Angus meat\nthe world has ever seen.  It is freezing in there and the freshly cut slabs\nof beef along the northern wall are still steaming.\n',1,139593,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(94,0,0,0,'Destiny\'s Crib','In this office is nothing but mass confusion. Scattered\nabout the floor are empty bottles of Amberbock and Killian\'s Irish\nRed. Just by walking in to this very office a feeling a Despair can\nbe sensed. They only sign of elegance within this dreadful room is\nthe adornment of beautiful Roses.\n',0,8201,60,0,0,0,0,0,25,120,0,'',NULL),
(99,0,0,0,'<R>Room No. 99','Well, that\'s what the <y>sign<1> said on the <R>door<1> anyway. It was strange that\nit was on the inside though. Nevermind the door. Where\'s the <C>bathroom<1>?! How do\nI get out of here? Hope that door isn\'t locked. The door with the <y>sign<1> not\nthe bathroom door. Although if the bathroom door is locked that wouldn\'t be \ngood either. Yes, that would be bad wouldn\'t it. Hey, who\'s talking to me?!?\nHello???! Why do the voices shut up when I search for their source? Where IS\nthat toilet!!? Who said that?! SHHH, he can hear us. What!?! Shut up and sit.\nThis will only take a second. Don\'t move.\n',-1,131073,60,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(100,0,0,0,'Center Square','You are in the center of a large city.  An east-west road meets with a\nnorth-south road here.  The plaza is wide and commotion surrounds you.  An\nopen doorway to the southwest seems to lead to a Tavern.\n',0,164017,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(101,1,0,0,'East King\'s Way','  This is a wide and clean street which slopes gently downwards as it runs\nto the east.  To the north is a high wall, behind which is a palace with\nhigh spires.  To the south is a fenced off park.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(102,2,0,0,'East King\'s Way','  This is a wide and clean street which slopes gently downwards as it runs\nto the east.  To the north is a high wall, behind which is a palace with\nhigh spires.  To the south is a fenced off park.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(103,3,0,0,'East King\'s Way','  This is a wide and clean street which slopes gently downwards as it runs\nto the east.  To the north is a gate in a high wall, behind which is a\npalace with high spires.  To the south, a path leads into a beautiful park.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(104,4,0,0,'East King\'s Way','  The road is level here, as it runs beside a palace\'s wall to the north,\nand a park\'s fence, to the south.  The road is extremely well kept up,\ncompared to other roads you\'ve seen.  There is a strange absence of manure.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(105,5,0,0,'East King\'s Way','  This east-west road is wide and clean.  To the north, a large palace\nhides behind a high wall.  Its spires and roof are all you can see.  To the\nsouth, a fence blocks your entrance to a flourishing park.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(106,6,0,0,'East King\'s Way','  This east-west road is wide and clean.  South of here is the wall of a\nlarge building.  An office building stands to the north.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(107,7,0,0,'East King\'s Way','  This east-west road is wide and clean.  To the north a road leading you\ninto a very nice area of city.  To the south is the Mage\'s Academy.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(108,8,0,0,'East King\'s Way','  This east-west road is wide and clean.  To the north is the entrance to the\nGrimhaven Hospital.  To the south is the entrance to the Mage\'s Academy.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(109,9,0,0,'East King\'s Way','  This east-west road is wide and clean.  It is sloping downwards as it\nextends east from here.  To the north is the Grimhaven Hospital.  To the\nsouth is the Mage\'s Academy.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(110,10,0,0,'East King\'s Way','  This east-west road is wide and clean.  It is sloping downwards as it\nextends east from here.  To the north is the Grimhaven Hospital.  To the\nsouth is the Mage\'s Academy.  You see Perimeter Road east of here.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(111,11,0,0,'Perimeter Road','  This road goes around the outer perimeter of Grimhaven, and lies between\nthe huge city walls and the city.  The walls are made of large stones held\ntogether with large amounts of mortar, and are turning gray from their age.\nIt looks impossible to scale these strong walls.  Looking westwards, you\nsee King\'s Way while east of here is one of the gates of the city.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(112,-1,0,0,'West King\'s Way','  This wide street is clean and well traveled.  To the north you see a large\nchurch, and to the south is a large building, a popular tavern apparently\nrun from this corner of the structure.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(113,-2,0,0,'West King\'s Way','  This is a wide and clean street which slopes gently downwards as it runs\nto the east.  To the north is a large church while to the south a large\nbuilding sits.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(114,-3,0,0,'West King\'s Way','  This is a wide and clean street which slopes gently downwards as it runs\nto the east.  To the north is an entrance to a large church.  To the south\nis a street that is lined with shops.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(115,-4,0,0,'West King\'s Way','  This is a wide and clean street which slopes gently downwards as it runs\nto the east.  To the north is a large church.  To the south is the side of\na building.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(116,-5,0,0,'West King\'s Way','  This is a wide and clean street which slopes gently downwards as it runs\nto the east.  To the north is a large church.  To the south is the side of\na building.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(117,-6,0,0,'West King\'s Way','  You are at the intersection of King\'s Way and Commonwealth Lane.  To your\nnortheast is a church.  To the southeast is the market district.  To the\nnorthwest is a solid looking bank, and southwest is a large fortified\nbuilding.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(118,-7,0,0,'West King\'s Way','  This is a wide and clean street which slopes gently downwards as it runs\nto the east.  To the north is the Grimhaven First Kingdom Bank.  To the\nsouth is a large, fortified building.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(119,-8,0,0,'West King\'s Way','This is a wide and clean street which slopes gently downwards as it runs\nto the east.  The wall of the casino is north while to the south is a\nfortified door leading into a large building; a sign hangs over the door.\n',-1,393216,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(120,-9,0,0,'West King\'s Way','  This is a wide and clean street which slopes gently downwards as it runs\nto the east.  To the south is a large building while north of here are the\nraucous noises associated with the Golden Treasure Casino.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(121,-10,0,0,'West King\'s Way','  You are at the west end of King\'s Way.  To the west is Perimeter Road.  To\nthe north is the wall of a casino while south is the smooth, stonework wall\nof a large fortified building.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(122,-11,0,0,'Perimeter Road','  This road goes around the outer perimeter of Grimhaven, and lies between\nthe huge city walls and the city.  The walls are made of large stones held\ntogether with large amounts of mortar, and are turning gray from their age.\nIt looks impossible to scale these strong walls.  West of here is one of\nthe gates of Grimhaven.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(123,11,1,0,'Perimeter Road','  This road goes around the outer perimeter of Grimhaven, and lies between\nthe huge city walls and the city.  The walls are made of large stones held\ntogether with large amounts of mortar, and are turning gray from their age.\nIt looks impossible to scale these strong walls.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
