(135,2,11,0,'Perimeter Road','  This road goes around the outer perimeter of Grimhaven, and lies between\nthe huge city walls and the city.  There is a small door leading into a\nlarge building to the south.  The stones on both sides of the door are\nhuge and held together by large amounts of mortar.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
