(170,0,1,0,'North Main Street','  This is a well maintained, north-south road running through a large city.\nTo the east a large palace hides behind a high wall.  Its spires and roof\nare all you can see.  To the west is a large church.  South lies the center\nof town.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(171,0,7,0,'North Main Street','  This is a well maintained, north-south road running through a large city.\nTo the east is the south-west corner of a large stone building.  To the\nwest is the side of a small home.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(172,0,8,0,'North Main Street','  This dirt road is extremely well-maintained.  To the east, large doors\nprovide entrance to a huge stone building.  Above the doors you can make\nout a sign.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(173,0,9,0,'North Main Street','The wide, north-south road you are on seems clean and well-traveled.  A\nside-street paved with wide cobblestones runs westward towards some imposing\nbuildings.  To the east lies a large stone building.\n',-1,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(174,0,10,0,'North Main Street','  This well-kept road runs northward to an intersection, and southward\ntowards the center of the city.  To the east, a large building towers above\nyou.  To the west, you can see the side of a small home.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(175,0,-1,0,'South Main Street','  This is a wide, north-south road which appears well-traveled.  To the east\nlies a large park, while to the west is an extensive marketplace.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
