(179,0,-5,0,'South Main Street','  This wide, north-south road runs between a large marketplace, to the west,\nand a beautiful park to the east.  The road really looks in rough shape here.\nThe park lies beyond a gate east of here.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(180,0,-6,0,'South Main Street','This wide, north-south road runs overlooks a beautiful park to the east.\nThe road really looks in rough shape here.  There is a grated window in the\nwall to the west.\n',-1,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
