(215,0,-13,0,'On a Path, Before a Large Gate','  This is a well-traveled path, running along the edge of a steep cliff.\nTo the west, the cliff drops off to the countryside below.  To the north, a\nlarge gate runs between two large towers on a high east-west wall.  To the\nsouth a path leads steeply downward.  A pathway follows the wall to the\neast and  west.\n',2,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(216,-1,9,0,'Briar Way','This road runs east to west through the financial district of Grimhaven.\nLarge, imposing buildings surround the area and Main Street is to the east.\n',0,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(217,-2,9,0,'Briar Way','This road runs east through the financial district of Grimhaven.\nLarge, imposing buildings surround the area and Main Street is to the\neast.\n',0,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
