(1087,0,18,-1,'Southern Entrance to the Haon-Dor Forest','You are standing just inside a large forest.  The expansive view of the\nforest reminds you of how large this forest really is!  South of you\nstands a plateau upon which the city of Grimhaven was founded.  The trail\nleads south merging into a broad road running towards Grimhaven and north\naway into the immense Haon-Dor forest.\n',0,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1088,34,-23,0,'A Dirt Path','  You are traveling along a dirt path that has many deep ruts in it.  In\nthe distance to the southeast, you think that you can make out what appears\nto be a gaping hole in the ground.  A thick white mist issues forth from the\ndistant opening.\n',16,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1089,37,-25,1,'A Dirt Path','  You are traveling along a dirt path that has many deep ruts in it.  In\nthe distance to the east, you think that you can make out what appears to\nbe a gaping hole in the ground.  A thick white mist issues forth from the\ndistant opening.\n',16,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
