(1091,39,-25,1,'A Dirt Path','  You are traveling along a dirt path that has many deep ruts in it.  In\nthe distance to the east, you think that you can make out what appears to\nbe a gaping hole in the ground.  A thick white mist issues forth from the\ndistant opening.  Another smaller trail heads off to the south.\n',16,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1092,40,-25,1,'A Dirt Path','  You are traveling along a dirt path that has many deep ruts in it.  To\nthe east, you think that you can make out what appears to be a gaping hole\nin the ground.  A thick white mist issues forth from the opening.\n',16,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1093,41,-25,1,'Outside a Large Cave','  You are standing outside of a large, gaping hole in the ground.  Darkness\nand a thick white mist seeps out, surrounding you and hindering your\nvision.  A flickering blue light dances somewhere inside the opening, just\nout of sight.  Upon close inspection of the cave opening, you notice what\nappears to be an ancient set of steps to the south, just inside the cave\nlip.  A dirt path leads off to the west.\n',16,131080,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1094,1,20,-1,'Small Path in Haon-Dor','  This is a small trail somewhere in the midst of the immense Haon-Dor forest.\nWest of here a larger trail can be seen, while to the east a small mound rises\nfrom the ground and a damp cave can be made out through the dim light\nfiltering through the overgrowth overhead.  Passage is also possible to\nthe north where the forest seems to thin ever so slightly.\n',16,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1095,0,13,-1,'Empty','',16,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1096,0,14,-1,'On a Broad Road Outside of Grimhaven','  You are just outside of the City of Grimhaven.  A huge iron gate towers\nover you to the south protecting the citizens of Grimhaven from attackers\nfrom the north.  Extending east and west as far as you can see are the\nmassive walls forming the perimeter of the city.  North of you is a broad\npaved road cutting through fields and pastures where the townfolk\'s graze\ntheir livestock.  In the distance the blue green hues of the Haon-Dor\nForest beckon and call to you promising future adventure and reminding you\nof adventures you have had in the past.\n',16,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1097,0,15,-1,'A Broad Paved Road','  You are on a broad paved road which runs north and south connecting a\ndense forest to your north and a large city to your south.  To your east\nand west are fields and pastures out of which you can hear the sounds of\nlivestock.\n',16,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1098,0,16,-1,'A Broad Paved Road','  You are on a broad paved road which runs north and south connecting a\ndense forest to your north and a large city to your south.  To your east\nand west are fields and pastures out of which you can hear the sounds of\nlivestock.\n',16,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1099,0,17,-1,'On a Broad Paved Road near a Large Forest','You are on a broad paved road which runs north and south connecting a\ndense forest to your north and a large city to your south.  To your east\nand west are fields and pastures out of which you can hear the sounds of\nlivestock.\n',0,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1100,0,41,-1,'A Rocky Trail','  You are on a dirt trail that runs north-south across the flat plains to\nthe north of the Haon-Dor Forest.  The trail itself is composed of hard\npacked dirt, studded with large rocks worn smooth by the passage of\nnumerous travelers.  An intersection lies to the south.\n',16,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1101,0,42,-1,'A Rocky Trail','  You are on a dirt trail that runs north-south across the flat plains to\nthe north of the Haon-Dor Forest.  The trail itself is composed of hard\npacked dirt, studded with large rocks worn smooth by the passage of\nnumerous travelers.  The trail bends from northeast to south here.\n',16,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1102,1,43,-1,'A Rocky Trail','  You are on a dirt trail that runs northeast-southwest across the flat\nplains to the north of the Haon-Dor Forest.  The trail itself is composed\nof hard packed dirt, studded with large rocks worn smooth by the passage of\nnumerous travelers.\n',16,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
