(1106,5,47,-1,'A Rocky Trail','  You are on a dirt trail that runs through a range of rocky hills to the\nnorth of the Haon-Dor Forest.  The trail itself is composed of hard packed\ndirt, studded with large rocks worn smooth by the passage of numerous\ntravelers.  The trail leads further into the hills to the north, and out\nonto some flat plains to the southwest.\n',16,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1107,5,48,-1,'A Rocky Trail','  You are on a dirt trail that runs through a range of rocky hills to the\nnorth of the Haon-Dor Forest.  The trail itself is composed of hard packed\ndirt, studded with large rocks worn smooth by the passage of numerous\ntravelers.  The trail leads north and south from here.\n',16,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
