(1120,26,61,-1,'A Trail Near Amber','  This hard packed dirt trail runs across the frozen terrain of the\nnorthern reaches.  To the west can be seen a wide featureless plain, while\nto the east, you can see the walls and the towers of the city of Amber in\nthe distance.  High mountains lie on the horizon to the north, and to the\nsoutheast, beyond Amber.  To the northeast you can just catch a glimpse of\nthe cold grey waters of an arctic sea.\n',16,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1121,27,61,-1,'A Trail Near Amber','  This hard packed dirt trail runs across the frozen terrain of the\nnorthern reaches.  To the west can be seen a wide featureless plain, while\nto the east, you can see the walls and the towers of the city of Amber in\nthe distance.  High mountains lie on the horizon to the north, and to the\nsoutheast, beyond Amber.  To the northeast you can just catch a glimpse of\nthe cold grey waters of an arctic sea.\n',16,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
