(1229,-61,-23,0,'Outside The Northern Gatekeep','  You are standing directly in front of the town walls of Brightmoon directly\nto the south.  The northern gatekeep stands before you, welcoming all guests\nand repelling all intruders.  The land is open for defensive purposes next to\nthe town walls, forming a path which runs east from here around the town walls.\nImmediately to the west is the Agorian Sea, the town walls extending onto a\nman-made peninsula to protect the town harbor.\n',17,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
