(1238,-54,-29,1,'Top of a Guardtower','  You are standing at the top of a large guard tower.  Various guardsman tools,\ntables, benches, and cots make this a comfortable post for the town guards.  A\nlarge set of stairs descends down the far wall to the bottom of the tower and\na doorway is in the south wall.\n',17,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
