(1288,-65,-28,0,'Brightmoon Bay','  You are floating on the surface of Brightmoon Bay.  To the east, you see\nseveral ships in dock, preparing for their next journey.  Just beyond those\nships lies the town wharf.  As your gaze falls westwards, you see a vast sea.\nIt\'s likely that without a ship and crew, you would become hopelessly lost upon\nthat sea.\n',17,139268,29,0,0,0,-1,3,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1289,-64,-28,0,'Brightmoon Bay','  You are floating on the surface of Brightmoon Bay.  Several ships are docked\nhere, preparing for their next journey.  A wharf lies to the east, while the\nexit to the sea lies westwards.\n',17,139268,28,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1290,-64,-27,0,'Brightmoon Bay','  You are floating on the surface of Brightmoon Bay.  Several ships are docked\nhere, preparing for their next journey.  A wharf lies to the east, while the\nexit to the sea lies westwards.\n',17,139268,28,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1291,-64,-29,0,'Brightmoon Bay','  You are floating on the surface of Brightmoon Bay.  Several ships are docked\nhere, preparing for their next journey.  A wharf lies to the east, while the\nexit to the sea lies to the northwest.\n',17,139268,28,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1292,-63,-28,0,'Fisherman\'s Wharf','  You stand here upon the town wharf on the Brightmoon Bay.  The smell of fish\nis present, and various boats are docked here preparing for the next leg of\ntheir journey.  While the bay itself lies to the west, the town square can be\nseen to the east and beyond that, the main gatekeep.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1293,-63,-27,0,'Fisherman\'s Wharf','  You stand here upon the town wharf on the Brightmoon Bay.  The smell of fish\nis present, and various boats are docked here preparing for the next leg of\ntheir journey.  The bay itself lies to the west, and the Brightmoon Bank lies\nto the east.  The town lies to the north.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1294,-63,-29,0,'Fisherman\'s Wharf','  You stand here upon the town wharf on the Brightmoon Bay.  The smell of fish\nis present, and various boats are docked here preparing for the next leg of\ntheir journey.  The bay itself lies to the west, and a sailing supply store\nlies to the east.  A shipping office lies to the south.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1295,-62,-27,0,'Brightmoon Bank','You stand in a bank.  There is a large sign on the wall that tells you the\nfine services that are offered here.\n',-1,174265,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,7,'',NULL),
(1296,-62,-29,0,'Jonah\'s Sailing Supplies','  This tightly packed store is stocked with all sorts of items that are\nnecessary to seafarers.  Large spools of rope rest in the center of the room,\nand various storage barrels and crates occupy the rest of the room.\n',17,174269,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1297,-62,-28,0,'Seacrest Way','  You stand here at the western end of Seacrest Way where it finishes its\njourney at the Brightmoon Bay.  Directly to the west lies the town wharf.  You\ncan see the town square to the east, and beyond that the main gatekeep.  To the\nnorth and south, are portal rooms, designed and built by the mages of the White\nTower.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1298,-62,-27,0,'Portal Room : Post Office & Bulletin Boards','This room is quite bare, having no features or decorations whatsoever.  This\nis only a transit room via a magic portal created by the White Tower to another\nplace.\n',0,174265,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1299,-62,-29,0,'Portal Room : Town Dump','This room is quite bare, having no features or decorations whatsoever.  This\nis only a transit room via a magic portal created by the White Tower to another\nplace.\n',-1,174265,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1300,-61,-28,0,'Intersection: Seacrest Way & Ocean Road','  You stand here in the middle of an intersection of two streets.  Far to\nthe north and south can keep seen two gatekeeps, each respectively housing\nthe north and south town gates.  Far the the east can be seen the town\nsquare, and just to the west a wharf and harbor.  Directly to the\nsoutheast is a large stone wall, blocking you off from the great Cathedral\nof Brightmoon.  A commodity store lies to the northeast.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1301,-56,-28,0,'Seacrest Way','  You stand on the eastern end of Seacrest Way inside the town.  To the east you\nsee a gatekeep which is the main entrance to the town.  To the west you see the\ntown square, and beyond that, Brightmoon Harbor.  A door to the south leads to\nthe general store in which you see an assortment of the more common items.  To\nthe north you see a grinder\'s shop.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1302,-57,-28,0,'Seacrest Way','  You are part way down the eastern end of Seacrest Way within the town.\nDirectly to the west is the town square, and beyond that lies Brightmoon\nHarbor.  Two offices can be seen to the north and south, and the main gatekeep\nlies towards the east.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1303,-58,-28,0,'Town Square','  You stand in the central square of the Town of Brightmoon.  The road is made\nof cobblestones, and various flora fill the area, providing a sweet aroma.  A\nroad sign stands to the side of the square, and a large marble statue of a\nunicorn rears back upon its pedestal in the center of the town square.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,14,'',NULL),
(1304,-59,-28,0,'Seacrest Way','  You stand on the western half of Seacrest Way.  Directly to the east can be\nseen the town square.  You hear a sudden burst of laughter coming from the\ntavern and inn to the north.  Directly to the south is a large stone wall,\nblocking you off from the great Cathedral of Brightmoon.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1305,-60,-28,0,'Seacrest Way','  You stand on the western half of Seacrest Way, just east of an\nintersection.  In the distance to the east, you see the town square, and to\nthe west, Brightmoon Bay.  Directly to the south is a large stone wall,\nblocking you off from the great Cathedral of Brightmoon.  To the north is a\nbusy commodity store.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1306,-55,-27,0,'Trader\'s Lane','  You stand on the northern half of Trader\'s Lane, just north of an\nintersection.  To the west lies a grinder\'s shop.  The town walls lie directly\nto the east.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1307,-55,-26,0,'Trader\'s Lane','  You stand on the northern half of Trader\'s Lane, just south of an\nintersection.  To the west lies an armory shop.  The town walls lie directly\nto the east.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1308,-55,-25,0,'Intersection: Wizard Way & Trader\'s Lane','  You stand here in the middle of an intersection of two streets.  To the\nsouthwest is an armory shop.  The town walls lie directly to the north and\neast.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1309,-56,-25,0,'Wizard Way','  You stand on the eastern end of Wizard Way, just west of an intersection.  To\nthe south lies an armory shop.  Towards the west in the distance can be seen a\nsmall white tower rising into the sky.  The town walls lie directly to the\nnorth.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1310,-57,-25,0,'Wizard Way','  You stand on the eastern end of Wizard Way, just east of an intersection.  To\nthe south lies a weapon shop.  Towards the west in the distance can be seen a\nsmall white tower rising into the sky.  The town walls lie directly to the\nnorth.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1311,-58,-25,0,'Intersection: Wizard Way & Swordman\'s Blvd','  You stand here in the middle of an intersection of two streets.  To the\nsoutheast is a weapon shop, and to the southwest is a pet store of sorts.  In\nthe distance to the south can be seen the town square.  The town walls lie\ndirectly to the north.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1312,-58,-26,0,'Swordman\'s Blvd','  You stand at the northern end of Swordman\'s Blvd, just south of an\nintersection.  To the east is a weapon shop, and to the west is a pet store of\nsorts.  Towards the south in the distance can be seen the town square.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1313,-58,-27,0,'Swordman\'s Blvd','  You stand on the northern half of Swordman\'s Blvd.  Directly to the south can\nbe seen the town square.  You hear a sudden burst of laughter coming from the\ntavern and inn to the west.  To the east lies an office.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1314,-59,-25,0,'Wizard Way','  You stand on the western end of Wizard Way, just west of an intersection.  To\nthe south lies a pet store of sorts.  A large white tower rises towards the sky\ndirectly to the southwest.  The town walls lie directly to the north.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1315,-60,-25,0,'Wizard Way','  You stand of the western end of Wizard Way, just east of an intersection.  To\nthe south lies a large white tower which stretches into the sky.  The town\nwalls lie to the north, and the northern gatekeep can be seen to the northwest.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1316,-61,-25,0,'Intersection: Wizard Way & Ocean Road','  You stand here in the middle of an intersection of two streets.  Directly to\nthe north looms a huge gatekeep, the northern entrance to the town.  To the\nsoutheast is a large white tower which stretches towards the sky.  The town\nwalls lie directly to the west.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1317,-61,-26,0,'Ocean Road','  You stand on the northern half of Ocean Road, just south of an intersection.\nTo the east lies a large white tower, which stretches towards the sky.  The\ntown walls lie to the west.  A short distance to the north, can be seen the\nnorthern gatekeep, and far to the south the southern gatekeep.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1318,-61,-27,0,'Ocean Road','  You stand on the northern half of Ocean Road, just north of an\nintersection.  To the east lies a busy commodity store.  The town walls lie\nto the west.  Far to the north can be seen the northern gatekeep, and to\nthe south the southern gatekeep.  Directly to the northeast is a large\nwhite tower which stretches into the sky.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1319,-61,-29,0,'Ocean Road','  You stand on the southern half of Ocean Road, just south of an intersection.\nDirectly to the east is a large stone wall, blocking you off from the great\nCathedral of Brightmoon.  Far to the south lies the southern gatekeep, and far\nto the north lies the northern gatekeep.  The town walls lie to the west.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1320,-61,-30,0,'Ocean Road','  You stand on the southern half of Ocean Road, just north of an intersection.\nDirectly to the east is a large stone wall, blocking you off from the great\nCathedral of Brightmoon.  Towards the south lies the southern gatekeep, and far\nto the north lies the northern gatekeep.  The town walls lie to the west.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1321,-61,-31,0,'Intersection: Oak Street & Ocean Road','  You stand here in the middle of an intersection of two streets.  Directly to\nthe northeast is a large stone wall, blocking you off from the great Cathedral\nof Brightmoon.  Directly to the south looms a huge gatekeep, holding the\nsouthern town gates.  Far to the north, you see the northern gatekeep.  The\ntown walls lie to the west.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1322,-60,-31,0,'Oak Street','  You stand on the western half of Oak Street, just east of an intersection.\nDirectly to the north is a large stone wall, blocking you off from the great\nCathedral of Brightmoon.  Towards the southwest lies the southern gatekeep.\nThe town walls lie to the south.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1323,-59,-31,0,'Oak Street','  You stand on the western half of Oak Street, just west of an intersection.\nDirectly to the north is a large stone wall, blocking you off from the great\nCathedral of Brightmoon.  The town walls lie to the south.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1324,-58,-31,0,'Intersection: Oak Street & Swordman\'s Blvd','  You stand in an intersection of two streets here.  Directly to the northwest\nis a large stone wall, blocking you off from the great Cathedral of Brightmoon.\nTo the northeast the aroma of finely baked bread catches your attention from a\nbakery.  The town walls lie directly to the south.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1325,-58,-30,0,'Swordman\'s Blvd','  You stand in the middle of the southern half of Swordman\'s Blvd.  Directly to\nthe west is a large stone wall, blocking you off from the great Cathedral of\nBrightmoon.  To the east the aroma of finely baked bread catches your attention\nfrom a bakery.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1326,-58,-29,0,'Swordman\'s Blvd','  You stand on Swordman\'s Blvd.  just south of the town square.  Directly to the\nwest is a large stone wall, blocking you off from the great Cathedral of\nBrightmoon.  There is an office to the east.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1327,-57,-31,0,'Oak Street','  You stand upon the eastern half of Oak Street, just east of an intersection.\nTo the north the aroma of finely baked bread catches your attention from a\nbakery.  The town walls lie directly to the south.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1328,-56,-31,0,'Oak Street','  You stand upon the eastern half of Oak Street, just west of an intersection.\nTo the north you can hear the clanging of a hammer on an anvil.  The town walls\nlie directly to the south.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1329,-55,-31,0,'Intersection: Oak Street & Trader\'s Lane','  You stand in the middle of an intersection of two streets.  To the northwest\nyou can hear the clanging of a hammer on an anvil.  The town walls lie directly\nto the south and east.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1330,-55,-30,0,'Trader\'s Lane','  You stand of the southern half of Trader\'s Lane.  To the west you can hear\nthe clanging of a hammer on an anvil.  The town walls lie directly to the east.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1331,-55,-29,0,'Trader\'s Lane','  You stand on the southern half of Trader\'s Lane, just south of an\nintersection.  To the west lies a general store in which you see an assortment\nof the more common items.  The town walls lie directly to the east.\n',17,139264,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1332,-59,-27,0,'Entrance to the Brightlaughter Tavern & Inn','  You have entered the greeting area of the Brightlaughter Tavern and Inn.  As\nyou look around, the place seems very warmly decorated, with a sense of\nsecurity in the air.  Various armchairs and benches fill the room, and you can\nfeel the plush carpet under your feet.  A large set of stairs climb the far wall\nto the Inn itself.\n',17,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1333,-59,-27,1,'The Brightlaughter Inn','  You stand at the front desk of the Inn.  The room itself is decorated in the\nsame manner as the greeting room; warm and secure.  You can see a long hallway\nof doors, apparently the rooms of the Inn, where many a traveler have rested\ntheir tired bones.\n',17,172221,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1334,-59,-26,0,'The Brightlaughter Tavern','This is the main tavern area, with hard wooden benches and tables throughout\nthe room.  The scent of strong drink and merry spirits fill the air, and the\nfireplace warms your chilled bones.\n',-1,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1335,-60,-27,0,'The Brightlaughter Tavern','  This is the main tavern area, with hard wooden benches and tables throughout\nthe room.  The scent of strong drink and merry spirits fill the air, and the\nfireplace warms your chilled bones.\n',17,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1336,-60,-26,0,'The Brightlaughter Tavern','  This is the main tavern area, with hard wooden benches and tables throughout\nthe room.  The scent of strong drink and merry spirits fill the air, and the\nfireplace warms your chilled bones.\n',17,166077,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1337,-59,-29,0,'Cathedral Yards','  You stand in a large grassy field of the great Cathedral of Brightmoon.  The\nCathedral itself lies up a set of stairs to the southwest.  To the south is a\nfence enclosing yet another smaller yard, and this yard stretches to the west.\nA gate leads to the town square to the northeast.\n',17,139268,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1338,-57,-27,0,'Mayor\'s Office','  This is a finely decorated office, with many official looking things\nthroughout the room.  Various bookshelves filled with books, and pictures hang\nfrom the walls.  In the back corner of the room rests a large oaken desk,\ncluttered with papers relating to official town business.\n',17,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1339,-57,-29,0,'Proctor\'s Office','  This is the office of the Proctor of Brightmoon.  Well organized and neatly\nkept, it is the central headquarters of law and order in the town as well as\nthe surrounding area.  You notice one particularly large desk in the corner of\nthe room, probably the Proctor\'s desk.\n',17,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1340,-56,-29,0,'Brightmoon Jail','  You stand in a short, tiled hallway.  The walls are almost featureless, and\nthe only thing of note are three jail cells.  Signs hang over the cells\nrespectively engraved with numbers.  Cell one is north, cell two is south, and\ncell three is east.  Each cell also has a small window labeled with the\nappropriate number.\n',17,141484,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1341,-56,-28,0,'A Jail Cell','  You are in a jail cell of the Brightmoon Jail, maintained by the Proctor of\nBrightmoon.  Unless you\'re a visitor, you\'re gonna be here for a while.\n',17,141484,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1342,-56,-30,0,'A Jail Cell','  You are in a jail cell of the Brightmoon Jail, maintained by the Proctor of\nBrightmoon.  Unless you\'re a visitor, you\'re gonna be here for a while.\n',17,141484,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1343,-55,-29,0,'A Jail Cell','  You are in a jail cell of the Brightmoon Jail, maintained by the Proctor of\nBrightmoon.  Unless you\'re a visitor, you\'re gonna be here for a while.\n',17,141484,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1344,-57,-30,0,'Pompo\'s Fine Pastries','  You stand inside a bakery shop filled with the sweet smell of freshly baked\npastries.  You mouth begins to water at the sight of the fine food contained\nwithin glass shelves within the counter and on the walls.\n',17,174269,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1345,-56,-30,0,'Brombur\'s Repairshop','  You have entered a hot, steamy shop with an impressive collection of tools\nhanging from the walls.  Behind the main counter, you hear the heavy hammering\nof an anvil diligently at work.\n',17,174269,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1346,-56,-29,0,'Shookran\'s General Store','  You have entered a store filled with general wares and items one would use\nfor everyday needs.  In one corner rest several large storage barrels, and the\nshelves on the walls are filled to the brim.\n',17,174269,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1347,-56,-27,0,'Ylorin\'s Weapons Sharpening','  You stand inside a shop filled with display cases of extremely sharp\ninstruments and tools of destruction.  Large swords hang from the walls, their\nsharp blades gleaming in the light.  Behind the counter in the back room can be\nseen a grinding wheel among other tools, hard at work.\n',17,174269,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1348,-59,-30,0,'A Quiet Garden','  This is a small quiet garden just adjacent to the Cathedral, and protected by\na fence to the north.  A small chapel can be seen to the west.\n',17,139264,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1349,-60,-30,0,'A Small Chapel','  You have entered a small quiet chapel.  A single pew rests before a shrine\nwhich contains a miniature statue of a magnificent unicorn; its long gold gilded\nhorn spiraling upwards.\n',17,174269,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1350,-60,-29,0,'Cathedral Yards','  You stand in a large grassy field of the great Cathedral of Brightmoon.  To\nthe south is a doorway leading to the Cathedral Infirmary, where the wounded may\nbe healed.\n',17,139264,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1351,-60,-30,0,'Infirmary Waiting Room','  You stand in a large waiting room for the Cathedral Infirmary.  There is a\nsmall desk in the corner, stacked with forms.\n',17,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1352,-59,-30,0,'The Cathedral Emergency Room','  This is the Cathedral Infirmary emergency room.\n',17,172216,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1353,-61,-30,0,'The Cathedral Infirmary','  This is the main area of the Cathedral Infirmary.  You can rest here and heal\nyourself.\n',17,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,19,'',NULL),
(1354,-60,-30,0,'Entrance to the Cathedral of Brightmoon','  You have entered the great Cathedral of Brightmoon.  As you look around, you\ngather this place has been in existence for quite some time.  Beautiful stained\nglass windows line the walls, and rows upon rows of pews fill the entire place.\nAlong an aisle to the southwest, you see the main altar.\n',17,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1355,-61,-31,0,'Main Aisle','  You stand halfway down the main aisle of the Cathedral at this point.  You are\nsurrounded on all sides by pews.\n',17,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1356,-61,-29,0,'Pews','  You can sit here and pray quietly, or just meditate.\n',17,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1357,-59,-31,0,'Pews','  Many scorched pews slightly crackle from a recent explosion.  Blackened\nsoot blankets the floor and walls, though the ceiling remains untouched.\nIt appears that the explosion was a mild one, perhaps it\'s a mark to\nwarn those that a fire mage dwells here.\n',17,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1358,-62,-30,0,'Pews','  You can sit here and pray quietly, or just meditate.\n',17,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1359,-60,-32,0,'Pews','  You can sit here and pray quietly, or just meditate.\n',17,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1360,-62,-32,0,'Cathedral Altar','  You stand at the main altar of the great Cathedral of Brightmoon.  The altar\nitself is made up of pure marble, with a golden unicorn engraved upon its\nfront.  A large chair also sits behind the altar, for use by the priest during\nservices.  The sacristy lies to the northwest and there is a small alcove\nto the southwest.\n',17,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1361,-63,-31,0,'Cathedral Sacristy','  You have entered the Cathedral Sacristy.  Various closets fill the room,\nfilled with various wardrobes and garments required in the performance of\nservices by the priests here in the Cathedral.\n',17,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1362,-56,-26,0,'Hourne\'s Fine Armors','  You stand within a roomy shop which contains a varied array of every common\narmor imaginable.  Armor hangs from the walls in convenient groupings of type,\nstyle, and size.  Behind the counter is a back room from which you hear a hammer\nand anvil, probably resizing a piece of armor for the latest customer.\n',17,174269,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1363,-57,-26,0,'Zephyr\'s Weapons of Destruction','  You have entered a large shop which contains an assortment of fine\nweapons of every make and model.  A few you don\'t even recognize hang\naround, piquing your curiosity.  Behind the counter in the back room can\nbe heard a hammer and anvil, probably busy forging yet another weapon.\nYou hear the signs of another shop above you.\n',17,174269,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1364,-59,-26,0,'Huma\'s Beastiary','This large room has various heads of stuffed animals hanging from the walls\nin an impressive display.  You see a large sign on the wall.\n',0,174269,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1365,-60,-26,0,'Bottom of The White Tower','  This finely decorated room seems to be the property of some local mage\'s\nguild.  Various artworks of unrecognizable origins hang on the walls, some\nseeming not of this world.  A large set of stairs ascend the far wall to the\ntop of the tower.\n',17,174269,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1366,-60,-26,1,'Top of The White Tower','  This room seems like a mage\'s guild supply room.  It is well stocked with\nshelves, books, bottles, potion, reagents, and every other item even remotely\nrelated to the practice of magic.\n',17,174269,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1367,-57,-26,1,'Aaron\'s Hunting Supplies','  You have entered a large hunting supply store which houses all the tools of\nthe trade.  Large stuffed animal and monster heads hang from the various walls,\nin an orderly display of trophies.  There is another shop below you.\n',17,174269,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1368,-49,-29,0,'Gladiator\'s Path','  You stand here in the middle of Gladiator\'s Path, which leads to the south\ntowards the Arena of Brightmoon.  Large fields of grain block both sides of the\nroad and prevent any movement to the east or west.\n',17,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1369,-49,-30,0,'Gladiator\'s Path','  You stand in the middle of Gladiator\'s Path where it begins to bend to the\nsouthwest.  In that direction, you can see clearly the walls of the Arena of\nBrightmoon.  In the distance to the north can vaguely be seen the Great Western\nCrossroads.  To the southeast, Norman\'s Road continues.\n',17,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1370,-50,-31,0,'Gladiator\'s Path','  You are standing at the southernmost end of Gladiator\'s Path.  Standing before\nyou are the large walls of the Arena of Brightmoon as they rise up into the\nsky.  From within its walls, you can hear the sounds of combat.  A large sign\nof warning is posted on the wall next to the arena door.\n',17,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1371,-50,-32,0,'The Arena','  You stand upon a large dirt field which seems surprisingly clean.  As you look\naround, you seem to be within a large arena, completely surrounded by spectator\nstands.  You can hear the sounds of combat in the distance, and see various\nwarriors and gladiators either dueling to settle differences, or just sparring\nfor practice.\n',17,161956,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1372,-51,-32,0,'The Arena','  You stand upon a large dirt field which seems surprisingly clean.  As you look\naround, you seem to be within a large arena, completely surrounded by spectator\nstands.  You can hear the sounds of combat in the distance, and see various\nwarriors and gladiators either dueling to settle differences, or just sparring\nfor practice.\n',17,161956,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
