(1379,-49,-34,0,'The Arena','  You stand upon a large dirt field which seems surprisingly clean.  As you look\naround, you seem to be within a large arena, completely surrounded by spectator\nstands.  You can hear the sounds of combat in the distance, and see various\nwarriors and gladiators either dueling to settle differences, or just sparring\nfor practice.\n',17,161956,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1380,-50,-35,0,'The Arena Locker Room','  You have entered a room where combatants in the arena can come to suit up and\nprepare for the days battles.  Minor first aid is also administered here, and\nfor serious injuries, one can be rushed to the infirmary in Brightmoon.  You\nsee a door to the south and a doorway to the east leading to a second\narena pit.\n',17,174269,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1381,-48,-28,0,'Seacrest Way','  You are standing upon Seacrest Way just east of the Great Western Crossroads.\nLarge fields of grain along the sides of the road block passage to either the\nnorth or south.  Far to the east can be seen a large mountain range rising in\nthe distance.\n',17,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1382,-49,-27,0,'Norman\'s Road','  You stand on the beginning of Norman\'s Road, as it winds its way northwards\ninto the northern wilderness.  Fields of grain block your movement to either\nthe east or west along both sides of the road.  Directly to the south can be\nseen the Great Western Crossroads.\n',17,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1383,-61,-22,0,'Northern Coastal Highway','A large highway begins here, following the coast of the Agorian Sea\nnorthwards into the northern wilderness.  Large fields of grain block all\npassage to the east, while the sea itself blocks the west.  Directly to the\nsouth lies the northern gatekeep of the Town of Brightmoon.\n',-1,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1384,-61,-34,0,'Southern Coastal Highway','  A large highway begins here, following the coast of the Agorian Sea\nsouthward into the southern wilderness.  Large fields of grain block all\npassage to the east, while the sea itself blocks the west.  Directly to the\nnorth lies the southern gatekeep of the Town of Brightmoon.\n',17,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1385,0,0,0,'Brightmoon Town Dump','You have entered some pocket of existence in an unknown dimension.  Where\nthere should be walls, you only see eternal blackness.  Although you see no\nvisible light source, the room is lit as bright as full sunlight.  The floor\nitself is clean and bare.  Being the town dump, you wonder what would happen if\nyou dropped something here......\n',-1,175289,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1386,0,0,0,'A Large Marble Room','You have entered a large marble room.  The walls and floors are completely\nsmooth, and have no interesting features whatsoever.  Although you can\'t see any\nvisible light source, the room is lit as bright as day.  Three archways lead to\nthe west, north, and east.\n',0,174265,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1387,0,0,0,'The Brotherhood of Galek\'s Board Room','  Stately marble columns sit in each corner of this immaculate alcove.\nKept clean and organized, the Brotherhood uses this room as a center\nof communication.\n',17,174269,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1388,0,0,0,'Brightmoon Branch Post Office','  This is your typical post office.  You see many letters strewn around the\nroom.  A garbage pail full of discarded retail flyers sits in a corner.\n',17,174269,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1389,0,0,0,'The Board Room','  This room serves only one purpose : the reading and writing of messages on \nthe mortal board of <h>.\n',17,174269,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1390,-62,-31,0,'Priest\'s Study','  This is the study for all of the priests in Brightmoon.  There are tomes\nscattered throughout the room.\n',17,139273,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1391,-59,-25,0,'The Brotherhood Meeting Room','  This room is somewhat of a secret in Brightmoon.  All the thieves of good\nalignment know of it, but not many others.  Here, the thieves help each other\nlearn the trade to aid the cause of good.\n',17,174269,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1392,-49,-35,0,'Monk\'s Study','  This study is warm and inviting.  It feels as though it is invested\nwith all the greatness of every monk who has ever lived.\n',17,174268,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1393,-60,-27,0,'Katherine\'s Commodities','  You stand just inside of the well-stocked commodities shop of Brightmoon,\nowned and operated by the lovely Katherine.  The walls are lined with shelves\nthat offer you a glimpse of what is traded here.  The shop itself is very\ntidy, and almost plain.  It appears that Katherine does quite an ample job of\nsupplying the local craftsmen with the materials they need.\n',17,174269,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1394,-63,-33,0,'In a Small Alcove','  This is a cool room packed with useless gear of all kinds.  Paddles and\npoles for barges, boxes and rusty mining tools, heaps of iron manacles\nlay scattered here.  Small wooden notches used to hang fresh linen crumble\nfrom the passing of time.\n',17,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1395,-63,-30,0,'Brightmoon Shipping Office','  This building houses the Brightmoon office of Cobra Shipping Ltd.,\nthe largest organized shipping firm in all the realms.  The shipping\noffice is in a state of constant turmoil, with people coming and\ngoing at all hours of the day or night, both to drop off things for\nshipment to another city or to pick up merchandise which arrived on\nthe latest caravan.  The room itself is tastefully done in light\nwood paneling, with a hard stone floor.  A large counter in the\ncenter of the room serves as a drop off and pick up point for\nmerchandise.\n',6,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1396,-50,26,0,'The Forge of Fistandantilus','  You are in the forge of Fistandantilus.  It is a one room building with a\npallet on the floor where the Blacksmith sleeps.  However, this is not\nfrom hardship but from love.  Forging weapons and armor is his only love\nas can be seen by the pictures of armor types and weapons cluttering every\nwall and table top.  You sense the good magic emanating from the forge\nalong with a special warmth that protects against the cold evil world\noutside.\n',17,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(1397,0,0,0,'Huma\'s Pet Room','Huma appears to take good care of his stock of pets as the pet room is\nquite nice and tidy.  Different make shift toys lie scattered about as\nthe various pets mingle and rest around the room.  Large bowls of food\nand water are well stocked and placed neatly against the far wall.\n',-1,174331,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1398,-62,-27,0,'Brightmoon Tax Office','This somber room serves as the office of the Royal tax collector, where all\ntaxes are received and tallied.\n',-1,174265,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(1399,-60,-25,0,'Magical Nexus','The translucent walls facilitate the flow of mana and the loa into the nexus, causing the air to give off an aura of blue. The floor is littered with parchments, quills and flasks, portraying a state of disregard for material value, as well as a hurried focus on the terrible purpose of the task at hand. This sacred place has been endowed with power by Elyon for the preparation for the destruction of the forces of evil. The power courses through the sorcerer, and into the scrolls and potions that he offers up to Galek fighters.\n',0,174269,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(1400,69,-33,0,'A Small Dirt Trail','  This is a small dirt trail somewhere in the midst of the sprawling\nexpanse of veldt you find yourself in.  Loose dirt and a few stones mark\nthis rather unremarkable path as it leads off into the grasslands.  A soft\nwind sweeps across the plains, bringing with it the faint aroma of dried\ngrass to your nostrils.\n',51,131076,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1401,68,-32,0,'A Small Dirt Trail','  This is a small dirt trail somewhere northeast of a sprawling expanse of\nveldt.  Loose dirt and a few stones mark this rather unremarkable path as\nit leads off to the west and southeast.  A soft wind sweeps in from the\ngrasslands to the south, bringing with it the faint aroma of dried grass to\nyour nostrils.\n',51,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1402,67,-32,0,'A Small Dirt Trail','  This is a small dirt trail somewhere northeast of a sprawling expanse of\nveldt.  Loose dirt and a few stones mark this rather unremarkable path as\nit leads off to the west and southeast.  A soft wind sweeps in from the\ngrasslands to the south, bringing with it the faint aroma of dried grass to\nyour nostrils.\n',51,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
