(1405,64,-31,0,'A Small Dirt Trail','  This is a small dirt trail somewhere in the middle of the wilderness.\nLoose dirt and a few random stones mark this rather unremarkable path.\nGrasslands surround you to the north and south.\n',51,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1406,63,-31,0,'A Small Dirt Trail','  This is a small dirt trail somewhere in the middle of the wilderness.\nLoose dirt and a few random stones mark this rather unremarkable path.\nGrasslands surround you to the north and south.\n',51,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1407,62,-31,0,'A Small Dirt Trail','  This is a small dirt trail somewhere in the middle of the wilderness.\nLoose dirt and a few random stones mark this rather unremarkable path.\nGrasslands surround you to the north and south.\n',51,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1408,61,-30,0,'A Small Dirt Trail','  This is a small dirt trail somewhere in the middle of the wilderness.\nLoose dirt and a few random stones mark this rather unremarkable path.\nGrasslands surround you to the north and south.\n',51,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1409,60,-30,0,'A Small Dirt Trail','  This is a small dirt trail somewhere in the middle of the wilderness.\nLoose dirt and a few random stones mark this rather unremarkable path.\nGrasslands surround you to the north and south. A large rock looks to\nhave been moved around recently.\n',51,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1410,59,-30,0,'A Small Dirt Trail','  This is a small dirt trail somewhere in the middle of the wilderness.\nLoose dirt and a few random stones mark this rather unremarkable path.\nGrasslands surround you to the north and south.\n',51,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1411,58,-30,0,'A Bend in the Trail','  This is a small dirt trail somewhere in the middle of the wilderness.\nLoose dirt and a few random stones mark this rather unremarkable path.\nGrasslands surround you to the north and south, and in the distance to the\nwest, you can see a forest.\n',51,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1412,57,-29,0,'A Bend in the Trail','  This is a small dirt trail somewhere in the middle of the wilderness.\nLoose dirt and a few random stones mark this rather unremarkable path.\nGrasslands surround you to the north and south, and in the distance to the\nwest, you can see a forest.\n',51,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1413,56,-29,0,'A Small Dirt Trail','  This is a small dirt trail somewhere in the middle of the wilderness.\nLoose dirt and a few random stones mark this rather unremarkable path.\nGrasslands surround you to the north and south, and in the distance to the\nwest, you can see a forest.\n',51,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1414,55,-29,0,'A Small Dirt Trail','  This is a small dirt trail somewhere in the middle of the wilderness.\nLoose dirt and a few random stones mark this rather unremarkable path.\nGrasslands surround you to the north and south, and in the distance to the\nwest, you can see a forest.\n',51,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1415,54,-29,0,'A Bend in the Trail','  The dirt trail bends a bit here, curving to the northwest and east.\nLoose dirt and a few stones mark this rather unremarkable path.  Visible\nin the distance to the west is a tall mountain with what appears to be\na gleaming metallic dome at its base.\n',51,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1416,53,-28,0,'A Small Dirt Trail','  This is a small dirt trail somewhere in the middle of the wilderness.\nLoose dirt and a few random stones mark this rather unremarkable path.\nNearby to the west lies a forested area and you spot what looks like\na gleaming hulk of metal beyond the woodlands.\n',51,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1417,52,-27,0,'A Small Dirt Trail','  This is a small dirt trail somewhere in the middle of the wilderness.\nLoose dirt and a few random stones mark this rather unremarkable path.\nSome sort of scorched furrow of earth lies to the southwest and it appears\nto stretch all the way to the base of a gleaming metal dome even further in\nthe distance.  A heavily wooded area lies to the west.\n',51,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1418,52,-26,0,'A Dirt Trail','  This is a small dirt trail somewhere in the middle of the wilderness.\nLoose dirt and a few random stones mark this rather unremarkable path.\nA heavily wooded area lies to the west.  Visible above the treetops is\na mountain looming in the distance to the southwest.\n',51,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1419,52,-25,0,'A Widening Dirt Trail','  The trail here widens as it runs to the northwest and narrows somewhat\nto the south.  Loose dirt and a few random stones mark this rather\nunremarkable path.  A heavily wooded area lies to the southwest.  Visible\nabove the treetops is a mountain in the distance far to the southwest.\n',51,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1420,51,-24,0,'A Dirt Trail','  You are traveling along a dirt path that has many deep cracks running\nthrough it.  The earth here appears dried out, broken and devoid of\nplantlife.  In the distance to the south is the welcome sight of some\nwoodlands and mountains lie to the west and southwest.\n',51,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1421,50,-23,0,'A Dirt Trail','  You are traveling along a dirt path that has many deep rents in its\nsurface.  The earth here appears dried out, broken and devoid of any\nplantlife whatsoever.  A patch of trees far to the south is the only\nhint of color besides brown and grey anywhere within sight.  Looming\nin the distance to the west like silent giants is a range of mountains.\n',51,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1422,50,-22,0,'A Dirt Trail','  You are traveling along a dirt path that has many deep rents in its\nsurface.  The earth here appears dried out, broken and devoid of any\nplantlife whatsoever.  Looming in the distance to the west like silent\ngiants of the earth is a range of mountains.\n',51,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1423,50,-21,0,'A Dirt Trail','  You are traveling along a dirt path that has many deep rents in its\nsurface.  The earth here appears dried out, broken and devoid of any\nplantlife whatsoever.  Looming in the distance like silent giants of the\nearth is a range of mountains.\n',51,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1424,49,-20,0,'A Dirt Trail','  You are traveling along a dirt path that has many deep rents in its\ncracked surface.  The earth here appears dried out, broken and devoid of\nany plantlife whatsoever.  Looming in the distance like silent giants of\nthe earth is a range of mountains.\n',51,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1425,48,-19,0,'A Dirt Trail','  You are traveling on a dirt path that has many deep rents in its\ncracked surface.  The earth here appears dried out, broken and devoid\nof any plantlife whatsoever.  Looking in the distance to the southwest\nis a range of mountains.  A ways to the north you see a crossroads.\n',51,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1426,48,-18,0,'A Dirt Trail','  You are traveling on a dirt path that has many deep rents in its\ncracked surface.  The earth here appears dried out, broken and devoid of\nany plantlife whatsoever.  Nearby to the north are large outcropping of\nstone and some clumps of scraggly brush.  Just to your north you see a busy\ncrossroads.\n',51,131076,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1450,48,-16,0,'Versilard\'s Highway Near the Red Stone Road','Constructed during the reign of Emperor Versilard during the Third Age, this\nancient highway was once the main route between Logrus and Amber over the\nSympathians, but as Grimhaven grew as the center of trade, fell into\ndisuse.  Now, it is little more than a rocky path displaying the effects of\ntime and the weather.  Somewhere south of here lies the town of Logrus,\nwhile north lies the Badlands and finally the pass through the mountains\nthat rise majestically to the west.\n',18,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1451,48,-15,0,'Versilard\'s Highway','Constructed during the reign of Emperor Versilard during the Third Age, this\nancient highway was once the main route between Logrus and Amber over the\nSympathians, but as Grimhaven grew as the center of trade, fell into\ndisuse.  Now, it is little more than a rocky path displaying the effects of\ntime and the weather.  Somewhere south of here lies the town of Logrus,\nwhile north lies the Badlands and finally the pass through the mountains\nthat rise majestically to the west.\n',18,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
