(1460,51,-6,0,'Versilard\'s Highway Just South of the Badlands','Constructed during the reign of Emperor Versilard during the Third Age,\nthis ancient highway was once the main route between Logrus and Amber over\nthe Sympathians, but as Grimhaven grew as the center of trade, fell into\ndisuse.  Now, it is little more than a rocky path displaying the effects\nof time and the weather.  Somewhere south of here lies the town of Logrus,\nwhile north lies the Badlands and finally the pass through the mountains\nthat rise majestically to the west.\n',18,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1461,58,12,0,'Versilard\'s Highway Just North of the Badlands','The desolate terrain of the Badlands stretches away to the south, while\nthe ancient highway of Emperor Versilard heads north towards a pass in the\nSympathian Mountains, which loom to the northwest.  The road is quite worn\ndown and large rocks lie in the way.  Few travelers come this way anymore.\n',18,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1462,58,13,0,'Versilard\'s Highway Near the Badlands','The desolate terrain of the Badlands can be seen a short distance to the\nsouth, while the ancient highway of Emperor Versilard heads north towards a\npass in the Sympathian Mountains, which loom to the northwest.  The road is\nquite worn down and large rocks lie in the way.  Few travelers come this\nway anymore.\n',18,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1463,58,14,0,'Versilard\'s Highway Near the Badlands','The desolate terrain of the Badlands can be seen a little ways to the\nsouth, while the ancient highway of Emperor Versilard heads northwest\ntowards a pass in the Sympathian Mountains, which loom to the northwest.\nThe road is quite worn down and large rocks lie in the way.  Few travelers\ncome this way anymore.\n',18,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1464,57,15,0,'Versilard\'s Highway Near the Badlands','The desolate terrain of the Badlands can be seen a ways to the southeast,\nwhile the ancient highway of Emperor Versilard heads northwest towards a\npass in the Sympathian Mountains, which loom to the north.  The road is\nquite worn down and large rocks lie in the way.  Few travelers come this\nway anymore.\n',18,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1465,56,16,0,'Versilard\'s Highway Near the Badlands','The desolate terrain of the Badlands can be seen on the horizon to the\nsoutheast, while the ancient highway of Emperor Versilard heads west\ntowards a pass in the Sympathian Mountains, which loom in the distance.\nThe road is quite worn down and large rocks lie in the way.  Few travelers\ncome this way anymore.\n',18,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1466,55,16,0,'Versilard\'s Highway','Constructed during the reign of Emperor Versilard during the Third Age,\nthis ancient highway was once the main route between Logrus and Amber over\nthe Sympathians, but as Grimhaven grew as the center of trade, fell into\ndisuse.  Now, it is little more than a rocky path displaying the effects\nof time and the weather.  Somewhere south of here, beyond the Badlands\nlies the town of Logrus, while northwest lies the pass through the\nSympathian Mountains, which rise majestically to the northwest.\n',18,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1467,54,16,0,'Versilard\'s Highway','Constructed during the reign of Emperor Versilard during the Third Age,\nthis ancient highway was once the main route between Logrus and Amber over\nthe Sympathians, but as Grimhaven grew as the center of trade, fell into\ndisuse.  Now, it is little more than a rocky path displaying the effects\nof time and the weather.  Somewhere south of here, beyond the Badlands\nlies the town of Logrus, while northwest lies the pass through the\nSympathian Mountains, which rise majestically to the northwest.\n',18,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
