(1470,51,19,0,'Versilard\'s Highway','Constructed during the reign of Emperor Versilard during the Third Age,\nthis ancient highway was once the main route between Logrus and Amber over\nthe Sympathians, but as Grimhaven grew as the center of trade, fell into\ndisuse.  Now, it is little more than a rocky path displaying the effects\nof time and the weather.  Somewhere south of here, beyond the Badlands\nlies the town of Logrus, while north lies the pass through the Sympathian\nMountains, which rise majestically to the northwest.  An overgrown trail\nfollow the course of a small gully into the hills to the west.\n',18,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1471,51,20,0,'Versilard\'s Highway Through the Foothills','Constructed during the reign of Emperor Versilard in the Third Age, this\nancient highway was once the main route over the Sympathians, but as shorter\nroutes were opened up, fell into disuse.  Now, it is little more than a\nrocky path displaying the effects of time and the weather.  Somewhere\nnorth of here, through a pass in the mountains whose eastern foothills\nyou now traverse, lies the city of Amber.  To the southeast, the land slopes\ndownward towards the rough terrain of the Badlands, beyond which lies the\ncity of Logrus.\n',18,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
