(1613,-39,40,-1,'Mountain Pass','  The path narrows as it winds its way through the mountains.  Cliffs tower\nto both sides and you hope you nothing starts a rock slide for there is little\nroom to run.\n',18,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(1614,-40,40,-1,'Mountain Pass','  The path narrows as it winds its way through the mountains.  Cliffs tower\nto both sides and you hope you nothing starts a rock slide for there is little\nroom to run.  A very narrow path heads up into the mountains to the south but\nit looks like it would be hard going to follow it.\n',18,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
