(2157,21,67,-5,'Active Tunnel','   There is much activity in this section of the mountain.  Loads of cut\nrock are carried north through the tunnel on wheelbarrows, mining\ncaptains shouting orders to the elven slaves, and many dwarven men cutting\naway at the stone walls.  The elven slaves are much more pale than the usual\nelf, and all of them have snowy white hair.  The dwarves themselves are\nstocky, but most of them look very powerful despite their height.  The\ndwarven mining captains are just as dirty as their workers, it seems they\nput in just as much effort as the rest do.  To the south the mining\noperation continues, and nearby to the north the tunnel ends.\n',21,131081,13,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(2158,21,68,-5,'Active Tunnel','   There is much activity in this section of the mountain.  Loads of cut\nrock are carried north through the tunnel on wheelbarrows, mining\ncaptains shouting orders to the elven slaves, and many dwarven men cutting\naway at the stone walls.  The elven slaves are much more pale than the usual\nelf, and all of them have snowy white hair.  The dwarves themselves are\nstocky, but most of them look very powerful despite their height.  The\ndwarven mining captains are just as dirty as their workers, it seems they\nput in just as much effort as the rest do.  To the north the tunnel ends in\na \'T\' intersection, and to the south the mining operation continues.\n',21,131081,13,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(2159,21,69,-5,'Busy Intersection','   The mining operations just don\'t seem to rest.  Much activity floods\nthrough these passages as rock and other debris are hauled away to the east.\nCarts and wheelbarrows are everywhere, and broken tools lie all over the\nground.  To the west is a lift that carries the miners to the different\nlevels of the mines.  To the south activity flourishes as the miners are\nhard at work.\n',21,131081,13,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(2160,20,69,-5,'The Lift','   The lift is the size of a small room, obviously made for transporting\nlarge loads of material.  It is completely made of wood except for the iron\nfencing that serves as a door.  This lift seems very sturdy despite the old\nwooden boards that it is made of.  The dwarves are obviously very good\nengineers.  There is a small lever which controls the movement of the lift.\nYou are at the top of the lift and there is heavy activity to the east.\n',21,131081,13,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(2161,20,69,-6,'The Lift','   The lift is the size of a small room, obviously made for transporting\nlarge loads of material.  It is completely made of wood except for the iron\nfencing that serves as a door.  This lift seems very sturdy despite the old\nwooden boards that it is made of.  The dwarves are obviously very good\nengineers.  There is a small lever which controls the movement of the lift.\n',21,131081,13,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(2162,20,69,-7,'The Lift','The lift is the size of a small room, obviously made for transporting\nlarge loads of material.  It is completely made of wood except for iron\nfencing that serves as a door.  This lift seems very sturdy despite the old\nwooden boards that it is made of.  The dwarves are obviously very good\nengineers.  There is a small lever which controls the movement of the lift.\nTo the west lies a short tunnel which leads out of the mountain.\n',0,131081,13,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(2163,22,69,-5,'Disposal Path','   A long line of carts, filled with waste products, head towards the east\nwhere there must be some sort of dumping site.  Carts come from the lift to\nthe west  and from south of the western intersection.\n',21,131081,13,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(2164,23,69,-5,'Disposal Path','   A long line of carts, filled with waste products, head towards the east\nwhere there must be some sort of dumping site.  Carts come from the lift to\nthe west and from south of the western intersection.  Far to the east, two\nlines of carts can be seen.  One heads east, from your position, into the\ntunnel.  And the other line appears out of the tunnel but turning south at an\nintersection.\n',21,131081,13,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(2165,24,69,-5,'Disposal Path','   A long line of carts, filled with waste products, head towards the east\nwhere there must be some sort of dumping site.  Carts come from the lift to\nthe east and from south of the western intersection to head east for\ndisposal.   A ways to the east the tunnel begins a sharp downward decent,\nwhere the lines of carts roll down the hill and another line of carts is seen\nheading west.\n',21,131081,13,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(2166,25,69,-5,'Disposal Intersection','   A long line of carts, filled with waste products, head towards the east\nwhere there must be some sort of dumping site.  Carts come from the lift to\nthe east and from south of the western intersection.   A ways to the east\nthe tunnel begins a sharp downward decent, where the lines of carts roll down\nthe hill.  To the west, carts are flooding in for disposal.  A line of empty\ncarts coming from the east head south into a wide tunnel.\n',21,131081,13,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(2167,25,68,-5,'Pickup Tunnel','   This tunnel is filled packed with every type of cart imaginable.  Along\nthe west wall lie carts that are broken and in line for repair, and along\nthe east wall lie carts that are currently not in use.  The middle of the\ntunnel has a clear path for a long line of carts constantly moving south.\nSeveral dwarves lounge about the tunnel, apparently on break.\n',21,131081,13,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(2168,25,67,-5,'Pickup Tunnel','   This tunnel is filled packed with every type of cart imaginable.  Along\nthe west wall lie carts that are broken and in line for repair, and along\nthe east wall lie carts that are currently not in use.  The middle of the\ntunnel has a clear path for a long line of carts constantly moving south.\nSeveral dwarves lounge about the tunnel, apparently on break.\n',21,131081,13,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
