(2256,14,61,-4,'Top of the Stairs','   You stand at the top of an dark oaken spiral staircase.  Looking down you\ncan see that the stairs lead down to the first floor of the structure.  The\nonly exit besides the stairs is to the east.\n',21,139592,12,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(2257,15,56,-4,'Bend in the Hallway','   No matter how quite you try to be, your footsteps still seem to echo in\nthis dark hall.  The marble floors seem to bring out every vibration of\nmovement.  To the west is a heavy oak door with a large black lock, and the\nhallway continues east and north.\n',21,139592,12,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(2258,15,57,-4,'Dark Hallway','   There is very little light coming through this corridor and the entire\nfloor is very quiet.  There hall runs north and south into darkness.  There\nis a door to the west.\n',21,139592,12,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
