(2269,17,56,-4,'Bedroom','   Judging from the robes hanging on the closet door, this seems to be the\nbedroom of a priest.  There is a large plush bed resting in one corner, and\na desk and chair sitting next to it.  A small window in the east wall gives\na glorious view of the valley below.\n',21,139592,12,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
