(3008,33,75,-3,'Benedict\'s Garden','Here is a perfectly lovely garden.  The sands and stones,\nplants and waters are laid out in perfect harmony among themselves.  Oddly,\nthere seems to be an underlying pattern to the garden that is almost\nfamiliar...\n',0,139264,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(3009,34,75,-3,'Garden Path','  You\'re on a pretty, little path.\n',24,139264,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(3010,38,68,-3,'Southern Courtyard','  A small but elegant courtyard south of the main entrance to the castle.\n',24,139269,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(3011,38,67,-3,'Inside The South Gate','  A wide, paved area just inside the south gate.\n',24,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(3016,35,69,-7,'The Bottom of the Stair','  You stand at the bottom of a huge stone spiral stair.\n',24,139272,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
