(3290,-58,45,0,'The Hilltop','This is the highest point of the grassy hill.  You can see for miles\nin all directions, which means you can see a lot of treetops.  To\nthe southwest, however, you can just make out the top of a large\nstone building.\n',29,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(3291,-57,45,0,'The Hillside','The grassy hillside is sheltered by The forest.  There is what appears\nto be the remains of a fire pit here.\n',29,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
