(3789,69,-16,-1,'The Town Sewers','  You have entered a deep and murky sewer system located beneath the town of\nLogrus.  Narrow walkways lead on into the darkness along slick, moss-covered\nwalls.  As you look into the water, your eyes can\'t detect anything alive\nwithin the muck as it is carried away further down the tunnel.  If anything were\nalive in there, you certainly wouldn\'t want to meet it.  A large iron grate bars\nfurther passage to the north.\n',27,139264,29,0,0,0,14,2,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(3790,69,-15,-1,'The Town Sewers','  You are standing within a tunnel of a large sewer system.  You can barely\nmaintain your balance through some feat of agility; moss, slime, and muck cover\neverything!  Water drips from a rocky ceiling, and the air itself is filled\nwith a musty stench that pervades your nostrils.  A large river of an\nindescribably thick mire crawls its way in a channel which runs north and south\nof here.  A large iron grate bars further passage to the south.\n',27,139272,29,0,0,0,15,2,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(3791,69,-14,-1,'The Town Sewers','You have reached a bend in this particular tunnel.  Carefully balancing on an\nedge of the walkway so as not to fall into the mire, you peer down each\ncorridor.  Nothing seems too unusual, just a lot of darkness and that ever-so\npleasant smell that is common to all sewers.\n',-1,139272,29,10,3791,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(3792,70,-14,-1,'The Town Sewers','  You are standing within a tunnel of a large sewer system.  You can barely\nmaintain your balance through some feat of agility; moss, slime, and muck cover\neverything!  Water drips from a rocky ceiling, and the air itself is filled\nwith a musty stench that pervades your nostrils.  A large river of an\nindescribably thick mire crawls its way in a channel which runs east and west\nof here.\n',27,139272,29,0,0,0,14,3,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(3793,71,-14,-1,'The Town Sewers','  You have apparently reached what would seem to be the end of your journey; a\nlarge grate prevents further passage to the east where the sewer continues on.\nPeering between the bars, you can\'t make anything out in the darkness beyond.\nYou quickly check the grate to find it locked.\n',27,139272,29,0,0,0,14,3,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(3794,72,-14,-1,'The Town Sewers','  You have apparently reached what would seem to be the end of your journey;\ntwo large grates prevent further passage to either the east or west where the\nsewer system continues onwards.  Peering between the bars, you can\'t make\nanything out in the darkness beyond.  You quickly check both grates to find\nthem locked.\n',27,139272,29,0,0,0,14,3,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(3795,72,-13,-1,'The Town Sewers','  You have entered a deep and murky sewer system located beneath the town of\nLogrus.  Narrow walkways lead on into the darkness along slick, moss-covered\nwalls.  As you look into the water, your eyes can\'t detect anything alive\nwithin the muck as it is carried away further down the tunnel.  If anything was\nalive in there, you certainly wouldn\'t want to meet it.\n',27,139272,29,0,0,0,14,2,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(3796,72,-12,-1,'The Town Sewers','  You have reached an apparent dead-end in the sewer system.  As you stand here\nlooking at the moss-covered walls, the only noticeable feature is a hole about a\nfoot wide set within the north wall.  It appears to be a junction pipe as\nrancid water pours forth from it, and follows a channel of dark water to the\nsouth.\n',27,139272,29,0,0,0,14,2,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(3797,71,-13,-1,'The Town Sewers','  You are standing within a tunnel of a large sewer system.  You can barely\nmaintain your balance through some feat of agility; moss, slime, and muck cover\neverything!  Water drips from a rocky ceiling, and the air itself is filled\nwith a musty stench that pervades your nostrils.  A large river of an\nindescribably thick mire crawls its way in a channel which runs east and west\nof here.\n',27,139272,29,0,0,0,14,1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
