(3799,73,-14,-1,'The Town Sewers','  You have entered a large four-way junction in the sewer system underneath the\ntown of Logrus.  This room appears to be the central area of the sewers.  Four\nlarge grates bar passage in the four cardinal directions.  Nothing else seems\nout of the ordinary.\n',27,139272,29,0,0,0,14,3,0,100,0,'',NULL),
