(3808,71,-16,-1,'The Town Sewers','  You are standing within a small passage within the sewer system under Logrus.\nIt seems to be a dead-end as the murky water descends through a smaller grate\non the western wall into darkness.  In the center of the river, you notice a\nlarge pile of sludge which has apparently formed a small island in an eddy of\nthe river current.  It looks fairly precarious, but you think you can reach it.\nThe only exit is back through a grate to the east.\n',27,139272,29,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
