(3950,0,0,0,'Grassy Knoll','This gentle hill leads north or south, is covered with grass and weeds, and\nhas a few wagon tracks freshly imprinted into the ground.\n',0,143616,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(3951,0,0,0,'Grassy Knoll','This gentle hill leads north or south, is covered with grass and weeds, and\nhas a few wagon tracks freshly imprinted into the ground.\n',0,143616,24,0,0,0,0,0,4,-1,0,'',NULL),
(3952,0,0,0,'Grassy Knoll','This gentle hill leads north or east and is covered in soft grass and a few young deciduous trees.',0,143616,24,0,0,0,0,0,4,-1,0,'',NULL),
(3953,0,0,0,'Grassy Knoll','This gentle hill leads east or west and is covered in soft grass. Where the ground levels out, the grasses thin and pebbles are scattered around.',0,143616,24,0,0,0,0,0,4,-1,0,'',NULL),
(3954,0,0,0,'Pebbly Path','This area is clear of trees and a pebbled path forms faintly to the west and grows more solid to the east. Scrubby bushes have taken root here and there, enjoying the wetter ground to the east.',0,143616,24,0,0,0,0,0,4,-1,0,'',NULL),
(3955,0,0,0,'Pebbly Path Along a River','This pebbly path leads west and south, and to the southwest a river can be seen flowing beside a rocky bank.',0,143616,24,0,0,0,0,0,4,-1,0,'',NULL),
(3956,0,0,0,'Pebbly Path Near a River','This pebbly path goes on to the north, but travel to the south peters out. The riverbank to the southwest has nourished a group of trees and vines that have choked out any travel to the southeast. Some industrious soul has dug a tunnel to avoid destroying the trees here.',0,143616,24,0,0,0,0,0,4,-1,0,'',NULL),
(3957,0,0,0,'Damp Tunnel','This damp tunnel is chilly but clean. The sides of the cave reveal tracks of minerals, and random flashes of light from unknown sources glints off them in some places.',0,143616,33,0,0,0,0,0,4,-1,0,'',NULL),
(3958,0,0,0,'Damp Tunnel','This damp tunnel is chilly but clean. The sides of the cave reveal tracks of minerals, and random flashes of light from unknown sources glints off them in some places.',0,143616,33,0,0,0,0,0,4,-1,0,'',NULL),
(3959,0,0,0,'Rickety Bridge','The banks of the river are close together here, a fortunate choice seeing as how this bridge is so poorly made. There is no access to the river here, but to the east and west the pebbly path continues.',0,143616,24,0,0,0,0,0,4,-1,0,'',NULL),
(3960,0,0,0,'Damp Tunnel','This damp tunnel is chilly but clean. The sides of the cave reveal tracks of minerals, and random flashes of light from unknown sources glints off them in some places.',0,143616,33,0,0,0,0,0,4,-1,0,'',NULL),
