(4190,0,0,0,'A Grassy Mountain Plateau','  Hardy mountain grasses grow in thick clumps between large boulders and the\njagged crown of the ridge.  An impressive view shows the land for miles in\nall directions.  Quite a bit of it is forested land.  Down the cliff to the\neast, a small village is cradled between mountain peaks.  The plateau drops\noff suddenly over a spring fed lake just to the south.\n',34,131072,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4191,0,0,0,'In the Air above a Mountain Reservoir','  This is thin air.  Very thin air.  It *NIPS* and *BITES* with the cold breeze.\nA cliffside looms before you to the north while the waters of a lake undulate\nbelow.  A small mountain village is cradled in a valley to the northeast.\n',34,131072,34,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4192,0,0,0,'In the Air above a Mountain Reservoir','  This is thin air.  Very thin air.  It *NIPS* and *BITES* with the cold breeze.\nA cliffside looms before you to the north while the waters of a lake undulate\nbelow.  A small mountain village is cradled in a valley to the northeast.\n',34,131072,34,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4193,0,0,0,'In the Air above a Mountain Reservoir','  This is thin air.  Very thin air.  It *NIPS* and *BITES* with the cold breeze.\nA cliffside looms before you to the north.  The undulating waters of the lake\nbelow splash and mist.  A small mountain village is cradled in a valley to the\nnortheast.\n',34,131072,34,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4194,0,0,0,'Beach Near a Large Lake','  A narrow expanse of sand and gravel leads to the edge of a vast lake to the\nsouth.  North of here is the village proper with thatched huts scattered about\nhaphazardly.  The beach is littered with fishing tackle of all sorts, small\noutriggers and some nets that have been spread.\n',34,131072,10,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4195,0,0,0,'Beach Near a Large Lake','  A narrow expanse of sand and gravel leads to the edge of a vast lake to the\nsouth.  North of here is the village proper with thatched huts scattered about\nhaphazardly.  The beach is littered with fishing tackle of all sorts, small\noutriggers and some nets that have been spread.\n',34,131072,10,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4196,0,0,0,'A Tiny Underwater Cavern','  Algae covered rock makes up the walls of this\nunderwater cavern.  Sand and shells cover the floor.\n',34,132104,30,0,0,0,50,0,1,100,0,'',NULL),
(4200,0,0,0,'On a Large Lake - near the Beach','   A large, spring-fed lake spreads out majestically.  The mountains form\nominous walls for the lake - holding the reservoir in place and preventing\nfurther passage.  To the north can be made out a small fishing village.  A\ngood sized village hut juts out over the lake to the northwest.  The lake\nwater looks pristine and the bottom can almost be seen, far below where\ngentle reeds grow up from the muck on the lake bed.  A large hut juts out\nover the water to the north.\n',34,131072,29,0,0,0,48,8,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4201,0,0,0,'On a Large Lake - near the Beach','   A large, spring-fed lake spreads out majestically.  The mountains form\nominous walls for the lake - holding the reservoir in place and preventing\nfurther passage.  To the north can be made out a small fishing village.  A\ngood sized village hut juts out over the lake to the northwest.  The lake\nwater looks pristine and the bottom can almost be seen, far below where\ngentle reeds grow up from the muck on the lake bed.  A large hut juts out\nover the water to the north.\n',34,131072,29,0,0,0,38,8,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4202,0,0,0,'On a Large Lake - near the Beach','   A large, spring-fed lake spreads out majestically.  The mountains form\nominous walls for the lake - holding the reservoir in place and preventing\nfurther passage.  To the north can be made out a small fishing village.  A\ngood sized village hut juts out over the lake to the northwest.  The lake\nwater looks pristine and the bottom can almost be seen, far below where\ngentle reeds grow up from the muck on the lake bed.  The lake is fairly shallow\nhere as it approaches the village beach on the north side.\n',34,131072,29,0,0,0,38,8,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4203,0,0,0,'On a Large Lake - near the Cliffs','   A large, spring-fed lake spreads out around you.  The mountains form ominous\nwalls for the lake - holding the reservoir in place and preventing further\npassage.  To the north can be made out a small fishing village.  The lake\nwater looks pristine and you can see almost to the bottom far below where\ngentle reeds grow up from the muck on the lake-bed.  The cliffs formed by the \nmountains tower above you virtually unscalable nearby.\n',34,131072,29,0,0,0,35,8,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
