(4222,0,0,0,'On a Large Lake','   A large, spring-fed lake spreads out around you.  The mountains form ominous\nwalls for the lake - holding the reservoir in place and preventing further\npassage.  To the north can be made out a small fishing village.  The lake\nwater looks pristine and you can see almost to the bottom far below where\ngentle reeds grow up from the muck on the lake-bed.\n',34,131072,29,0,0,0,40,1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4223,0,0,0,'On a Large Lake - near the Cliffs','   A large, spring-fed lake spreads out around you.  The mountains form ominous\nwalls for the lake - holding the reservoir in place and preventing further\npassage.  To the north can be made out a small fishing village.  The lake\nwater looks pristine and you can see almost to the bottom far below where\ngentle reeds grow up from the muck on the lake-bed.  The lake begins to narrow\nto the east and the current seems to be increasing in speed.  The cliff walls\nare directly north of you and the water laps softly against the granite face.\n',34,131072,29,0,0,0,40,1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4224,0,0,0,'On a Large Lake - near the Cliffs','   A large, spring-fed lake spreads out around you.  The mountains form ominous\nwalls for the lake - holding the reservoir in place and preventing further\npassage.  To the north can be made out a small fishing village.  The lake\nwater looks pristine and you can see almost to the bottom far below where\ngentle reeds grow up from the muck on the lake-bed.  The cliff walls loom on\nboth the north and south facings.  West of here is the beginnings of a vast\nmountain lake while east lies surging waters that appears to be the runoff\nof the lake.\n',34,131072,29,0,0,0,40,1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4225,0,0,0,'On a Large Lake - near the Cliffs','   A large, spring-fed lake spreads out around you.  The mountains form ominous\nwalls for the lake - holding the reservoir in place and preventing further\npassage.  To the north can be made out a small fishing village.  The lake\nwater looks pristine and you can see almost to the bottom far below where\ngentle reeds grow up from the muck on the lake-bed.  The cliffs formed by the\nmountains tower above you virtually unscalable nearby.\n',34,131072,29,0,0,0,40,6,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
