(4248,0,0,0,'Underwater in a Large Lake','  The spring-fed mountain waters hover on the verge of freezing making an\nextended stay down here dangerous for fear of hypothermia.  The water itself\nis quite clear and you can easily make out small plant life growing up from\nthe muck on the bottom as well as other things in your vicinity.  The waters\nare quite deep although there feels to be a very small current eastward.\n',34,131072,30,0,0,0,40,4,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
