(4265,0,0,0,'Fast Moving River','  The waters here are turbulent and frothy with foam as the current moves\nwater from the spring-fed reservoir west of here toward the east.  The cliff\nwalls block passage north and south.  The water is too frothy to estimate\ndepth beyond a few inches but you guess that it is fairly shallow here as\nrocks occasionally jut through the surface.  West of here is a large lake\nwhile east is a magnificent view unobstructed by mountains.  You can make\nout Grimhaven and the forests around it.\n',34,131072,29,0,0,0,5,1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4266,0,0,0,'Mid-Air near the Top of a Waterfall','  Turbulent white, foamy water plunges over the edge of a waterfall immediately\nwest of here and spray soaks you to the bone.\n',34,131072,34,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4267,0,0,0,'Mid-Air Near a Waterfall','  Turbulent white, foamy water plunges over the edge of a waterfall immediately\nwest of here and spray soaks you to the bone.\n',34,131072,34,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4268,0,0,0,'Mid-Air Above the Base of a Waterfall','  Turbulent white, foamy water plunges over the edge of a waterfall immediately\nwest of here and spray soaks you to the bone.\n',34,131072,34,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4269,0,0,0,'The Base of a Waterfall','  Immediately west of here is a high waterfall whose plunging water creates\na tremendous roaring noise.  The pool of water at the base is surging with\nfoam as the waterfall keeps churning it endlessly.  Spray lingers in the\nair and soaks you completely.  The pool of water has an outlet to the east.\n',34,131072,29,0,0,0,5,5,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4270,0,0,0,'The Base of a Waterfall','  Immediately west of here is a high waterfall whose plunging water creates\na tremendous roaring noise.  The pool of water at the base is surging with\nfoam as the waterfall keeps churning it endlessly.  Spray lingers in the\nair and soaks you completely.  The pool of water has an outlet to the east.\n',34,131072,29,0,0,0,10,8,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
