(4273,0,0,0,'The Base of a Waterfall','  Immediately west of here is a high waterfall whose plunging water creates\na tremendous roaring noise.  The pool of water at the base is surging with\nfoam as the waterfall keeps churning it endlessly.  Spray lingers in the\nair and soaks you completely.  The pool of water has an outlet to the east.\n',34,131072,29,0,0,0,10,6,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4274,0,0,0,'The Base of a Waterfall','  Immediately west of here is a high waterfall whose plunging water creates\na tremendous roaring noise.  The pool of water at the base is surging with\nfoam as the waterfall keeps churning it endlessly.  Spray lingers in the\nair and soaks you completely.  The pool of water has an outlet to the south.\n',34,131072,29,0,0,0,10,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4275,0,0,0,'Sucked Under','  The plunging water crashes against your body and forces you underwater.\nYou thrash around, but the water buffets you and you become disoriented\nas to which way is up.  In your confusion, you swim toward the surface only\nto find you have been turned about and wind up bumping your head against\nthe bottom.  With lungs about to burst you calm your panic and hope that\nthe water will carry you back toward the surface...\n',34,131072,30,0,0,0,10,4,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4276,0,0,0,'On the Kranor River in the Parnithian Mountains','  The Kranor River winds its way through the Parnithian mountains which stretch\nnorth-south across the land.  The source of the river is somewhere west of \nhere while the river itself winds slowly southeasterly eventually coming out\nin the Myrian Ocean.  Mountainous cliffs are on either side of the river\nblocking passage in all directions save that which the river runs.\n',34,131072,29,0,0,0,15,1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
