(4284,0,0,0,'A Rough-Hewn Tunnel','  A fairly wide tunnel drops away into the mountain. The walls are roughly \ncut, jagged with rocks embedded in pockets of soil. There is a stillness, a \nquiet quality of muffled tones, the occasional echo of which wafts up from \ndeep in the tunnel.\n',34,131080,35,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,12,'',NULL),
(4285,0,0,0,'A Rough-Hewn Tunnel','  A fairly wide tunnel drops away into the mountain. The walls are roughly \ncut, jagged with rocks embedded in pockets of soil. There is a stillness, a \nquiet quality of muffled tones, the occasional echo of which wafts up from \ndeep in the tunnel.\n',34,131080,35,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(4286,0,0,0,'A Rough-Hewn Tunnel','  A fairly wide tunnel drops away into the mountain. The walls are roughly\ncut, jagged with rocks embedded in pockets of soil.  A low, muffled but \nsteady thrumming comes from somewhere deep within the mountain.  The north\nwall of the tunnel has been cut away providing an exit in that direction.\n',34,131080,35,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(4287,0,0,0,'A Rough-Hewn Tunnel','  A fairly wide tunnel leads north here, a wide shaft opens up above.\nThe walls are roughly  cut, jagged with rocks embedded in pockets of\nsoil. The sandy tunnel floor appears to have been raked clean of any\ndebris. A low muffled but steady thrumming comes from somewhere deep\nwithin the mountain.\n',34,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(4288,0,0,0,'A Rough-Hewn Alcove','  This small alcove has been roughly dug into the wall, leaving it jagged\nwith rocks embedded in pockets of soil.  Directly to the south a fairly\nwide tunnel drops away into the mountain.  A low, muffled but steady \nthrumming comes from somewhere deep within the mountain.\n',34,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(4289,0,0,0,'A Rough-Hewn Tunnel','  A fairly wide tunnel leads through the mountain. The walls are roughly\ncut, jagged with rocks embedded in pockets of soil.  The sandy tunnel\nfloor appears to have been raked clean of any debris.  A low, steady\nthrumming comes from somewhere within the mountain.\n',34,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
