(4292,0,0,0,'Within a Cavernous Geode','  This enormous geode creates a sparkling cavern.  The amethyst interior\nreflects light, purple tinged rays that flutter about the chamber.  Smooth\nglassy flooring has been created somehow, leaving the gems of the geode\nglimmering underfoot as well as every other direction.  A low musical\nthrumming echos out from the eastern side of the cavern.\n',34,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
