(4300,1,-29,0,'Entrance to the Swamp','  You are at the end of the road.  Before you lies the Bullywug Swamp.  Tread\ncarefully, this area has a history.  It was once said that a great band of\nadventurers went into this swamp to crush the entire Bullywug nation.  Although\nreports of thousands of dead Bullywugs returned, the band of heroes never did.\n',30,131073,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4301,1,-28,0,'The Bullywug Swamp','  You are in a dark and murky area.  Stagnant water laps at your knees.  You\nthink about what the water might conceal.  You tremble.  Not much sunlight comes\nthrough the large hanging vines which infest the mossy trees of this swamp.\n',30,131104,27,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
