(4323,-8,-26,0,'Great Levee of the Lost Lake','  You are on high ground now, although the ground is not extremely solid.  This\nnatural wall of dirt holds back the waters of the Lost Lake.  Over the\ncenturies, the waters of the lake have seeped though this earthen barrier, thus\ncreating the dreaded Bullywug Swamp.  A large pile of driftwood has\ncollected towards the southwest of the immediate area.\n',30,131072,27,0,0,0,5,5,5,-1,0,'',NULL),
