(4368,-5,-23,0,'Ye Old Bullywug Boat and Bait Shoppe','  This is a rickety old wooden shed.  The grounds around the shed are littered\nwith buckets and pails.  The buckets and pails are full of frogs and minnows to\nbe sold as bait.  Behind the shed is where the old Bullywug keeps his boats\nthat are for sale.\n',30,166077,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
