(4377,2,-22,0,'The Bullywug Swamp','This is a dark and murky area, and stagnant water laps against the mud.  \nThe thought of what the water might conceal isn\'t pleasant.  Not much \nsunlight comes through the large hanging vines which infest the mossy \ntrees of this swamp, but a small clump of ferns has flourished here.\n',0,131104,27,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4378,3,-22,0,'The Bullywug Swamp','  You are in a dark and murky area.  Stagnant water laps at your knees.  You\nthink about what the water might conceal.  You tremble.  Not much sunlight comes\nthrough the large hanging vines which infest the mossy trees of this swamp.\n',30,131104,27,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4379,-3,-21,0,'Great Levee of the Lost Lake','  You are on high ground now, although the ground is not extremely solid.  This\nnatural wall of dirt holds back the waters of the Lost Lake.  Over the\ncenturies, the waters of the lake have seeped though this earthen barrier, thus\ncreating the dreaded Bullywug Swamp.\n',30,131072,27,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4380,-4,-21,0,'On the Lost Lake','  Dark water is swirling beneath you.  The rolling of the lake is almost saying\nthat a leviathan lives here.  To lose something in these murky depths would be\ndisaster.  And besides, that something could be your life!\n',30,131072,29,0,0,0,-1,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
