(4396,5,-24,0,'Hut of the Bullywug Shaman','  This is the hut of the Bullywug Shaman.  It is filled with the smell of herbs\nand swamp spices.\n',30,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(4397,-7,-29,0,'Home of the Bullywug Tracker','  This hut is dominated by a large hunting trophy on the wall.  This Bullywug\nmust be a master tracker and killer.\n',30,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(4398,0,-21,0,'Home of the Bullywug Chieftain','  This is the largest Bullywug home you have seen so far.  The floor is damp,\nbut clean.  There are a series of small holes in the ceiling.\n',30,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(4399,-9,-27,0,'Bandit\'s Camp','  Hidden among the dense vegetation of the swamp the little camp appears to\nhave just recently been setup.  A pile of dry twigs lie to one side for the\nnights fire and some grasses and leaves have been piled around the center\nof the camp for makeshift beds.  A wet pile of driftwood has been set near\nthe break in the vegetation to the northeast to be used in concealing the\nopening there.\n',35,131072,27,0,0,0,0,-1,15,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4401,13,1,0,'Grimhaven Outer Pathway','  This pathway circles the outer perimeter of Grimhaven\'s city walls.  The\npath is used by maintenance crews who keep the wall in repair and by the\nKing\'s soldiers, who insure that no one is sneaking into the city, except\nvia the gates.  The pathway is made of hard packed dirt.  To the east and\nsoutheast lies the Grimhaven marketplace, and to the south is the city\'s\neastern gate.\n',35,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4402,13,2,0,'Grimhaven Outer Pathway','  This pathway circles the outer perimeter of Grimhaven\'s city walls.  The\npath is used by maintenance crews who keep the wall in repair and by the\nKing\'s soldiers, who insure that no one is sneaking into the city, except\nvia the gates.  The pathway is made of hard packed dirt.  The side of a\nbuilding lies to the east and the path continues north and south.\n',35,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4403,13,3,0,'Grimhaven Outer Pathway','  This pathway circles the outer perimeter of Grimhaven\'s city walls.  The\npath is used by maintenance crews who keep the wall in repair and by the\nKing\'s soldiers, who insure that no one is sneaking into the city, except\nvia the gates.  The pathway is made of hard packed dirt.  To the east\nstands a small building and the path continues north and south.\n',35,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
