(4572,15,7,0,'Winding Way','  Winding Way is a narrow, serpentine street that meanders through one of\nGrimhaven\'s main residential districts.  The modest homes of city\'s\nworking class line both sides of the street, which is nothing more than\nhard packed dirt.  To the north is the Grimhaven Public School and there\nare homes to the east and west.  Winding Way continues northwest and\nsouth. \n',37,131072,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
