(4704,-22,-10,0,'Ruins','  Blocks of stone lie on the ground in various and distinct patterns.\nYou feel a sense of awe and calm descend upon you as you gaze upon what\ncan only be the remains of a temple.  To what deity, you cannot tell\nfor no distinguishable remains can be found.\n',32,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
