(4710,-26,-12,0,'Rolling Hills','You stand amid some gently rolling hills.  They seem to get larger and\nsteeper towards the south.  You see the green of the forest that covers\nthese hills in every direction.  There is the smell of pine and sap in\nthe air.\n',32,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4711,-25,-12,0,'Rolling Hills','You stand amid some gently rolling hills.  They seem to get larger and\nsteeper towards the south.  You see the green of the forest that covers\nthese hills in every direction.  There is the smell of pine and sap in\nthe air.\n',32,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4712,-24,-12,0,'Rolling Hills','You stand amid some gently rolling hills.  They seem to get larger and\nsteeper towards the south.  You see the green of the forest that covers\nthese hills in every direction.  There is the smell of pine and sap in\nthe air.  A gigantic fallen tree blocks the passage way to the east.\n',32,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4713,-23,-12,0,'Forest','You are in a forest of gigantic trees.  The branches seem to form a\ncanopy over your head, although they leave ample room for creatures\nof the forest to pass through.  You faintly smell moss and decaying\nleaves that cover both the ground and the trees of the forest.  A\ngigantic fallen tree blocks the passage way west.\n',32,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4714,-22,-12,0,'Hilltop','You stand high upon a hilltop that overlooks the immediately surrounding\ncountry side.  Directly to the north lie some ruins.  To the southwest\nyou see a gigantic tree and far to the south you see a mountain\nrising high into the air.\n',32,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4715,-26,-13,0,'Rocky Hills','Here the rolling hills to the north, start to give way to the mountain\nto the south.  The hills are slightly rocky and you might twist an ankle\nif you don\'t watch where you are going.  An occasional insect flies\nin your face.\n',32,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
