(4720,-26,-14,0,'Rocky Hills','Here the rolling hills to the north, start to give way to the mountain\nto the south.  The hills are slightly rocky and you might twist an ankle\nif you don\'t watch where you are going.  An occasional insect flies\nin your face.  A wall of brambles blocks your way south.\n',32,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4721,-25,-14,0,'Rocky Hills','Here the rolling hills to the north, start to give way to the mountain\nto the south.  The hills are slightly rocky and you might twist an ankle\nif you don\'t watch where you are going.  An occasional insect flies\nin your face.  A wall of brambles blocks your way south.\n',32,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4722,-24,-14,0,'Base of a Gigantic Tree','This tree is HUGE!  You could drive an entire legion, maybe an entire\ncorps through the trunk!  Not even a score of ogre, standing hand-in-\nhand, could encircle the trunk of this magnificent tree.  Surely\nthis tree has stood since The World began and was present when\nthe Immortals created it!  You begin to wonder, just how many rings\ndoes this tree have? 1..2..3...\n',32,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4723,-23,-14,0,'Rocky Hills','Here the rolling hills to the north, start to give way to the mountain\nto the south.  The hills are slightly rocky and you might twist an ankle\nif you don\'t watch where you are going.  An occasional insect flies\nin your face.\n',32,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
