(4735,-26,-17,0,'Really Steep Rocky Hills','The rocks on these hills are loose and start to slide as you move along.\nThe grade is much steeper than the rolling hills to your north, but not\nquite as sheer as the mountain to your south.  A mountain rises\nimmediately to the south and east.\n',32,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4736,-25,-17,0,'Base of a Mountain','You stand at the base of a mountain.  You can\'t see the mountain top due\nto the clouds.  The granite base rises at such a grade that climbing\nthe mountain seems to be impossible.  You figure you would have to fly\nif you wanted to see the rest of the mountain.  A few sprigs of grass and\nmoss grow out of the cracks in the rocks.\n',32,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4737,-24,-17,0,'Glowing Nest','  You see a rather gaudy nest made of woven vines with a soft lining\nof various dried grasses.  The nest itself seems to glow with a holy\naura and the vibrations produce a melodic humming noise.\n',32,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4738,-23,-17,0,'Entrance in the Base of a Mountain','This opening is about five feet tall.  Colorful banners have been\nplaced on either side of the entrance.  You hear a melodic sound\ncoming from within the cave.\n',32,131072,25,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4739,-22,-17,0,'Really Steep Rocky Hills','The rocks on these hills are loose and start to slide as you move along.\nThe grade is much steeper than the rolling hills to your north, but not\nquite as sheer as the mountain to your south.  A mountain rises\nimmediately to the south and west.\n',32,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4740,-26,-18,0,'Cave Entrance','This is a fairly large hole in the side of the mountain.  The stones\nthat create the entrance seem to be chipped, like something big\nhad to squeeze through here.  There seem to be some faint streaks of\nbronze around the chipped stone.  You hear the faint lapping of water.\n',32,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4741,-25,-18,0,'Cavern in the Mountain','You stand in a spacious cavern.  You could fit twenty or thirty dwarves\nin this amphitheater.  There are rocks placed in strategic locations\naround a larger central stone.  You get the feeling that meetings\nare held here.\n',32,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(4742,-24,-18,0,'Hallway','This hallway seems to be a natural formation of the rock.  Maybe some\nancient lava flow carved these passages during some ancient time.  A melodic\nsound can be heard from the north.\n',32,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(4743,-23,-18,0,'Hallway','This hallway seems to be a natural formation of the rock.  Maybe some\nancient lava flow carved these passages during some ancient time.  A melodic\nsound can be heard from the west.\n',32,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(4744,-22,-18,0,'Base of a Mountain','You stand at the base of a mountain.  You can\'t see the mountain top due\nto the clouds.  The granite base rises at such a grade that climbing\nthe mountain seems to be impossible.  You figure you would have to fly\nif you wanted to see the rest of the mountain.  A few sprigs of grass and\nmoss grow out of the cracks in the rocks.\n',32,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4745,-26,-19,0,'Huge Nest','This is the largest nest you\'ve seen.  Many colorful banners and pennants\nhave been draped around the edges of the nest.  The vines that have\nbeen woven into the nest seem sturdier than the rest and the grass that\nlines the nest feels a little softer to the touch.  Obviously, someone\nof importance makes his home here.\n',32,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4746,-25,-19,0,'Cavern in the Mountain','This cavern is fairly large.  Several nests made from woven vines and\nlined with soft grasses have been placed around the perimeter of the\ncavern.  A few colorful banners lean up against the walls and the\nskeletal remains of some domestic animal lie in the middle of the\nroom.\n',32,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(4747,-24,-19,0,'Cavern in the Mountain','This cavern is fairly large.  Several nests made from woven vines and\nlined with soft grasses have been placed around the perimeter of the\ncavern.  A few colorful banners lean up against the walls and the\nskeletal remains of some domestic animal lie in the middle of the\nroom.\n',32,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(4748,-23,-19,0,'Warm and Cozy Cavern','This small cavern is warmer than the others.  There seem to be shelves\nalong the wall with small nests.  Each nest seems to contain a little\negg.  A few half-made javelins and sheaths lie here.\n',32,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(4749,-22,-19,0,'Pantry','Hanging from vines attached to the ceiling, there are several choice\ncuts of raw animal meat.  A breeze blows by you, helping to keep this\nroom at a cool, refrigerate temperature.  You notice a little hole\nthat rises up into the ceiling.  Maybe the wind is blowing in from\nthe top of the mountain.\n',32,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(4750,-26,-10,1,'In the Air','The wind is brisk but manageable as it sways you in your flight.  You see\nsome birds flying off in the background and you hear the occasional shriek\nof some unknown bird.  You see a cloud to the southeast.\n',32,131072,34,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4751,-25,-10,1,'In the Air','The wind is brisk but manageable as it sways you in your flight.  You see\nsome birds flying off in the background and you hear the occasional shriek\nof some unknown bird.  You see clouds to the south and southeast.\n',32,131072,34,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
