(4791,-25,-18,1,'Nest made of Trees','You are standing in a monstrous nest made of trees and branches from\nwhat look like giant Sequoias.  Words fail to describe the sheer\nvastness of the nest.  It must be at least sixty feet in diameter!\nAn entire legion could fit in here!  Mixed in with the nest seem to\nbe some scrapped remains of some armor and an rusted axe.  A few\nmolted golden feathers hang in the breeze on the sides of the nest.\n',32,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4792,-24,-18,1,'Huge Cave','This is a rather spacious cavern.  The same claw marks that were seen\nat the entrance to the cave, can also be found here.  You begin to\nwonder what manner of beast could create such deep ruts in solid rock?\nThe smell of chlorine becomes stronger from the southwest.\n',32,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(4793,-23,-18,1,'Cave Entrance','This is a fairly large entrance for a cave.  The wind blows out from\nthe cave and you think it sounds like something is breathing heavily\nfrom within.  There seems to be some heavy, deep scratches on the\nrocks like some gigantic, clawed beast has walked through here\nseveral times.  You smell a faint tinge of chlorine.\n',32,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(4794,-22,-18,1,'Near the Side of a Mountain','The wind is brisk but manageable as it sways you in your flight.  You see\nsome birds flying off in the background and you hear the occasional shriek\nof some unknown bird.  A mountain looms directly south and west.\n',32,131072,34,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
