(4796,-25,-19,1,'Huge Cave','The smell of chlorine is almost overpowering!  You feel like you might\nsuffocate.  Out of the corner of your eye you see a small golden\nscale that looks very worn.\n',32,133128,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,496,0,'',NULL),
