(4800,-26,-10,2,'High Atop a Cloud','You hover above the highest point of the cloud.  You begin to think of\nmarshmallows, trains, Brutius and other mundane objects that you are\nreminded of.  You can see a long way from here.  A very faint glimmer\nfrom one of the towers in Grimhaven make you realize just how high\nyou actually are.\n',32,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4801,-25,-10,2,'Atop a Cloud','You find yourself thinking, So this is what clouds are made of...  as\nyou feel the moisture from the cloud cover your body.  You are so high\nup that it\'s hard to believe that the could could actually get higher\nas it does to the west.\n',32,131072,34,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4802,-24,-10,2,'Thin Air','You\'re having trouble *wheeze* breathing!  The air is very thin and you\nfeel a brush of cold air as the wind blows.  You see a large cloud\nimmediately to the west and a tree way to the south.\n',32,131072,34,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
