(4805,-26,-11,2,'Atop a Cloud','Wisps of moisture follow your trail as you walk across the cloud.  You\nthink you hear the sound of an angel harp nearby.  Your imagination?\nThe cloud is such a pure white that you wonder how anything so beautiful\ncould ever help cause such awesome damage from tornadoes and hurricanes.\n',32,131072,34,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4806,-25,-11,2,'Atop a Cloud','Is this heaven?  Is this where the immortals live?  You certainly feel\nas if you could rule The World from this vantage point.  You can see\nalmost the entire world from here!\n',32,131072,34,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
