(4840,-26,-18,2,'Thin Air','You\'re having trouble *wheeze* breathing!  The air is very thin and you\nfeel a brush of cold air as the wind blows.  You see a large mountain\nimmediately to the southeast.\n',32,131072,34,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4841,-25,-18,2,'Near a Mountain Top','You\'re having trouble *wheeze* breathing!  The air is very thin and you\nfeel a brush of cold air as the wind blows.  You see a large mountain\nimmediately to the southeast.\n',32,131072,34,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4842,-24,-18,2,'Cave Entrance','You step foot on a very rocky outcropping.  You don\'t seem to be able to\ngo any higher on the mountain.  The wind almost succeeds in blowing you\noff the edge (you decide that you should be more careful).  The air\nup here is thin, but deliciously pure.  You notice some slight streaks of\nblack on the rocks around you and notice a small cave entrance to the south.\n',32,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(4843,-23,-18,2,'Near a Mountain Top','You\'re having trouble *wheeze* breathing!  The air is very thin and you\nfeel a brush of cold air as the wind blows.  You see a large mountain\nimmediately to the southwest.\n',32,131072,34,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4844,-22,-18,2,'Thin Air','You\'re having trouble *wheeze* breathing!  The air is very thin and you\nfeel a brush of cold air as the wind blows.  You see a large mountain\nimmediately to the southwest.\n',32,131072,34,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4845,-26,-19,2,'Near a Mountain Top','You\'re having trouble *wheeze* breathing!  The air is very thin and you\nfeel a brush of cold air as the wind blows.  You see a large mountain\nimmediately to the east.\n',32,131072,34,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4846,-25,-19,2,'Edge of a Mountain Top','There is just barely enough room to rest here.  You notice with satisfaction\nthat the wind actually blows you against the face of the mountain.  What\na relief, you can actually relax for a bit.  You think you hear the\ncall of a strange bird.  What was that?\n',32,131072,25,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4847,-24,-19,2,'Cave','The walls of the room are filled with hieroglyphics and seem to picture\nthe sun and some strange bird very favorably.  There is the definite smell\nof incense in the air.  The strange black streaks on the rocks seem to\ncenter around the center of the room.  The streaks radiate outward,\nalmost like a star-burst.\n',32,133128,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(4848,-23,-19,2,'Edge of a Mountain Top','There is barely room for anybody else on this ledge!  The stones you stand\nupon creak with your weight and you wonder how long they will hold.  A\nfaint scent of smoke mars the otherwise pure, fresh air.\n',32,131072,25,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4849,-22,-19,2,'Near a Mountain Top','You\'re having trouble *wheeze* breathing!  The air is very thin and you\nfeel a brush of cold air as the wind blows.  You see a large mountain\nimmediately to the west.\n',32,131072,34,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4850,-23,-12,3,'Outer Space','*GASP*\nYou can\'t breath!  There\'s no air!  You vainly try to hold your breath...\n',32,131078,34,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4851,-27,-12,0,'Cave','The cave is rather large with several scratchings on the floor and walls.\nThe most obvious feature is the large nest made of sticks and leaves.  The\noccasional skeletal remains of what seems to be an equine lie scattered\nabout.\n',32,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(4852,-27,-15,0,'Cave','This cave contains the remains of several large, white, feathers.  You\nnotice several hoof prints scattering the dirt floor.  There is a nest\ntowards the back of the cave amid a scattering of dried out grass and\nsome fruit that smells fairly fresh.\n',32,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(4853,-21,-14,0,'Cave','There\'s a definite feline scent to this place, though mixed with just a\ntouch of what smells like brass?  You notice some large paw prints in\nthe soft dirt.  You can barely make out the silhouette of a goat skull\ntowards the back of the cave.\n',32,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(4854,0,0,0,'Humid Cave','Wow ! It feels like a sauna in here! There seems to be steam rising from\npores in the rock and the heat gives you the feeling that you are in the\ndeepest jungle. Some very colorful bits of down lie scattered about. There is\nan opening in the northern wall that leaks in light and sound from the\nforest beyond.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(4855,-27,-19,0,'Cave','The cave has rather smooth walls.  It is totally barren, except for\nthe pool of water in the center.  The rocks around the pool seem to\nbe slightly damp, as if the water splashed on them.  The water in\nthe pool seems totally calm.\n',32,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(4856,0,0,0,'Under Water','  You find yourself swimming underwater.  There doesn\'t seem to be any\ncurrent and the water tastes slightly salty.  You wonder if this\npool exits out in the ocean somewhere.  You see light reflecting\non the water above you.\n',32,131072,30,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4857,0,0,0,'Under Water','  You find yourself swimming underwater.  There doesn\'t seem to be any\ncurrent and the water tastes slightly salty.  You wonder if this\npool exits out in the ocean somewhere.  You see light reflecting\non the water above you.\n',32,131072,30,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4858,0,0,0,'Subterranean Cave','This subterranean cave is surprisingly dry, considering it is only\naccessible through a pool of water.  Scattered on the ground are some\nbronzed colored scales.  Near the edge of the pool lies the carcass of\nwhat looks like a small shark.  You notice you are standing on the\ntattered remains of a pirate flag.\n',32,133128,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,420,0,'',NULL),
(4859,-24,-14,-1,'Tree Hollow','You stand in the hollow of a huge, ancient tree.  The inside of the bark\nis soft, but still very thick.  It looks as if something has clawed through\nsome of the softer wood to clear out a dwelling place.  The body of a\nsmall songbird lies amidst some leaves and berries.\n',32,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4860,-24,-9,0,'Cave','You see a horse-sized nest, sparsely decorated with a variety of golden tan\nand brown feathers.  There are some stalks of fruits scattered about and\nunder a small pile in the corner, you can make out some small pieces off\nglass and crystal that are reflecting the ambient light.\n',32,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(4862,-27,-14,0,'Pathway','This is where the path meets the rolling hills.  To the east you can see\nsome rolling hills and a gigantic tree.  You hear the sounds of of birds\nnearby.\n',32,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4863,-28,-15,0,'Pathway','You are on a path that runs between some hills.  There is a gentle\nbreeze blowing from the north and you hear the sounds of bird calls\nfrom the north as well.\n',32,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4864,-27,-16,0,'Pathway','You are on a path that runs between some hills.  There is a gentle\nbreeze blowing from the north and you hear the sounds of bird calls\nfrom the north as well.\n',32,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4865,-28,-17,0,'Pathway','You are on a path that runs between some hills.  There is a gentle\nbreeze blowing from the north and you hear the sounds of bird calls\nfrom the north as well.\n',32,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4866,-28,-18,0,'Pathway','You are on a path that runs between some hills.  There is a gentle\nbreeze blowing from the north and you hear the sounds of bird calls\nfrom the north as well.\n',32,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(4867,-28,-19,0,'Pathway','You are on a path that runs between some hills.  There is a gentle\nbreeze blowing from the north and you hear the sounds of bird calls\nfrom the north as well.\n',32,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(5000,0,0,0,'A Niche at the Edge of a Desolate Valley','The mountains close in on all sides except to the south, creating a little\nniche in the edge of this desolate valley.  The area is clear of vegetation,\neven the ground has smoothed out into a fine-grained gravel.  The bitter,\nice-cold wind howls and eddies near the southern edge of the niche, but the\nnorthern end is well-protected from its buffeting.\n',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(5001,0,0,0,'A Niche at the Edge of a Desolate Valley','The mountains close in on all sides except to the south, creating a little\nniche in the edge of this desolate valley.  The area is clear of vegetation,\neven the ground has smoothed out into a fine-grained gravel.  The bitter,\nice-cold wind howls and eddies near the southern edge of the niche, but the\nnorthern end is well-protected from its buffeting.\n',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(5002,0,0,0,'A Niche at the Edge of a Desolate Valley','The mountains close in on all sides except to the east, creating a little\nniche in the edge of this desolate valley.  The area is clear of vegetation,\neven the ground has smoothed out into a fine-grained gravel.  The bitter,\nice-cold wind howls and eddies near the eastern edge of the niche, but the\nwestern end is well-protected from its buffeting.\n',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(5003,0,0,0,'The Edge of a Desolate Valley','  A bitter, ice-cold wind relentlessly buffets the sparse and desolate\nlandscape, filled mostly with large rocks and boulders.  Here and there, a\nnaked tree stands lonely against the sky, sharing the hard-packed, frozen\nground with stunted-looking sagebrush bare of foliage, silvered by frost.  The\nice-capped mountains rim the edge of the valley.\n',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(5004,0,0,0,'The Edge of a Desolate Valley','  A bitter, ice-cold wind relentlessly buffets the sparse and desolate\nlandscape, filled mostly with large rocks and boulders.  Here and there, a\nnaked tree stands lonely against the sky, sharing the hard-packed, frozen\nground with stunted-looking sagebrush bare of foliage, silvered by frost.  The\nice-capped mountains rim the edge of the valley.\n',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(5005,0,0,0,'A Niche at the Edge of a Desolate Valley','  The mountains close in on all sides except to the east, creating a little\nniche in the edge of this desolate valley.  The area is clear of vegetation,\neven the ground has smoothed out into a fine-grained gravel.  The bitter,\nice-cold wind howls and eddies near the eastern edge of the niche, but the\nwestern end is well-protected from its buffeting.\n',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(5006,0,0,0,'Narrow Passage at a Desolate Valley','  The mountains close in on all sides except to the east and west, creating a\nnarrow passage in this desolate valley.  The area is clear of vegetation,\neven the ground has smoothed out into a fine-grained gravel.  The bitter,\nice-cold wind howls and eddies near the eastern edge of the niche, but toward\nthe west it doesn\'t buffet as fiercely.\n',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(5007,0,0,0,'The Floor of a Desolate Valley','  A bitter, ice-cold wind relentlessly buffets the sparse and desolate\nlandscape, filled mostly with large rocks and boulders.  Here and there, a\nnaked tree stands lonely against the sky, sharing the hard-packed, frozen\nground with stunted-looking sagebrush bare of foliage, silvered by frost.  The\nfloor of this desolate valley stretches around, a yawning sea of grays and\nwhites.\n',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
