(5023,0,0,0,'Narrow Passage at a Desolate Valley','  The mountains close in on all sides except to the east and west, creating a\nnarrow passage in this desolate valley.  The area is clear of vegetation, even\nthe ground has smoothed out into a fine-grained gravel.  The bitter, ice-cold\nwind howls and eddies the sparse landscape.\n',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
