(5050,0,0,0,'<g>A Cluster of Ferns<z>','Supple and moist, the walls and ceiling of this room are covered in healthy,\nfresh <g>ferns<z>.  A scrambled pattern of footprints mar the muddy floor\nleaving behind small pools of swamp water.\n',0,139272,27,0,0,0,0,-1,10,100,0,'',NULL),
