(5055,0,0,0,'<B>A Small Watering Hole<z>','<g>Run-off from this corner of the swamp seems to have found this little dip to\naccumulate in.  <z><B>Amazingly enough, the water is much clearer than you\'d\nexpect to see in a swamp.  Tiny webbed footprints appear here and there and\naround the outsides of the pool.<z>  <g>Large walls of foliage and reeds keep\nthis spot barely visible from the rest of the swamp.<z>\n',0,8200,29,0,0,0,0,0,10,100,0,'',NULL),
