(5091,0,0,0,'<k>The Cave of<z> <R>Dalia\'Pantin<z>','<k>Any thing that might have once thrived in this cave ceased growing long ago. \nThe presence that calls this space home seems to have sucked all the life from\nit.  The floor, walls, and ceiling are nothing but cold, bare stone.  Small\nsplatters of <R>blood<z> <k>stain the floor.<z>\n',0,139272,33,0,0,0,0,-1,10,100,0,'',NULL),
