(5599,-31,8,0,'Northwest Forest of Lan\'Quin','  You are not sure if you are heading in the right direction or not.  The\nceiling overhead is a tangle of dead limbs and barely surviving leaves, with\nfog and gloom closing in everywhere.  Strange howling sounds resound in your\near, coming from every direction at once.  Your ears strain to make out that\nslight rustling which follows you wherever you go, but you can not determine\nwhat the source is.  You only hope you can find the light of day before you\nsuffocate in this death gulch.\n',37,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(5600,-20,7,0,'West of a Small Hill','  A small, almost perfectly round hill is the only feature of note.  The trees\nseem to have decided not to grow here, in fact, the only vegetation visible\nare many small mushrooms which grow in spurts across the mound in random\nformations.  It seems as though the trail has brought you to a dead end,\nalthough you could walk around the perimeter of the mound, or simply up to the\ntop if the thought crossed your mind.  But for some strange reason, you seem\ncompelled to travel clockwise ...\n',38,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
