(5632,0,0,0,'A Trail Through Some Rocky Hills','  Rough terrain lies all about you as you make your way along what is little\nmore than a gamepath.  The rock strewn hillsides on either side force to you\nto stay to the trail if you wish to avoid spraining an ankle.  Scraggly brush\ngrows in the gaps between the rocks, providing a hiding place for who knows\nwhat type of wildlife.  An occasional pine or spruce tree grows atop the\nwindswept hills.  The path continues to the east and southwest.  \n',44,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(5633,0,0,0,'A Trail Through Some Rocky Hills','  Rough terrain lies all about you as you make your way along what is little\nmore than a gamepath.  The rock strewn hillsides on either side force to you\nto stay to the trail if you wish to avoid spraining an ankle.  The hills are\nhigher here than in the surrounding area, allowing a good view of the great\nexpanse of forest that extends in all directions.  The path continues to the\nwest and northeast.  \n',44,131072,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
