(5795,0,0,0,'A Desolate Battlefield','  A warm wind blows across the sky, carrying with it the odor of blood and\ndeath.  Various broken weapons and drops of blood are randomly found strewn\nabout the ground.  It seems as though the battlefield stretches on infinitely\nin all directions.  On the ground here, there are large holes and aberrations.\n',42,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(5796,0,0,0,'A Desolate Battlefield','  A warm wind blows across the sky, carrying with it the odor of blood and\ndeath.  Various broken weapons and drops of blood are randomly found strewn\nabout the ground.  It seems as though the battlefield stretches on infinitely\nin all directions.\n',42,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
