(6396,0,0,0,'North Camino Pescadero','  Camino Pescadero is a main north-south thoroughfare that runs \nthrough the heart of Xanesla\'s marketing district.  A large tavern is \nto the east, which is generally populated at all hours by rowdy \nindividuals.  The street has been paved with a white and flaky \nshale that kicks up a fine power when disturbed. \n',0,139584,22,0,0,0,0,-1,100,-1,0,'',NULL),
(6397,0,0,0,'North Camino Pescadero','  Camino Pescadero is a main north-south thoroughfare that runs \nthrough the heart of Xanesla\'s marketing district.  A pleasant looking inn\nis to the east.  The street has been paved with a white and flaky shale \nthat kicks up a fine power when disturbed. \n',0,139584,22,0,0,0,0,-1,100,-1,0,'',NULL),
(6398,0,0,0,'Del Playa Road','  The busy streets of Camino Pescadero and Del Playa intersect here, \noften resulting in heavy congestion and horrific accidents.  \n',0,139584,22,0,0,0,0,-1,100,-1,0,'',NULL),
(6399,0,0,0,'South Camino Pescadero','  Camino Pescadero is a main north-south thoroughfare that runs \nthrough the heart of Xanesla\'s marketing district.  A large field is \nto the east.  The street has been paved with a white and flaky shale \nthat kicks up a fine power when disturbed. \n',0,139584,22,0,0,0,0,-1,100,-1,0,'',NULL),
(6400,0,0,0,'South Camino Pescadero','  Camino Pescadero is a main north-south thoroughfare that runs \nthrough the heart of Xanesla.  The street has been paved with a \nwhite and flaky shale that kicks up a fine power when disturbed. \n',0,139584,22,0,0,0,0,-1,100,-1,0,'',NULL),
