(6402,0,0,0,'South Camino Pescadero','  Camino Pescadero is a main north-south thoroughfare that runs \nthrough the heart of Xanesla.  To the north is the busy market \ndistrict.  The street has been paved with a white and flaky shale \nthat kicks up a fine power when disturbed. \n',0,139584,22,0,0,0,0,-1,100,-1,0,'',NULL),
(6403,0,0,0,'South Camino Pescadero','  Camino Pescadero is a main north-south thoroughfare that runs \nthrough the heart of Xanesla.  To the north is the busy market \ndistrict.  The street has been paved with a white and flaky shale\nthat kicks up a fine power when disturbed. \n',0,139584,22,0,0,0,0,-1,100,-1,0,'',NULL),
(6404,0,0,0,'South Camino Pescadero','  The Soutern end of Camino Pescadero ends here abruptly at the \nsouthern city wall.  To the east is a large building.  To the north is \nthe hustle and bustle of the heart of Xanesla.  This street has \nbeen paved with a flaky shale that kicks up a fine white powder \nwhen disturbed.\n',0,139584,22,0,0,0,0,-1,100,-1,0,'',NULL),
(6405,0,0,0,'Cynthia\'s Clerical Emporium','  The strong scent of incense permeates this quaint little shop.  \nThe walls are decorated with painting of famous religious icons \nand events. \n',0,166077,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6406,0,0,0,'Crab\'s Clothing Supplies','  Rows and rows of clothing, both new and used are hanging \nfrom the ceiling of this musty shop.  Small signs are scattered \nabout advertising the latest sales. \n',0,166077,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6407,0,0,0,'Salty\'s Armor Supplies','  Salty\'s armor shop is littered with various pieces of old armor.  Once a \nsailor, Salty gathered up all of his treasure and opened up a shop.  \n',0,166077,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6408,0,0,0,'The Mariner\'s Blade','  The standard types of weapons adorn the walls, each with a \nprice tag affixed to them.  The air smells of sulfur, and small \nmetal shavings cover the floor. \n',0,166077,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6409,0,0,0,'Old Kings Tavern','  Sawdust has been sprinkled about the floor of this trendy and \nupscale tavern.  Small dart boards are hung on the walls and a \nlarge decorative bar is against the northern wall.  \n',0,166077,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6410,0,0,0,'Beach Comber Inn','  A tranquil and homey feel dominates this inn, where the rich \nand famous are known to stay while vacationing.  \n',0,166073,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6411,0,0,0,'Del Playa Road','  A simple dirt  road runs east and west through Xanesla.  The\nroad is littered with trash and debris.\n',0,139584,22,0,0,0,0,-1,20,-1,0,'',NULL),
(6412,0,0,0,'Stork Field','  This large field has been granted by the University to the citizens \nof Xanesla.  The grass is slowly browning and being covered with \ntrash.  On weekends students can be found here gathered together \nin various sporting events centered around alcohol, which \ngenerally deteriorate into a bacchanalian orgy.  \n',0,139584,26,0,0,0,0,-1,50,-1,0,'',NULL),
(6413,0,0,0,'Stork Field','  This large field has been granted by the University to the citizens\nof Xanesla.  The grass is slowly browning and being covered with\ntrash.  On weekends students can be found here gathered together\nin various sporting events centered around alcohol, which \ngenerally deteriorate into a bacchanalian orgy.  \n',0,139584,26,0,0,0,0,-1,50,-1,0,'',NULL),
(6414,0,0,0,'Dark Hallway','  The lighting in this room is kept very low, probably to allow the \ncustomers some discretion.  The paint along the walls, ceiling and \nfloors is flaking apart, and lies scattered about the floor in pieces.  \n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,25,100,0,'',NULL),
(6415,0,0,0,'Dark Hallway','  The lighting in this room is kept very low, probably to allow the \ncustomers some discretion.  The paint along the walls, ceiling and \nfloors is flaking apart, and lies scattered about the floor in pieces.  \n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6416,0,0,0,'Dark Hallway','  The lighting in this room is kept very low, probably to allow the \ncustomers some discretion.  The paint along the walls, ceiling and \nfloors is flaking apart, and lies scattered about the floor in pieces.  \n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,25,100,0,'',NULL),
(6417,0,0,0,'Brothel Entrance','  The lighting in this room is kept very low, probably to allow the \ncustomers some discretion.  To the north lies the famous Xanesla \nbrothel.  The paint along the walls, ceiling and floors is flaking apart, \nand lies scattered about the floor in pieces.  \n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,25,100,0,'',NULL),
(6418,0,0,0,'Lester\'s Jewels','  A small wooden building has been converted into a jewelry \nstore.  Small dust covered display cases are stacked along the \nwalls, partially hiding the merchandise.  \n',0,166077,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6419,0,0,0,'Jenoa\'s General Store','  Jenoa\'s store is well organized and tidy, despite the large \namount of inventory that is always kept on hand.  \n',0,166077,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6420,0,0,0,'Eldon\'s Precious Gems','Eldon is apparently not a shopkeeper who prides himself on \ntidiness. His shop and its contents are covered with crumbs \nand empty tea cups are littered about.  \n',0,166077,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6421,0,0,0,'Component World','  Jars of various bug parts, eyeballs, and other unidentifiable \nobjects are scattered throughout this shop, which is in complete \ndisarray.  \n',0,166077,32,0,0,0,0,-1,100,100,0,'',NULL),
(6422,0,0,0,'Post Office','  Stacks of letters, most of them opened, are littered about this \notherwise empty room.  A small sign is plastered along the \nnorthern wall.  \n',0,166077,22,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6423,0,0,0,'Tio Alberto\'s Snack Shop','  The stoves are covered with pots of simmering food which \nbubble and burp over a well tended flame.  There is a small \ncounter behind which the workers are diligently preparing the \nfood. \n',0,166077,32,0,0,0,0,-1,25,100,0,'',NULL),
(6424,0,0,0,'Del Playa Road','  A simple dirt  road runs east and west through Xanesla.  The\nroad is littered with trash and debris.\n',0,139584,22,0,0,0,0,-1,100,-1,0,'',NULL),
