(6427,0,0,0,'Palatial Room','  This room has been decorated to look like a palatial throne room.  A \nlarge fake diamond throne sits against the northern wall.  A small \nbowl of grapes has been set before the throne.  Long strands of \npurple and gold silk banners hang from the ceiling.  \n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,50,100,0,'',NULL),
(6428,0,0,0,'Cave Like Room','  This room has been decorated to look like a primitive cave.  There are\n<b>simplistic <p>finger <r>paintings on the wall, <y>tiger skin rugs <1>strewn\nabout,\nand a fake fire blazing in the middle of the room.\n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,50,100,0,'',NULL),
(6429,0,0,0,'Western Room','  This room has been decorated to look like a western setting.  Two \nsmall sleeping bags have been spread out across the floor which has \nbeen covered in dust.  Several cactus are drawn on the walls.  The \nceiling has been painted as a star covered sky.        \n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,50,100,0,'',NULL),
(6430,0,0,0,'Selection Room','  This room is covered with writings and warnings that have been\nplastered to the walls.  The room is painted all white and has a\nlemony smell.\n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,50,100,0,'',NULL),
(6431,0,0,0,'Ocean Avenue','  <b>This street <W>has been painted <b>blue and <W>white to \n<b>give it an ocean look.  Small well fitting cobblestones <W> have \nbeen expertly crafted <b>and laid to give them street <W>a \nsurprisingly smooth texture.  <b>A small shop is to the west.<1>    \n',0,139584,22,0,0,0,0,-1,25,-1,0,'',NULL),
