(6440,0,0,0,'A Hobbit Hole','  This room has been built to resemble an underground hobbit \nhole.  The furniture is all very diminutive and quaint.  The room smells\nof freshly cut grass.\n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,50,100,0,'',NULL),
(6441,0,0,0,'Underground Room','  This room has been built to resemble an underground cave.  Fake \nstalactites and stalagmites have been affixed to the floor and \nceiling.  Fake veins of gold have been painted into the walls. \n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,50,100,0,'',NULL),
(6442,0,0,0,'Forest Room','This room has been built to resemble a small forest.  Fake trees\nand grass decorate  the room and bird songs are coming from an\nunknown source.  The air smells of wet grass.\n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,50,100,0,'',NULL),
(6443,0,0,0,'A Lounge','This room has been designed as a relaxing break room for the working girls.\nThe walls are painted in soft colors and the furniture is plush and relaxing.\n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,50,100,0,'',NULL),
(6444,0,0,0,'Ocean\'s Arena','  One of the earliest buildings in Xanesla, the city\'s arena has been \naround for years.  A large dirt floor expands throughout the arena \nand is stained dark with blood.  Large stands loom up above to \nthe west.    \n',0,139584,21,0,0,0,0,-1,25,-1,0,'',NULL),
(6445,0,0,0,'Ocean\'s Arena','  One of the earliest buildings in Xanesla, the city\'s arena has been \naround for years.  A large dirt floor expands throughout the arena \nand is stained dark with blood.  Large stands loom up above to \nthe west.    \n',0,139584,21,0,0,0,0,-1,25,-1,0,'',NULL),
