(6462,0,0,0,'Waiting Room','  This is the waiting room to Xanesla\'s only hospital.  The room is kept\nspotlessly clean and smells of ammonia. There is generally a lot\nof traffic here as the citizens of Xanesla are always getting into trouble.\n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6463,0,0,0,'Emergency Room','  This is the only office of Xanesla\'s doctor.  Here, maladies of all \ntypes are expertly treated by the hospital staff.  The floor is \nspattered with blood and soiled rags.  \n',0,205176,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6464,0,0,0,'Del Playa Road','  A simple dirt road runs east and west through Xanesla.  The road is littered\nwith trash and debris.  \n',0,139584,22,0,0,0,0,-1,100,-1,0,'',NULL),
(6465,0,0,0,'Trash Strewn Cottage','  This small cottage is littered with trash and infested by rodents.  Rotting\nfood and unopened books lie scattered about the room.  Although it is only a\nsmall living space, it would appear that at least seven students are living here\nat once.\n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,25,100,0,'',NULL),
(6466,0,0,0,'Small Cottage','  This small cottage is littered with trash and infested by rodents.  Rotting\nfood and unopened books lie scattered about the room.  Although it is only a\nsmall living space, it would appear that at least seven students are living\nhere at once.\n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,25,100,0,'',NULL),
(6467,0,0,0,'Stuffy Apartment','  This small cottage is littered with debris, trinkets, and collectibles.  It\nwould appear that whoever lives here is not very found of getting rid of things.\nThe extensive collection is gathered together in precarious stacks that appear\nready to topple with the slightest disturbance. \n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6468,0,0,0,'Overcrowded Apartment','  This small apartment appears to be the home of many young, sloppy and\nundedicated students.  The remnants of many parties lie scattered about the\ncottage.  Empty alcohol bottles, half eaten moldy food, and dried puddles of\ncrusty vomit decorate the room.  \n',0,139584,22,0,0,0,0,-1,40,-1,0,'',NULL),
(6469,0,0,0,'Bry\'s Alchemy Shop','  This small shop is cluttered with beakers, bottles, and ingredients which are\nloosely strewn about the room.  The air reeks of sulphur and is somewhat hazy. \nAs this shop is out of the market district, it is clear that it is being run\nillegally and probably kicks back a portion of its profits to the city\nofficials.  \n',0,166077,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6470,0,0,0,'Tealeaf\'s Items of Opportunity','  This small shop is cluttered with lock picks, trap parts, and poisonous\ningredients which are carelessly strewn about the room.  The air reeks of\nsteel and is somewhat hazy.  As this shop is out of the market district, it is\nclear that it is being run illegally and probably kicks back a portion of its\nprofits to the city officials.  \n',0,166077,32,0,0,0,0,-1,25,100,0,'',NULL),
(6471,0,0,0,'North State Street','  State street is a busy thoroughfare which is congested both night and day. \nThe road has been paved with a dense marble coating which is perpetually dull\ndue to all the traffic.  The road ends to the north at the base of the city\nwall.  To the west looms the Xanesla arena, while to the east is the Mission.  \n',0,139584,22,0,0,0,0,-1,100,-1,0,'',NULL),
(6472,0,0,0,'North State Street','  State street is a busy thoroughfare which is congested both night and day. \nThe road has been paved with a dense marble coating which is perpetually dull\ndue to all the traffic.  The street continues to the north and south.\n',0,139584,22,0,0,0,0,-1,100,-1,0,'',NULL),
