(6483,0,0,0,'South State Street','State street is a busy thoroughfare which is congested both night and day.\nThe road has been paved with a dense marble coating which is perpetually dull\ndue to all the traffic.  The street continues to the south.  To the east is\nthe great tower of Xanesla.\n',0,139584,22,0,0,0,0,-1,100,-1,0,'',NULL),
(6484,0,0,0,'Mission Entrance','  This old stone building was built here long before the city was erected around\nit.  Originally it was used as a rallying point from which the Galekians brought\nreligion to the local natives.  Now it is kept solely as a tourist attraction.  ',0,140616,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6485,0,0,0,'Mission Altar','  This old stone building was built here long before the city was erected around\nit.  Originally it was used as a rallying point from which the Galekians brought\nreligion to the local natives.  Now it is kept solely as a tourist attraction.\nA large marble altar, paying homage to Mezan is here.\n',0,140616,32,0,0,0,0,-1,25,100,0,'',NULL),
(6486,0,0,0,'College Entrance','  This modernized building was designed to instill thinking and creativity in\nits\noccupants.  Unfortunately the modern design, which focused more on creative\nangles and fixtures, has left the building drafty and unstable.  Small bits of\nrubble cover the floor, having fallen from the large cracked ceiling.\n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,50,100,0,'',NULL),
(6487,0,0,0,'Sterile Hallway','This modernized building was designed to instill thinking and creativity in\nits occupants.  Unfortunately the modern design, which focused more on\ncreative angles and fixtures, has left the building drafty and unstable.  Small\nbits of rubble cover the floor having fallen from the large cracked ceiling.\n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,25,100,0,'',NULL),
(6488,0,0,0,'Classroom','  This classroom is a bland and generic modern classroom.  Over thirty tiny\ndesks have been crammed together in a semicircle, focused at the desk and\nchalkboard at the front of the room.  ',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,30,100,0,'',NULL),
(6489,0,0,0,'Church Entrance','  Although religion is not prominent in Xanesla, the church has become a social\nmeeting place for all sorts of people.  The church is very accepting of all\nreligious beliefs.  The church has been crafted from a solid white marble which\nis often polished, keeping it shiny and fresh looking.\n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,25,100,0,'',NULL),
(6490,0,0,0,'Donation Room','  Although religion is not prominent in Xanesla, the church has become a social\nmeeting place for all sorts of people.  The church is very accepting of all\nreligious beliefs.  The church has been crafted from a solid white marble which\nis often polished, keeping it shiny and fresh looking.\n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,30,100,0,'',NULL),
(6491,0,0,0,'Daycare Center','  The citizens of Xanesla are able to drop their children off in daycare while\nthey work.  Oddly, the daycare facilities are rarely used.  Noticeably missing\nfrom this barren room are any toys, trinkets or other items that the children\ncan play with.  \n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,25,100,0,'',NULL),
(6492,0,0,0,'Skid Row','  This narrow alley runs east from state street.  The street is not paved and is\nriddled with holes, large rocks, and mud.  The local residents pile their\ngarbage in this alley, which often collects for weeks, emitting a rancid\nodor.  The homeless have erected makeshift shelters and have claimed this as\ntheir own.\n',0,139584,22,0,0,0,0,-1,20,-1,0,'',NULL),
(6493,0,0,0,'Tower Hallway','  This newly designed tower was built shortly after a series of unsuccessful\nattempts on the life of the Queen of Xanesla.  It was not designed for style or\ncomfort, but was intended to use both man power and magical forces to protect\nthe Queen at all costs.  The corridors are very narrow, allowing only a few\npeople to pass at once.\n',0,172360,32,0,0,0,0,-1,25,100,0,'',NULL),
(6494,0,0,0,'6494','Empty\n',0,131072,60,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
