(6529,0,0,0,'Science Laboratory','  This room reeks of ammonia and sulfur.  A large wooden table sits in the\ncenter of the room and is covered with assorted jar and glasses, each filled\nwith unidentifiable liquids, jells, and flesh-like substances. \n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,40,100,0,'',NULL),
