(6531,0,0,0,'Altar','  A large altar rises up above, nearly fifteen feet, depicting a couple in an\nintimate embrace.  A small pulpit faces the congregation sitting area, from\nwhich a fervent priest may address his flock.  \n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
