(6545,0,0,0,'Sewer Outlet','The sewer abruptly ends at a large steel grate, through \nwhich the city\'s waste flows out into the ocean.  The bars of \nthe grate are covered in a foul smelling black grime.\n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6546,0,0,0,'City Sewer Tunnel','  Just below Del Playa, this section of the city is filled with waste.\nThe walls are coated with a shiny brown slime and glisten with moisture. \n',0,139592,22,0,0,0,0,-1,30,100,0,'',NULL),
(6547,0,0,0,'Sewer Tunnel','The sewer walls are coated with slime and grime, as a trickle of water heads\nsoutheast.  A foul stench rises up from the floor.\n',0,139592,22,0,0,0,0,-1,30,100,0,'',NULL),
(6548,0,0,0,'Sewer Tunnel','  The smell of fecal matter and rotting food is immensely powerful and steeps\ninto everything.  The walls are coated with a shiny brown slime and glisten with\nmoisture.  A foul congealed brown substance coats the floor.  The stone walls\nare beginning to crumble and dust trickles from the ceiling.   \n',0,139592,22,0,0,0,0,-1,30,100,0,'',NULL),
(6549,0,0,0,'Sewer Tunnel','The smell of fecal matter and rotting food is immensely powerful and seeps\ninto everything.  The walls are coated with a shiny brown slime and glisten with\nmoisture.  A foul congealed brown substance coats the floor.\n',0,139592,22,0,0,0,0,-1,30,100,0,'',NULL),
(6550,0,0,0,'Sewer Tunnel','  The smell of fecal matter and rotting food is immensely powerful and \nsteeps into everything.  The walls are coated with a shiny brown slime \nand glisten with moisture.  A foul congealed brown substance coats the \nfloor.\n',0,139592,22,0,0,0,0,-1,30,100,0,'',NULL),
(6551,0,0,0,'City Sewers','  Just below skid row, this section of the sewer is even more\nfilthy and disgusting than most.  Large piles of dung and\ntrash are spread about. \n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6552,0,0,0,'Sewer Tunnel','  This section of the sewers has been swept clean of the debris and filth. \nNearby a \nnewly dug tunnel reveals signs of recent activity.\n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,30,100,0,'',NULL),
(6553,0,0,0,'Freshly Made Tunnel','  This freshly dug tunnel links up to the city sewers.  Although it is kept\nclean,\nthe smell of the sewers blows in and pollutes the tunnel air.\n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6554,0,0,0,'Freshly Made Tunnel','  To the west, the putrid city sewers emit a foul odor into this tunnel.\nTo the east, the recently crafted tunnel delves deeper into the earth.  \n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6555,0,0,0,'Freshly Made Tunnel','  This newly designed tunnel leads directly to and from the city sewers.  The \ntunnel itself has been carved through volcanic rock and granite.  To the east,\nthe\ntunnel grows wider.\n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6556,0,0,0,'Freshly Made Tunnel','  This newly designed tunnel leads directly to and from the city sewers. \nThe tunnel itself has been carved through volcanic rock and granite.  \nTo the east, the tunnel grows wider.\n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,30,100,0,'',NULL),
(6557,0,0,0,'Dead End Tunnel','  The freshly carved tunnel ends abruptly here at a granite\nwall, which is covered with various symbols.  Fresh footprints lead to and\nfrom the dead end.\n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6558,0,0,0,'Temple Entrance','  The temple is a large, one story, stone building. The entrance is a large, \nelegantly decorated archway, with the words, \"Goddess of Blood\" \ncarved into the stone above the doorway.  Several large pillars line the \noutside of this area. The inside is very spacious, and filled with small \nbenches and stone tables. A small fountain sits in the middle of the area, \nbubbling blood.  At the far end of the temple stands a statue of a woman, \nwith wild hair standing on end and an infant\'s heart in her hand.  \n',0,172360,32,0,0,0,0,-1,30,100,0,'',NULL),
(6559,0,0,0,'6559','Empty\n',0,131072,60,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(6560,0,0,0,'Temple Corridor','The temple is a large, one story, stone building.  Several large pillars line\nthe\noutside of this area.  The inside is very spacious, and filled with small\nbenches\nand stone tables.  <r>Thin trails of blood spindle down the walls of the\ncorridor,<1>\n<R>pooling<1> on the floor.\n',0,172360,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
