(6569,0,0,0,'Burial Chamber','  Large mounds of freshly disturbed earth are strewn about this \nchamber, which is teeming with maggots.  The earth is steeped \nwith blood.  Rotting corpses are mixed in the ground, like ingredients \nin a large cauldron.  The smell of rotting flesh permeates the still air.   \n',0,172360,32,0,0,0,0,-1,25,100,0,'',NULL),
(6570,0,0,0,'Underground Masoleum','  The temple is a large, one story, stone building.  Several large pillars line\nthe outside of this area.  The inside is very spacious, and filled with small\nbenches and stone tables. <r>Thin trails of blood spindle down the walls of the\ncorridor,<1><R> pooling<1> on the floor.\n',0,172360,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6571,0,0,0,'Dark Hallway','  The temple is a large, one story, stone building.  Several large pillars line\nthe outside of this area.  The inside is very spacious, and filled with small\nbenches and stone tables. <r>Thin trails of blood spindle down the walls of the\ncorridor,<1><R> pooling<1> on the floor.\n',0,172360,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
