(6573,0,0,0,'Sarcophagus','  This ancient sarcophagus appears recently disturbed, as there are \nscuff marks in the ancient dust that coats the tomb.  Fresh pools\nof blood dot the floor. \n',0,172360,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6574,0,0,0,'Dark Hallway',' The temple is a large, one story, stone building.  Several large pillars line\nthe outside of this area.  The inside is very spacious, and filled with small\nbenches and stone tables. <r>Thin trails of blood spindle down the walls of the\ncorridor,<1><R> pooling<1> on the floor.\n',0,172360,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6575,0,0,0,'Sarcophagus','  Recently decimated in a fire, this tomb is nothing more than a pile of\nsmoldering ashes.\nThin wisps of smoke trail up from the ashes.\n',0,172360,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6576,0,0,0,'Dark Hallway','  The temple is a large, one story, stone building.  Several large pillars line\nthe outside of this area.  The inside is very spacious, and filled with small\nbenches and stone tables. <r>Thin trails of blood spindle down the walls of the\ncorridor,<1><R> pooling<1> on the floor.\n',0,172360,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
