(6578,0,0,0,'Dark Crypt','  This is the western end of a large crypt.  Far off to the east a large\naltar. <r>Melodic drips of blood<1> fall from the ceiling, splatter on the\nfloor, and ooze\ntoward the altar.  An electric charge hangs in the air.  The walls\ntwist and contort, momentarily forming faces screaming in \nagony.\n',0,172360,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6579,0,0,0,'Dark Crypt','  This is the middle of a large crypt.  Far off to the east a large\naltar. <r>Melodic drips of blood<1> fall from the ceiling, and ooze\ntoward the altar.  An electric charge hangs in the air.  The walls\ntwist and contort, momentarily forming faces screaming in \nagony.\n',0,172360,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6580,0,0,0,'Dark Crypt','  This is the east end of a large crypt.  Small drops of blood ooze\nin from the west, run up the side of the altar, and disappear into it.\nAn electric charge hangs in the air.  The walls twist and contort, \nmomentarily forming faces that scream in agony.\n',0,172360,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
