(6587,0,0,0,'Tunnel Branch','The smell of fecal matter and rotting  food is immensely powerful and steeps\ninto everything.  The walls are coated with a shiny brown slime and glisten\nwith moisture.  A foul congealed brown substance coats the floor.  The stone\nwalls are beginning to crumble and dust trickles from the ceiling.  The tunnel\nbranches off in many directions here.\n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(6588,0,0,0,'Sewer Tunnel','The smell of fecal matter and rotting  food is immensely powerful and steeps\ninto everything.  The walls are coated with a shiny brown slime and glisten\nwith moisture.  A foul congealed brown substance coats the floor.  The stone\nwalls are beginning to crumble and dust trickles from the ceiling.  The tunnel\nbranches off in several directions.\n',0,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
