(6680,0,-4,-5,'Sunken Tunnel','  You stand in a long tunnel, of which the floor seems to have dropped about\ntwo feet below the level of the other tunnels.  The floor is crumbling below\nyour feet, and it seems as though it could give way at anytime soon.  The tunnel\nruns north and south from here.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
