(6690,7,-5,-5,'Leper Colony','  You are standing in a room which is much larger than any of the others that\nyou have seen thus far.  The room is square, and you guess that it is a living\nquarters for this group of lepers.  The lepers have come here to seek refuge\nfrom the persecution that they found in Grimhaven.  There is rotting pieces of\nflesh and body parts lying all around the floor.  There is a putrid stench in\nthe air here.  The only exit lies back to the east.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6691,4,-1,-5,'Leper Colony','  You are standing in a room which is much larger than any of the others that\nyou have seen thus far.  The room is square, and you guess that it is a living\nquarters for this group of lepers.  The lepers have come here to seek refuge\nfrom the persecution that they found in Grimhaven.  There is rotting pieces of\nflesh and body parts lying all around the floor.  There is a putrid stench in\nthe air here.  The only exit from here is back to the west.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6692,6,-2,-5,'Dark Corridor','  You stand in a corridor that is extremely dark.  This appears to connect\ntwo of the other passages to one another.  As you feel along the walls, you\nnotice that these walls feel very smooth.  The corridor is otherwise empty.\nThe corridor continues north into darkness, and there is a small step-down to\nthe south leading to another tunnel.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6693,6,-1,-5,'Dark Corridor','  You stand in a corridor that is extremely dark.  This appears to connect\ntwo of the other passages to one another.  As you feel along the walls, you\nnotice that these walls feel very smooth.  The corridor is otherwise empty.\nThis corridor runs north and south into complete darkness.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6694,6,0,-5,'Dark Corridor','  You stand in a corridor that is extremely dark.  This appears to connect\ntwo of the other passages to one another.  As you feel along the walls, you\nnotice that these walls feel very smooth.  The corridor is otherwise empty.\nThe corridor continues north and south from here.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6695,6,1,-5,'Flesh Filled Corridor','  You are standing in the most grotesque corridor you have ever seen.  There\nare large blood stains on the floor, and rotting flesh and limbs littering the\nground.  There is a horrible odor in the air, and you feel your stomach turning.\nThis passage must be used heavily by the lepers who call this place home.  You\nsee a tunnel leading to the south, as well as east and west.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6696,7,1,-5,'Flesh Filled Corridor','  You are standing in the most grotesque corridor you have ever seen.  There\nare large blood stains on the floor, and rotting flesh and limbs littering the\nground.  There is a horrible odor in the air, and you feel your stomach turning.\nThis passage must be used heavily by the lepers who call this place home.  You\ncan continue east and west along this corridor.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6697,8,1,-5,'Flesh Filled Corridor','  You are standing in the most grotesque corridor you have ever seen.  There\nare large blood stains on the floor, and rotting flesh and limbs littering the\nground.  There is a horrible odor in the air, and you feel your stomach turning.\nThis passage must be used heavily by the lepers who call this place home.  You\nstand in a sharp bend in the corridor that now leads north and west.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6698,8,2,-5,'Flesh Filled Hallway','  You are standing in the most grotesque corridor you have ever seen.  There\nare large blood stains on the floor, and rotting flesh and limbs littering the\nground.  There is a horrible odor in the air, and you feel your stomach turning.\nThis passage must be used heavily by the lepers who call this place home.  You\nsee that the hallway continues north and south from this point.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6699,8,3,-5,'Flesh Filled Hallway','  You are standing in the most grotesque corridor you have ever seen.  There\nare large blood stains on the floor, and rotting flesh and limbs littering the\nground.  There is a horrible odor in the air, and you feel your stomach turning.\nThis passage must be used heavily by the lepers who call this place home.  You\nsee a small door on the west wall, which is the direction the blood stains lead.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6700,8,4,-5,'Cave-In','  You stand in a small section of the hallway that has caved-in recently.\nUpon further inspection, you can tell that this hallway used to lead somewhere\nto the north.  Large rocks now block the way in that direction, and they\nwould be much to difficult to move.  It looks as though you will have to turn\nback to the south.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6701,7,3,-5,'Lit Hallway','  You are standing at the beginning of this well lit, well traveled hallway.\nThere are dozens of small blood drops on the ground, as well as some small\npieces of flesh and a few partial limbs.  There is a stench in the air here, and\nit is making you sick to your stomach.  There is a small door on the east wall.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6702,6,3,-5,'Lit Hallway','  You stand in a bend in this well lit hallway.  Small blood drops and\nrotting pieces of flesh litter the ground here, and there is a stench in\nthe air that makes you feel a little queasy.  This tunnel would appear to\nbe heavily traveled by the lepers that call this place home.  The hallway\nruns to the north and east from here.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6703,6,4,-5,'Lit Hallway','  You are standing in the middle of a well lit, well traveled hallway.  There\nare many small blood drops on the floor, and there is a slight stench of rotten\nflesh in the air.  The tunnel seems to be a main means of travel for the lepers\noccupying this dungeon.  The hallway continues north and south from here.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6704,6,5,-5,'Lit Hallway','  You are standing at the end of this well lit hallway.  There are blood drops\nlining the floor, and the appearance of the floor gives you the impression\nthat this tunnel is well traveled.  Doors lie to the north, east, and west.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6705,5,1,-5,'Flesh Filled Corridor','  You are standing in the most grotesque corridor you have ever seen.  There\nare large blood stains on the floor, and rotting flesh and limbs littering the\nground.  There is a horrible odor in the air, and you feel your stomach turning.\nThis passage must be used heavily by the lepers who call this place home.  You\ncan travel east and west from here.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6706,4,1,-5,'Flesh Filled Corridor','  You are standing in the most grotesque corridor you have ever seen.  There\nare large blood stains on the floor, and rotting flesh and limbs littering the\nground.  There is a horrible odor in the air, and you feel your stomach turning.\nThis passage must be used heavily by the lepers who call this place home.  You\nsee a small iron door to the north with blood drops leading underneath, and\nthis corridor continues east and west.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6707,4,2,-5,'Leper Colony','  You are standing in a room which is much larger than any of the others that\nyou have seen thus far.  The room is square, and you guess that it is a living\nquarters for this group of lepers.  The lepers have come here to seek refuge\nfrom the persecution that they found in Grimhaven.  There is rotting pieces of\nflesh and body parts lying all around the floor.  There is a putrid stench in\nthe air here.  The only exit from here is back to the south.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6708,3,1,-5,'Flesh Filled Corridor','  You are standing in the most grotesque corridor you have ever seen.  There\nare large blood stains on the floor, and rotting flesh and limbs littering the\nground.  There is a horrible odor in the air, and you feel your stomach turning.\nThis passage must be used heavily by the lepers who call this place home.  You\nstand in a bend in the corridor, leading to the east and south.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6709,3,0,-5,'Soaked Tunnel','  You are standing in a very wet tunnel.  The air is very moist, and it has\na horrible odor.  There is a slime on the walls that make them very slick to\nthe touch.  You can hear water falling somewhere to the south, and that is\nno doubt the source of the moisture.  There is a small trail of blood leading\nto the north from here.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6710,2,-1,-5,'Musty Tunnel','  You stand in a musty tunnel.  There is a lot of moisture in the air here,\nand it feels very thick.  The walls have a coating of slippery moss on them,\nwhich covers them almost entirely.  The floor is damp to the touch, and it\nis sticking to your boots.  To the east you see a very wet tunnel, and you can\nalso travel to the west.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6711,1,-1,-5,'Musty Tunnel','  You are standing in a musty tunnel.  There is a lot of moisture in the air\nhere, and it feels very thick.  The walls have a coating of slippery moss on\nthem, and it covers them almost entirely.  The floor is damp to the touch, and\nit sticks to your boots.  This tunnel travels east and west from here.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6712,0,-1,-5,'Musty Tunnel','  You are standing at a bend in this musty tunnel.  There is a lot of moisture\nin the air here, and it feels very thick.  The walls have a coating of moss\non them that is very slippery, and covers them almost entirely.  The floor\nis very damp here, and it is sticking to your boots.  You feel a slight draft\nof cool air coming from the north.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6713,0,0,-5,'Musty Tunnel','  You stand in the middle of a very musty tunnel.  There is a lot of moisture\nin the air, and it feels very thick.  The walls are covered with a thin layer\nof moss, making them very slippery.  The floor is damp here, and it sticks to\nyour boots as you make your way through.  You feel a slight draft of cool air\ncoming from the north.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6714,0,1,-5,'Musty Tunnel','  You are standing in a musty tunnel.  There is a lot of moisture in the air\nand it feels very thick.  The walls are covered almost completely with moss,\nwhich makes them slick to the touch.  The floor is damp here, and it sticks\nto your boots as you make your way through.  You feel a slight draft of cool\nair coming from the north.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6715,0,2,-5,'Cool Passage','  This tunnel is filled with very cool air.  The air is also moist, and it\nseems to be getting more so as it heads west.  The walls are cold, and they\nare smooth as you run your hand along them.  The floor is covered with a thin\nlayer of wet dirt.  This passage leads east and west, and there is another\ntunnel to the south.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6716,1,2,-5,'Cool Passage','  This tunnel is filled with very cool air.  The air is also moist, and it\nseems to be getting more so as it heads west.  The walls are cold, and they\nare smooth as you run your hand along them.  The floor is covered with a thin\nlayer of wet dirt.  You see a large iron door on the north wall, and this tunnel leads west.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6717,1,3,-5,'Missionary Headquarters','  You stand in a very large room, which serves as a headquarters for this\ngroup of missionaries.  They have come here from far away lands to help the\npoor lepers.  The walls are carved smooth and the floor is well kept.  There\nis a lovely scent of burning incense burning here.  There are many large banners\nthat here, hanging on all of the walls.  There are doors to the east and south.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6718,2,3,-5,'Winding Hallway','  The hallway that you are standing in is extremely dark.  The walls are your\nonly guide as you make your way through.  The walls here are very rough, and the\nfloor is one of soft dirt.  There is an eerie quiet here.  Feeling your way\nalong the west wall, you notice an iron door.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6719,2,4,-5,'Winding Hallway','  The hallway that you are standing in is extremely dark.  The walls are your\nonly guide as you make your way through.  The walls here are very rough, and the\nfloor is one of soft dirt.  There is an eerie quiet here.  Feeling your way\nalong the walls, you can tell that this hallway runs north and south.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6720,2,5,-5,'Winding Hallway','  The hallway that you are standing in is extremely dark.  The walls are your\nonly guide as you make your way through.  The walls here are very rough, and the\nfloor is one of soft dirt.  There is an eerie quiet here.  Feeling your way\nalong the walls, you can tell that there is a sharp bend here, and the\nhallway continues to the south and west.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6721,1,5,-5,'Winding Hallway','  The hallway that you are standing in is extremely dark.  The walls are your\nonly guide as you make your way through.  The walls here are very rough, and the\nfloor is one of soft dirt.  There is an eerie quiet here.  Feeling your way\nalong the walls, you notice that this is another bend in the hallway.  You\ncan travel north and east from here.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6722,1,6,-5,'Winding Hallway','  The hallway that you are standing in is extremely dark.  The walls are your\nonly guide as you make your way through.  The walls here are very rough, and the\nfloor is one of soft dirt.  There is an eerie quiet here.  Feeling your way\ncan tell that this passage leads south and west.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6723,0,6,-5,'Winding Hallway','  The hallway that you are standing in is extremely dark.  The walls are your\nonly guide as you make your way through.  The walls here are very rough, and the\nfloor is one of soft dirt.  There is an eerie quiet here.  Feeling your way\nthe walls you determine that the only exits lie to the east and west.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6724,-1,6,-5,'Winding Hallway','  The hallway that you are standing in is extremely dark.  The walls are your\nonly guide as you make your way through.  The walls here are very rough, and the\nfloor is one of soft dirt.  There is an eerie quiet here.  Feeling your way\nalong the walls, you can tell that this passage has come to an end.  You notice\na large door to the south, and upon touching it your hand becomes covered\nwith what appears to be blood.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6725,-1,3,-5,'Leper Colony','  You are standing in a room which is much larger than any of the others that\nyou have seen thus far.  The room is square, and you guess that it is a living\nquarters for this group of lepers.  The lepers have come here to seek refuge\nfrom the persecution that they found in Grimhaven.  There is rotting pieces of\nflesh and body parts lying all around the floor.  There is a putrid stench in\nthe air here.  The only exit from here is back to the south.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6726,-1,2,-5,'Cool Passage','  This tunnel is filled with very cool air.  The air is also moist, and it\nseems to be getting more so as it heads west.  The walls are cold, and they\nare smooth as you run your hand along them.  The floor is covered with a thin\nlayer of wet dirt.  There is a small iron door in the north wall, and this\npassage continues to the east and west.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6727,-2,2,-5,'Cool Passage','  This tunnel is filled with very cool air.  The air is also moist, and it\nseems to be getting more so as it heads south.  The walls are cold, and they\nare smooth as you run your hand along them.  The floor is covered with a thin\nlayer of wet dirt.  The floor feels more saturated as this tunnel heads south.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6728,-2,1,-5,'Cool Passage','  This tunnel is filled with very cool air.  The air is also moist, and it\nseems to be getting more so as it heads south.  The walls are cold, and they\nare smooth as you run your hand along them.  The floor is covered with a thin\nlayer of wet dirt, leading you to believe that there is water nearby.  You\ncan hear a trickling of water coming from the south.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6729,-2,0,-5,'Cool Passage','  The tunnel that you stand in is very cool and moist here.  There is a mist\nin the air, and it is very refreshing.  The walls are covered with beads of\nwater, and the floor is extremely damp.  You can hear the sound of flowing water\ncoming from the south, and you may also travel north.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6730,-2,-1,-5,'Underground Spring','  You stand along the northern wall of a very large underground spring.\nThe walls are very moist, and there are beads of water running down them.\nThe water has formed many large puddles on the floor, and it appears to be\na good source of fresh water.  The air is cool, moist, and very refreshing.\nYou may move in any direction from here.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6731,-1,-1,-5,'Underground Spring','  You stand in the northeast corner of a very large underground spring.\nThe walls are very moist, and there are beads of water running down them.\nThe water has formed many large puddles on the floor, and it appears to be\na good source of fresh water.  The air is cool, moist, and very refreshing.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6732,-1,-2,-5,'Underground Spring','  You stand in the southeast corner of a very large underground spring.\nThe walls are very moist, and there are beads of water running down them.\nThe water has formed many large puddles on the floor, and it appears to be\na good source of fresh water.  The air is cool, moist, and very refreshing.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6733,-2,-2,-5,'Underground Spring','  You stand along the southern wall of a very large underground spring.\nThe walls are very moist, and there are beads of water running down them.\nThe water has formed many large puddles on the floor, and it appears to be\na good source of fresh water.  The air is cool, moist, and very refreshing.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6734,-3,-2,-5,'Underground Spring','  You stand in the southwest corner of a very large underground spring.\nThe walls are very moist, and there are beads of water running down them.\nThe water has formed many large puddles on the floor, and it appears to be\na good source of fresh water.  The air is cool, moist, and very refreshing.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6735,-3,-1,-5,'Underground Spring','  You stand in the northwest corner of a very large underground spring.\nThe walls are very moist, and there are beads of water running down them.\nThe water has formed many large puddles on the floor, and it appears to be\na good source of fresh water.  The air is cool, moist, and very refreshing.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6736,-1,5,-5,'Top of a Dark Stairway','  You are standing at the top of a very large staircase.  The stairs are made\nfrom some sort of stone, and are very steep.  You hear a bone curdling scream\ncoming from somewhere down below although it is much to dark to see anything.\nThere is a large iron door on the north wall.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6737,5,5,-5,'Priest\'s Chamber','  This is a very large room, and it has a holy aura about it.  The room is very\ntidy, and it appears that the priest is an organized man.  There are various\nreligious artifacts lying around.  The only exit from here, is through the\ndoor on the east wall.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6738,7,5,-5,'Prayer Room','  This room has a very holy aura about it.  There is a large altar in the center\nof the room.  There are banners on the wall as well as a large wooden cross.\nThere is a padded bench on the ground just in front of the altar, and you\nimagine that this is for kneeling before the altar in prayer.  Maybe this\nwould be a good time to pray for safe travels.  The only exit lies west.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6739,6,6,-5,'Leper Colony','  You are standing in a room which is much larger than any of the others that\nyou have seen thus far.  The room is square, and you guess that it is a living\nquarters for this group of lepers.  The lepers have come here to seek refuge\nfrom the persecution that they found in Grimhaven.  There is rotting pieces of\nflesh and body parts lying all around the floor.  There is a putrid stench in\nthe air here.  The only visible exit lies back to the south.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6740,-1,5,-6,'Base of a Dark Stairway','  You are standing at the base of a very large staircase.  The stairs are\nmade from some sort of stone, and they are very steep.  There are some small\nblood drops on a few of the steps.  It is very dark here, and you can only\nsee a couple feet around you.  From here, the stairs lead upward.  You can not\nsee what looms to the south.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6741,-1,4,-6,'Short Corridor','  This corridor is very short and narrow.  There are many footprints here on\nthe ground, and you can tell that these are of human origin.  It seems that\nthere has been much activity here recently.  Looking to the south, you see a\nlarge iron door.  Looking north, the corridor leads to a large staircase.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6742,-1,3,-6,'Vigilante Outpost','  You are standing along the northern wall of a large vigilante outpost.\nThe men that live here, have come to bring the seedy individuals that roam the\ndungeon, to justice.  There are many swords and shields adorning the walls, and\nscraps of metal and broken weapons litter the floor.  This room serves as a\ntraining facility as well as the headquarters.\n',41,131081,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6743,-2,3,-6,'Vigilante Outpost','  You are standing in the northwest corner of a large vigilante outpost.\nThe men that live here, have come to bring the seedy individuals that roam the\ndungeon, to justice.  There are many swords and shields adorning the walls, and\nscraps of metal and broken weapons litter the floor.  This room serves as a\ntraining facility as well as the headquarters.\n',41,131081,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6744,-2,2,-6,'Vigilante Outpost','  You are standing in the southwest corner of a large vigilante outpost.\nThe men that live here, have come to bring the seedy individuals that roam the\ndungeon, to justice.  There are many swords and shields adorning the walls, and\nscraps of metal and broken weapons litter the floor.  This room serves as a\ntraining facility as well as the headquarters.  There is a small wooden door\non the west wall with a sign on it.\n',41,131081,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6745,-3,2,-6,'Sleeping Quarters','  You are standing in a very large room that smells of body odor.  This seems\nto be the sleeping quarters for this group of vigilantes.  The room is bare of\ndecor and furnishings except for the many bunkbeds lining the walls.  The\nonly exit from here lies back to the east.\n',41,131081,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6746,-1,2,-6,'Vigilante Outpost','  You are standing along the southern wall of this large vigilante outpost.\nThe men that live here, have come to bring the seedy individuals that roam the\ndungeon, to justice.  There are many swords and shields adorning the walls, and\nscraps of metal and broken weapons litter the floor.  This room serves as a\ntraining facility as well as the headquarters.  There is a large iron door\nto the south that is barred shut with a long length of wood.\n',41,131081,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6747,0,2,-6,'Vigilante Outpost','  You are standing in the southeast corner of a large vigilante outpost.\nThe men that live here, have come to bring the seedy individuals that roam the\ndungeon, to justice.  There are many swords and shields adorning the walls, and\nscraps of metal and broken weapons litter the floor.  This room serves as a\ntraining facility as well as the headquarters.\n',41,131081,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6748,0,3,-6,'Vigilante Outpost','  You are standing in the northeast corner of a large vigilante outpost.\nThe men that live here, have come to bring the seedy individuals that roam the\ndungeon, to justice.  There are many swords and shields adorning the walls, and\nscraps of metal and broken weapons litter the floor.  This room serves as a\ntraining facility as well as the headquarters.  There is a small wooden\ndoor on the east wall with a sign on it.\n',41,131081,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6749,1,3,-6,'Office of the Captain','  This small room is no doubt an office.  The room is very tidy, everything\nseems to have a place specifically designed for it.  The captain seems to\nbe a very organized man.  There is the smell of pipe smoke in the air, and\nsmall plaques and awards hang on the walls.\n',41,131081,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6750,-1,1,-6,'Narrow Corridor','  You are standing in a very narrow corridor, which is lined by rough walls.\nThere is rubble on the ground, and it is somewhat difficult to walk.  This would\nnot be a good place to stumble upon someone, due to the lack of space.  You can\nhear some quiet movement coming from somewhere nearby, but can not tell where.\nThere is a large iron door to the north, and you may also travel south.\n',41,131081,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6751,-1,0,-6,'Corridor Crossing','  You are standing in the middle of an intersection of two tunnels.  Judging\nby the footprint in the dirt, it appears that there has been much travel here\nrecently.  To the north and south you see a very narrow corridor, but it is\ntoo dark to see much else in those directions.  To the east and west, the tunnel\nwidens greatly, providing more room to move about.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6752,0,0,-6,'Wide Tunnel','  You are walking along in a very wide tunnel, that measures about fifteen\nfeet across.  The walls are rough, and appear to have been chipped away to make\ntraveling easier.  More evidence of this is in the small rocks that line the\nedges near the walls.  There are human footprints all along this tunnel floor.\nFeeling along the walls, you can tell that the tunnel continues east and west.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6753,1,0,-6,'Wide Tunnel','  You are walking along in a very wide tunnel, that measures about fifteen\nfeet across.  The walls are rough, and appear to have been chipped away to make\ntraveling easier.  More evidence of this is in the small rocks that line the\nedges near the walls.  There are human footprints all along this tunnel floor.\nThere is a sharp bend here in the tunnel.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6754,-2,0,-6,'Wide Tunnel','  You are walking along in a very wide tunnel, that measures about fifteen\nfeet across.  The walls are rough, and appear to have been chipped away to make\ntraveling easier.  More evidence of this is in the small rocks that line the\nedges near the walls.  There are human footprints all along this tunnel floor.\nThis tunnel continues east and west into complete darkness.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6755,-3,0,-6,'Wide Tunnel','  You are walking along in a very wide tunnel, that measures about fifteen\nfeet across.  The walls are rough, and appear to have been chipped away to make\ntraveling easier.  More evidence of this is in the small rocks that line the\nedges near the walls.  There are human footprints all along this tunnel floor.\nThe tunnel bends here, continuing east and south.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6756,-3,-1,-6,'Dead End','  You have come to a dead end in this wide tunnel.  Looks like you will have\nto turn back the way which you entered.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6757,-1,-1,-6,'Narrow Corridor','  You are standing in a very narrow corridor, which is lined by rough walls.\nThere is rubble on the ground, and it is somewhat difficult to walk.  This would\nnot be a good place to stumble upon someone, due to the lack of space.  You can\nhear some quiet movement coming from somewhere nearby, but can not tell where.\nFrom here the tunnel goes north and south.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6758,-1,-2,-6,'End of a Narrow Corridor','  You are standing at the end of this very narrow corridor.  It is very dark.\nThere is rubble on the ground, and it is somewhat difficult to walk.  This would\nnot be a good place to stumble upon someone, due to the lack of space.  You can\nhear some quiet movement coming from somewhere nearby, but can not tell where.\nThere is a large wooden crate pushed up against the south wall, that seems\nto be out of place.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6759,-1,-3,-6,'Criminal Hideout','  You are standing in what seems to be a hideout of sorts for a group of\nescaped convicts.  There are various home made weapons and pieces of armor\nstacked along the walls.  There are no beds here, and from the looks of\nthings these criminals sleep on the dirt floor, if they sleep at all.   You\ncan see the back side of a crate that closes off this hideout to the north.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6760,-2,-3,-6,'Criminal Hideout','  You are standing in what seems to be a hideout of sorts for a group of\nescaped convicts.  There are various home made weapons and pieces of armor\nstacked along the walls.  There are no beds here, and from the looks of\nthings these criminals sleep on the dirt floor, if they sleep at all.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6761,-2,-4,-6,'Criminal Hideout','  You are standing in what seems to be a hideout of sorts for a group of\nescaped convicts.  There are various home made weapons and pieces of armor\nstacked along the walls.  There are no beds here, and from the looks of\nthings these criminals sleep on the dirt floor, if they sleep at all.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6762,-1,-4,-6,'Criminal Hideout','  You are standing in what seems to be a hideout of sorts for a group of\nescaped convicts.  There are various home made weapons and pieces of armor\nstacked along the walls.  There are no beds here, and from the looks of\nthings these criminals sleep on the dirt floor, if they sleep at all.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6763,1,-1,-6,'Wide Tunnel','  You are walking along in a very wide tunnel, that measures about fifteen\nfeet across.  The walls are rough, and appear to have been chipped away to make\ntraveling easier.  More evidence of this is in the small rocks that line the\nedges near the walls.  There are human footprints all along this tunnel floor.\nThe tunnel runs north and south from here.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6764,1,-2,-6,'Wide Tunnel','  You are walking along in a very wide tunnel, that measures about fifteen\nfeet across.  The walls are rough, and appear to have been chipped away to make\ntraveling easier.  More evidence of this is in the small rocks that line the\nedges near the walls.  There are human footprints all along this tunnel floor.\nThis wide tunnel continues to the north and east, and there is a large opening\nto the south of here.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6765,1,-3,-6,'Large Cavern','  You are standing in a very large cavern.  The roof is nearly twenty feet high,\nand you can move about freely.  The walls have some small carvings on them,\ngiving the impression that someone has been here recently.  There are also\nscraps of weapons and armor on the ground, and it seems as if there was a great\nbattle that took place here.  The only visible exit is back to the north.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6766,3,-3,-6,'Small Dwelling','  This small room is very cluttered.  It appears to serve as both a home and\na place of study to Druindar.  The room is bare of any fixtures, except for\nthe various pieces of equipment lying around.  The walls are carved out of\nthe the stone, making them rough to the touch.  There are almost as many\nbooks lying around as there are weapons and training equipment.\n',42,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6767,2,-2,-6,'Wide Tunnel','  You are walking along in a very wide tunnel, that measures about fifteen\nfeet across.  The walls are rough, and appear to have been chipped away to make\ntraveling easier.  More evidence of this is in the small rocks that line the\nedges near the walls.  There are human footprints all along this tunnel floor.\nThe tunnel runs east and west from here.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6768,3,-2,-6,'Wide Tunnel','  You are walking along in a very wide tunnel, that measures about fifteen\nfeet across.  The walls are rough, and appear to have been chipped away to make\ntraveling easier.  More evidence of this is in the small rocks that line the\nedges near the walls.  There are human footprints all along this tunnel floor.\nThe tunnel continues east and west, and there is a small iron door to the south.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6769,4,-2,-6,'Wide Tunnel','  You are walking along in a very wide tunnel, that measures about fifteen\nfeet across.  The walls are rough, and appear to have been chipped away to make\ntraveling easier.  More evidence of this is in the small rocks that line the\nedges near the walls.  There are human footprints all along this tunnel floor.\nThe tunnel continues west from here, and the tunnel to the north seems to have\nexcess amounts of loose dirt in it.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6770,4,-1,-6,'Earthy Tunnel','  This tunnel is more natural than most of the others that you have seen so\nfar.  Loose soil covers the floor completely and as you walk, the muddy\nsoil clumps to your boots.  The stench of fresh earth is in the air.  In\nthe distance, you can hear screams of agony.  This tunnel leads north and\nsouth, and there is another corridor leading east.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6771,5,-1,-6,'Well Traveled Hallway','  You stand in a very heavily traveled hallway.  The floor is covered with\nmany footprints, and there is an appearance that someone was dragged through\nhere recently.  The walls are covered with soot, and there is a slight haze in\nthe air.  There is also the stench of burning flesh here, and loud screams echo\nthrough the hallway.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6772,6,-1,-6,'Well Traveled Hallway','  You stand in a very heavily traveled hallway.  The floor is covered with\nmany footprints, and there is an appearance that someone was dragged through\nhere recently.  The walls are covered with soot, and there is a slight haze in\nthe air.  There is also the stench of burning flesh here, and loud screams echo\nthough the hallway.  The screams seem to be getting louder to the north.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6773,6,0,-6,'Well Traveled Hallway','  You stand in a very heavily traveled hallway.  The floor is covered with\nmany footprints, and there is an appearance that someone was dragged through\nhere recently.  The walls are covered with soot, and there is a slight haze in\nthe air.  There is also the stench of burning flesh here, and loud screams echo\nthough the hallway.  The screams seem to be getting louder to the north.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
