(6775,6,2,-6,'Well Traveled Hallway','  You stand in a very heavily traveled hallway.  The floor is covered with\nmany footprints, and there is an appearance that someone was dragged through\nhere recently.  The walls are covered with soot, and there is a slight haze in\nthe air.  There is also the stench of burning flesh here, and loud screams echo\nthough the hallway.  The screams seem to be getting louder to the north.  There\nis a musty smell coming from the west.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6776,5,2,-6,'Earthy Tunnel','  This tunnel is more natural than most of the others that you have seen so\nfar.  Loose soil covers the floor completely and as you walk, the muddy\nsoil clumps to your boots.  The stench of fresh earth is in the air.  In\nthe distance, you can hear screams of agony.  This tunnel leads east to a\nwell traveled tunnel, and also west.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6777,4,2,-6,'Earthy Tunnel','  This tunnel is more natural than most of the others that you have seen so\nfar.  Loose soil covers the floor completely and as you walk, the muddy\nsoil clumps to your boots.  The stench of fresh earth is in the air.  In\nthe distance, you can hear screams of agony.  This tunnel makes a sharp\nbend here, leading south and east.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6778,4,1,-6,'Earthy Tunnel','  This tunnel is more natural than most of the others that you have seen so\nfar.  Loose soil covers the floor completely and as you walk, the muddy\nsoil clumps to your boots.  The stench of fresh earth is in the air.  In\nthe distance, you can hear screams of agony.  This tunnel leads north and\nsouth from here.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6779,4,0,-6,'Earthy Tunnel','  This tunnel is more natural than most of the others that you have seen so\nfar.  Loose soil covers the floor completely and as you walk, the muddy\nsoil clumps to your boots.  The stench of fresh earth is in the air.  In\nthe distance, you can hear screams of agony.  This tunnel leads north and\nsouth from here.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6780,6,3,-6,'Entrance to the Torture Chamber','  You are standing before a large torture chamber.  You can hear screams of\npain and agony coming from inside.  There is a smoky haze in the air, and the\nstench of burning flesh in the air.  The only thing that separates you from\nthis horror is the large iron door on the north wall.\n',41,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6781,6,4,-6,'Torture Chamber','  You stand just inside the entrance to a very large torture chamber.  There\nare scraps of metal, bone, flesh, and blood stains scattered about the floor.\nThere is a smoky haze filling the air, making it difficult to breath.  The\nwalls here are black, and covered with soot.  There are various implements of\ntorture filling the chamber.  From here you may move in any direction.\n',41,163848,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6782,5,4,-6,'Torture Chamber','  You stand in the southwest corner of this very large torture chamber.  There\nare scraps of metal, bone, flesh, and blood stains scattered about the floor.\nThere is a smoky haze filling the air, making it difficult to breath.  The\nwalls here are black, and covered with soot.  There are various implements of\ntorture filling the chamber.  There is a small holding cell to the west.\n',41,163848,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(6783,4,4,-6,'Dirty Cell','  You are standing in a very dirty cell.  There is a small dish on the floor\nwhich you assume is for food or water or maybe both.  The floor is dirt, with\nstrands of a hay-like material strewn about.  There is a make-shift bed in the\nnortheast corner of the cell consisting of 2 rocks and an old piece of cloth.\nThe only way out is past the iron cell bars to the east.\n',41,163848,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
