(7179,52,-135,5,'On the Citadel Walls',' You stand on the massive walls of the Citadel.  To the south the\nwalls descend to merge with the canyon wall and you become dizzy as\nyou realize just how high up the cliff face the Citadel rests.  A\ndoor to the east leads into one of the gate towers for the Citadel.\n',46,131072,2,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(7180,53,-135,5,'Top of a Citadel Gate Tower',' Slightly large than the bailey gate towers this tower is still\nslightly cramped even though the room is completely barren of\nobjects.  A door to west appears to lead out onto the Citadel\nWalls and a window to the southeast overlooks the main gates to\nthe Citadel.  Oil lamps are attached to the walls to keep the\ntower lit at all times for the guards.\n',46,131081,12,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(7181,56,-135,5,'Top of a Citadel Gate Tower',' Slightly large than the bailey gate towers this tower is still\nslightly cramped even though the room is completely barren of\nobjects.  A door to east appears to lead out onto the Citadel Walls\nand a window to the southwest overlooks the main gates to the\nCitadel.  Oil lamps are attached to the walls to keep the tower lit\nfor the guards at all times.\n',46,131081,12,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
