(7236,0,0,0,'On the Mine Lift',' While you stand on the lift it creaks, rattles, and shakes moving you\nupwards.  The rocky walls pass by with their hacked and hewned surfaces\ndisplaying tiny dots of missed obsidian.  The lift itself is a blur of\nmotion as counter weights, ropes, and pulleys move by you to slowly\nmove you to the top of the lift.\n',46,139592,13,50,7228,1,0,0,10,120,0,'',NULL),
(7237,0,0,0,'On the Mine Lift',' While you stand on the lift it creaks, rattles, and shakes moving you\ndownwards.  The rocky walls pass by with their hacked and hewned surfaces\ndisplaying tiny dots of missed obsidian.  The lift itself is a blur of\nmotion as counter weights, ropes, and pulleys move by you to slowly\nmove you to the bottom of the lift.\n',46,139592,13,50,7266,1,0,0,10,120,0,'',NULL),
