(7275,0,0,0,'Main Mine Area',' Littered with rocks, obsidian ore, and scrapped mining tools this is\nthe main area of the mines.  Once a natural cavern the walls of the mine\nwere hacked away stripping them of almost all their ore.  A few slaves\nwork around the area removing small bits of obsidian overlooked for\nlarger areas earlier in the mining.  Otherwise most work occurs in the\nactive area of the mine to the northeast.  Occasionally a structural\nbracing element can be seen bracing a wall whose stability is in\nquestion.  To the southeast a passage leads to the storage area of the\nmines.\n',46,139592,13,0,0,0,0,0,0,200,0,'',NULL),
(7276,50,-129,3,'Wide Ledge Above the Mines',' This ledge appears to run around the main portion of the Mine and is\nused by the guards for both the transportation of goods into and out of\nthe Mine and to observe and watch the Mine activities.  Deep ruts mar\nthe surface you walk on while you spot occasional wooden structures\noverhead.  The ledge itself is about six feet wide and has no railing\nof any type.\n',46,139592,13,0,0,0,0,0,10,120,0,'',NULL),
(7277,0,0,0,'Main Mine Area',' Littered with rocks, obsidian ore, and scrapped mining tools this is\nthe main area of the mines.  Once a natural cavern the walls of the mine\nwere hacked away stripping them of almost all their ore.  A few slaves\nwork around the area removing small bits of obsidian overlooked for\nlarger areas earlier in the mining.  Otherwise most work occurs in the\nactive area of the mine to the northeast.  Occasionally a structural\nbracing element can be seen bracing a wall whose stability is in\nquestion.\n',46,139592,13,0,0,0,0,0,0,200,0,'',NULL),
(7278,0,0,0,'Main Mine Area',' Littered with rocks, obsidian ore, and scrapped mining tools this is\nthe main area of the mines.  Once a natural cavern the walls of the mine\nwere hacked away stripping them of almost all their ore.  A few slaves\nwork around the area removing small bits of obsidian overlooked for\nlarger areas earlier in the mining.  Otherwise most work occurs in the\nactive area of the mine to the northeast.  Occasionally a structural\nbracing element can be seen bracing a wall whose stability is in\nquestion.\n',46,139592,13,0,0,0,0,0,0,200,0,'',NULL),
(7279,0,0,0,'Talrog\'s Office',' Slightly neater then the rest of the mines this small office was\nconverted from a dead end shaft.  A simple wall and door have been\nerected across the opening to the south of the tunnel making it into\na small room.  The walls while not \"house\" quality have been sanded\nsmooth and are fairly plumb.  Several lamps adorn the wall keeping\nthe area lit at all times.\n',46,139593,13,0,0,0,0,0,15,120,0,'',NULL),
(7280,0,0,0,'Storage Area',' A little neater then the rest of the mines this storage area was\nthe second area which the miners explored.  Unfortunately most of the\nveins they mined in this direction quickly died out leaving them\nwith a large dead space.  It was quickly converted to this storage\narea as the miners struck an incredibly rich vein to the northeast of\nthe original mine.  Not much can be seen here besides the occasional\nbracing, stacks of wood for future braces, piles of broken mining\ntools to be refurbished, and an occasional extremely well sealed\ncrate of pure obsidian ore, but generally these are transported out\nof the mines within hours of being sealed shut.  A passage to the main\nmine area can be seen to the northwest.\n',46,139592,13,0,0,0,0,0,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(7281,0,0,0,'Storage Area',' A little neater then the rest of the mines this storage area was\nthe second area which the miners explored.  Unfortunately most of the\nveins they mined in this direction quickly died out leaving them\nwith a large dead space.  It was quickly converted to this storage\narea as the miners struck an incredibly rich vein to the northeast of\nthe original mine.  Not much can be seen here besides the occasional\nbracing, stacks of wood for future braces, piles of broken mining\ntools to be refurbished, and an occasional extremely well sealed\ncrate of pure obsidian ore, but generally these are transported out\nof the mines within hours of being sealed shut.\n',46,139592,13,0,0,0,0,0,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(7282,0,0,0,'Storage Area',' A little neater then the rest of the mines this storage area was\nthe second area which the miners explored.  Unfortunately most of the\nveins they mined in this direction quickly died out leaving them\nwith a large dead space.  It was quickly converted to this storage\narea as the miners struck an incredibly rich vein to the northeast of\nthe original mine.  Not much can be seen here besides the occasional\nbracing, stacks of wood for future braces, piles of broken mining\ntools to be refurbished, and an occasional extremely well sealed\ncrate of pure obsidian ore, but generally these are transported out\nof the mines within hours of being sealed shut.  A wall and door\nerected across the passage to a dead end tunnel block passage to the\nnorth.\n',46,139592,13,0,0,0,0,0,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(7283,0,0,0,'Cooking Area',' This tiny alcove off the storage area is used as a cooking pit for\nthe slave who cooks the meals.  A tiny hole above the cooking pit is\nperfect for directing smoke out of the mines.  Unfortunate to the\nslaves it is no where near big enough to permit the passage of any\nhumanoid creature.\n',46,139592,13,0,0,0,0,0,0,96,0,'',NULL),
(7284,0,0,0,'Storage Area',' A little neater then the rest of the mines this storage area was\nthe second area which the miners explored.  Unfortunately most of the\nveins they mined in this direction quickly died out leaving them\nwith a large dead space.  It was quickly converted to this storage\narea as the miners struck an incredibly rich vein to the northeast of\nthe original mine.  Not much can be seen here besides the occasional\nbracing, stacks of wood for future braces, piles of broken mining\ntools to be refurbished, and an occasional extremely well sealed\ncrate of pure obsidian ore, but generally these are transported out\nof the mines within hours of being sealed shut.  A passage way to the\nnorthwest leads out to the main area of the mines.\n',46,139592,13,0,0,0,0,0,0,120,0,'',NULL),
