(7852,-9,20,-2,'On a Swift Flowing River','The river flows down a steeper gradient here, dropping below the pine and oak\ntrees that flank it to the north.  As the river flows downhill to the south,\nit cuts deeper into a rocky ravine through the countryside.\n',50,131072,29,0,0,0,30,2,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(7853,-10,20,-1,'On a River Through a Ravine','The river flows rapidly here at the northern entrance to a narrow ravine.  You\nsee some white foam forming on the water further downhill to the southwest,\nand to the north you can see a steep rise in the river\'s slope where it leads\nup to an area flanked by pine and oak trees.\n',50,131072,29,0,0,0,30,9,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(7854,-11,19,-1,'On a River Through a Ravine','The water is slightly tinged with white foam as it rushes through the ravine\nfrom northeast to southwest.  High rocky cliffs rise on each side of you as\nyou float down this river.\n',50,131072,29,0,0,0,24,9,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(7855,-12,18,-1,'On a River Through a Ravine','The water here becomes more foamy to the southwest, and you see less rapid\nparts of the river to the northeast.  Some sharp rocks jut out of the water\non the east side of the river, and you must avoid them so as to not cut\nyourself.\n',50,131072,29,0,0,0,20,9,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(7856,-13,17,-1,'On a River Through a Ravine','The water is flowing rather rapidly here, and a good amount of white foamy\nwater swirls around rocks near shallow areas of the river.  High rocky cliff\nwalls rise on either side of the river, which flows from northeast to southwest.\n',50,131072,29,0,0,0,17,9,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(7857,-14,16,-1,'On a River Through a Ravine','Rapid waters swirl around rocks jutting out of the river, causing white foam\nto spray you.  It is an effort to avoid any of the treacherous parts of the\nriver or the towering ravine walls on either side of the river.  The rapids\nflow from northeast to southwest, where they appear even more powerful.\n',50,131072,29,0,0,0,14,9,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(7858,-15,15,-1,'On a River Through a Ravine','The waters here are strong and rapidly flowing, and foamy waters splash your\nface and clothing.  The loud roar of the waters echoes in your ears and is\nmagnified by the high walls of the ravine, which guide the river from\nnortheast to southwest, and it is difficult for you to avoid slamming into them.\n',50,131072,29,0,0,0,13,9,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(7859,-16,14,-1,'On a River Through a Ravine','The ravine turns sharply to the south here, and ferocious rapids from the\nnortheast batter you into the cliff walls on the west side of the river.  Foam\nis sprayed into your face, blinding you, and the roar of the river is deafening.\n',50,131072,29,0,0,0,10,2,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(7860,-16,13,-1,'On a River Through a Ravine','The waters here are strong and rapidly flowing, and foamy waters splash your\nface and clothing.  The loud roar of the waters echoes in your ears and is\nmagnified by the high walls of the ravine, which guide the river from\nnorth to south, and it is difficult for you to avoid slamming into them.\n',50,131072,29,0,0,0,8,2,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(7861,-16,12,-1,'On a River Through a Ravine','The waters here are strong and rapidly flowing, and foamy waters splash your\nface and clothing.  The loud roar of the waters echoes in your ears and is\nmagnified by the high walls of the ravine, which guide the river from\nnorth to south, and it is difficult for you to avoid slamming into them.\n',50,131072,29,0,0,0,7,2,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(7862,-16,11,-1,'On a River Through a Ravine','The waters here are strong and rapidly flowing, and foamy waters splash your\nface and clothing.  The loud roar of the waters echoes in your ears and is\nmagnified by the high walls of the ravine, which guide the river from\nnorth to south, and it is difficult for you to avoid slamming into them.\n',50,131072,29,0,0,0,7,2,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(7863,-16,10,-1,'On a River Through a Ravine','The ravine turns viciously to the southwest here, and ferocious rapids from the\nnorth batter you into the cliff walls on the south side of the river.  Foam is\nsprayed into your face, blinding you, and the roar of the river is deafening.\n',-1,131072,29,0,0,0,7,9,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(7864,-17,9,-1,'On a River Through a Ravine','The waters here are strong and rapidly flowing, and foamy waters splash your\nface and clothing.  A loud roar of the waters echoes in your ears and is\nmagnified by the high walls of the ravine, which guide the river from\nnortheast to southwest, and it is difficult for you to avoid slamming into them.\n',50,131072,29,0,0,0,8,9,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(7865,-18,8,-1,'On a River Through a Ravine','The ravine turns sharply to the south here, and ferocious rapids from the\nnortheast batter you into the cliff walls on the west side of the river.  Foam\nis sprayed into your face, blinding you, and the roar of the river is deafening.\n',50,131072,29,0,0,0,10,2,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(7866,-18,7,-1,'On a River Through a Ravine','The waters here are strong and rapidly flowing, and foamy waters splash your\nface and clothing.  The loud roar of the waters echoes in your ears and is\nmagnified by the high walls of the ravine, which guide the river from north\nto south, and it is difficult for you to avoid slamming into them.\n',50,131072,29,0,0,0,10,2,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(7867,-18,6,-1,'On a River Through a Ravine','The ravine turns sharply to the south here, and ferocious rapids from the\nnorth batter you into the cliff walls on the south side of the river.  Foam\nis sprayed into your face, blinding you, and the roar of the river is deafening.\nFortunately, you can see the ravine walls sharply cut off to the southwest\nand a forest terrain seems to dominate.\n',50,131072,29,0,0,0,10,9,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(7868,-19,5,-1,'On a River at the Edge of a Ravine','A ravine is formed out of the terrain to the northeast, where the river\ncurrent is flowing from.  The waters here flow at a much slower pace than in\nthe ravine.  To the south and west you see dense trees lining the top ridges\nof the ravine as the area turns to forest.\n',50,131072,29,0,0,0,20,2,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(7869,-19,4,-1,'On a River at the Edge of a Ravine','A ravine is formed out of the terrain to the northeast, where the river\ncurrent is flowing from.  The waters here flow at a much slower pace than in\nthe ravine.  To the south and west you see dense trees lining the top ridges\nof the ravine as the area turns to forest.\n',50,131072,29,0,0,0,20,2,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(7870,-19,3,-1,'On a River at the Edge of a Ravine','The river turns south here and leads through a forest to the Serpent River.\nThe bend in the river has the effect of dampening the current, which is more\nrapid to the northeast.  There is a bridge to the southwest over the  peaceful\nwaters.\n',50,131072,29,0,0,0,25,9,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(8400,-9,1,0,'The Entrance to the Abandoned Golden Treasure Casino','<k>  You are standing in the entrance to the Abandoned Golden Treasure.\nThe first thing you notice are the long rows of derelict slot machines\nto the east and west.  Further into the casino you can make out three\nor four <1><R>firepits<1><k> in the center of the room.  An inconspicuous spiral\nstaircase leads upwards.  A strange wooden panel below you looks like\nit can be opened.<1>\n',-1,393225,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(8401,-9,2,0,'A <R>Firepit<1>','<k>  A <1><R>firepit<1><k> has been built using old slot machine parts here.\nHalf-burned remains of a large table smolder in the pit.  <1><g>Green felt<1><k>\nstill clings to one chunk of relatively unscathed wood and barely\ndiscernible markings indicate that it was once a blackjack table.\nA few mouldy sleeping mats surround the pit.<1>\n',-1,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(8402,-9,4,0,'A <R>Firepit<1>','<k>  A <1><R>firepit<1><k> has been built using old slot machine parts here.\nHalf-burned remains of a large table smolder in the pit.  Green felt\nstill clings to one chunk of relatively unscathed wood and barely\ndiscernible markings indicate that it was once a craps table.\nA few mouldy sleeping mats surround the pit.<1>\n',-1,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(8403,-9,5,0,'A <R>Firepit<1>','<k>  A <1><R>firepit<1><k> has been built using old slot machine parts here.\nHalf-burned remains of a large table smolder in the pit.  Green felt\nstill clings to one chunk of relatively unscathed wood and barely\ndiscernible markings indicate that it was once a roulette wheel.\nA few mouldy sleeping mats surround the pit.<1>\n',-1,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(8404,-10,1,0,'A Derelict Slot Machine','<k>  You are at a large derelict slot machine.  The lights have long\nsince gone dead and every once shiny surface has been scratched to\ndullness.  The handle has been broken off, probably sharpened and used\nas a shiv by some unknown vagrant.  A large jagged hole has been cut\ninto the machine at the base, presumably to remove whatever coins may\nhave remained.<1>\n',-1,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(8405,-10,2,0,'A Derelict Slot Machine','<k>  You are at a large derelict slot machine.  The lights have long\nsince gone dead and every once shiny surface has been scratched to\ndullness.  The handle has been broken off, probably sharpened and used\nas a shiv by some unknown vagrant.  A large jagged hole has been cut\ninto the machine at the base, presumably to remove whatever coins may\nhave remained.<1>\n',-1,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
