(8541,59,-40,0,'A Dirt Trail on the Veldt','This is a small dirt trail somewhere in the midst of the sprawling expanse\nof savannah you find yourself in.  Loose dirt and a few stones mark this\nrather unassuming path as it leads off into the grasslands.  A gentle wind\nsweeps across the veldt, bringing the faint odor of dried grass to your\nnostrils.  A lake lies sprawled out nearby to the southeast and a small\ncopse of trees is to the west.  Off to the southwest you can barely make\nout what appears to be a large jumble of stones.  The trail winds off to\nthe southeast and southwest.\n',50,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
