(8615,65,-44,0,'Veldt','As far as the eye can see, rolling grassland spreads out before you.\nInterspersed with the field of greens and the light yellow of sun-dried\ngrass, you can make out the occasional copse of trees and a slight\nswell of a hill far off in the distance.\n',50,131072,42,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(8616,66,-44,0,'Hills','Standing atop this hill, the view of the surrounding land is somewhat\nbreathtaking.  Off in the distance you can make out a patch of trees or two\nas well as what appears to be water speckling the grasslands.  Somewhat\ncloser is a dirt path to your northeast and more hills to your southeast\nand northwest.\n',50,131072,47,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(8617,67,-44,0,'Veldt','As far as the eye can see, rolling grassland spreads out before you.\nInterspersed with the field of greens and the light yellow of sun-dried\ngrass, you can make out the occasional copse of trees and a slight\nswell of a hill far off in the distance.\n',50,131072,42,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(8618,68,-44,0,'A Dirt Trail on the Veldt','This is a small trail somewhere in the midst of the sprawling expanse\nof plains.  Dirt and a few stones mark this rather unremarkable path as it\nleads off into the grasslands.  A slight wind sweeps across the surrounding\nsavannah, bringing the faint smell of dried grass to your nostrils.  A set of\nlow hills can be made out not too far off to the west.\n',50,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(8619,52,-45,0,'Veldt','As far as the eye can see, rolling grassland spreads out before you.\nInterspersed with the field of greens and the light yellow of sun-dried\ngrass, you can make out the occasional copse of trees and a slight\nswell of a hill far off in the distance.\n',50,131072,42,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
