(8622,55,-45,0,'Veldt','As far as the eye can see, rolling grassland spreads out before you.\nInterspersed with the field of greens and the light yellow of sun-dried\ngrass, you can make out the occasional copse of trees and a slight\nswell of a hill far off in the distance.\n',50,131072,42,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(8623,56,-45,0,'A Dirt Trail by the Ruins','This is a small dirt path somewhere in the midst of the sprawling expanse\nof veldt you find yourself in.  Loose dirt and a few stones mark this rather\nunassuming path as it leads off into the grasslands.  A soft wind sweeps\nacross the savannah, bringing the faint aroma of dried grass to your\nnostrils.  The trail seems to end quite abruptly here, as abruptly as a\nfaint dirt path can of course.  A crumbling wall of stones blocks passage\nto the east.\n',50,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(8624,57,-45,0,'Amidst a Sea of Rubble','Strewn all about is a sea of rubble.  Making movement difficult, the\nsheer amount of miscellaneous evidence of architecture in a state of\nruin is quite astounding in itself.  Mixed in with crumbled masonry\nand dirt, you can make out the occasional bit of rotted wood and\ntwisted metal.  What remains of a stone wall blocks passage to the\nsouth and west.\n',50,131072,43,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(8625,58,-45,0,'A Mountain of Pebbles','You are atop a monstrous heap of tiny stones.  Obviously not naturally\noccurring, you are at a loss as to how this formation came to be or\nwhy.  Footing on this mound is treacherous to say the least, the small\nstones not providing much in the way of a stable surface.\n',50,131072,43,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(8626,59,-45,0,'Amidst a Sea of Rubble','Strewn all about is a sea of rubble.  Making movement difficult, the\nsheer amount of miscellaneous evidence of architecture in a state of\nruin is quite astounding in itself.  Mixed in with crumbled masonry\nand dirt, you can make out the occasional bit of rotted wood and\ntwisted metal.  What remains of a stone wall blocks passage to the\neast.\n',50,131072,43,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
