(9182,0,0,0,'Up in the Canopy','Before you unfolds a whole new world.  Monkey\'s chatter loudly.  Huge\nbranches form a network, filled with life.  The humid air gently blows\nscented breezes through the tree tops.\n',59,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9183,0,0,0,'Up in the Canopy','The path along the huge branches twists and turns back and forth, through\nthe tree tops.  The breeze gently swirls sweet scents through the air.\n',59,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9184,0,0,0,'Up in the Canopy','The path along the huge branches twists and turns through the tree tops.\nThe breeze gently swirls sweet scents through the warm air.  Insects buzz\na soft lullaby, as they sip the hidden nectar of the many flowers.\n',59,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9185,0,0,0,'A Lush Jungle Path','Monkey chatter floats down from the tall trees of the inland forests.\nThe heavy musk of exotic flowers, mingle deliciously with a cacophony\nof tropical wildlife, a sweet nectar to the spirit.\n',59,131072,45,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
