(9221,0,0,0,'A Windwhipped Beach','Large barren cliffs loom to the northwest of the mist obscured beach.  The\njubilant ocean throws spray all around as it assaults the shoreline, the\nsalty breeze whisks merrily across the sand.  To the west a path leads away\nfrom the beach.\n',59,131072,54,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9222,0,0,0,'A Path Into the Mountains','The path is ornamented with an occasional tropical plant, leading uphill to\nthe northwest, plant life becomes very scarce, downhill, to the southeast\nthe path is more lush.  To the northeast is the entrance to a dark cave.\n',59,131072,48,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9223,0,0,0,'An Island Cave','The cave walls feel cold and dry, the only sounds are echoes of your\npresence.  It is very dark.\n',59,131080,56,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9224,0,0,0,'Tumbling Down a Cliffside','Rocks gouge you as you lose your balance and fall.  You slide down the\ncliffside.\n',59,131072,58,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9225,0,0,0,'Tumbling Down a Cliffside','Rocks gouge you as you lose your balance and fall.  You slide down the\ncliffside.\n',59,131072,58,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9226,0,0,0,'Tumbling Down a Cliffside','Rocks gouge you as you lose your balance and fall.  You slide down the\ncliffside.\n',59,131072,57,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9227,0,0,0,'Tumbling Down a Cliffside','Rocks gouge you as you tumble down the cliff into the jungle below.\n',59,131072,57,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9228,0,0,0,'A Steep Wooded Path','The steeply sloping, well forested path leads inland.  The sound of pigs\nsquealing loudly comes from a small sty to the west.\n',59,131072,48,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9229,0,0,0,'A Windwhipped Beach','Large barren cliffs loom to the west of the mist obscured beach.  The\njubilant ocean throws spray all around as it assaults the shoreline,\nthe salty breeze whisks merrily across the sand.\n',59,131072,54,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9230,0,0,0,'A Path Into the Mountains','The path is ornamented with an occasional tropical plant, leading uphill to\nthe north, plant life is very scarce.  To the southeast the trail leads down.\n',59,131072,48,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9231,0,0,0,'An Island Cave','Upon entering the dark cave you notice the dank smell, molds and mildews\nsend tiny spores flying with each step.  To the east the darkness\ncontinues, to the southwest is a mountainous path.\n',59,131084,56,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9232,0,0,0,'An Island Cave','Your footsteps echo through the dark cave, molds and mildews send tiny\nspores flying with each step.  To the southeast the darkness continues,\nfrom the west comes a fresh breeze.\n',59,131080,56,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9233,0,0,0,'A Steep Mountain Path','The steeply sloping path leads inland, into a thick forest.  The sound of\npigs squealing can be heard in the distance.\n',59,131072,48,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9234,0,0,0,'On a Cliff-face','You grab onto the few jutting rocks present.  Better climb out now if you\ncan, the cliff dissapears below.\n',59,131072,58,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9235,0,0,0,'On a Cliff-face','You grab onto the few jutting rocks present.  Better climb out now if you\ncan, the cliff dissapears below.\n',59,131076,58,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9236,0,0,0,'A Path Into the Mountains','The path is ornamented with an occasional tropical plant, leading uphill to\nthe northeast, the path becomes rocky and barren.  To the south the trail\nleads downhill.\n',59,131076,48,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9237,0,0,0,'A Dangerous Path Along a Mountain Ridge','You tread carefully as you pick your way between the rocks jutting out at\nall angles.  A stone occasionally plummets down the steep cliffsides that\nline the path.  The view here is breathtaking, the beach below is obscured\nby mist, tall trees grow thickly inland.\n',59,131072,48,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9238,0,0,0,'A Dangerous Path Along a Mountain Ridge','You tread carefully as you pick your way between the rocks jutting out at\nall angles.  A stone occasionally plummets down the steep cliffsides that\nline the path.  The view here is breathtaking, the beach below is obscured\nby mist, tall trees grow thickly inland.\n',59,131072,48,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9239,0,0,0,'A Dangerous Path Along a Mountain Ridge','You tread carefully as you pick your way between the rocks jutting out at\nall angles.  A stone occasionally plummets down the steep cliffsides that\nline the path, which now snakes off in several directions.  The view here\nis breathtaking,the beach below is obscured by mist, tall trees grow\nthickly inland.  Smoke from some island dwelling curls out of the tree\ntops.  Rocks roll out from under your feet, creating a very precarious\nfooting, to proceed in any direction seems extremely risky.\n',59,131076,48,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9240,0,0,0,'A Dangerous Path Along a Mountain Ridge','You tread carefully as you pick your way between the rocks jutting out at\nall angles.  A stone occasionally plummets down the steep cliffsides that\nline the path.  The view here is breathtaking, the beach below is obscured\nby mist, tall trees grow thickly inland.\n',59,131072,48,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
