(9244,0,0,0,'A Dangerous Path Along a Mountain Ridge','You tread carefully as you pick your way between the rocks jutting out at\nall angles.  A stone occasionally plummets down the steep cliffsides that\nline the path.  The view here is breathtaking, the beach below is obscured\nby mist, tall trees grow thickly inland.\n',59,131072,48,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9246,0,0,0,'A Lush Jungle Path','The path here looks well used, trampled in spots, but still abundantly\nsurrounded by exotic flowers.  Monkeys chatter loudly in the tall vine\ndraped trees of the inland forests.\n',59,131072,45,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9247,0,0,0,'A Filthy Pig Sty','Old corn cobs and dirty straw are pushed up into the corners of the sty,\ncenter of the room is a mud covered pit.  It smells like many pigs have\nlived here.\n',59,131072,48,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9248,0,0,0,'Before an Ornately Crafted Cottage','You stand before a small but ornately crafted cottage.  The portico leads\nto an elegant golden door.  The path leads uphill to the north.\n',59,131072,48,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9249,0,0,0,'A Large Cheery Hall','Lofty ceilings, stout wooden beams, and a huge hearth, the room is sparse\nyet warm.  The haunting echo of past travelers, boisterous in revelry,\ncomes to mind.  There is a delicate golden door to the east, another door\nleads north.\n',59,131080,55,0,0,0,0,0,0,180,0,'',NULL),
(9250,0,0,0,'A Lavishly Decorated Bedroom','The picture of comfort, silk drapes hang from large window frames, the\nwalls are shimmery, luminous.  Rainbows bounce off the walls and play\nabout the floor and furnishings.  There is a delicate golden door on the\nwest wall.\n',59,131080,55,0,0,0,0,0,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(9251,0,0,0,'A Well Fruited Pineapple Field','A well cared for field, fragrant pineapple fruits emerge from clusters of\nlong sword-shaped leaves.\n',59,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9252,0,0,0,'A Well Fruited Pineapple Field','A well cared for field, fragrant pineapple fruits emerge from clusters of\nlong sword-shaped leaves.\n',59,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9253,0,0,0,'A Thick Stand of Bamboo','Treelike grasses tower thickly above the path.  An arched canopy in some\nplaces, shorter and more recently harvested in others.\n',59,131072,45,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9254,0,0,0,'A Thick Stand of Bamboo','Treelike grasses tower thickly above the path.  An arched canopy in some\nplaces, shorter and more recently harvested in others.\n',59,131072,45,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
