(9266,0,0,0,'A Well Fruited Pineapple Field','A well cared for field, fragrant pineapple fruits emerge from clusters of\nlong sword-shaped leaves.  Rising ominously from the inland is a great\nsmoking volcano.  Paths lead away from the pineapple fields to the south\nand the east.\n',59,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9267,0,0,0,'An Island Path','Smoke from a huge fuming volcano to the south, fills the air acidly.  To\nthe east is a thick stand of bamboo, to the west is a luscious looking\npineapple field.  To the south you can climb a short ways up the side of\nthe volcano.\n',59,131076,45,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9268,0,0,0,'A Clearing at the Edge of a Thick Bamboo Stand','The stubble of recently cut bamboo is scattered about the edges of the\ntowering grasses.  Rising ominously from the inland is a great smoking\nvolcano.  Paths lead away from the bamboo stand to the west and to the\nsouth.\n',59,131076,45,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9269,0,0,0,'A Thick Stand of Bamboo','Treelike grasses tower thickly above the path.  An arched canopy in some\nplaces, shorter and more recently harvested in others.\n',59,131072,45,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9270,0,0,0,'A Thick Stand of Bamboo','Treelike grasses tower thickly above the path.  An arched canopy in some\nplaces, shorter and more recently harvested in others.\n',59,131072,45,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9271,0,0,0,'A Thick Stand of Bamboo','Treelike grasses tower thickly above the path.  An arched canopy in some\nplaces, shorter and more recently harvested in others.\n',59,131072,45,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9272,0,0,0,'An Island Path','Smoke from a huge fuming volcano to the east, fills the air acidly.  To\nthe north is a field of fragrant pineapples, to the south is a jungle\nof sweet sugar cane.\n',59,131076,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9273,0,0,0,'On the side of a Volcano','Try as you might, the volcano can not be climbed any higher.  Looking down\nyou can see the fields of pineapple and bamboo on the island below.  The\nair seems warmer here, smoke overhead encircles the top of the fuming\nvolcano.  To the north the path leads down.\n',59,131072,45,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9274,0,0,0,'An Island Path','Smoke from a huge fuming volcano to the west, fills the air acidly.  To\nthe north is a thick stand of bamboo, to the south the ground becomes\nsoggy and is laden with rice.\n',59,131076,45,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9275,0,0,0,'An Abundant Cane Field','A path cuts deeply into a jungle of gigantic plume topped grasses.\n',59,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9276,0,0,0,'An Abundant Cane Field','A path cuts deeply into a jungle of gigantic plume topped grasses.\n',59,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9277,0,0,0,'An Abundant Cane Field','A path cuts deeply into a jungle of gigantic plume topped grasses.\n',59,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9278,0,0,0,'An Abundant Cane Field','A paths cut deeply into a jungle of gigantic plume topped grasses.  To\nthe north and the east, paths lead away from the canefield.  Rising\nominously from the inland is a great smoking volcano.\n',59,131072,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9279,0,0,0,'An Island Path','Smoke from a huge fuming volcano to the north, fills the air acidly.  To\nthe west is an abundantly filled field of sugar cane, to the east the\nground becomes soggy and the fields are laden with rice.\n',59,131076,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9280,0,0,0,'A Soggy Rice Paddy','You slog through the soggy field.  Thick clusters of grains hang\ngracefully from their stalks.  To the north and west are paths running\nalong dryer ground.  Rising ominously from the inland is a great smoking\nvolcano.\n',59,131076,50,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9281,0,0,0,'A Soggy Rice Paddy','You slog through the soggy field.  Thick clusters of grains hang\ngracefully from their stalks.\n',59,131072,50,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
