(9438,50,6,-5,'The Canyon Floor Near an Altar','   A huge stone pillar rises towards the sky, linking with\nothers to the east and west.  The pillar is etched with a strange\nwriting that you can almost make out.  You feel a cold wind blowing\nfrom the northeast.\n',53,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9439,51,6,-5,'The Canyon Floor Near an Altar','   A huge stone pillar rises towards the sky, linking with\nothers to the east and west.  The pillar is etched with a strange\nwriting that you can almost make out.  You feel a cold wind blowing\nfrom the northeast.\n',53,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9440,52,6,-5,'The Canyon Floor Near an Altar','   A massive stone pillar rises out of the canyon floor here,\ncreating a picket in a ring around a large black altar.  There are\nrings carved up the entire height of the stone.  A chill breeze\nblows from the northeast.\n',53,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9441,48,5,-5,'The Canyon Floor','   The high walls of the canyon enclose you in every direction.  The\nsmooth, rocky canyon floor give you the impression that this canyon\nonce held a great river.  The solid, weatherbeaten rock surface shows\nthe true age of the canyon, which must have existed for hundreds of\nthousands of years.  The canyon is completely bare of any plant life.\n',53,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9442,49,5,-5,'The Canyon Floor','   The high walls of the canyon enclose you in every direction.  The\nsmooth, rocky canyon floor give you the impression that this canyon\nonce held a great river.  The solid, weatherbeaten rock surface shows\nthe true age of the canyon, which must have existed for hundreds of\nthousands of years.  The canyon is completely bare of any plant life.\n',53,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9443,50,5,-5,'The Canyon Floor Near an Altar','   A huge stone pillar rises towards the sky, linking with\nothers to the east and west.  The pillar is etched with a strange\nwriting that you can almost make out.  You feel a cold wind blowing\nfrom the northeast.\n',53,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9444,51,5,-5,'An Altar on the Canyon Floor','   The center of the canyon floor is dominated by a massive stone\naltar covered by demonic runes and script.  Carved upon its black\nsurface are gruesome depictions of the evil acts committed here.\nAs you get closer, you feel a chill run up your spine and the hair\non your neck stands on end.  A large, dark stain flows down the side\nof the altar and across the floor of the canyon.  Three large bowls\nfilled with a dark red liquid are sitting at the base of the altar.\n',53,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9445,52,5,-5,'The Canyon Floor Near an Altar','   A huge stone pillar rises towards the sky, linking with\nothers to the east and west.  The pillar is etched with a strange\nwriting that you can almost make out.  You feel a cold wind blowing\nfrom the northeast.\n',53,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9446,53,5,-5,'The Canyon Floor','   The high walls of the canyon enclose you in every direction.  The\nsmooth, rocky canyon floor give you the impression that this canyon\nonce held a great river.  The solid, weatherbeaten rock surface shows\nthe true age of the canyon, which must have existed for hundreds of\nthousands of years.  The canyon is completely bare of any plant life.\n',53,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9447,50,4,-5,'The Canyon Floor Near an Altar','   A massive stone pillar rises out of the canyon floor here,\ncreating a picket in a ring around a large black altar.  There are\nrings carved up the entire height of the stone.  A chill breeze\nblows from the northeast.\n',53,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9448,51,4,-5,'The Canyon Floor Near an Altar','   A huge stone pillar rises towards the sky, linking with\nothers to the east and west.  The pillar is etched with a strange\nwriting that you can almost make out.  You feel a cold wind blowing\nfrom the north.\n',53,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9449,52,4,-5,'The Canyon Floor Near an Altar','   A massive stone pillar rises out of the canyon floor here,\ncreating a picket in a ring around a large black altar.  There are\nrings carved up the entire height of the stone.  A chill breeze\nblows from the north.\n',53,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9450,53,4,-5,'Just North of the Canyon River','   The canyon floor is smooth from the constant erosion of the small\nriver that lies before you.  The river travels at a very fast speed,\nand the water seems very clear.  As the river reaches the canyon wall,\nit returns underground through a small opening in its rocky riverbed.\n',53,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9451,50,3,-5,'Just North of the Canyon River','   The canyon floor is smooth from the constant erosion of the small\nriver that lies before you.  The river travels at a very fast speed,\nand the water seems very clear.\n',53,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
