(9454,53,3,-5,'The Canyon River','   This clear blue river flows at a very fast pace.  While it is small, it\nhas quite a strong current, that could cause problems for even the most\nexperienced of rafter.  Many men have been found on shore after traveling\nthis river, perhaps you should have thought twice before getting on it.\n',53,131072,29,0,0,0,5,4,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9455,50,2,-5,'The Canyon River','   This clear blue river flows at a very fast pace.  While it is small, it\nhas quite a strong current, that could cause problems for even the most\nexperienced of rafter.  Many men have been found on shore after traveling\nthis river, perhaps you should have thought twice before getting on it.\n',53,131072,29,0,0,0,5,1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
