(9476,59,-2,-1,'Inside the Burial Chamber','   All about you are skeletons and corpses of long dead savages.  You\nare in the actual burial chamber.  The walls here are smooth, worked\nstone that must have come from the surrounding Badlands.  The floor\nis also stone, but is covered with a thick layer of dust and filth.\nThere are old, rotting weapons lying on the floor in random places.\nThe stale air, filled with the stench of rotting flesh, is enough\nto make you want to vomit.\n',53,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9477,60,-2,-1,'Inside the Burial Chamber','   All about you are skeletons and corpses of long dead savages.  You\nare in the actual burial chamber.  The walls here are smooth, worked\nstone that must have come from the surrounding Badlands.  The floor\nis also stone, but is covered with a thick layer of dust and filth.\nThere are old, rotting weapons lying on the floor in random places.\nThe stale air, filled with the stench of rotting flesh, is enough\nto make you want to vomit.\n',53,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
