(9718,-21,-52,0,'A Jungle Path','  Just slightly more then a game path this hard packed trail is\nalmost overgrown with thick lush vegetation.  From all about you\ncome the calls of exotic birds and unseen animals while little but\ndim threads of light are able to penetrate the thick canopy overhead.\nThe heat and humidity are almost unbearable and the littlest effort makes\nyou break out in a heavy sweat.  Considering the thick vegetation about\nyou, your choices for movement are strictly limited to either one way or\nanother down the path.\n',65,131072,45,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9719,-20,-53,0,'A Jungle Path','  Just slightly more then a game path this hard packed trail is\nalmost overgrown with thick lush vegetation.  From all about you\ncome the calls of exotic birds and unseen animals while little but\ndim threads of light are able to penetrate the thick canopy overhead.\nThe heat and humidity are almost unbearable and the littlest effort makes\nyou break out in a heavy sweat.  Considering the thick vegetation about\nyou, your choices for movement are strictly limited to either one way or\nanother down the path.\n',65,131072,45,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9720,-19,-53,0,'A Jungle Path','  Just slightly more then a game path this hard packed trail is\nalmost overgrown with thick lush vegetation.  From all about you\ncome the calls of exotic birds and unseen animals while little but\ndim threads of light are able to penetrate the thick canopy overhead.\nThe heat and humidity are almost unbearable and the littest effort makes\nyou break out in a heavy sweat.  Considering the thick vegetation about\nyou, your choices for movement appear to be back to the west.  A thick\nwall of vegetation seems to block the path where it once moved eastwards.\n',65,131072,45,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9721,-27,-46,0,'Overgrown Clearing','  Apparently once a man made clearing everything in sight appears to\nhave been retaken by nature\'s children.  Lush green vegetation grows\neverywhere while vines slowly break apart and destroy any man made\nstructures which were apparently long ago abandoned.  Or possibly not,\none structure to the south which is almost completely concealed in\nvibrant green vines seems to have a small tendril of smoke winding up\nfrom its roofline.  Now if only you could find the entrance through the\nmass of vegetation.  A rickety gate to the northeast is almost\ncompletely concealed in the undergrowth, but still appears functional.\n',79,139584,45,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9722,-27,-47,0,'Cleric\'s Hidden Abode','  Surrounded by lush vegetation and thick leafy vines this tiny abode is\nvirtually invisible from the outside.  Looking around you see that behind\nthe mass of vegetation there is actually a small structure which keeps the\nweather at bay.  The only portion of the room not covered in vegetation is\na small grated opening in the ceiling which allows for the escape of smoke\nand a small bit of light to infiltrate the room during the day.  A mess of\nheavy experimenting equipment lines the walls of the room and the only\nvisible exit appears to be a small concealed doorway.\n',79,139592,55,0,0,0,0,-1,10,120,0,'',NULL),
(9723,0,0,0,'A Small and Simple Flat','You can tell upon arriving that this apartment is owned by a simple man. The\nroom is sparsely decorated save the assorted trophies from battles that hang\nupon it\'s walls.  It seems to be a rather quiet place.  One where it is easy\nto meditate and study the mysteries of the arcane.\n',-1,139272,21,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9724,0,0,0,'A Precipice on the Northern Face of a Volcano','Though dormant for ages, small plumes of sulphurous smoke still escape from\nvents along the base of the volcano.  The canopy of a dark jungle spreads out\nbeneath its ashen flanks.  A path leads to a cluster of hardy <o>bushes<1> to\nthe west, and a well built iron gate has been set firmly into the rock to the\nsoutheast.\n',0,131072,48,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9725,0,0,0,'A Hollow Magma Chamber','Long ago, a ventricle of molten rock grew under the skin of the volcano. \nIt breached the surface and left behind this domed vault. \nThe walls of black basalt are veined with iridescent webs that swirl up and out\nof view in the gloom \noverhead.  A dark iron gate has been set into the northwestern wall.\n',0,139528,56,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9726,13,-80,0,'On a White Cobblestone Path','This is a white cobblestone path.  It seems to begin abruptly right here\nand runs to the south.  The wild growth of vegetation seems to keep clear\nof the path, as the path is untouched by it.  The path also seems to keep\npredatory animals off itself, as you can hear their thrashings all around\nbut witness none on the path.  To the northeast is nothing but thick,\nthorny bushes, but you have a feeling that you could squeeze your way\nthrough them.\n',55,139264,61,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9727,13,-81,0,'On a White Cobblestone Path','This is a white cobblestone path.  It runs north and south.  The wild growth\nof vegetation seems to keep clear of the path, as the path is untouched by\nit.  The path also seems to keep predatory animals off itself, as you can\nhear their thrashings all around but witness none on the path.  The thick\nbushes on both sides of the path allowes no passage off the path.\n',55,139264,61,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9728,13,-82,0,'On a White Cobblestone Path','This is a white cobblestone path.  It runs north and south.  The wild growth\nof vegetation seems to keep clear of the path, as the path is untouched by\nit.  The path also seems to keep predatory animals off itself, as you can\nhear their thrashings all around but witness none on the path.  You wonder\nif there is magic at work here?  The thick bushes on both sides of the path\ndo not allow passage off the path.\n',55,139264,61,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9729,13,-83,0,'On a White Cobblestone Path','This is a white cobblestone path.  It runs north and south.  The wild growth\nof vegetation seems to keep clear of the path, as the path is untouched by\nit.  The path also seems to keep predatory animals off itself, as you can\nhear their thrashings all around but witness none on the path.  You wonder\nif there is magic at work here?  The thick bushes on both sides of the path\ndo not allow passage off the path.  In a distance far to the south, the\nsilhouette of a ruined, once mighty, castle can be seen.  A faint stench is\nin the air.\n',55,139264,61,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9730,13,-84,0,'On a White Cobblestone Path','This is a white cobblestone path.  It runs north and south.  The wild growth\nof vegetation seems to keep clear of the path, as the path is untouched by\nit.  The path also seems to keep predatory animals off itself, as you can\nhear their thrashings all around but witness none on the path.  You wonder\nif there is magic at work here?  The thick bushes on both sides of the path\ndo not allow passage off the path.  In a short distance to the south, the\nsilhouette of a ruined, once mighty, castle can be seen.  A faint stench is\nin the air.\n',55,139264,61,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9731,14,-79,0,'Green Cobblestone Path','This path is made of bright emerald-green cobblestones.  It seems to be even\nbetter kept than the one southwest from here.  The decision to tread farther\non this path should be an easy one but the strange color of the cobblestones\nmakes you wary.  There is a stench of decaying leaves in the air.\n',55,139264,61,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9732,15,-78,0,'Green Cobblestone Path','This path is made of bright emerald-green cobblestones.  The path seems to\nhave been better kept than the one southwest from here.  The decision to\ntread farther on this path should be an easy one but the strange color of\nthe cobblestones makes you wary.  There is a stench of decaying leaves in\nthe air.\n',55,139264,61,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9733,16,-77,0,'Green Cobblestone Path','This path is made of bright emerald-green cobblestones.  It seems to have been\nbetter kept than the one southwest from here.  However, your sixth sense urges\nyou to turn and flee southwest.  As you try to overcome this childish fear,\nyou realize that you have never seen cobblestones the color of the ones used\nin this path before.  Some strange rustling sounds can be heard from the\nnortheast.  The stench of decaying vegetation is also wafting in from the\nnortheast.\n',55,139264,61,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9734,17,-76,0,'Dead End','A green cobblestone path ends here.  Actually, it seems like someone, or\nsomething, decided to end the path here as the cobblestones have been ripped\nout of the earth and are strewn about.  It is hard to imagine what kind of\ndemonic power could actually rip the path apart like this.  The thick\nvegetation blocks all passage except southwest on the path and a thin\nstretch to the northeast.  The green cobblestone continues on to the\nsouthwest, but to the northeast a strange magical barrier halts your\nmovements.  The barrier seems to go in all directions from a pile of\nrubble knee high to as far as you can reach upwards.  Through a thick misty\nfog you can just make out the sand of a small beach past the barrier\n',55,139264,61,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9735,13,-85,0,'Facing a Slimy Moat','The cobblestone path leads to a draw bridge over a slimy moat to the south.\nThe thick bushes on both sides of the path are rotting, yet alive, and stink\nhorribly.  The bushes that have actually touched the slime that fills the\nmoat have rotted and deteriorated into a stinking black mass.  The draw\nbridge has been lowered to allow access to the ruined castle to the south.\nYou wonder if this moat has a monster to protect the castle from intruders?\n',55,139264,61,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9736,13,-86,0,'On a Draw Bridge','This is a draw bridge, made of solid rock, spanning across a slime-filled\nmoat.  A white cobblestone path leads away to the north, while a portcullis\nto the south, when raised, allows entrance to the castle proper.\n',55,139264,61,0,0,0,0,0,4,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9737,13,-87,0,'Courtyard','This courtyard seems like it has seen better days.  Bits and pieces of rotten\nflesh are all around.  The floor of the courtyard is covered with trails of\noozy slime.  It seems to be the center of activity in this castle.  There\nare guard houses on both sides of the courtyard and to the south, a gate opens\ninto the castle itself.\n',55,139264,61,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(9738,14,-87,0,'Zombie Guard House','This guard house is, if it is actually possible, in a worse shape than the\nrest of the castle.  Bits of rotting and worm-infested flesh are strewn all\nabout.  The stench wafting from the rotten flesh bits is unbearable.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9739,12,-87,0,'Zombie Guard House','This guard house is, if it is actually possible, in a worse shape than the\ncastle itself.  The floor is completely covered with bits and pieces of\nrotten, worm-infested flesh.  The stench of the rotting flesh in here is\nunbearable.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9740,13,-88,0,'Entrance To the Ruined Castle','You stand at the entryway to this once magnificent castle.  To the north\nis an untidy courtyard, while a corridor continues to the south leading in\nto the castle.  Walls of solid rock are on both your sides.  As you look at\nthe walls, you realize that the castle might look to be in ruins, but it has\nnot lost its structural integrity over the years.  A stench seems to emanate\nfrom the walls of the castle itself.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9741,13,-89,0,'Corridor','This is a corridor running north-south in the ruined castle.  It continues to\nthe north leading out of the castle.  To the south, it runs into a gloomy\nhallway.  There are doors to small chambers on both sides of the corridor.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9742,12,-89,0,'Head Guard Chamber','This is the chamber of the Head of the zombie guards.  The stench of rotten\nflesh is very strong in here.  There are holes in the walls of this chamber\nas if a huge ogre has hammered them with his fists.  You have a feeling that\nyou should leave this room while you still have a chance.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9743,14,-89,0,'Messenger\'s Chamber','This is the chamber of the Zombie Master\'s messenger to the rest of the land.\nThere are hoof-prints all over the dirt floor here.  This room seems to be\nkept very clean by its occupant.  There are no bits of flesh, or slime trails\nin this room, like the rest of this castle.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9744,13,-90,0,'Intersection: Corridor and Gloomy Hallway','You stand at an intersection in the ruined castle.  A small, dirty corridor\nleads to a courtyard a little ways to the north, while a much wider, and tidy\ncorridor leads deep into the castle to the south.  There is a gloomy hallway\nleading both east and west from here.  The floor here seems to be new.  The\nstench seems to waft in from both sides, but it seems to dissipate to the\nsouth.\n',55,139272,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9745,13,-91,0,'Master Corridor','You walk down the wide and tidy master corridor of the castle.  The stench is\nalmost unnoticeable here.  The corridor walls seem to be in much better shape\nhere, as they actually seem to glow with a soft light.  Maybe it is just an\nillusion caused by the torches that line both the walls.  You can go north to\na small intersection or continue south deeper into the castle.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9746,13,-92,0,'Master Corridor','You walk down the wide and tidy master corridor of the castle.  The stench is\nalmost unnoticeable here.  The corridor walls seem to be in much better shape\nhere, as they actually seem to glow with a soft light.  Maybe it is just an\nillusion caused by the torches that line both the walls.  You can go north to\na small intersection or continue south deeper into the castle.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9747,13,-93,0,'Master Corridor','You walk down the wide and tidy master corridor of the castle.  The stench is\nalmost unnoticeable here.  The corridor walls seem to be in much better shape\nhere, as they actually seem to glow with a soft light.  Maybe it is just an\nillusion caused by the torches that line both the walls.  You can go north to\nan intersection far to the north.  There is a door to the south leading into\na chamber.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9748,13,-94,0,'Master Chamber','You have entered the master chamber in the ruined castle.  This part of the\ncastle is nothing like the rest of it.  While the whole castle is in ruins,\nthe corridor north of here and this chamber is splendidly furnished, almost\nto the point of royalty.  A crimson red carpet covers the floor here and\nthe walls seem to glow with a soft light.  A heavy stone door is set in the\nwest wall, while a heavy wooden door, wrought in gold, leads into a small\nchamber to the east.  There is a rusty, iron door in the southern wall of\nthe chamber.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9749,13,-95,0,'The Pool of Eternal Damnation','This is a dark and gloomy room in the very back of the castle.  The light is\nvery bad in here as you can barely see anything around you.  There seem to\nbe a warning of some sort scratched on the floor.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,2,100,0,'',NULL),
(9750,14,-94,0,'A Small Chamber','This is a small but well kept chamber.  Although the chamber is decorated very\nsimply, it looks pleasant because of its cleanliness.  You wonder whether the\nchamber maid lives in this chamber.  A small wooden door leads into the Master\nChamber to the west.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9751,12,-94,0,'The Master Bedroom','You have wandered into the Zombie Master\'s bedroom.  From just looking around,\nyou could not tell that this is the room of the master of this castle, but you\nsense great magic all around that tells you that the occupant of this room\ncould be none other.  You wonder if it is better to come face to face with\nthe zombie master or to leave his room unnoticed?  A stone door leads into\na large chamber to the east.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9752,12,-90,0,'Gloomy Hallway','You are walking through a hallway running east-west.  It intersects with a\ncorridor to the east, while a faint aroma urges you to go west.  The aroma\nis suppressed by a strong stench that also wafts in from the west.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9753,11,-90,0,'Gloomy Hallway','You stand in a gloomy hallway that runs east and south.  The castle wall\nto the north blocks any passage that way, while to the west, seem to be\nthe royal kitchen of the castle.  You scent a slight, sweet aroma from the\nwest, while the stench of rotten flesh wafts in from the south.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9754,10,-90,0,'Kitchen','This is a very nondescript kitchen, a sweet aroma fills the air.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9755,11,-91,0,'Gloomy Hallway','You stand in a gloomy hallway running north-south.  A very slight, sweet\naroma comes in from the north, while a nasty smell comes in from the west.\nIt smells like bleach.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9756,10,-91,0,'Laundry','You have entered the castle laundry.  Robes, jerkins, cloak, jackets and\nmany other kinds of attire are strewn all about.  Everything is covered\nwith some green slimy material that smells like rotten flesh.  The smell\nof bleach, however, makes you feel queasy.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9757,11,-92,0,'Gloomy Hallway','You stand in a gloomy hallway running north-south.  You scent a faint smell\nof bleach from the north, but here, the hallway has that strong smell of\nrotten flesh in the air again.  You wonder if it was actually gone or just\ncovered up by other stronger smells in the northern part of this corridor?\nYou can go north and south in the hallway, or enter a small room to the\nwest.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9758,10,-92,0,'Weavers','You stand in the castle weavers.  Rolls of magical thread of various colors\nare lined up against the west wall.  You can leave the room into a gloomy\nhallway to the east.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9759,11,-93,0,'Gloomy Hallway','You stand at the end of the gloomy hallway.  The southern wall of the castle\nfaces you to the south, while the hallway leads north.  You can enter a small\nroom to the west.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9760,10,-93,0,'Seamstress Room','This is the castle seamstress\'s room.  Different colored cloth, as well as some\nleather, is piled up everywhere.  This must be where the attire for the\nmaster of the castle, his mistress, and all his followers is made.  You\ncan leave into a gloomy hallway to the east.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9761,14,-90,0,'Gloomy Hallway','You walk down a gloomy hallway running east-west.  It intersects with a small\ncorridor to the west, while you sense a magical power coming in from the east.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9762,15,-90,0,'Arcane Hallway','You stand in an ancient hallway.  A soft light seems to emanate from the walls\nof this hallway and you sense magic in the air.  You can enter a small temple\nto the east.  The hallway continues to the south, while to the west, you can\nto a gloomy hallway leading farther west.\n',55,139273,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9763,16,-90,0,'Temple Sanctuary','You stand in the northern part of the temple sanctuary.  This place has a\nsense of holiness about it.  There is an exit in the western wall leading\ninto an ancient hallway.  The sanctuary continues to the south, while an\naltar can be seen through an exit going southeast.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9764,15,-91,0,'Arcane Hallway','You stand in an ancient hallway.  A soft light seems to emanate from the walls\nof this hallway and you sense magic in the air.  You can enter a small temple\nto the east.  The hallway continues to the south and north.\n',55,139273,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9765,16,-91,0,'Temple Sanctuary','You stand in the southern part of the temple sanctuary.  This place has a\nsense of holiness about it.  There is an exit in the western wall leading\ninto an ancient hallway.  The sanctuary continues to the north, while an\naltar can be seen through an exit going northeast.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9766,15,-92,0,'Arcane Hallway','You stand in an ancient hallway.  A soft light seems to emanate from the walls\nof this hallway and you sense magic in the air.  A small door leads into a\nsmall chamber to the east, while the hallway continues to the south.\n',55,139273,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9767,16,-92,0,'A Small Chamber','This is a small chamber, completely devoid of any furniture.  Although the\nchamber is empty, it does not feel that way to you.  You sense magic all\naround you.\n',55,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9768,15,-93,0,'Arcane Hallway','You stand in an ancient hallway.  A soft light seems to emanate from the walls\nof this hallway and you sense magic in the air.  A solid, oak door leads into\na vast chamber to the east.  You sense an aura of great magic on the other\nside of this chamber door.  The hallway continues to the north and the castle\nwall blocks further passage to the south.\n',55,139273,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9769,16,-93,0,'The Chamber of Wizardry','You have entered a vast, arcane chamber.  Powerful magic seems to course\nthrough the very air in this chamber as your skin starts to tingle.  The\nchamber walls glow radiantly as the magic courses through them.  You dread\ncoming face to face with the inhabitant of such a powerful place.\n',55,139273,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9770,17,-91,0,'At an Ancient Altar','You stand in a non-descript corner of the temple sanctuary inside an ancient\ncastle.  You can go back into the sanctuary through exits both northwest and\nsouthwest.\n',55,139273,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9771,13,-90,-1,'Catacombs','This is the entrance to the catacombs below the ruined castle.  The walls\nare made of very ancient, crumbling rock.  It seems as if it could cave-in\nany minute.  The stench of rotten flesh is very strong here, coupled with\na damp smell.  There is a small flight of stairs leading up to a small\ntrapdoor that leads out of the catacombs.  You hear water dripping in the\ndistance, or is it somewhere close by?\n',55,139272,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9772,12,-90,-1,'Catacombs','You are wandering the catacombs below the ancient castle.  The walls are\nmade of very ancient, crumbling rock.  It seems as if it could cave-in\nany minute.  The stench of rotten flesh is very strong here, coupled with\na damp smell.  There is a strong oak door set in the north wall and an\nobsidian door streaked with blood and ooze in the southern wall.  You\nhear water dripping in the distance, or is it somewhere close by?\n',55,139272,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9773,12,-89,-1,'Dungeon-Keeper\'s Chamber','This is the Chamber of the Dungeon-Keeper.  It seems to be rather well kept.\nIt seems like the occupant of the room likes to keep it tidy.  However, the\nnorthwest corner of the room seems to be at an odd angle.\n',55,139272,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9774,12,-91,-1,'Torture Chamber','You have wandered into the torture chamber.  This is a vast chamber which\nhas many blood-spattered instruments of torture scattered all about.  The\nchamber walls also have streaks of dried blood and gore on them.  There is\na blood-streaked door made of obsidian in the north wall.\n',55,139272,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9775,11,-90,-1,'Catacombs','You are wandering the catacombs below the ancient castle.  The walls are\nmade of very ancient, crumbling rock.  It seems as if it could cave-in\nany minute.  The stench of rotten flesh is very strong here, coupled with\na damp smell.  There are sturdy, iron doors in both the north and the\nsouth wall.  You can also continue into the catacombs to the east.\n',55,139272,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9776,11,-89,-1,'A Prison Cell','This is a very nondescript, and very small, prison cell.  You can barely\nfit three people in here.  There is a sturdy iron door in the south wall\nof the cell.\n',55,139272,33,0,0,0,0,0,3,100,0,'',NULL),
(9777,11,-91,-1,'A Prison Cell','This is a very nondescript, and very small, prison cell.  You can barely\nfit three people in here.  There is a sturdy iron door in the north wall\nof the cell.\n',55,139272,33,0,0,0,0,0,3,100,0,'',NULL),
(9778,13,-91,-1,'Catacombs','This is a simple part of the catacombs below the ruined castle.  The walls\nare made of very ancient, crumbling rock.  It seems as if it could cave-in\nany minute.  The stench of rotten flesh is very strong here, coupled with\na damp smell.  You hear water dripping in the distance, or is it somewhere\nclose by?\n',55,139272,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9779,13,-92,-1,'Catacombs','This is a simple part of the catacombs below the ruined castle.  The walls\nare made of very ancient, crumbling rock.  It seems as if it could cave-in\nany minute.  The stench of rotten flesh is very strong here, coupled with\na damp smell.  You hear water dripping in the distance, or is it somewhere\nclose by?\n',55,139272,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9780,14,-92,-1,'Catacombs','This is a simple part of the catacombs below the ruined castle.  The walls\nare made of very ancient, crumbling rock.  It seems as if it could cave-in\nany minute.  The stench of rotten flesh is very strong here, coupled with\na damp smell.  You hear water dripping in the distance, or is it somewhere\nclose by?\n',55,139272,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
