(9784,11,-88,-1,'A Plain Room','This is a plain room, completely devoid of any furniture.  The packed dirt\nfloor has markings that make it seem as if someone lives here.  Most of the\nmarkings on the floor seem to be right next to the north wall of the room.\n',55,139272,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(9785,11,-87,-1,'Castle Treasury','This is the Castle Treasury, carved in the stone under the ruined castle.\nIt is a very safe place to keep treasure.  There is a plain stone door\nin the southern wall of the treasury.\n',55,139272,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
