(10139,10,38,-2,'Gamepath','  You walk a short way down the congested game path, pushing bunches of foliage\nout of your way.  The trail is nearly impossible to find, but you pick your\nway through it with difficulty.  After proceeding a short distance you come\nto a dead-end here.  A lightning strike has felled a tree.  The tree\'s thick\nbranches hang downward forming a great, natural portcullis blocking the path\nsouthward.  An odd giggling can be heard further down the trail, and it is\nunfortunate that there is absolutely no way to continue on here.  Perhaps\nyou can find another way into the thick of the forest somewhere else and\ndiscover who it is that laughs at you like that.\n',56,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10140,18,43,-1,'A Suspended Platform in the Elf Plaza','You are high above the ground supported by a wooden platform hanging by vines\nfrom the larger branches overhead.  There are a large number of individual\nplatforms, each of which is connected to its neighbor by a vine-rope walkway.\nThe platforms seem steady enough, although the occasional gust of wind will set\nthem swinging.  The bridges are a different matter - shifting radically each\ntime someone on them takes a step and it takes some effort to maintain balance.\nThe whole affair creates a plaza for the social interaction of the wood elves\nwho call this place home.  This platform is rather large as it supports one\nof the wood elves homes.  A door to the north leads into the home.\n',56,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10141,19,43,-1,'A Suspended Platform in the Elf Plaza','You are high above the ground supported by a wooden platform hanging by vines\nfrom the larger branches overhead.  There are a large number of individual\nplatforms, each of which is connected to its neighbor by a vine-rope walkway.\nThe platforms seem steady enough, although the occasional gust of wind will set\nthem swinging.  The bridges are a different matter - shifting radically each\ntime someone on them takes a step and it takes some effort to maintain balance.\nThe whole affair creates a plaza for the social interaction of the wood elves\nwho call this place home.  This platform is rather large as it supports one\nof the wood elves homes.  A door to the north leads into the home.\n',56,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
