(10148,18,39,-1,'A Suspended Platform in the Elf Plaza','You are high above the ground supported by a wooden platform hanging by vines\nfrom the larger branches overhead.  There are a large number of individual\nplatforms, each of which is connected to its neighbor by a vine-rope walkway.\nThe platforms seem steady enough, although the occasional gust of wind will set\nthem swinging.  The bridges are a different matter - shifting radically each\ntime someone on them takes a step and it takes some effort to maintain balance.\nThe whole affair creates a plaza for the social interaction of the wood elves\nwho call this place home.  This platform is rather large as it supports one\nof the wood elves homes.  A door to the south leads into the home.\n',56,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10149,19,39,-1,'A Suspended Platform in the Elf Plaza','You are high above the ground supported by a wooden platform hanging by vines\nfrom the larger branches overhead.  There are a large number of individual\nplatforms, each of which is connected to its neighbor by a vine-rope walkway.\nThe platforms seem steady enough, although the occasional gust of wind will set\nthem swinging.  The bridges are a different matter - shifting radically each\ntime someone on them takes a step and it takes some effort to maintain balance.\nThe whole affair creates a plaza for the social interaction of the wood elves\nwho call this place home.  This platform is rather large as it supports one\nof the wood elves homes.  A door to the south leads into the home.  There also\nseems to be a number of vine ropes leading upward.  A few of them even have\nknots tied every few feet so that even an elf youngster could climb upward with ease.\n',56,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10150,20,43,-1,'The Wood Elves Eastern Walkway','  This is a fairly large platform on the eastern side of the wood elves domain.\nThe platforms are connected by vine rope bridges which look to be safe even\nthough they wobble and sway quite a bit whenever someone crosses one of them or\nwhen a gust of wind blows through the trees.  The platform appears to be well\nsecured to a number of branches either resting directly on one or hanging by a\nnumber of vines from a branch higher up the massive oaks that predominate in\nthis part of the forest.  You can hardly believe that this place can not be\nspotted from the ground seeing how large some of the platforms are, but then\nagain, the thick foliage of these massive trees blocks your line of sight into\nthe forest up here as easily as it did when you were on the ground.\n',56,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10151,21,43,-1,'The Wood Elves Eastern Walkway','  This is a fairly large platform on the eastern side of the wood elves domain.\nThe platforms are connected by vine rope bridges which look to be safe even\nthough they wobble and sway quite a bit whenever someone crosses one of them or\nwhen a gust of wind blows through the trees.  The platform appears to be well\nsecured to a number of branches either resting directly on one or hanging by a\nnumber of vines from a branch higher up the massive oaks that predominate in\nthis part of the forest.  You can hardly believe that this place can not be\nspotted from the ground seeing how large some of the platforms are, but then\nagain, the thick foliage of these massive trees blocks your line of sight into\nthe forest up here as easily as it did when you were on the ground.\n',56,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10152,21,45,-1,'The Wood Elves Eastern Walkway','  This is a fairly large platform on the eastern side of the wood elves domain.\nThe platforms are connected by vine rope bridges which look to be safe even\nthough they wobble and sway quite a bit whenever someone crosses one of them or\nwhen a gust of wind blows through the trees.  The platform appears to be well\nsecured to a number of branches either resting directly on one or hanging by a\nnumber of vines from a branch higher up the massive oaks that predominate in\nthis part of the forest.  You can hardly believe that this place can not be\nspotted from the ground seeing how large some of the platforms are, but then\nagain, the thick foliage of these massive trees blocks your line of sight into\nthe forest up here as easily as it did when you were on the ground.\n',56,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10153,21,44,-1,'The Wood Elves Eastern Walkway','  This is a fairly large platform on the eastern side of the wood elves domain.\nThe platforms are connected by vine rope bridges which look to be safe even\nthough they wobble and sway quite a bit whenever someone crosses one of them or\nwhen a gust of wind blows through the trees.  The platform appears to be well\nsecured to a number of branches either resting directly on one or hanging by a\nnumber of vines from a branch higher up the massive oaks that predominate in\nthis part of the forest.  You can hardly believe that this place can not be\nspotted from the ground seeing how large some of the platforms are, but then\nagain, the thick foliage of these massive trees blocks your line of sight into\nthe forest up here as easily as it did when you were on the ground.\n',56,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10154,21,42,-1,'The Wood Elves Eastern Walkway','  This is a fairly large platform on the eastern side of the wood elves domain.\nThe platforms are connected by vine rope bridges which look to be safe even\nthough they wobble and sway quite a bit whenever someone crosses one of them or\nwhen a gust of wind blows through the trees.  The platform appears to be well\nsecured to a number of branches either resting directly on one or hanging by a\nnumber of vines from a branch higher up the massive oaks that predominate in\nthis part of the forest.  You can hardly believe that this place can not be\nspotted from the ground seeing how large some of the platforms are, but then\nagain, the thick foliage of these massive trees blocks your line of sight into\nthe forest up here as easily as it did when you were on the ground.    A\ntremendously large branch supports this oversized platform.  Two houses stand\nat either end, and doors lead east and west inside them.  The pathway continues\nnorth and south as well.\n',56,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10155,21,41,-1,'The Wood Elves Eastern Walkway','  This is a fairly large platform on the eastern side of the wood elves domain.\nThe platforms are connected by vine rope bridges which look to be safe even\nthough they wobble and sway quite a bit whenever someone crosses one of them or\nwhen a gust of wind blows through the trees.  The platform appears to be well\nsecured to a number of branches either resting directly on one or hanging by a\nnumber of vines from a branch higher up the massive oaks that predominate in\nthis part of the forest.  You can hardly believe that this place can not be\nspotted from the ground seeing how large some of the platforms are, but then\nagain, the thick foliage of these massive trees blocks your line of sight into\nthe forest up here as easily as it did when you were on the ground.    There is\na doorway leading east into one of the wood elves\' home on this large platform.\nThis also seems to be the southern end of the eastern walkway as no bridges\ncontinue from here.  Although a strange pipe-like object sticks through the\nplatform and disappears down into the dense foliage.\n',56,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10156,17,43,-1,'The Wood Elves Western Walkway','  This is a fairly large platform on the western side of the wood elves domain.\nThe platforms are connected by vine rope bridges which look to be safe even\nthough they wobble and sway quite a bit whenever someone crosses one of them or\nwhen a gust of wind blows through the trees.  The platform appears to be well\nsecured to a number of branches either resting directly on one or hanging by a\nnumber of vines from a branch higher up the massive oaks that predominate in\nthis part of the forest.  You can hardly believe that this place can not be\nspotted from the ground seeing how large some of the platforms are, but then\nagain, the thick foliage of these massive trees blocks your line of sight into\nthe forest up here as easily as it did when you were on the ground.  The\nwestern walkway connects the main plaza with the pathway of the revered elm\nwest of here.  There is little else around.\n',56,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10157,16,43,-1,'The Wood Elves Western Walkway','  This is a fairly large platform on the western side of the wood elves domain.\nThe platforms are connected by vine rope bridges which look to be safe even\nthough they wobble and sway quite a bit whenever someone crosses one of them or\nwhen a gust of wind blows through the trees.  The platform appears to be well\nsecured to a number of branches either resting directly on one or hanging by a\nnumber of vines from a branch higher up the massive oaks that predominate in\nthis part of the forest.  You can hardly believe that this place can not be\nspotted from the ground seeing how large some of the platforms are, but then\nagain, the thick foliage of these massive trees blocks your line of sight into\nthe forest up here as easily as it did when you were on the ground.  The\nwestern walkway connects the main plaza with the pathway of the revered elm\nwest of here.  There is little else around.\n',56,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10158,15,43,-1,'The Wood Elves Western Walkway','  This is a fairly large platform on the western side of the wood elves domain.\nThe platforms are connected by vine rope bridges which look to be safe even\nthough they wobble and sway quite a bit whenever someone crosses one of them or\nwhen a gust of wind blows through the trees.  The platform appears to be well\nsecured to a number of branches either resting directly on one or hanging by a\nnumber of vines from a branch higher up the massive oaks that predominate in\nthis part of the forest.  You can hardly believe that this place can not be\nspotted from the ground seeing how large some of the platforms are, but then\nagain, the thick foliage of these massive trees blocks your line of sight into\nthe forest up here as easily as it did when you were on the ground.  The\nwestern walkway connects the main plaza with the pathway of the revered elm\nwest of here.  There is little else around.\n',56,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10159,14,43,-1,'The Pathway of the Revered Elm','Elm trees are a place of peace and sanctuary for all elves who will always\ntry and have at least one such tree nearby them.  The platform that you are now\nupon encircles the elm tree and rests entirely on its massive limbs.  This\nplatform, like those comprising the other walkways, is connected to its\nneighbors by vine rope bridges, although these seem to have been made more\ndurable and steady by the inclusion of sinewy fibers taken from what the elf\nhunters bring back to feed the village with.  A certain solemn quiet surrounds\nthe walkway as it is a place of respect for the elves, but the ever-present\nforest noises of its animals still intrudes here.\n',56,164016,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10160,14,44,-1,'The Pathway of the Revered Elm','Elm trees are a place of peace and sanctuary for all elves who will always\ntry and have at least one such tree nearby them.  The platform that you are now\nupon encircles the elm tree and rests entirely on its massive limbs.  This\nplatform, like those comprising the other walkways, is connected to its\nneighbors by vine rope bridges, although these seem to have been made more\ndurable and steady by the inclusion of sinewy fibers taken from what the elf\nhunters bring back to feed the village with.  A certain solemn quiet surrounds\nthe walkway as it is a place of respect for the elves, but the ever-present\nforest noises of its animals still intrudes here.  Attached to the tree is a\nsturdy, rope ladder leading upward.\n',56,164016,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10161,13,44,-1,'The Pathway of the Revered Elm','Elm trees are a place of peace and sanctuary for all elves who will always\ntry and have at least one such tree nearby them.  The platform that you are now\nupon encircles the elm tree and rests entirely on its massive limbs.  This\nplatform, like those comprising the other walkways, is connected to its\nneighbors by vine rope bridges, although these seem to have been made more\ndurable and steady by the inclusion of sinewy fibers taken from what the elf\nhunters bring back to feed the village with.  A certain solemn quiet surrounds\nthe walkway as it is a place of respect for the elves, but the ever-present\nforest noises of its animals still intrudes here.\n',56,164016,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
