(10181,8,43,-1,'The Altar of the Druid Monastery','The monastic temple that the elven druids have erected is in honor to the\nrevered elm tree that they worship.  Like all druid monasteries, it is open\nair, but has a few shrines to protect anything that needs it from the elements.\nThe whole monastery is supported by the branches of the elm and the center of\nreverence, the altar, is here.\n',56,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(10182,19,40,0,'A Wood Elf Dormitory','A large platform high up in one of the trees houses a good portion of the\nwood elf villagers.  The platform is entirely enclosed and the only entrance\ninto it is the vine rope ladder through which you came.  The dormitory has\nmeager furnishings, but various elves have put up personal objects so as to give\nthe place a feeling of home.  Somewhat surprisingly, there seems to be little\ndistinction or separation between the sexes.  No effort at providing privacy is\nattempted and apparently none is desired.  Male and female elves live here with\ntheir children in relative harmony.\n',56,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(10183,20,40,0,'A Wood Elf Dormitory','A large platform high up in one of the trees houses a good portion of the\nwood elf villagers.  The platform is entirely enclosed and the only entrance\ninto it is the vine rope ladder through which you came.  The dormitory has\nmeager furnishings, but various elves have put up personal objects so as to give\nthe place a feeling of home.  Somewhat surprisingly, there seems to be little\ndistinction or separation between the sexes.  No effort at providing privacy is\nattempted and apparently none is desired.  Male and female elves live here with\ntheir children in relative harmony.\n',56,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
