(10190,18,44,-1,'A Wood Elf\'s Home','This is a small tree house with meager furnishings and little opulence.\nThe elven belief in a simple life and taking from nature only what is\nneeded to survive is well displayed in the complete lack of extraneous\nobjects.  The walls are made of timber and what few items lie about are of\na practical nature.  There are a few plants about which the elves tend\nwith a diligence as it is a sign of how they take care of nature just as\nnature takes care of them.  The elf family that lives here is held in high\nenough regard by the village to warrant one of the few private homes they\nhave.  A simple window looks out into the forest.\n',56,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(10191,19,44,-1,'A Wood Elf\'s Home','This is a small tree house with meager furnishings and little opulence.  The\nelven belief in a simple life and taking from nature only what is needed to\nsurvive is well displayed in the complete lack of extraneous objects.  The walls\nare made of timber and what few items lie about are of a practical nature.\nThere are a few plants about which the elves tend with a diligence as it is a\nsign of how they take care of nature just as nature takes care of them.  The elf\nfamily that lives here is held in high regard by the village to warrant one of\nthe few private homes they have.  A simple window looks out into the forest.\n',56,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
