(10212,23,60,-1,'Tundra Trail near Amber','A wide, featureless plain spreads out before you.  Short, stubby crabgrass\nprotrudes through the surface in clumps scattered about.  A mountain range lines\nthe horizon to the east, while little can be seen to the west.  A bitterly cold\nwind seems to sweep down from the northeast.  The towers and walls of the town\nof Amber lie to the east against a mountainous backdrop.\n',56,131072,3,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10213,24,61,-1,'Tundra Trail near Amber','A wide, featureless plain spreads out before you.  Short, stubby crabgrass\nprotrudes through the surface in clumps scattered about.  A mountain range lines\nthe horizon to the east, while little can be seen to the west.  A bitterly cold\nwind seems to sweep down from the northeast.  The towers and walls of the town\nof Amber lie to the east against a mountainous backdrop.\n',56,131072,3,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10214,25,61,-1,'Tundra Trail near Amber','A wide, featureless plain spreads out before you.  Short, stubby crabgrass\nprotrudes through the surface in clumps scattered about.  A mountain range lines\nthe horizon to the east, while little can be seen to the west.  A bitterly cold\nwind seems to sweep down from the northeast.  The towers and walls of the town\nof Amber lie to the east against a mountainous backdrop.\n',56,131072,3,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10215,18,62,-1,'Frontier Trail','The unkempt trail upon which you stand runs south across a featureless tundra\nto the civilized lands of the interior, or north through the mountains toward\nthe frontier.  Arctic grasses grow with difficulty and a bitter wind blows out\nof the north.\n',56,131072,3,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10216,18,63,-1,'Frontier Trail','The unkempt trail upon which you stand runs south across a featureless tundra\nto the civilized lands of the interior, or north through the mountains toward\nthe frontier.  Arctic grasses grow with difficulty and a bitter wind blows out\nof the north.\n',56,131072,3,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10217,18,64,-1,'Frontier Trail in a Mountain Pass','The unkempt trail upon which you stand runs south across a featureless tundra\nto the civilized lands of the interior, or north through the mountains toward\nthe frontier.  Arctic grasses grow with difficulty and a bitter wind blows out\nof the north.  The tundra south of here turns abruptly into mountains -\nfortunately a way through presents itself in the form of this mountain pass.\nThere seems to be the signs of an establishment further north in the pass.\n',56,131072,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10218,17,65,-1,'Frontier Trail in a Mountain Pass','The unkempt trail upon which you stand runs south across a featureless tundra\nto the civilized lands of the interior, or north through the mountains toward\nthe frontier.  Arctic grasses grow with difficulty and a bitter wind blows out\nof the north.  The tundra south of here turns abruptly into mountains -\nfortunately a way through presents itself in the form of this mountain pass.\nThere seems to be the signs of an establishment further north in the pass.\n',56,131072,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10219,17,66,-1,'Frontier Trail in a Mountain Pass','The unkempt trail upon which you stand runs south across a featureless tundra\nto the civilized lands of the interior, or north through the mountains toward\nthe frontier.  Arctic grasses grow with difficulty and a bitter wind blows out\nof the north.  The tundra south of here turns abruptly into mountains -\nfortunately a way through presents itself in the form of this mountain pass.\nThere seems to be the signs of an establishment further north in the pass.\n',56,131072,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10220,18,67,-1,'Frontier Trail near the Border','A widened area in the pass has allowed the construction of a frontier guard\npost here.  The palisade and walls that the guard post defends lie just\nnortheast of here where the pass begins to narrow again.  A gateway lies in\nthe center of the wall allowing the foolhardy to discover their fate.  A\nbarracks has been constructed on the north side of the trail to house the\nfrontier\'s defenders and a training ground lies west of the barracks.  A\nsmall, barred window is in the wall of the barracks.\n',56,131072,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10221,17,66,-1,'Frontier Trail near the Border','A widened area in the pass has allowed the construction of a frontier guard\npost here.  The palisade and walls that the guard post defends lie just\nnortheast of here where the pass begins to narrow again.  A gateway lies in\nthe center of the wall allowing the foolhardy to discover their fate.  A\nbarracks has been constructed on the north side of the trail to house the\nfrontier\'s defenders and a training ground lies west of the barracks.  A\nsmall, barred window is in the wall of the barracks.\n',56,131072,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10222,20,68,-1,'Frontier Trail near the Border','A widened area in the pass has allowed the construction of a frontier guard\npost here.  The palisade and walls that the guard post defends lie just\nnortheast of here where the pass begins to narrow again.  A gateway lies in\nthe center of the wall allowing the foolhardy to discover their fate.  A\nbarracks has been constructed on the north side of the trail to house the\nfrontier\'s defenders and a training ground lies west of the barracks.  A\nstout wooden door bars the way north into the barracks.\n',56,131072,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10223,19,67,-1,'Frontier Trail near the Border','A widened area in the pass has allowed the construction of a frontier guard\npost here.  The palisade and walls that the guard post defends lie just\nnortheast of here where the pass begins to narrow again.  A gateway lies in\nthe center of the wall allowing the foolhardy to discover their fate.  A\nbarracks has been constructed on the north side of the trail to house the\nfrontier\'s defenders and a training ground lies west of the barracks.   A\nsmall, barred window is in the wall of the barracks.\n',56,131072,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10224,9,44,-3,'Frontier Trail - Inside the Gate','A widened area in the pass has allowed the construction of a frontier guard post\nhere.  The palisade and walls that the guard post defends lie just northeast of\nhere where the pass begins to narrow again.  A gateway lies in the center of the\nwall allowing the foolhardy to discover their fate.  A barracks has been\nconstructed on the north side of the trail to house the frontier\'s defenders and\na training ground lies west of the barracks.  The wall stretches across the pass\nrunning from northwest to southeast and a small access trail runs up and down\njust behind it to aid in the defense.  The gate itself lies immediately before\nyou and is made of immense timbers reinforced with iron bands.  It swings\ncumbersomely on its hinges.  Additionally, a small, barred window looks into\nthe barracks from here.\n',56,131072,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10231,7,46,-2,'Frontier Wall','This scaffolding is partially protected by the thick timbers forming the\npalisade, although your upper body and head are still exposed when you stand\nupright.  The timbers themselves are encrusted with a hardened, black resin\nthat must be used to ward off fires.  You have a clear view over the palisade,\nand a bowman would have no difficulty firing down on any attacking force\nfoolish enough to rush the wall.\n',56,131072,3,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10232,7,45,-2,'Frontier Wall','This scaffolding is partially protected by the thick timbers forming the\npalisade, although your upper body and head are still exposed when you stand\nupright.  The timbers themselves are encrusted with a hardened, black resin\nthat must be used to ward off fires.  You have a clear view over the palisade,\nand a bowman would have no difficulty firing down on any attacking force\nfoolish enough to rush the wall.\n',56,131072,3,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10233,8,45,-2,'Frontier Wall','This scaffolding is partially protected by the thick timbers forming the\npalisade, although your upper body and head are still exposed when you stand\nupright.  The timbers themselves are encrusted with a hardened, black resin\nthat must be used to ward off fires.  You have a clear view over the palisade,\nand a bowman would have no difficulty firing down on any attacking force\nfoolish enough to rush the wall.\n',56,131072,3,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
