(10361,17,60,-7,'Natural Well','  This is a large room, roughly circular in shape.  The center of the room is\ndominated by what looks like a well.  The lip of the well is about two feet off\nthe floor and is about ten feet across.  Disappearing into the inky black depths\nis a rusty chain.  The chain is held up by a broken crank which had been fixed\nto the ceiling above the shaft.\n',62,131080,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(10362,17,60,-8,'Inside a Well','  It is difficult to see much in the black depths of the well.  All light seems\nto be absorbed by the black rock.  The walls are quite slick, and it is rather\ndifficult to find purchase to prevent tumbling into the black depths.  A rusty\nchain is suspended in the middle of the room continuing into the rooms above and\nbelow.\n',62,131080,15,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(10363,17,60,-9,'Inside a Well','You find yourself clinging to the wall.  Your only foothold is a four\ninch crack in the wall.  As you peer into the inky darkness, you wonder how\nyou will ever make it out of here.\n',62,131080,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(10364,17,60,-10,'Inside a Well','  It is difficult to see much in the black depths of the well.  All light seems\nto be absorbed by the black rock.  The walls are quite slick, and it is rather\ndifficult to find purchase to prevent tumbling into the black depths.  A rusty\nchain is suspended in the middle of the room continuing into the rooms above and\nbelow.\n',62,131080,15,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(10365,17,60,-11,'Inside a Well','  It is difficult to see much in the black depths of the well.  All light seems\nto be absorbed by the black rock.  The walls are quite slick, and it is rather\ndifficult to find purchase to prevent tumbling into the black depths.  A rusty\nchain is suspended in the middle of the room continuing into the rooms above and\nbelow.\n',62,131080,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
