(10377,18,59,-16,'Dry Riverbed',' Once a river flowed here, but now only the sandy trace of its passage remains.\nAt one time an earthquake or other cataclysm must have changed its course.  The\nriver followed a strange course through the mountain, twisting and turning its\nway through the mountain.\n',62,131080,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,200,0,'',NULL),
(10378,18,60,-16,'Thin Subterranean Stream','  A tiny trickle of water runs down the wall and winds its way across the\ncavern, disappearing into the opposite wall.  The riverbed here, except for the\nstream, is still dry and looks like it has been that way for ages.\n',62,131080,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,200,0,'',NULL),
(10379,18,61,-16,'Dry Riverbed',' Once a river flowed here, but now only the sandy trace of its passage remains.\nAt one time an earthquake or other cataclysm must have changed its course.  The\nriver followed a strange course through the mountain, twisting and turning its\nway through the mountain.\n',62,131080,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,200,0,'',NULL),
(10380,17,60,-16,'Dry Riverbed',' Once a river flowed here, but now only the sandy trace of its passage remains.\nAt one time an earthquake or other cataclysm must have changed its course.  The\nriver followed a strange course through the mountain, twisting and turning its\nway through the mountain.\n',62,139272,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,200,0,'',NULL),
(10381,17,61,-16,'Narrow Passage','  This is a very tight squeeze through the rock.  The walls are very close,\npractically brushing your shoulders.  A faint breeze ruffles your hair.\n',62,139272,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(10382,16,62,-16,'Narrow Passage','  This is a very tight squeeze through the rock.  The walls are very close,\npractically brushing your shoulders.  A faint breeze ruffles your hair.\n',62,139272,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(10383,15,62,-16,'Narrow Passage','  This is a very tight squeeze through the rock.  The walls are very close,\npractically brushing your shoulders.  A faint breeze ruffles your hair.\n',62,139272,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(10384,14,63,-16,'Narrow Passage','  This is a very tight squeeze through the rock.  The walls are very close,\npractically brushing your shoulders.  A faint breeze ruffles your hair.  To\nthe north the passage seems to open up.\n',62,139272,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(10385,14,64,-16,'Vast Cavern','  This cavern is truly immense.  The ceiling is easily seven hundred feet\nhigh, if not greater.  The granite floor is fairly smooth, although\nstrange gouges several feet long and a few inches deep occasionally mar\nthe surface.  A vague odor tickles your senses.  It seems rather familiar\nthis acrid odor, but it is too diffuse to get a good grasp of its\nidentity.\n',62,139272,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,700,0,'',NULL),
(10386,15,64,-16,'Vast Cavern','  This cavern is truly immense.  The ceiling is easily seven hundred feet\nhigh, if not greater.  The granite floor is fairly smooth, although\nstrange gouges several feet long and a few inches deep occasionally mar\nthe surface.  A vague odor tickles your senses.  It seems rather familiar\nthis acrid odor, but it is too diffuse to get a good grasp of its\nidentity.\n',62,139272,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,700,0,'',NULL),
