(10394,15,67,-16,'Cavern Opening','  The cavern has opened up to a cliff here, exposing it to the open air.  No\npassage appears available to descend the cliff from here.  The granite floor\nshows even more scars marring the surface.  Small pools of some liquid bubble\nhere producing a noxious fume.  Strange pieces of granite are strewn about the\nfloor.  Their shape is vaguely familiar.\n',62,139272,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,700,0,'',NULL),
(10395,14,67,-16,'Cavern Opening','  The cavern has opened up to a cliff here, exposing it to the open air.  No\npassage appears available to descend the cliff from here.  The granite floor\nshows even more scars marring the surface.  Small pools of some liquid bubble\nhere producing a noxious fume.  Strange pieces of granite are strewn about the\nfloor.  Their shape is vaguely familiar.\n',62,139272,5,0,0,0,0,0,0,700,0,'',NULL),
(10500,1,14,-1,'An Unkempt Grassy Field','  You are in a large unkempt field with numerous paths criss-crossing in\nall directions.  Grasses and weeds make the ground soft on your feet.\nImmediately to your west is a broad road.  Off to your east you see a\nfence enclosing a Pasture filled with livestock.  To your south, the walls\nof Grimhaven tower over you promising protection.  Way off to the north,\nyou see the beginnings of the Haon-Dor Forest.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10501,1,15,-1,'An Unkempt Grassy Field','  You are in a large unkempt field with numerous paths criss-crossing in\nall directions.  Grasses and weeds make the ground soft on your feet.\nImmediately to your west is a broad road.  Off to your east you see a\nfence enclosing a pasture filled with livestock.  To your south, the walls\nof Grimhaven tower over you promising protection.  Way off to the north,\nyou see the beginnings of the Haon-Dor Forest.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10502,1,16,-1,'An Unkempt Grassy Field','  You are in a large unkempt field with numerous paths criss-crossing in\nall directions.  Grasses and weeds make the ground soft on your feet.\nImmediately to your west is a broad road.  Off to your east, you see a\nfence enclosing a pasture filled with livestock.  To your south, the walls\nof Grimhaven tower over you promising protection.  To the north, you see\nthe beginnings of the Haon-Dor Forest.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10503,1,17,-1,'A Path on The Edge of the Forest','  You are on a small path just south of the Haon-Dor forest.  The forest\nextends as far as you can see but is too dense to enter.  South of you is\na large unkempt field filled with grasses and weeds.  Off to the\nsoutheast, you see a fence enclosing a pasture filled with livestock.\nImmediately to your west is a broad paved road running south.  Way off\nsouth down this road, the lights and sounds of Grimhaven still echo a\npromise of protection and civilization not provided by the menacing forest\nto your north.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10504,2,17,-1,'A Path on the Edge of the Forest','  You are on a small path just south of the Haon-Dor forest.  The forest\nextends as far as you can see but is too dense to enter.  South of you is\na large unkempt field filled with grasses and weeds.  Off to the southeast\nis a a large enclosed pasture which has fences running south and east\nsurrounding a large grazing pasture.  A distance to your west is a broad\npaved road running south.  Way off south down this road, the lights and\nsounds of Grimhaven still echo a promise of protection and civilization\nnot provided by the menacing forest to your north.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10505,2,16,-1,'An Unkempt Grassy Field','  You are in the north part of a large unkempt field with numerous paths\ncriss-crossing in all directions.  Grasses and weeds make the ground soft\non your feet.  To your west is a broad road.  To the east you see a fence\nenclosing a pasture filled with livestock.  Off to the south, the lights\nand sounds of Grimhaven promise some degree of protection and\ncivilization.  Directly to the north is a small path which runs around the\npasture.  Further north, you see the imposing density of the Haon-Dor\nForest which extends as far as you can see.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10506,2,15,-1,'A Bare Patch in a Grassy Field','  <k>You are in the middle of a large unkempt field with numerous paths\ncriss-crossing in all directions.  This particular part of the field is\ntotally bare of all life as though an evil magic has scarred the very\nfabric of the earth and cursed it for all eternity.  Off to your west is a\nbroad road.  To the east you see a fence enclosing a pasture filled with\nlivestock.  Off to the south, the lights and sounds of Grimhaven promise\nsome degree of protection and civilization.  To the north, you see the\nimposing density of the Haon-Dor Forest which extends as far as you can\nsee.<1>\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10507,2,14,-1,'An Unkempt Grassy Field before a Gate','  You are on the southern edge of a large unkempt field.  There is a gate\ndirectly to your south behind which is a path running along the Grimhaven\ncity walls.  Grasses and weeds make the ground soft on your feet.  Off to\nyour west is a broad road.  To the east you see the intersection of two\nfences running east and northeast which enclose a pasture filled with\nlivestock.  Above you, the lights and sounds of Grimhaven promise some\ndegree of protection and civilization.  Far to the north, you see the\nimposing density of the Haon-Dor Forest which extends as far as you can\nsee.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10508,2,13,-1,'A Path along a Wall','  You are on a small path running along and under the walls of Grimhaven.\nIt looks well traveled and there is a lot of litter strewn all over the\nground.  Above you, you can hear sounds of the city and the Grimhaven\nguards.  You see some graffiti etched in the walls.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10509,3,13,-1,'A Path along a Wall','  You are on a small path running along and under the walls of Grimhaven.\nIt looks well traveled and there is a lot of litter strewn all over the\nground.  Above you, you can hear sounds of the city and the Grimhaven\nguards.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10510,4,13,-1,'A Path along a Wall','  You are on a small path running along and under the walls of Grimhaven.\nIt looks well traveled and there is a lot of litter strewn all over the\nground.  Just to your north is a large rock outcropping blocking your\nview.  Above you, you can hear sounds of the city and the Grimhaven\nguards.  Just to your south is a little nook hidden on all sides from\nview.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10511,4,12,-1,'A Sheltered Nook Under the Walls','  A jutting ledge in the wall and a large outcropping to the north\nprotects this nook from observation from all but the most determined\nwatcher.  It appears to be used for various parties as you see a large\nvariety of discarded party garbage.  It also appears to be used for other\npurposes judging by a familiar smell and a brownish streak on the wall.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10512,3,18,-1,'A Clearing in the Haon-Dor Forest','  You feel a sense of awe at the immensity of the forest that surrounds\nyou.  Trees and foliage press in from you from all sides and you wonder\nhow this clearing has stood against these forces over time.  On the whole\nthe clearing gives off a sense of well being and seems to be used for\nreligious purposes judging by the small altar on the north side of the\nclearing and a small pit where people can build campfires during\nceremonies.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10513,3,15,-1,'Before a Gate in a a Fenced-in Pasture','  You are on the eastern edge of a large unkempt field.  There is a gate\ndirectly to your east behind which is a large enclosed grazing pasture.\nGrasses and weeds make the ground soft on your feet.  Off to your west is a\nbroad road.  To the south, the distant lights and sounds of Grimhaven\npromise some degree of protection and civilization.  Far to the north, you\nsee the imposing density of the Haon-Dor Forest which extends as far as\nyou can see to the north.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10514,3,16,-1,'An Unkempt Grassy Field','  You are on the northeastern edge of a large unkempt field with numerous\npaths criss-crossing in all directions.  Grasses and weeds make the ground\nsoft on your feet.  Directly to the east passage is blocked by the a fence\nrunning north and south which encloses a pasture filled with livestock.\nWay off to your west is a broad road.  Far to the south, the lights and\nsounds of Grimhaven promise some degree of protection and civilization.\nDirectly to your north is a small path running around the pasture.\nFurther north, you see the imposing density of the Haon-Dor Forest which\nextends as far as you can see.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10515,3,17,-1,'A Path on The Edge of the Forest','  You are on a small path running east and west just south of a small\nclearing in the middle of the Haon-Dor forest.  This clearing is directly\nto your north and is a place where civilization has made a slight inroad\ninto the density of the Haon-Dor Forest which otherwise extends without a\nbreak as far as you can see to the north, northeast and northwest.\nImmediately to the south is a large unkempt field filled with grasses and\nweeds.  Immediately to the southeast, there is a fence enclosing a pasture\nfilled with livestock.  Off to your west is a broad paved road running\nsouth.  Way off south down this road, the lights and sounds of Grimhaven\nstill echo a promise of protection and civilization not provided by the\nmenacing forest to your north.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10516,4,17,-1,'A Path on The Edge of the Forest','  You are on a small path just south of the Haon-Dor forest and north of a\nlarge enclosed pasture.  The forest extends as far as you can see but is\ntoo dense to enter.  South of you is a fence running east to west\nenclosing the pasture both blocking your passage and keeping the animals\nfrom escaping.  The path is slightly overgrown but the grasses and weeds\nmake it easy on your feet.  A good distance to your west is a broad paved\nroad running south.  Way off south down this road, the lights and sounds of\nGrimhaven still echo a promise of protection and civilization not provided\nby the menacing forest to your north.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10517,5,17,-1,'A Path on The Edge of the Forest','  You are on a small path just south of the Haon-Dor forest and north of a\nlarge enclosed pasture.  The forest extends as far as you can see but is\ntoo dense to enter.  South of you is a fence running east to west\nenclosing the pasture both blocking your passage and keeping the animals\nfrom escaping.  The path is slightly overgrown but the grasses and weeds\nmake it easy on your feet.  A good distance to your west is a broad paved\nroad running south.  Way off south the lights and sounds of Grimhaven still\necho a promise of protection and civilization not provided by the menacing\nforest to your north.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10518,6,17,-1,'A Path on The Edge of the Forest','  You are on a small path just south of the Haon-Dor forest and north and\nwest of a large enclosed pasture.  The forest extends as far as you can see\nbut is too dense to enter except for one small gap to the northeast.  South\nand east of you is a fence which encloses the pasture both blocking your\npassage and keeping the animals from escaping.  The path is slightly\novergrown but the grasses and weeds make it easy on your feet.  Far to your\nwest is a broad paved road running south.  Way off south the lights and\nsounds of Grimhaven still echo a promise of protection and civilization not\nprovided by the menacing forest to your north.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10519,3,14,-1,'The Southwest Corner of a Pasture','  You are in the southwestern corner of a large enclosed pasture which\nGrimhaven citizens use to keep their livestock safe.  Grasses and weeds\nmake the ground soft on your feet but I wouldn\'t lie down anywhere.\nDirectly to the east passage is blocked by the pasture fence which runs\neast and northeast from this part of the pasture.  Far to the south, the\nlights and sounds of Grimhaven promise some degree of protection and\ncivilization.  Far to the north, you see the imposing density of the\nHaon-Dor Forest which extends as far as you can see.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10520,4,14,-1,'Along the Southern Fence','  You are on the southern edge of a large enclosed pasture which Grimhaven\ncitizens use to keep their livestock safe.  Grasses and weeds make the\nground soft on your feet but I wouldn\'t lie down anywhere.  Directly to the\nsouth passage is blocked by the pasture fence which runs east and west in\nthis part of the pasture.  Just on the other side of the fence is a large\nrock outcropping blocking your view but further south the walls of\nGrimhaven tower above you promising some degree of protection and\ncivilization.  Way off north in the far distance, you see the imposing\ndensity of the Haon-Dor Forest which extends as far as you can see.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10521,4,15,-1,'A Gate in the Western Fence','  You are on the western edge of a large enclosed pasture which Grimhaven\ncitizens use to keep their livestock safe.  Directly to the west, there is\na large swinging gate in the fence which runs around the pasture.  This\ngate is the main entrance and exit to the pasture.  Farther south, the\nlights and sounds of Grimhaven promise some degree of protection and\ncivilization.  In the distant north is the imposing density of the Haon-Dor\nForest which extends as far as you can see.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10522,4,16,-1,'The Northwest Corner of a Fenced-in Pasture','  You are in the northwest corner of a large enclosed pasture which\nGrimhaven citizens use to keep their livestock safe.  Grasses and weeds\nmake the ground soft on your feet but I wouldn\'t lie down anywhere.\nDirectly to the west and north your passage is blocked by the pasture\nfence which runs south and east from this part of the pasture.  Far to the\nsouth, the lights and sounds of Grimhaven still promise some degree of\nprotection and civilization.  Just past the fence to your north, you see a\nsmall path bordering the imposing density of the Haon-Dor Forest which\nextends as far as you can see.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10523,5,16,-1,'Along the Northern Fence of a Pasture','  You are on the northern edge of a large enclosed pasture which Grimhaven\ncitizens use to keep their livestock safe.  Grasses and weeds make the\nground soft on your feet but I wouldn\'t lie down anywhere.  Directly to the\nnorth passage is blocked by the pasture fence which runs east and west in\nthis part of the pasture.  Far to the south, the lights and sounds of\nGrimhaven still promise some degree of protection and civilization.  Just\npast the fence to the north, you see a small path bordering the imposing\ndensity of the Haon-Dor Forest which extends as far as you can see.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10524,5,15,-1,'In a Livestock Pasture','  You are in the middle of a large enclosed pasture which Grimhaven\ncitizens use to keep their livestock safe.  Grasses and weeds make the\nground soft on your feet but I wouldn\'t lie down anywhere.  Off to the west,\nyou see a gate which provides a means of exiting the pasture.  Off to the\nsouth, the lights and sounds of Grimhaven promise some degree of\nprotection and civilization.  Off to the north, you see the imposing\ndensity of the Haon-Dor Forest which extends as far as you can see.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10525,5,14,-1,'Along the Southern Fence','  You are in the southern part of a large enclosed pasture which Grimhaven\ncitizens use to keep their livestock safe.  Grasses and weeds make the\nground soft on your feet but I wouldn\'t lie down anywhere.  Directly to the\nsouth passage is blocked by the pasture fence which runs southeast and\nwest in this part of the pasture.  Past the fence is a large rock\noutcropping that blocks your view at ground level.  Further south, the\nlights and sounds of Grimhaven tower above you promising some degree of\nprotection and civilization.  Way off north in the far distance, you see\nthe imposing density of the Haon-Dor Forest which extends as far as you\ncan see.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10526,6,13,-1,'Along the Southern Fence','  You are on the southern edge of a large enclosed pasture which Grimhaven\ncitizens use to keep their livestock safe.  Grasses and weeds make the\nground soft on your feet but I wouldn\'t lie down anywhere.  Directly to the\nsouth passage is blocked by the pasture fence which runs east and\nnorthwest in this part of the pasture.  Past the fence to the west is a\nlarge rock outcropping that blocks your view.  Further south, the lights\nand sounds of Grimhaven tower above you promising some degree of\nprotection and civilization.  Way off north in the far distance, you see\nthe imposing density of the Haon-Dor Forest which extends as far as you\ncan see.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
