(10529,6,16,-1,'Along the Northern Fence of a Pasture','  You are on the northern edge of a large enclosed pasture which Grimhaven\ncitizens use to keep their livestock safe.  Grasses and weeds make the\nground soft on your feet but I wouldn\'t lie down anywhere.  Directly to the\nnorth passage is blocked by the pasture fence which runs east and west in\nthis part of the pasture.  Far to the south, the lights and sounds of\nGrimhaven still promise some degree of protection and civilization.  Just\npast the fence to the north, you see a small path bordering the imposing\ndensity of the Haon-Dor Forest which extends as far as you can see.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10530,7,17,-1,'The Northeast Corner of a Pasture','  You are in the northeast corner of a large enclosed pasture which\nGrimhaven citizens use to keep their livestock safe.  Grasses and weeds\nmake the ground soft on your feet but I wouldn\'t lie down anywhere.  All\naround you except to the south your passage is blocked by the pasture\nfence.  Just past the fence to the north the imposing density of the\nHaon-Dor Forest extends as far as you can see.  Far to the south, the\nlights and sounds of Grimhaven still promise some degree of protection and\ncivilization.  Past the fence to the east you see an inhospitable plateau\nof rocky fields and deep ravines.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10531,7,16,-1,'Along the Eastern Edge of a Pasture','  You are on the eastern edge of a large enclosed pasture which\nGrimhaven citizens use to keep their livestock safe.  Grasses and weeds\nmake the ground soft on your feet but I wouldn\'t lie down anywhere.\nDirectly to your east, your passage is blocked by the pasture fence.  Off\nto the north, you see the imposing density of the Haon-Dor Forest which\nextends as far as you can see.  Off to the south, the lights and sounds of\nGrimhaven still promise some degree of protection and civilization.  Past\nthe fence to the east you see an inhospitable plateau of rocky fields and\ndeep ravines.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
