(10533,7,14,-1,'Along the Eastern Edge of a Pasture','  You are on the eastern edge of a large enclosed pasture which Grimhaven\ncitizens use to keep their livestock safe.  Grasses and weeds make the\nground soft on your feet but I wouldn\'t lie down anywhere.  Directly to\nyour east, your passage is blocked by the pasture fence.  Far off to the\nnorth, you see the imposing density of the Haon-Dor Forest which extends\nas far as you can see.  Off to the south, the lights and sounds of\nGrimhaven still promise some degree of protection and civilization.  Past\nthe fence to the east you see an inhospitable plateau of rocky fields and\ndeep ravines.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10534,7,13,-1,'The Southeastern Corner of a Pasture','  You are in the southeast corner of a large enclosed pasture which\nGrimhaven citizens use to keep their livestock safe.  Grasses and weeds\nmake the ground soft on your feet but I wouldn\'t lie down anywhere.\nDirectly to the east and south your passage is blocked by the pasture\nfence which runs north and west from this part of the pasture.  Just past\nthe fence to the south, the lights and sounds of Grimhaven tower above you\npromising some degree of protection and civilization.  Past the fence to\nthe east you see an inhospitable plateau of rocky fields and deep ravines.\nFar to the north, the imposing density of the Haon-Dor Forest extends as\nfar as you can see.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10535,-1,14,-1,'A Small Rocky Field','  You are in a small field filled with rocks carved out of an inhospitable\nrocky plain.  Very little is growing in this field.  The plain extends to\nthe west but is impassable due to deep ravines and razor sharp rocks.\nImmediately to your east is a broad road.  Immediately to your south, the\nwalls of Grimhaven tower over you promising protection.  Under the walls\nruns the perimeter path around the Grimhaven City walls but your way to\nthis path is blocked by a large fallen meteor that just missed Grimhaven\nitself.  Far off to the north, you see the imposing density of the Haon-Dor\nForest.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10536,-1,15,-1,'A Small Rocky Field','  You are in a small field filled with rocks carved out of an inhospitable\nrocky plain.  Very little is growing in this field.  The plain extends to\nthe west but is impassable due to deep ravines and razor sharp rocks.\nImmediately to your east is a broad road.  To the north and northwest the\nrest of the rocky field.  To your south, the walls of Grimhaven tower over\nyou promising protection and civilization.  Far to the north, you see the\nimposing density of the Haon-Dor Forest.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10537,-1,16,-1,'A Worn Path Through a Small Rocky Field','  You are on a warn path traversing a small field filled with rocks.  Very\nlittle is growing in this field as it has been carved by a seemingly\ninhuman effort out of an inhospitable rocky plain.  The field extends with\nthe path a short distance to the west and then disappears altogether after\nwhich the path leads to some pastures also carved out of the rocky plain.\nAll around this field and the pastures are boulders, sharp rocks and deep\nravines making cross country travel well nigh impossible.  Directly to\nyour east is a broad road running north and south.  To the south, the\nwalls of Grimhaven tower over you promising protection and civilization.\nTo the north, you see the imposing density of the Haon-Dor Forest.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10538,-1,17,-1,'A Small Rocky Field','You are in a small field filled with rocks carved out of an inhospitable\nrocky plain.  Very little is growing in this field.  The plain extends to\nthe west but is impassable due to deep ravines and razor sharp rocks.\nImmediately to your east is a broad road.  To the south and southwest the\nrest of the rocky field.  Further to your south, the walls of Grimhaven\ntower over you promising protection and civilization.  Directly to the\nnorth is the imposing Haon-Dor Forest.\n',0,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10539,-2,16,-1,'A Worn Path Through a Small Rocky Field','  You are on a warn path traversing a small field filled with rocks.  Very\nlittle is growing in this field as it has been carved by a seemingly\ninhuman effort out of an inhospitable rocky plain.  The path only extends\nwest a short distance ending at some pastures also carved out of the rocky\nplain.  All around this field and the pastures are boulders, sharp rocks\nand deep ravines making cross country travel well nigh impossible.  Off to\nthe east after cutting across the rest of the field, the path intersects a\nbroad road running north and south.  To the south, the walls of Grimhaven\ntower over you promising protection and civilization.  To the north, you\nsee the imposing density of the Haon-Dor Forest.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10540,-3,16,-1,'A Worn Path','  You are in a worn path carved out of an inhospitable plain.  The path\nconnects some small pastures to the west with a rocky field to the east.\nBeyond the field is a broad road leading south back to town or north to\nthe Haon-Dor forest.  The path has very little growing on it and has some\nrazor sharp rocks on either side of its safety.  All around this path, the\nfield and the pastures are boulders, sharp rocks and deep ravines making\ncross country travel well nigh impossible.  Off to your south, the walls\nof Grimhaven tower over you promising protection and civilization.  In the\nfar north, you see the imposing density of the Haon-Dor Forest.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10541,-4,16,-1,'Outside some Small Pastures','  You are just outside of some small pastures which are used by citizens\nof Grimhaven to hold livestock.  Gates to these pastures are to your north\nand south.  There is a path to your east which leads the way back to town\nby way of a rocky field.  The path widens into a deeply rutted dirt road\nto the west.   On all sides of the path, the field and these pastures are\nboulders, razor sharp rocks and deep ravines making cross country travel\nwell nigh impossible.  Off to your south, the walls of Grimhaven tower\nover you promising protection and civilization.  Far to the north, you see\nthe imposing density of the Haon-Dor Forest.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10542,-4,15,-1,'In a Small Pasture','  You are in a small enclosed pasture which Grimhaven citizens use to keep\ntheir livestock safe.  This pasture is a little rocky and out of the way\nso it is mostly used by the poorer townsfolks.  On all sides of this\npasture are boulders, razor sharp rocks and deep ravines making cross\ncountry travel well nigh impossible.  Off to the south, the lights and\nsounds of Grimhaven promise protection and civilization.  Far off to the\nnorth, you see the imposing density of the Haon-Dor Forest which extends\nas far as you can see.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10543,-4,14,-1,'In a Small Pasture','  You are in a small enclosed pasture which Grimhaven citizens use to keep\ntheir livestock safe.  This pasture is a little rocky and out of the way\nso it is mostly used by the poorer townsfolks.  On all sides of this\npasture are boulders, razor sharp rocks and deep ravines making cross\ncountry travel well nigh impossible.  Off to the south, the lights and\nsounds of Grimhaven promise protection and civilization.  Far off to the\nnorth, you see the imposing density of the Haon-Dor Forest which extends\nas far as you can see.\n',64,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
