(10624,39,35,0,'Arden Lake','  As you gaze across its surface, the calm, deep blue-green waters of Arden \nLake confer a sense of peace and tranquility.  This lake is the home of the \nLake Elf Goddess, Eldathial.  Arden Lake is a deep lake that reaches a depth \nof four hundred feet in two distinct places.  The remainder of the lake ranges \nfrom twenty-five to one hundred feet more than ten feet from the shoreline.\n',90,139584,29,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10625,40,35,0,'Fishing Dock','  Weather worn and old, the dock upon which you stand is solid as granite.\nThere is a sickly sweet smell that eminates from the wood.  There is also\na high railing along the edge of the dock that borders the lake.  The\nrailing has regular breaks in it where ladders down to the water can be \nseen.\n',90,139584,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10626,41,35,0,'Before the Fishing Dock','  Green grass stands tall here.  To your west you see the fishing dock that \nbegins right beneath your feet.  A strange smell wafts in from the cool \nbreeze from the west.  The slight lapping of the water against the pylons \nwhich the dock stands gives you a relaxed and soothing feeling.\n',90,139584,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10627,33,34,0,'Path Before the Forest Island','  Standing before you to your south is the beginning of a large thick forest.\nTrees stand tall and there is an unusual calm and silence about the woods here.\nYou feel the hairs of your neck standing on end, as if you were being watched,\nor maybe stalked.\n',90,139584,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(10628,34,34,0,'Arden Lake','  As you gaze across its surface, the calm, deep blue-green waters of Arden \nLake confer a sense of peace and tranquility.  This lake is the home of the \nLake Elf Goddess, Eldathial.  Arden Lake is a deep lake that reaches a depth \nof four hundred feet in two distinct places.  The remainder of the lake ranges \nfrom twenty-five to one hundred feet more than ten feet from the shoreline.\n',90,139584,29,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
