(10643,40,33,0,'The Dancing Dryad','  This three-story building has been constructed log cabin style.  Towards \nthe southeast corner of the hospice is a large stone fireplace.  This is a \nrelatively small supplemental building that rests ten feet above the water \nin a crook of three massive boulders in which it has been built.\n',90,139593,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,300,0,'',NULL),
