(10837,58,-125,7,'Atop the Queen\'s Tower','   This covered tower room provides views of the surrounding area for the\nqueen.  The queen comes here to look over her husband\'s citadel and\nsurrounding lands.  You can see vast distances in any direction.  A set of\nstairs leads down.\n',69,131073,2,0,0,0,0,0,6,-1,0,'',NULL),
