(11141,0,0,0,'In the Temple of the Ryoken','This is a dark room.  The walls are made of a strange red metal and appear\nto be bleeding.  The floor is covered in a thick, soggy carpet that is\nstained red from the walls.  Whenever you move you can feel the carpet\ngrasping at your feet.  Archways lead to the north, east and south.\n',65,139272,50,0,0,0,0,0,10,100,0,'',NULL),
(11142,0,0,0,'In the Temple of the Ryoken','This is a dark room.  The walls are made of a strange red metal and appear\nto be bleeding.  The floor is covered in a thick, soggy carpet that is\nstained red from the walls.  Whenever you move you can feel the carpet\ngrasping at your feet.  Archways lead to the west and north.\n',65,139272,50,0,0,0,0,0,10,100,0,'',NULL),
(11143,0,0,0,'In the Temple of the Ryoken','This is a dark room.  The walls are made of a strange red metal and appear\nto be bleeding.  The floor is covered in a thick, soggy carpet that is\nstained red from the walls.  Whenever you move you can feel the carpet\ngrasping at your feet.  Archways lead to the east and south.\n',65,139272,50,0,0,0,0,0,10,100,0,'',NULL),
(11144,0,0,0,'In the Temple of the Ryoken','This is a dark room.  The walls are made of a strange red metal and appear\nto be bleeding.  The floor is covered in a thick, soggy carpet that is\nstained red from the walls.  Whenever you move you can feel the carpet\ngrasping at your feet.  Archways lead to the north and south.\n',65,139272,50,0,0,0,0,0,10,100,0,'',NULL),
(11145,0,0,0,'In the Temple of the Ryoken','This is a dark room.  The walls are made of a strange red metal and appear\nto be bleeding.  The floor is covered in a think, soggy carpet that is\nstained red from the walls.  Whenever you try to move you can feel the carpet\ngrasping at your feet.  Archways lead to the north and south.\n',65,139272,50,0,0,0,0,0,10,100,0,'',NULL),
(11146,0,0,0,'In the Temple of the Ryoken','This is a dark room.  The walls are made of a strange red metal and appear\nto be bleeding.  The floor is covered in a thick, soggy carpet that is\nstained red from the walls.  Whenever you move you can feel the carpet\ngrasping at your feet.  Archways lead to the north and south.\n',65,139272,50,0,0,0,0,0,10,100,0,'',NULL),
(11147,0,0,0,'In the Temple of the Ryoken','This is a dark room.  The walls are made of a strange red metal and appear\nto be bleeding.  The floor is covered in a thick, soggy carpet that is\nstained red from the walls.  Whenever you move you can feel the carpet\ngrasping at your feet.  Archways lead to the north and south.\n',65,139272,50,0,0,0,0,0,10,100,0,'',NULL),
(11148,0,0,0,'Top of a Padded Stair','This is a brightly lighted chamber.  The red metal walls are clean and\ncovered in brightly shining runes.  The floor is covered in a thick, soft\ncarpet that is pearly white.  The carpet absorbs all sounds you make.\nArchways lead to the north and east.  A highly polished red metal stair\nleads down.\n',65,173241,55,0,0,0,0,0,10,100,0,'',NULL),
(11149,0,0,0,'A Spartan Office','This is a sparsely furnished office.  The man who works in this office\nbelieves in being clean, for not a spec of dust can be found.\n',65,139273,22,0,0,0,0,0,5,100,0,'',NULL),
(11150,0,0,0,'A Polished Marble Hallway','This is part of a polished marble hallway.  The walls, ceiling and floor\nare all made out of black and white checkered marble.  Veins of red metal\nrun through the marble giving the appearance of arteries in the stone.\nA door made out of titanium has been set into the north wall.  Exits lead\nto the west and south.\n',65,139273,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(11151,0,0,0,'A Polished Marble Hallway','This is part of a polished marble hallway.  The walls, ceiling and floor\nare all made out of black and white checkered marble.  Veins of red metal\nrun through the marble giving the appearance of arteries in the stone.\nExits lead to the west and north.\n',65,139273,22,0,0,0,0,0,10,100,0,'',NULL),
(11152,0,0,0,'Guards Kitchen','This is the kitchen used to cook the meals for the guardsmen.  Many large\nlarge pots fill this room.  Dirty dishes have been piled high on a table\nin one corner of the room.  The smell coming from the pots is strangely\nbitter to your nose.  There are doors leading to the west and south.\n',65,139273,55,0,0,0,0,0,10,100,0,'',NULL),
(11153,0,0,0,'Storage Room','This is the storage room used by the guards cooks.  There are several\nslabs of meat hanging from the ceiling.  Barrels of various goods have\nbeen stacked against the south wall.  A door has been set into the north\nwall.\n',65,139273,13,0,0,0,0,0,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(11154,0,0,0,'End of a Polished Marble Hallway','This is the end of a polished marble hallway.  The walls, ceiling and floor\nare all made out of black and white checkered marble.  Veins of red metal\nrun through the marble giving the appearance of arteries in the stone.\nExits lead to the west and south.\n',65,139273,22,0,0,0,0,0,10,100,0,'',NULL),
(11155,0,0,0,'A Polished Marble Hallway','This is part of a polished marble hallway.  The walls, ceiling and floor\nare all made out of black and white checkered marble.  Veins of red metal\nrun through the marble giving the appearance of arteries in the stone.\nExits lead to the west, north and east.\n',65,139273,22,0,0,0,0,0,10,100,0,'',NULL),
(11156,0,0,0,'A Polished Marble Hallway','This is part of a polished marble hallway.  The walls, ceiling and floor\nare all made out of black and white checkered marble.  Veins of red metal\nrun through the marble giving the appearance of arteries in the stone.\nExits lead to the west and east.\n',65,139273,22,0,0,0,0,0,10,100,0,'',NULL),
(11157,0,0,0,'A Round Room','This is a round room.  This room connects the guards barracks to the\nkitchen and dining room.  Three doors lead out from this room.  A door\nleads west to the barracks, another door leads east to the kitchen and\nthe door to the south leads to the dining room.\n',65,139273,55,0,0,0,0,0,10,100,0,'',NULL),
(11158,0,0,0,'Guards Dining Room','This is a large room where the guardsmen come to eat their meals.  A huge\ntable fills most of the room.  The oval table is made of one piece of solid\nmarble and has a flawless finish.  Doors lead out to the north and west.\n',65,139273,55,0,0,0,0,0,50,100,0,'',NULL),
(11159,0,0,0,'Entrance to the Smithy','This is the entrance to the smithy where the blacksmith works.  The\nfloor is covered in a fine layer of soot.  Heat radiates from large\nmetal gate in the west wall.  An exit leads east.\n',65,139273,55,0,0,0,0,0,10,100,0,'',NULL),
(11160,0,0,0,'A Polished Marble Hallway','This is part of a polished marble hallway.  The walls, ceiling and floor\nare all made out of black and white checkered marble.  Veins of red metal\nrun through the marble giving the appearance of arteries in the stone.\nExits lead to the west and east.\n',65,139273,22,0,0,0,0,0,10,100,0,'',NULL),
(11161,0,0,0,'A Polished Marble Hallway','This is part of a polished marble hallway.  The walls, ceiling and floor\nare all made out of black and white checkered marble.  Veins of red metal\nrun through the marble giving the appearance of arteries in the marble.\nA door has been set into the south wall.  Exits lead to the west and east.\n',65,139273,22,0,0,0,0,0,10,100,0,'',NULL),
(11162,0,0,0,'Entrance to the Barracks','This large room serves as the entrance to the guardsmen\'s barracks.  A\ndoor has been set into the east wall.  The room stretches onward to the\nwest, southwest and south.\n',65,139273,55,0,0,0,0,0,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(11163,0,0,0,'Barracks','This is the guardsmen\'s barracks.  Many beds lie spread across the room\nwith tables sitting here and there for playing card games.  All the beds\nare perfectly made and nothing seems out of order.  The room spreads to\nthe north, northwest and west.  A small door has been set into the east\nwall.\n',65,139273,55,0,0,0,0,0,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(11164,0,0,0,'Blacksmith\'s Room','This is the blacksmith\'s living quarters.  Clothes have been flung on the\nfloor beneath the bed.  The floor is covered in a thin film of black soot.\nA small wooden door leads to the west and a large metal gate leads to the\neast.\n',65,139273,55,0,0,0,0,0,10,100,0,'',NULL),
(11165,0,0,0,'Top of a Red Metal Stair','This is the top of a red metal stair.  Stairs of a dull red metal lead\ndown into the darkness below.  A strange moaning sound can be heard coming\nfrom below.  An exit leads east.\n',65,139273,55,0,0,0,0,0,10,100,0,'',NULL),
(11166,0,0,0,'A Polished Marble Hallway','This is part of a polished marble hallway.  The walls, ceiling and floor\nare all made out of black and white checkered marble.  Veins of red metal\nrun through the marble giving the appearance of arteries in the stone.\nA thick, red metal gate blocks an exit to the west.  An exit leads to the\neast.\n',65,139273,22,0,0,0,0,0,10,100,0,'',NULL),
(11167,0,0,0,'Barracks','This is the guardsmen\'s barracks.  Many beds lie spread across the room\nwith tables sitting here and there for playing card games.  All the beds\nare perfectly made and nothing seems to be out of order.  The room spreads\nto the east, southeast and south.\n',65,139273,55,0,0,0,0,0,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(11168,0,0,0,'Barracks','This is the guardsmen\'s barracks.  Many beds lie spread across the room\nwith tables sitting here and there for playing card games.  All the beds\nare perfectly made and nothing seems out of order.  The room spreads to\nthe north, northeast and east.\n',65,139273,55,0,0,0,0,0,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(11169,0,0,0,'Blacksmith\'s Forge','This room contains all the tools used by the blacksmith to create weapons\nand armor.  The room is incredibly hot from the huge forge.  A large\ndoor has been set into the south wall and a small wooden door has been\nset into the east wall.\n',65,139273,42,0,0,0,0,0,15,100,0,'',NULL),
(11170,0,0,0,'Storage Room','This room is used to store the weapons and armor made by the blacksmith.\nSuits of red metal armor line the walls while racks of weapons take up\nthe middle of the room.  Each item is tied down with glowing red ropes.\nA large door has been set into the north wall.\n',65,139273,42,0,0,0,0,0,30,100,0,'',NULL),
(11171,0,0,0,'End of a Polished Marble Hallway','This is the end of a polished marble hallway.  The walls, ceiling and\nfloor are all made of out of black and white checkered marble.  Veins\nof red metal run through the marble giving the appearance of arteries\nin the stone.  A thick, red metal gate blocks an exit to the east.\nAn exit leads to the south.\n',65,139273,22,0,0,0,0,0,8,100,0,'',NULL),
(11172,0,0,0,'A Polished Marble Hallway','This is part of a polished marble hallway.  The walls, ceiling and floor\nare all made out of black and white checkered marble.  Veins of red metal\nrun through the marble giving the appearance of arteries in the stone.\nExits lead to the north and south.\n',65,139273,22,0,0,0,0,0,8,100,0,'',NULL),
(11173,0,0,0,'Bottom of a Padded Stair','This is a brightly lighted chamber.  The red metal walls are clean and\ncovered in brightly shining runes.  The floor is covered in a thick, soft\ncarpet that is pearly white.  The carpet absorbs all sounds you make.\nAn archway leads to the north.  A highly polished, red metal stair leads\nup.\n',65,173241,55,0,0,0,0,0,10,100,0,'',NULL),
(11174,0,0,0,'In the Church of the Ryoken','This is a dark room with a red metal floor.  Deep grooves have been cut\ninto the red metal floor and seem to lead to the south.  The moans of\npraying Ryoken can be heard from all around.\n',65,139272,55,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(11175,0,0,0,'In the Church of the Ryoken','This is a dark room with a red metal floor.  Deep grooves have been cut\ninto the red metal floor and seem to lead to the south.  The moans of\npraying Ryoken can be heard from all around.\n',65,139272,55,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(11176,0,0,0,'In the Church of the Ryoken','This is a dark room with a red metal floor.  Deep grooves have been cut\ninto the red metal floor and seem to lead to the south.  The moans of\npraying Ryoken can be heard from all around.\n',65,139272,55,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(11177,0,0,0,'Top of a Blood Covered Stair','This is a dark room with a deeply grooved, red metal floor.  A large gem\nis hovering about four feet in the air and is glowing a deep crimson.  All\nthe grooves running into this room end directly underneath the large gem.\nThe moans of praying Ryoken can be heard from all around.  Stairs covered\nin thick layers of blood lead down.  Cries of pain and whimpers of fear\ncan be heard coming from below.  Exits lead to the west, northwest, north\nand down.\n',65,139272,55,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(11178,0,0,0,'In the Church of the Ryoken','This is a dark room with red metal floors.  Deep grooves have been cut\ninto the red metal floor and seem to lead to the southeast.  The moans\nof praying Ryoken can be heard from all around.\n',65,139272,55,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(11179,0,0,0,'In the Church of the Ryoken','This is a dark room with red metal floors.  Deep grooves have been cut\ninto the red metal floor and seem to lead to the southeast.  The moans\nof praying Ryoken can be heard from all around.\n',65,139272,55,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
