(12123,0,0,0,'Commonwealth Lane',' This was once a well maintained, north-south road running through a\nlarge city.  To the east, a large collapsed church settles as you walk\npast.  To the west was the city Post Office, but it has caved in.\n',81,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12126,0,0,0,'Commonwealth Lane',' This was once a well maintained, north-south road running through a\nlarge city.  To the east, a large collapsed church settles as you walk\npast.  To the west the fortune teller\'s shop once stood, all that remains\nis a large pile of rubble now.\n',81,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12127,0,0,0,'Commonwealth Lane',' This was once a well maintained, north-south road running through a\nlarge city.  To the east, a large collapsed church settles as you walk\npast.  To the west the a shop once stood, all that remains is a large pile\nof rubble now.\n',81,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12128,0,0,0,'Commonwealth Lane',' This was once a well maintained, north-south road running through a\nlarge city.  To the east, a large collapsed church settles as you walk\npast.  To the west a shop once stood, all that remains is a large pile of\nrubble now.\n',81,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12129,0,0,0,'South Main Street','  This is a wide, north-south road is overrun with weeds.  To the east\nlies a large charred park, while to the west appears to be a vacant\nmarketplace.\n',81,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12130,0,0,0,'South Main Street',' This is a wide, north-south road which has been undisturbed for quite\nsome time.   A parting in the tall grass reveals large ruts left by the\npassage of many carts long ago used to frequent this road.  To the east\nyou see a charred park, while to the west is a vacant marketplace.\n',81,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12131,0,0,0,'South Main Street',' This is a wide, north-south road is overrun with weeds.  To the east\nlies a large charred park, while to the west appears to be a vacant\nmarketplace.\n',81,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12132,0,0,0,'South Main Street',' This wide, north-south road runs between a large vacant marketplace, to\nthe west, and a charred park to the east.  The road really looks in rough\nshape here.  The park lies beyond a gate east of here.\n',81,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12133,0,0,0,'South Main Street',' This wide, north-south road overlooks a charred park to the east.  The\nroad really looks in rough shape here.\n',81,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12134,0,0,0,'South Main Street',' This is a wide, north-south road which has not been disturbed in a long\ntime.  To the east lies a large two-story building, while to the west is a\nseries of run-down collapsed buildings.\n',81,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12135,0,0,0,'South Main Street','This is a wide, north-south road which has not been disturbed in a long\ntime.  To the east lies a large two-story building, while to the west is a\nseries of run-down collapsed buildings.\n',-1,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12136,0,0,0,'South Main Street',' This is a wide, north-south road which has not been disturbed in a long\ntime.  To the east lies a large two-story building, while to the west is a\nseries of run-down collapsed buildings.\n',81,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12137,0,0,0,'South Main Street',' This is a wide, north-south road which appears well-traveled.\n',81,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12138,0,0,0,'Perimeter Road',' This road goes around the outer perimeter of Grimhaven, and lies\nbetween the huge city walls and the city.  The walls are made of large\nstones held together with large amounts of mortar, and have long out lived\ntheir use.  It looks easy to scale these walls now that have been subdued\nby an unknown force.  Pieces of the wall lie everywhere.  This\nintersection on Perimeter Road connects the city of Grimhaven to the rest\nof The World.  You see gates to the distance in the south, or is that a\ngate you see?\n',81,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12139,0,0,0,'Inside the City Gates',' You stand between a large opening where two huge iron gates once stood.\nTo the north, a road winds into a ruined large city.  To the south you\ncan make out a swirling mass of some kind.\n',81,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
