(12168,0,0,0,'Briar Way',' This small weeded road runs east to west.  To the west is a dead-end and\nthe east is Main Street.\n',81,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12169,0,0,0,'Briar Way',' This is the end to Briar Way.  There are collapsed houses all around\nyou.\n',81,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
