(12248,0,0,0,'Walton Ave South',' This avenue runs north and south.  The forest road is wide and leaves\nlitter the dirt floor.  The avenue is still under construction, you can\nsee where townsfolks have marked their claim to the lands by using wooden\nstakes and rope tieing off their boundaries.  Though there are few housing\nunits here, they probably belong to merchants that have accumulated enough\ntalens to build a humble home.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
