(12250,0,0,0,'Walton Ave South',' This avenue runs north and south.  The forest road is wide and leaves\nlitter the dirt floor.  The avenue is still under construction, you can\nsee where townsfolks have marked their claim to the lands by using wooden\nstakes and rope tieing off their boundaries.  Though there are few housing\nunits here, they probably belong to merchants that have accumulated enough\ntalens to build a humble home.  To the west you spot a small settlement.\nA shack lies east of you.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12251,0,0,0,'Walton Ave South',' This avenue runs north and south.  The forest road is wide and leaves\nlitter the dirt floor.  The avenue is still under construction, you can\nsee where townsfolks have marked their claim to the lands by using wooden\nstakes and rope tieing off their boundaries.  Though there are few housing\nunits here, they probably belong to merchants that have accumulated enough\ntalens to build a humble home.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12252,0,0,0,'Walton Ave South',' This avenue runs north.  The forest road is wide and leaves\nlitter the dirt floor.  The avenue is still under construction, you can\nsee where townsfolks have marked their claim to the lands by using wooden\nstakes and rope tieing off their boundaries.  Though there are few housing\nunits here, they probably belong to merchants that have accumulated enough\ntalens to build a humble home.  A small shop lies to the east and a\nsettlement lies west.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12253,0,0,0,'Mohamed\'s Cloth Tailoring',' Here you can purchase the finest cloth ever! Bought and Sold!\nWooden crates and shelves hold piles of fine cloth from around\nThe World.  The shopkeeper greets you warmly.\n',82,164093,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,110,0,'',NULL),
(12254,0,0,0,'Strictly Leather',' Here\'s where you can find quality leathers bought and sold.\nThe store is small yet piles upon piles of leather can be\nseen neatly folded on the counters.  The shopkeeper greets you\nwarmly.\n',82,164029,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,110,0,'',NULL),
(12255,0,0,0,'A Small Dwelling',' You have entered the home leather shopkeeper.  Leather skins and tools\nused for his profession lie strewn upon the ground.  The home is quite\ncozy, it reflects someone who makes an honest living.\n',82,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,110,0,'',NULL),
(12256,0,0,0,'Darwins Wool',' Fine fabric of wool can be bought and sold here! Piles of wool\nline the north and south walls.  The shopkeeper greets you warmly.\n',82,164093,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,110,0,'',NULL),
(12257,0,0,0,'Sarah\'s Fine Silk',' Sarah\'s fine silk is the best in the lands!  Anything silk can\nbe bought and sold here! The shopkeeper greets you with a smile.\n',82,164093,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,110,0,'',NULL),
(12258,0,0,0,'A Small Dwelling',' You have entered what seems to be the home of the Wool shopkeeper.\nTools used and skinning lie strewn on the ground next to a\nspinning wheel.\n',82,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(12259,0,0,0,'Sweat Shop',' The smell of sweat wafts through the air here.  Several small\nspinning wheels sit here just below a hole in the roof used for\nventilating the room.\n',82,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,110,0,'',NULL),
(12260,0,0,0,'West Stone Road',' Stone road runs east to west here and bustles heavily with activity.\nYou can see that the road is laced with small white pebbles most\nlikely used to keep the weeds and grass from flourishing.  Large\noak trees placed along the this road create a natural splintery\narchway above your head that provides shade and some protection\nfrom the elements.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12261,0,0,0,'Stone Road',' Stone road runs east to west here and bustles heavily with activity.\nYou can see that the road is laced with small white pebbles most\nlikely used to keep the weeds and grass from flourishing.  Large\noak trees placed along the this road create a natural splintery\narchway above your head that provides shade and some protection\nfrom the elements.  A small well has been freshly dug here.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12262,0,0,0,'Fordam Road North',' You are on the eastern end of this settlement where progress has yet to\nmake its mark.  One remarkable aspect of this road is the beauty of\nthe woods that are lush and green.  A shop lies to the west.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
