(12268,0,0,0,'Fordam Road South',' You are on the eastern end of this settlement where progress has yet to\nmake it mark upon.  One remarkable aspect of this road is the beauty of\nthe woods that are lust and green.  A shop lies to the east of you.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12269,0,0,0,'Fordam Road South',' You are on the eastern end of this settlement where progress has yet to\nmake it mark upon.  One remarkable aspect of this road is the beauty of\nthe woods that are lust and green.  A home lies to the west of you.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12270,0,0,0,'Fordam Road South',' You are on the eastern end of this settlement where progress has yet to\nmake it mark upon.  One remarkable aspect of this road is the beauty of\nthe woods that are lust and green.  A shack lies east.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12271,0,0,0,'Fordam Road South',' You are on the eastern end of this settlement where progress has yet to\nmake its mark upon.  One remarkable aspect of this road is the beauty of\nthe woods that are lust and green.  This route is not yet a trail nor is\nit a road, in fact, it is a pathway hardly traveled.  Tucked away in\nthe depths of the trees to the east is a small shop.  A small sign\ndecorates the archway of the shop.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12272,0,0,0,'The Golden Goose',' Objects of great wealth and treasures of gold glint brightly\nof the mounted sconces in the room.  Gold is obviously bought,\nsold or traded here.  The shopkeeper greets you warmly.\n',82,164029,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(12273,0,0,0,'A Small Dwelling',' You have entered a humble of one of the residents of Grimhaven.\nThe housing itself is constructed of wood normally found in the\nenchanted forest of Darkwood just west of the city.  Unlike\nmost of the simple units in Grimhaven, the wood here bends\nnaturally forming itself to create this home.\n',82,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(12274,0,0,0,'A Small Dwelling',' You have entered a humble of one of the residents of Grimhaven.\nThe housing itself is constructed of wood normally found in the\nenchanted forest of Darkwood just west of the city.  Unlike\nmost of the simple units in Grimhaven, the wood here bends\nnaturally forming itself to create this home.\n',82,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(12275,0,0,0,'The Silver Spoon',' Treasure and other various trinkets to shining silver armor line\nthe walls here.  Virtually anything you can think of that silver\nis bought and sold here.  The shopkeeper greets you warmly.\n',82,164029,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(12276,0,0,0,'Brassy Trinkets and Other',' This shop is a marvel to look at.  Small trinkets made of brass\nglint lightly from the torches that mount the walls.  Other\narticles of brass can be bought and sold here as well.\n',82,164029,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(12277,0,0,0,'A Small Dwelling',' You have entered a humble of one of the residents of Grimhaven.\nThe housing itself is constructed of wood normally found in the\nenchanted forest of Darkwood just west of the city.  Unlike\nmost of the simple units in Grimhaven, the wood here bends\nnaturally forming itself to create this home.\n',82,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(12278,0,0,0,'Precious Gems',' Small gems, large gems, virtually any type of gem bought and\nsold here! If the price is right, the shopkeeper might even\nbe able to set gems into rings themselves! From wedding rings\nto elegant gem neck wear this store has it all.\n',82,164029,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(12279,0,0,0,'The Furry Trading Post',' This is a rangers nightmare.  Piles of furs have been stocked\nhigh on the counter before you.  It seems trapping has been\nplentiful this season.\n',82,164093,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(12280,0,0,0,'East Stone Road',' Stone road runs east to west here and bustles heavily with activity.\nYou can see that the road is laced with small white pebbles most\nlikely used to keep the weeds and grass from flourishing.  Large\noak trees placed along the this road create a natural splintery\narchway above your head that provides shade and some protection\nfrom the elements.  <G>Walton Ave<1> travels north and south of you.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12281,0,0,0,'East Stone Road',' Stone road runs east and west.  You can see that the road is laced\nwith small white pebbles most likely used to keep the weeds and grass\nfrom flourishing.  Large oak trees placed along the this road create\na natural splintery archway above your head that provides shade and\nsome protection from the elements.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12282,0,0,0,'Concourse and Fordam',' Concourse street runs to the west and is wide enough for merchants\nselling their wares to pass easily during peak hours.  While many roads\nin this territory are still under construction, small businesses and homes\nhave managed to surface quickly despite the rough terrain that surrounds\nyou.  Roped off sections staked out with wooden spikes are presumably\nspaces for either homes or shops can be seen lining the avenue.\nA small shop lies north of you.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12283,0,0,0,'Concourse Street',' Concourse street runs east to west and is wide enough for merchants\nselling their wares to pass easily during peak hours.  While many roads\nin this territory are still under construction, small businesses and homes\nhave managed to surface quickly despite the rough terrain that surrounds\nyou.  Roped off sections staked out with wooden spikes are presumably\nspaces for either homes or shops can be seen lining the avenue.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
