(12290,0,0,0,'Concourse Street',' Concourse street runs east to west and is wide enough for merchants\nselling their wares to pass easily during peak hours.  While many roads\nin this territory are still under construction, small businesses and homes\nhave managed to surface quickly despite the rough terrain that surrounds\nyou.  Roped off sections staked out with wooden spikes are presumably\nspaces for either homes or shops can be seen lining the avenue.  A small\nshop lies north of you, tacked to its archway is a small sign.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12291,0,0,0,'Concourse and Walton',' Concourse street runs east to west and is wide enough for merchants\nselling their wares to pass easily during peak hours.  While many roads\nin this territory are still under construction, small businesses and homes\nhave managed to surface quickly despite the rough terrain that surrounds\nyou.  Roped off sections staked out with wooden spikes are presumably\nspaces for either homes or shops can be seen lining the avenue.\nWalton avenue trails south and a horse trail leads north.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12292,0,0,0,'The Mineral Trading Store',' A remarkable store dealing in mineral trades stands here.  The\nsmall shop has many items since the material bought and sold here\nis either built into everything or used by certain townsfolk for their\nprofessions.  The shopkeeper greets you warmly.\n',82,164029,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(12293,0,0,0,'The Rubber Store',' The use for rubber has grown a great deal since its finding.\nMostly used as a component for mages, rubber is also greatly\nused in places where one would think not to use it.  Also known\nfor its resistance to lightning, rubber might play a very\nimportant role in your life one day.  The shopkeeper greets\nyou warmly.\n',82,164093,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(12294,0,0,0,'Calja\'s Glass',' Miniature sculptures and stained containers made from glass line\nthese inner walls.  Vases, goblets, chalices - virtually anything\nmade from glass can be bought and sold here! The shopkeeper greets\nyou warmly.\n',82,164029,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(12295,0,0,0,'Plastics are Us',' The development of plastic is still in its youthful stage and\nhardly ever used in this town, yet that didn\'t stop someone from\nbuilding a shop for its use.  Rows upon rows of long, short tubes of\nplastic line the north wall.  Attached to each is a price tag.\nSmall sheets of plastic cut into cubes fill the counter before\nyou.  The shopkeeper greets you with a smile.\n',82,164029,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(12296,0,0,0,'Staked Claim',' Someone has lain claim to this portion of land.  Wooden stakes placed\nin four corners mark the boundaries of whatever is to be built here.\nA few shovels and other tools for digging lie aside a mound of uncovered\ndirt where the foundation will be built.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12297,0,0,0,'Staked Claim',' Someone has lain claim to this portion of land.  Wooden stakes placed\nin four corners mark the boundaries of whatever is to be built here.\nA few shovels and other tools for digging lie aside a mound of uncovered\ndirt where the foundation will be built.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12298,0,0,0,'Wazzy Wax',' Wazzy\'s wax is just your average wax shop.  Shipments of wax housed\nin crates line the walls and hundreds of candles, mostly used\nby the temple of <p>Zelpth<1> lie piled on the counter before you.\nThe shopkeeper greets you warmly.\n',82,164093,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(12299,0,0,0,'Temple Grounds',' You are standing on the temple grounds to the one of the old gods called\nZelpth.  An altar has been set up here for now welcoming all walks of life\nto pray before a huge fat statue of an Ogre.  The temple is a recent\naddition to Grimhaven and is still under construction.\n',82,164025,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(12300,0,0,0,'High Trail',' A heavily wooded area leads here east to west.  The trail is recent and\nuntamed as of yet since the growth of this town has just begun.  Already\nsomeone has placed their garbage here as a dumping ground.  Cardboard\nmats and moth eaten blankets also lie strewn on the ground.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12301,0,0,0,'High Trail',' This trail is recent mostly used by seedy individuals and lost souls.\nThe townsfolk who are now dwelling in this section have already begun\nusing this spot as a local dumping ground until the city\'s officials can\nfind a more suitable spot.  A few broken wine glasses and cardboard mats\ncan be seen here.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12302,0,0,0,'High Trail',' A short trail through the woods leads east to west.  A few broken wine\nbottles and cardboard mats lie strewn on the grass.  You can tell that\nthis is not a nice part of the settlement.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12303,0,0,0,'High Trail',' A short trail through the woods leads east to west.  A few broken wine\nbottles and cardboard mats lie strewn on the grass.  You can tell that\nthis is not a nice part of the settlement.  <G>Walton Ave<1> lies east of\nyou.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12304,0,0,0,'Southern Settlement',' These lands are yet untamed to the townsfolk that have recently\nsettled here.  Small homes poorly made can be seen here along this\nworn pathway of dirt.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12305,0,0,0,'Southern Settlement',' These lands are yet untamed to the townsfolk that have recently\nsettled here.  Small homes poorly made can be seen here along this\nworn pathway of dirt.  A door stands north of you before a humble\nhome.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12306,0,0,0,'Southern Settlement',' These lands are yet untamed to the townsfolk that have recently\nsettled here.  Small homes poorly made can be seen here along this\nworn pathway of dirt.  A home lies to the south of you.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12307,0,0,0,'A Small Shelter',' The shelter is no more than a few planks of wood mended together by mud\nand straw.  Broken pottery used as food containers lie arranged on a\ntattered blanket.  A heap of clothing serves as a bed for the resident\nof this home.\n',82,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
