(12312,0,0,0,'Path Before the Temple',' A wide clean path leads north to a small settlement and south\ntowards a temple.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12313,0,0,0,'Path Before the Temple',' The path travels back north and comes to rest before an unfinished temple\nof <p>Zelpth<1> which is still under construction.  Two very large\nfortified gates stands here as the entrance to the temple grounds.  Many\npeople from the shelter come here to pray from all walks of life.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12314,0,0,0,'East Stone Road',' Stone road runs west to east.  You can see that the road is laced with\nsmall white pebbles most likely used to keep the weeds and grass from\nflourishing.  Large oak trees arranged along the this road create a\nnatural splintery archway above your head that provides shade and some\nprotection from the elements.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12315,0,0,0,'East Stone Road',' Stone road runs west to east.  You can see that the road is laced with\nsmall white pebbles most likely used to keep the weeds and grass from\nflourishing.  Large oak trees arranged along the this road create a\nnatural splintery archway above your head that provides shade and some\nprotection from the elements.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12316,0,0,0,'Fordam and Stone',' You are on the eastern end of this settlement where progress has yet to\nmake it mark upon.  One remarkable aspect of this road is the beauty of\nthe woods that are lush and green.  East of you leads to the wilds beyond.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12317,0,0,0,'Southern Settlement',' These lands are yet untamed to the townsfolk that have recently\nsettled here.  Small homes poorly made can be seen here along this\nworn pathway of dirt.  An avenue bustling with activity lies east\nof you.  A humble home lies to the north of you.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
