(12322,0,0,0,'Horse Trail',' A horse trail leads north to south.  Not far north of you lies a dense\nforest untouched by the laws of production.  Tall thickets and foliage\ncluster this trail tightly.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12323,0,0,0,'Horse Trail',' A horse trail leads north to south.  Not far north of you lies a dense\nforest untouched by the laws of production.  Tall thickets and foliage\ncluster this trail tightly.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12324,0,0,0,'Horse Trail',' A horse trail leads north to south.  Not far north of you lies a dense\nforest untouched by the laws of production.  Tall thickets and foliage\ncluster this trail tightly.  A stable can be seen to the west.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12325,0,0,0,'Horse Trail',' A horse trail leads east to west.  Not far north of you lies a dense\nforest untouched by the laws of production.  The thickets to the west\nhave been cleared away to provide a pathway for the horses kept in the\nstables.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12326,0,0,0,'Horse Stable',' The stable is hot and humid built from earth and wood.  The floor is\nfairly clean despite large portions of hay used to feed the livestock\nhere.  North and south of you corrals hold decent looking horses, you\ncan tell that are well taken care of.\n',82,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(12327,0,0,0,'Corral',' The corral is small enough to hold you and a steed.  Fresh hay has been\nput down for feeding.\n',82,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,2,100,0,'',NULL),
