(12335,0,0,0,'Horse Trail',' A horse trail bends through the woods on a narrow path.  Thickets\nand foliage cluster this trail tightly.  A cool breeze flows from\nthe southeast where a small pond is seen.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12336,0,0,0,'Horse Trail',' A horse trail bends through the woods on a narrow path.  Thickets\nand foliage cluster this trail tightly.  A cool breeze flows from\nthe south where a small pond is seen.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12337,0,0,0,'Horse Trail',' A horse trail leads east, west of you lies a small shop or some sort.\nTo the north of you is a dense forest untouched by the laws of\nproduction.  Tall thickets and foliage cluster this trail tightly.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12338,0,0,0,'Horse Trail',' A horse trail leads through the woods on a narrow dirt path.\nSinging can be heard coming from a local tavern east of you.\nTall thickets and foliage cluster this trail tightly.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12339,0,0,0,'The Pit Stop',' Like much of the eastern settlement this establishment is still under\nconstruction.  You can see a set of stairs not yet finished that will\nlead up to another location of this building.  An unfinished doorway\nstands north where the northern wing will be.  Barbarians and woodsmen\ntravel in an out quenching their thirst at the local bar before moving on\nto the hired women here who can and will fullfill your every need.\n',82,164025,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(12340,0,0,0,'Kettler\'s Slaughter House',' Kettler\'s slaughter house is filled with flies and other infestations\nof various bugs.  A bloodstained counter is topped with fresh meats\narranged by the butcher and sold off in bulks.\n',82,164029,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,110,0,'',NULL),
(12341,0,0,0,'Horse Trail By a Pond',' A small pond is here in a dense forest.  Moss and algae circle the\nouter edges of the pond.  You gather the stable owner must take his\nlivestock here providing water for them.\n',82,131072,29,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12342,0,0,0,'Horse Trail',' The aroma of the woods wafts through the air filling your lungs with\na crisp clean scent of pine.  There\'s something relaxing  about the\nstillness these woods generate leaving the wind to fall gently on your\nface washing away every care in The World from it.  Tall plush green\ntrees tower over your head providing just the right amount of shade\nneeded to lie back and enjoy your surroundings.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12343,0,0,0,'Horse Trail',' The aroma of the woods wafts through the air filling your lungs with\na crisp clean scent of pine.  There\'s something relaxing  about the\nstillness these woods generate leaving the wind to fall gently on your\nface washing away every care in The World from it.  Tall plush green\ntrees tower over your head providing just the right amount of shade\nneeded to lie back and enjoy your surroundings.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
