(12349,0,0,0,'Horse Trail',' The aroma of the woods wafts through the air filling your lungs with\na crisp clean scent of pine.  There\'s something relaxing about the\nstillness these woods generate leaving the wind to fall gently on your\nface washing away every care in The World from it.  Tall plush green\ntrees tower over your head providing just the right amount of shade\nneeded to lie back and enjoy your surroundings.  To the east you see\na small wood cottage.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12350,0,0,0,'Cottage in the Woods',' A wood cottage blends easily with its surroundings, it looks newly built.\nFrom here the great Haon-Dor forest extends all around you here, it seems\nto go on forever.  A door to the cottage is here.\n',82,131072,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12351,0,0,0,'Cottage',' The cottage is not yet totally built.  An unfinished floor still\nhas sometime before it is completed and a stonewash fireplace sits\nhere waiting to be installed.  A tiny crystal dragon sits here upon\na golden anvil.\n',82,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,110,0,'',NULL),
(12400,31,-50,-1,'Tiny Damp Basement','  The tiny basement is dark and cramped.  The air is thick with the\nodor of mildew and you are shocked to see a small cot off to one side\nof the room, someone lives here!  A small collection of knick knacks\nlie strewn about the room and a small lamp burns a thick oil made of\nwhale blubber and other fats.  A tiny stairway leads up to the cabin\nabove and the trap door that is cleverly concealed under a pile of\nfake rubble.\n',71,139305,32,0,0,0,0,0,3,72,0,'',NULL),
(12401,40,-43,0,'Edge of the Fog','  You are on the edges of a large field of fog.  To enter would risk\nbecoming hopelessly lost.\n',71,131072,28,0,0,0,25,9,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(12402,41,-43,0,'Next to a Cliff Face','  You are moving along a shear cliff face which runs parallel to the ocean.\n',71,131072,28,0,0,0,25,9,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
