(12881,43,-62,-1,'Inside a Volcano','  You are standing on a small ledge which spirals around the inside\nof the volcano.  It is extremely hot in here but not unbearable.  The\nedge of the volcano is just above you while the ledge continues\nto wind down into the heart of the volcano.\n',71,131084,49,0,0,0,0,0,6,100,0,'',NULL),
(12882,43,-62,-2,'Inside a Volcano','  You are standing on a small ledge which spirals around the inside\nof the volcano.  The it is extremely hot in here but not unbearable.\nThe ledge spirals up to the edge of the volcano or downwards to the\nbottom of the volcano.\n',71,131084,49,0,0,0,0,0,6,100,0,'',NULL),
(12883,43,-62,-3,'Heart of the Volcano','  Standing in the heart of the volcano you are glad that no lava is\npresent in large quantities.  The lower portion of the volcano is very\nporous where lava has burned its way through when forced up from below\nthe surface.  You can see two tunnels that are big enough for a person\nto squeeze through but in one the roof has collapsed about 5 feet in.\nThe other appears to be free of rubble.  A small ledge spirals around\nthe inside of the volcano leading up to the edge of the volcano.\n',71,131084,49,0,0,0,0,0,8,100,0,'',NULL),
(12884,44,-61,-3,'In a Small Tunnel','  This small tunnel is very porous where lava has burned away all of\nthe soft rock and left only the hardest of substances.  You can see\nthe heart of the volcano to the southwest and the tunnel continues to\nthe north.  The heat in here is almost more than you can bear.\n',71,131084,49,0,0,0,0,0,4,100,0,'',NULL),
(12885,44,-60,-3,'In a Small Tunnel','This small tunnel is very porous where lava has burned away all of the soft\nrock and left only the hardest of substances.  You can see the heart of the\nvolcano to the southwest and the tunnel continues to the northeast.\n',-1,131084,49,0,0,0,0,0,2,100,0,'',NULL),
