(13142,18,-75,0,'A Strange Island','  Standing on this island seems to trigger some natural instinct\nwhich warns of nearby danger.  The island is covered in an extremely\nthick layer of vegetation, offering excellent cover for predators.\nYet when you look around everything seems peaceful enough.  The\nisland continues to the southwest where it is consumed in a thick\nfog.  As you attempt to brave the fog and explore the rest of the\nisland you are stopped by some force.  Try as you might you cannot\nseem to get past the barrier.\n',71,131076,45,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
