(13198,35,-94,0,'Stretch of Clear Waters','  To the east the storm front has dissipated into a thick field of\nfog.  To enter into the fog would be sure suicide, as you would soon\nbe hopelessly lost.  The storm still rages to the west in all its\nfury blocking passage that way as well.\n',71,131072,51,0,0,0,20,3,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(13199,35,-95,0,'Stretch of Clear Waters','  This narrow path is bordered by a dense field of fog to the east and\na raging storm to the west.\n',71,131072,51,0,0,0,20,3,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(13200,35,-96,0,'Stretch of Clear Waters','  This narrow path is bordered by a dense field of fog to the east and\na raging storm to the west.\n',71,131072,51,0,0,0,20,3,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(13201,35,-97,0,'Stretch of Clear Waters','  This narrow path is bordered by a dense field of fog to the east and\na raging storm to the west.\n',71,131072,51,0,0,0,20,3,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(13202,35,-98,0,'Stretch of Clear Waters','  This narrow path is bordered by a dense field of fog to the east and\na raging storm to the west.\n',71,131072,51,0,0,0,20,3,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(13203,34,-99,0,'Next to the Storm','  On one side of you a terrible storm blows in all its fury.  It is too\nsevere to chance passage through.  To the east of you the ocean continues,\nand to the northeast you can see a clear passage in between the edge of\nthe storm and a large field of fog.\n',71,131072,51,0,0,0,20,3,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(13204,35,-99,0,'Myrian Ocean','  You are in the midst of the vast Myrian Ocean.  To the north of you\nis a clear passage in between a severe ocean storm and a large field of\nfog.\n',71,131072,51,0,0,0,25,3,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(13205,36,-99,0,'Next to the Fog','  To the north of you is a a large field of fog.  To enter is almost\na certain sentence of becoming hopelessly lost.  The ocean continues\nto the west.  To the northwest you can see a clear passage in between\nthe fog and a severe ocean storm.\n',71,131072,51,0,0,0,30,3,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(13206,37,-99,0,'Next to the Fog','  To the north and east of you is a a large field of fog.  To enter\nis almost a certain sentence of becoming hopelessly lost.\n',71,131072,51,0,0,0,30,3,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
