(13479,32,-125,0,'End of the Clear Waters','  To the south of you the clear waters end as the storm to the west\nmeets up with a large field of fog to the east thereby blocking all\npassage at this time.\n',71,131072,51,0,0,0,20,3,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(13480,0,0,0,'In the Throat of Belimus','  Your life has been spared! Maybe.  You find your self standing in the\nthroat of Belimus miraculously alive.  You stand in a small cylinder\nlike area.  The walls of the throat have a soft slimy feeling to them\nwhich makes it very hard to remain standing.  The way up is blocked but\nbelow you the throat drops away into darkness.\n',71,173064,63,0,0,0,5,5,0,100,11,'',NULL),
(13481,0,0,0,'In the Throat of Belimus','  Your life has been spared! Maybe.  You find your self standing in the\nthroat of Belimus miraculously alive.  You stand in a small cylinder\nlike area.  The walls of the throat have a soft slimy feeling to them\nwhich makes it very hard to remain standing.  The throat continues both\nup and down from here.\n',71,173064,63,0,0,0,5,5,0,100,11,'',NULL),
(13482,0,0,0,'In the Throat of Belimus','  Your life has been spared! Maybe.  You find your self standing in the\nthroat of Belimus miraculously alive.  You stand in a small cylinder\nlike area.  The walls of the throat have a soft slimy feeling to them\nwhich makes it very hard to remain standing.  The throat continues both\nup and down from here.\n',71,173064,63,0,0,0,5,5,0,100,11,'',NULL),
(13483,0,0,0,'In Belimus\'s Stomach','  As you cling to the walls of Belimus\'s stomach you can feel the effect\nof his strong stomach acids as they eat through any armor your wearing to\nbegin to feed on your skin.\n',71,173064,63,0,0,0,5,5,0,100,10,'',NULL),
(13484,0,0,0,'In Belimus\'s Stomach','  As you cling to the walls of Belimus\'s stomach you can feel the effect\nof his strong stomach acids as they eat through any armor your wearing to\nbegin to feed on your skin.\n',71,173064,63,0,0,0,5,5,0,100,10,'',NULL),
