(13489,0,0,0,'Bottom of Belimus\'s Stomach','  As you stand at the bottom of Belimus\'s stomach in a pool of acid you\ncan see the remains of many a warrior who met their fate here as well.\nDiscarded piles of bone and small bits of metal which could not be\ndissolved by Belimus\'s stomach acids lie strewn about the floor.\n',71,173064,63,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,10,'',NULL),
(13490,0,0,0,'Bottom of Belimus\'s Stomach','  As you stand at the bottom of Belimus\'s stomach in a pool of acid you\ncan see the remains of many a warrior who met their fate here as well.\nDiscarded piles of bone and small bits of metal which could not be\ndissolved by Belimus\'s stomach acids lie strewn about the floor.\n',71,173064,63,0,0,0,5,5,0,100,10,'',NULL),
(13491,0,0,0,'Bottom of Belimus\'s Stomach','  As you stand at the bottom of Belimus\'s stomach in a pool of acid you\ncan see the remains of many a warrior who met their fate here as well.\nDiscarded piles of bone and small bits of metal which could not be\ndissolved by Belimus\'s stomach acids lie strewn about the floor.\n',71,173064,63,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,10,'',NULL),
(13492,0,0,0,'In the Intestines of Belimus','  Unfortunately there is no return from this point.  You are dead!\n',71,173066,63,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(13493,0,0,0,'Belimus\'s Windpipe','  You are standing in Belimus windpipe.  The walls are fairly dry here\nand very smooth.  The windpipe is about 8 feet in diameter, just enough\nroom for you to stand with a feeling of comfort, if any can be found in\nhere.\n',71,173064,63,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,9,'',NULL),
(13494,0,0,0,'Belimus\'s Windpipe','  You are standing in Belimus windpipe.  The walls are fairly dry here\nand very smooth.  The windpipe is about 8 feet in diameter, just enough\nroom for you to stand with a feeling of comfort, if any can be found in\nhere.  The windpipe branches here to enter the two lungs.\n',71,173064,63,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,9,'',NULL),
(13495,0,0,0,'Belimus\'s Lung','  You are standing amidst a sea of branches and air sacs used to filter\nBelimus\'s air supply.  You looks to be like a small jungle in here only\nit is deathly silent at the moment.\n',71,173064,63,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,9,'',NULL),
(13496,0,0,0,'Belimus\'s Lung','  You are standing amidst a sea of branches and air sacs used to filter\nBelimus\'s air supply.  You looks to be like a small jungle in here only\nit is deathly silent at the moment.  You can see a large flap of some\nkind above you to the west, but Belimus\'s muscles hold it completely shut.\n',71,173064,63,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,9,'',NULL),
(13497,0,0,0,'Belimus\'s Lung','  You are standing amidst a sea of branches and air sacs used to filter\nBelimus\'s air supply.  You looks to be like a small jungle in here only\nit is deathly silent at the moment.\n',71,173064,63,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,9,'',NULL),
(13498,0,0,0,'Belimus\'s Lung','  You are standing amidst a sea of branches and air sacs used to filter\nBelimus\'s air supply.  You looks to be like a small jungle in here only\nit is deathly silent at the moment.  You can see a large flap of some\nkind above you to the east, but Belimus\'s muscles hold it completely shut.\n',71,173064,63,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,9,'',NULL),
(13499,0,0,0,'Near Belimus\'s Blowhole','  Two large flaps are below you to the east and west.  These allow passage\ninto the lungs for air and are at the complete control of Belimus.  Above\nyou another muscle controls the opening to Belimus\'s blowhole itself and\nmay be your only hope for escape.\n',71,173064,63,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,8,'',NULL),
(13700,0,0,0,'Chaotic Astral Pocket','  This small astral pocket roils chaotically.  Reality twists and bends,\nmaking your head spin in confusion.  Flashes of distant locations flicker\nall around you, beckoning to you.\n',85,139592,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,199,27,'',NULL),
(13701,-19,24,-2,'Before A Large Cave','  A small tunnel leads in from the east and joins a large cave directly west.\nYou hear a light splashing of <b>water<1> coming from the cave and the air is damp\nand chilly.  Rivulets of <b>water<1> flow westward.\n',85,139592,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,80,0,'',NULL),
(13702,-23,24,-2,'A Large Cave','  This large cave is home to a fair sized pond, which is directly north.  The\nwater looks rather murky and probably does not circulate much.  The air is damp\nand chilly, and the ground is quite muddy.  Water slowly drips down from roots\nhanging off the dirt ceiling, adding even more mud to the pond.  A <o>rusty<1>\npickaxe with a rotting <o>wooden<1> handle leans against the wall.  It looks like\nit has been there for a long time.\n',85,139592,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,80,0,'',NULL),
(13703,-23,23,-2,'A Large Cave','  This large cave is home to a fair sized pond, which is directly east.  The\nwater looks rather murky and probably does not circulate much.  You can barely\nmake out some sort of lumpy form in the water to the east.  The air is damp\nand chilly, and the ground is quite muddy.  Water slowly drips down from roots\nhanging off the dirt ceiling, adding even more mud to the pond.\n',85,139592,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,80,0,'',NULL),
(13704,-22,25,-2,'A Large Cave','  This large cave is home to a fair sized pond, which is directly north.  The\nwater looks rather murky and probably does not circulate much.  The air is damp\nand chilly, and the ground is quite muddy.  Water slowly drips down from roots\nhanging off the dirt ceiling, adding even more mud to the pond.\n',85,139592,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,80,0,'',NULL),
(13705,-22,24,-2,'A Brackish Pond','  The water in this pond is rather <k>murky<1> and large clumps of <o>hair<1> from the\nlocal wildlife float around.  It doesn\'t appear to circulate at all and is\nprobably only fed by rivulets of rain that run in from the cave mouth.  The\n<o>mud<1> is very deep and it is difficult to walk.\n',85,139592,29,0,0,0,0,0,0,80,0,'',NULL),
(13706,-22,23,-2,'A Brackish Pond','  The water in this pond is rather <k>murky<1> and large clumps of <o>hair<1> from the\nlocal wildlife float around.  It doesn\'t appear to circulate at all and is\nprobably only fed by rivulets of rain that run in from the cave mouth.  The\n<o>mud<1> is very deep and it is difficult to walk.  A foul rotting corpse of\nunknown species floats here, apparently too rotten now to be eaten.\n',85,139592,29,0,0,0,0,0,0,80,0,'',NULL),
(13707,-22,22,-2,'A Large Cave','  This large cave is home to a fair sized pond, which is directly north.  The\nwater looks rather murky and probably does not circulate much.  You can barely\nmake out some sort of lumpy form in the water to the north.  The air is damp\nand chilly, and the ground is quite muddy.  Water slowly drips down from roots\nhanging off the dirt ceiling, adding even more mud to the pond.\n',85,139592,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,80,0,'',NULL),
(13708,-21,25,-2,'A Large Cave','  This large cave is home to a fair sized pond, which is directly north.  The\nwater looks rather murky and probably does not circulate much.  The air is damp\nand chilly, and the ground is quite muddy.  Water slowly drips down from roots\nhanging off the dirt ceiling, adding even more mud to the pond.  An old boot,\nhalf rotted and chewed up, lies on the floor.  It looks about dwarf sized.\n',85,139592,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,80,0,'',NULL),
(13709,-21,24,-2,'A Brackish Pond','  The water in this pond is rather <k>murky<1> and large clumps of <o>hair<1> from the\nlocal wildlife float around.  It doesn\'t appear to circulate at all and is\nprobably only fed by rivulets of rain that run in from the cave mouth.  The\n<o>mud<1> seems to be less thick here and the ground is unusually level.\n',85,139592,29,0,0,0,0,0,0,80,0,'',NULL),
