(13909,0,0,0,'Slave Market','  This open area is the where slave traders hawk their wares and buyers do\ntheir shopping and dealing.  The majority of the market place is taken up\nby large permanent pen structures, where slaves are held until they are sold.\n',105,139592,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(13910,0,0,0,'Slave Market','  This open area is the where slave traders hawk their wares and buyers do\ntheir shopping and dealing.  The majority of the market place is taken up\nby large permanent pen structures, where slaves are held until they are sold.\n',105,139592,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
