(13918,0,0,0,'Center Square','  You are in the center of a large underground city.  A bustling slave market\nsurrounds you.  A set of stairs carved into the stone to the north lead\nupwards to the rest of <w>Yautepec<1>.\n',105,139592,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(13919,0,0,0,'Slave Market','  This open area is the where slave traders hawk their wares and buyers do\ntheir shopping and dealing.  The majority of the market place is taken up\nby large permanent pen structures, where slaves are held until they are sold.\n',105,139592,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
