(14015,0,0,0,'Cihuacoatl\'s Home','  This residence is small but luxurious.  Cold cave walls are concealed by\nfabulous silks and paintings.  Lush carpet covers the floor, which has been\nchiseled and sanded smooth.\n',105,139592,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
