(14020,0,0,0,'Residence of the <P>Twelve Minds<1>','  This large cave serves as the residence of the <P>Twelve Minds<1>, the leaders\nof <w>Yautepec<1>.  The <P>Twelve Minds<1> govern all slave trade in the underdark\nand direct the mind flayer society as well.  Universally feared and respected,\nthe rule of the <P>Twelve Minds<1> will no doubt endure a very long time.\n',105,139592,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
