(14033,0,0,0,'Stone Stairs','  Wide stairs lead downwards to the <o>Slave Market<1> section of <w>Yautepec<1>.\n',105,139592,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(14034,0,0,0,'Stone Stairs','  Wide stairs lead downwards to the <o>Slave Market<1> section of <w>Yautepec<1>.\n',105,139592,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(14035,0,0,0,'Stone Stairs','  Wide stairs lead downwards to the <r>Merchant Ring<1> section of <w>Yautepec<1>.\n',105,139592,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(14036,0,0,0,'Stone Stairs','  Wide stairs lead downwards to the <r>Merchant Ring<1> section of <w>Yautepec<1>.\n',105,139592,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(14037,0,0,0,'Pedro\'s General Supplies','  Racks of equipment line the cave walls in this general supply store.\nEverything you might need to journey out of <w>Yautepec<1> and into the underdark\nis available here.\n',105,139592,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(14038,0,0,0,'Jorges\'s Commodities','  Large bins of various precious metals sit on display.  Lockboxes with signs\nnaming them as containers for gems and jewels are stacked up behind the\ncounter.\n',105,139592,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(14039,0,0,0,'Carlos\'s Components','  This shop provides magical components, potions and scrolls to the magi of\nthe illithid realm.  A large inventory of arcane supplies is stored on shelves,\nin bins and on racks.\n',105,139592,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(14040,0,0,0,'Mahatma\'s Medical Supplies','  Traveling medical supplies may be purchased here for dangerous journeys into\nthe underdark.\n',105,139592,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(14041,0,0,0,'Mahatma\'s Medicine','  This general clinic caters to citizens of <w>Yautepec<1> as well as adventurers\nwho come to harm in the surrounded underdark.  Every ailment known to the\ndoctor can be healed for a price.\n',105,139592,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(14042,0,0,0,'Julio\'s Investment Services','  Julio invests money into various slave trading operations.  The money\ninvested comes from the citizens of <w>Yautepec<1>, but the profits go to Julio\nand the Twelve Minds.  Money invested with Julio is insured by <w>Yautepec<1>,\nbut you will never see a profit.\n',105,139592,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(14043,0,0,0,'Juan\'s Clothing','  Several displays of high illithid fashion hang on display.  Any number of\nfine garments and apparel may be purchased here.\n',105,139592,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(14044,0,0,0,'Fernando\'s Armor','  Protective equipment and sturdier clothing can be found here.  Slave traders\nand their guards provide swift business for Fernando.  Anyone venturing out\ninto the underdark could benefit from this shop.\n',105,139592,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(14045,0,0,0,'Francesco\'s Weapons','  Implements of combat are on display, hanging from the walls or mounted in\ndisplay cases.  All sorts of weapons gathered from the surrounding underdark\nis available here, as the illithids rarely forge their own.\n',105,139592,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(14046,0,0,0,'Ignacio\'s Jewelry','  Expensive necklaces and rings are on display for the wealthier citizens of\n<w>Yautepec<1>.  Ignacio\'s is the finest store around for the discriminating\nmind flayer fop.\n',105,139592,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(14047,0,0,0,'Citizen\'s Residence','  This <w>Yautepecian<1> home is opulently furnished, with beautiful silks\nand rugs hanging on the walls and fine furs and rugs on the floor.  A thick\nwooden door harvested from some sort of underdark flora bears an intricate\nembossing of various slave trader scenes.\n',105,139592,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
