(15475,0,0,0,'Small Clearing in Haon-Dor Forest','  Tall and thick pine trees are all around, but the undergrowth has been kept\nclean in this part of the forest, providing a comfortable spot.  The breeze\nblows more fiercely through the sparse vegetation and the air is damp.  A large\npool of mud lies in the center of the clearing, capturing rain water and\nemanating vapor.  The ground is very humid here, several footprints of\ndifferent sizes and shapes are noticeable as well as a trail of mud leading\neast into the forest.\n',-1,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(15476,0,0,0,'Before a Small Clearing in Haon-Dor','  Tall and thick pine trees are all around.  The undergrowth isn\'t as abundant\nhere as in other areas of the forest.  A gentle damp breeze comes in from the\nclearing to the south.  The ground is a mixture of sand, mud, gravel and\nleaves, and it gets more humid here.  Several footprints of various sizes and\nshapes are noticeable on the humid ground and a barely visible trail of mud\nleads\neast into the forest.\n',-1,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
