(15499,0,0,0,'Southern Entrance to the Haon-Dor Forest','The imposing Haon-Dor forest stands to the north with tall and thick pines\ntrees\nstretching as far as the eye can see.  Directly to the south is small field\nfilled\nwith rocks carved out of an inhospitable rocky plain, while further away is the\nplateau\nupon which the city of Grimhaven was founded, with its walls towering with\npromises of\nprotection and civilization.  To the east is a well traveled path through the\nforest.\n',0,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
