(15560,0,0,0,'A Coral Reef','The water is somewhat shallow here, though moving with some speed.  The reef continues in\nan easterly direction.\n',96,131072,51,0,0,0,2,3,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(15561,0,0,0,'A Coral Reef','Through crystal clear water you see a vast array of colorful coral that continues to the south.\n',96,131072,51,0,0,0,2,3,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
