(15974,0,0,0,'Library Corner','  This room is swathed in a thick blanket of tangible quiet.  Tapestry adorned\nwalls stand proudly, muting loud noises into a soft buzz.  Vaulted stone\nceilings rise above, decorated with gold designs and patterns.  The bare floor\nis made of a cold unyielding white marble. \n',129,167100,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,360,0,'',NULL),
