(15977,0,0,0,'Library Study Hall','  The stillness of the surrounding air provides a place for people to pursue\nquiet contemplation.  Tapestry adorned walls stand proudly, muting loud noises\ninto a soft buzz.  Vaulted stone ceilings rise above, decorated with gold\ndesigns and patterns.  The bare floor is made of a cold unyielding white\nmarble. \n',129,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,360,0,'',NULL),
(15978,0,0,0,'Library Book Repository','  The aroma of old parchment and must tingles through the air.  Stone walls bulge\nto overflowing with books and shelving.  The floor is adorned with a stiff\nrug. A small plaque is fixed to a shelf nearby.  \n',129,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(15979,0,0,0,'Library Book Repository','  The aroma of old parchment and must tingles through the air.  Stone walls bulge\nto overflowing with books and shelving.  The floor is adorned with a stiff\nrug. A small plaque is fixed to a shelf nearby.  \n',129,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(15980,0,0,0,'Library Study','  The small walls of this enclosed study exclude noise and interruption like\nan ear plug of soft wax.  Prim furnishings huddle in the corners.  The floor\nis adorned with a stiff rug.  A small door leads east. \n',129,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(15981,0,0,0,'Library Staircase','  A giant spiraling marble staircase plunges through the middle of the room\'s\nfloor. Stone walls bulge to overflowing with books and shelving.  The floor is\nadorned with a stiff rug.  Two simple doors lead west and south.  \n',129,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
