(15986,0,0,0,'Library Book Vault','  Everything in this room is covered in a thin layer of dust.  Sheaves of\npaper and parchment lay strewn about carelessly.  Thick stacks of iron-bound\nbooks lurk along the stone walls.  The bare floor is made of a cold unyielding\nwhite marble.  A large iron door dominates the east wall.  \n',129,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,4,'',NULL),
(15987,0,0,0,'Library Study','  The small walls of this enclosed study exclude noise and interruption like\nan ear plug of soft wax.  Prim furnishings huddle in the corners.  The floor\nis adorned with a stiff rug.  A large iron door dominates the west wall.  A\nsmall door leads to the north. \n',129,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(15988,0,0,0,'Library Book Repository','  The aroma of old parchment and must tingles through the air.  Stone walls bulge\nto overflowing with books and shelving.  The floor is adorned with a stiff\nrug. A small plaque is fixed to a shelf nearby.  \n',129,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
