(15992,0,0,0,'Inside A Library Spire','  Aged pearly-white marble lines the inside of this cylindrical room.  A\nspiraling staircase corkscrews along the walls.  The stair work is plain; \nclean straight lines cut across undressed stone.  A weathered trapdoor in the\nceiling leaks in some outside air.  A small button dots the middle of the\nsouth wall. \n',129,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,300,4,'',NULL),
(15993,0,0,0,'Atop A Library Spire','Iron crenellations encircle this platform, keeping the unwary from a fatal\nplummet.  Below and beyond a rocky cliff which supports the library, the\nAgorian Sea sprawls to the west.  To the east lie many golden fields of grain\nand pasture.  To the south a high wall protects the city of Brightmoon.  To\nthe southwest lies another spire, twin to this one.  A weathered trapdoor is\nset into the stone floor. \n',-1,131072,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(15994,0,0,0,'(null)','Empty\n',129,131072,60,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(15995,0,0,0,'Inside a Tool Shed','  The inside of this tool shed is enclosed by worn oak paneling, aged and\nbrittle from years of bearing the weight of the roof.  The smell of dried\nplant clippings and musty dirt suffuses the air.  Many tools rest neatly along\nthe dry wood walls.  The hard-packed earth floor is covered in straw.  \n',129,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,5,60,0,'',NULL),
(15996,0,0,0,'Inside A Library Spire','  Aged pearly-white marble lines the inside of this cylindrical room.  A\nspiraling staircase corkscrews along the walls.  The stair work is plain; \nclean straight lines cut across undressed stone.  A weathered trapdoor in the\nceiling leaks in some outside air.  A small button dots the middle of the\nsouth wall.  \n',129,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,4,'',NULL),
