(16311,10,-19,0,'A Small Animal Cage','This small cage has been well maintained. The floor is kept clean and\nfresh straw for the animals always provided. The bars of the cage are well\nsmithed and extremely sturdy as well as rust free. The cart this cage\nhas been made on sways very lightly in the outdoor breeze.\n',133,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,3,100,0,'',NULL),
