(16317,14,-21,0,'The Entrance to the Tent','The entrance to this tent smells of mildew from previous rains. The\nsize of the entrance leaves little room for visitors to avoid\nticket sales. The ground is worn showing more dirt than grass. Small\ncuts in the tent canvas allows air passage to keep patrons cool.\n',133,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,9,100,0,'',NULL),
(16318,14,-22,0,'The Foyer','The performance area is plainly visable to the south. The ground\nhere is devoid of any vegetation and has been well traveled showing\nthe popularity of the event. Two heavy canvas curtains hang to the \neast and west while to the south a small round podium is visable.\n',133,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(16319,14,-23,0,'The Ringmaster\'s Pedestal','From the pedestal the entire tent can be seen. Spectator stands \ncan be seen to the northeast and northwest. The performance area\noccupies the remainder of the circus tent. Small ducts are visable\nin the ceiling of the tent. The ducts let sunlight and air pass\nthrough the tent.\n',133,131084,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(16320,14,-24,0,'Center of a Large Tent','The ground here is devoid of any vegetation, it is moist\nwith the remainders of freshly removed animal feces. The northern\nsection of the tent has visable spectator stands. Light has been\ndirected to this area by fuel soaked torches in the distance that\nhave been carefully placed along the tent perimeter. The entire\ntent is visable from this point.\n',133,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(16321,14,-25,0,'Between Two Performing Areas','The ground here is devoid of any vegetation, it is moist\nwith the remainders of freshly removed animal feces. The northern\nsection of the tent has visable spectator stands. Light has been\ndirected to this area by fuel soaked torches in the distance that\nhave been carefully placed along the tent perimeter.\n',133,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
