(16348,17,-22,0,'Spectator Stands','The stands are made portable by a collapsible wooden frame\nreinforced with dwarven steel. The elevation of the stands\nprovides a clear view of the performances held to the south.\nThey are kept clean and maintained between performances.   \n',133,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(16349,19,-21,0,'A Small Office','A cluttered desk dominates the room. The floor of this cart is\ncovered in papers and maps of the far reaches of the world. Atop\nthe desk a small stack of books has been carelessly stacked on\ntop of countless pieces of trash and debris. The walls are covered\nwith maps and notes of different conquests. The only exit from\nthis mess is back the way you came in.\n',133,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,3,100,0,'',NULL),
(16350,2,-34,-2,'<G>A Trail off a Muddy Path<1>','  <g>There is a faint trail coming from the west to a tropical jungle to the\neast.  The trail looks new and whoever made it didn\'t do a good job.  The\njungle grows thicker and thicker to the east and seems to have a mind of\nits own.  The sounds of many exotic birds and ferocious animals drift from\nthe east.<1>\n',108,131076,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(16351,3,-34,-2,'<G>Inside A Tropical Jungle<1>','<g>You are surrounded by thick tropical trees.  The long vine bushes and the\ndamp earth makes it hard to move about.  The sky is barely visible between\nthe tree tops.  Piles of animal dung are scattered all over the jungle and\nyou can\'t seem to be sure of where the jungle begins or ends.<1>\n',-1,131072,45,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(16352,3,-34,-1,'<G>On Top Of The Trees<1>','  <g>It\'s hard to see between the thick tree branches.  There are many vine\nrope bridges between the trees, which enables you to travel between the\ntree tops.  Someone or something intelligent must have put them together\nand you can\'t help the feeling that you\'re being watched.<1>\n',108,131072,58,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(16353,4,-35,-2,'<G>Inside A Tropical Jungle<1>','  <g>You are surrounded by thick tropical trees.  The long vine bushes and the\ndamp earth makes it hard to move about.  The sky is barely visible between\nthe tree tops.  Piles of animal dung are scattered all over the jungle and\nyou can\'t seem to be sure of where the jungle begins or ends.<1>\n',108,131072,45,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
