(17272,0,0,0,'The Brightmoon Bay','  Clear waters stretch in all directions about you. You can see the white\ntowers of Brightmoon past the eastern shore of this great bay, and to the west\nthe magnificent Sea Gate is visible. The waterfront docks are north of here.\n',135,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(17273,0,0,0,'The Eastern Shore of Brightmoon Bay','  You are on the eastern shore of the Great Bay of Brightmoon, crystal clear\nwaters stretch to the north far across to the other side of the bay. West of\nhere you can see the great Sea Gate, and to the northeast, the sparkling\ncity of Brightmoon is visible.\n',135,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(17274,0,0,0,'The Western Shore of Brightmoon Bay','  You are on the western shore of the Great Bay of Brightmoon, crystal clear\nwaters stretch to the east far across to the other side of the bay. North-\nwest of here you can see the great Sea Gate, and to the east, the sparkling\ncity of Brightmoon is visible. South of here is a small supply dock.\n',135,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(17275,0,0,0,'The Brightmoon Bay','  Clear waters stretch in all directions about you. You can see the white\ntowers of Brightmoon past the eastern shore of this great bay, and to the west\nthe magnificent Sea Gate is visible. The waterfront docks are north and east of\nhere.\n',135,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(17276,0,0,0,'The Brightmoon Bay','  Clear waters stretch in all directions about you. You can see the white\ntowers of Brightmoon past the eastern shore of this great bay, and to the west\nthe magnificent Sea Gate is visible. The waterfront docks are north and east of\nhere.\n',135,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(17277,0,0,0,'The Brightmoon Bay','  Clear waters stretch in all directions about you. You can see the white\ntowers of Brightmoon past the eastern shore of this great bay, and to the west\nthe magnificent Sea Gate is visible. The waterfront docks are north of here.\n',135,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(17278,0,0,0,'The Brightmoon Bay','  Clear waters stretch in all directions about you. You can see the white\ntowers of Brightmoon past the eastern shore of this great bay, and to the west\nthe magnificent Sea Gate is visible. The waterfront docks are north of here.\n',135,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(17279,0,0,0,'The Eastern Shore of Brightmoon Bay','  You are on the eastern shore of the Great Bay of Brightmoon, crystal clear\nwaters stretch to the north far across to the other side of the bay. West of\nhere you can see the great Sea Gate, and to the northeast, the sparkling\ncity of Brightmoon is visible.\n',135,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(17280,0,0,0,'A Simple Parlor','  This simple parlor room serves as an entrance to the lighthouse. A door leads\neast to a small supply dock, and south of here is a hallway to a large arched\nroom. This room seems to serve as both a living room, and kitchen for the care-\ntaker of the lighthouse. The dark atmosphere and the sting of salty air give\nthis building a rustic feeling.\n',135,131080,55,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(17281,0,0,0,'Outside a Large Lighthouse','  A warm wind blows in east from the Argorian ocean and on into Brightmoon. A\nlarge lighthouse is just built on this section of the sea wall, which appears \nto be the only place level enough for such a building. The lighthouse door is \ntoo the west, and there is a window to the south. A small supply dock leads \neast into Brightmoon Bay.\n',135,131072,44,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(17282,0,0,0,'A Small Supply Dock','  This small supply dock leads from the great Brightmoon Bay to a tall, ancient\nlighthouse that sits atop the seawall west of here. The wind creates a howling\nsound blowing through cracks in the wall, and the salty tang of the sea air\ngrants a freshenss to the areas. A small pathway leads west to the lighthouse.\n',135,131072,44,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(17283,0,0,0,'The Brightmoon Bay','  Clear waters stretch in all directions about you. You can see the white\ntowers of Brightmoon past the eastern shore of this great bay, and to the west\nthe magnificent Sea Gate is visible. The waterfront docks are northeast of\nhere, and there is a small supply dock west.\n',135,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(17284,0,0,0,'The Brightmoon Bay','  Clear waters stretch in all directions about you. You can see the white\ntowers of Brightmoon past the eastern shore of this great bay, and to the west\nthe magnificent Sea Gate is visible. The waterfront docks are north and east of\nhere.\n',135,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(17285,0,0,0,'The Southern Shore of Brightmoon Bay','  You are on the southern shore of the Great Bay of Brightmoon, crystal clear\nwaters stretch to the north far across to the other side of the bay. Northwest \nof here you can see the great Sea Gate, and to the east, the sparkling city of\nBrightmoon is visible.\n',135,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(17286,0,0,0,'The Southern Shore of Brightmoon Bay','  You are on the southern shore of the Great Bay of Brightmoon, crystal clear\nwaters stretch to the north far across to the other side of the bay. North-\nwest of here you can see the great Sea Gate, and to the east, the sparkling\ncity of Brightmoon is visible.\n',135,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(17287,0,0,0,'A Large Arched Room','  This room has a high, arched ceiling, dominated by a spiraling stairway which \nextends up to what you assume must be the lighthouse lamproom. The room itself \nis cluttered with a variety of intresting - but apparently worthless relics. A \nwindow to the west gives you an impressive view of the Argorian Sea, there is a \nsimple door to the east, and a hallway to the north.\n',135,131080,55,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(17288,0,0,0,'A Plain Bedroom','  Strange mariner tokens line the walls of this bedroom. From compasses to maps,\nfrom a pile of small crystals the color of the sea to a brilliantly shining\nmedallion bearing the flame of galek. It seems that the caretaker of this place\nis quite the collector, although very little seems to have any worth. There is a\nsimple door to the west, and a window east looks out into Brightmoon Bay.\n',135,131080,55,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(17289,0,0,0,'The Southern Shore of Brightmoon Bay','  You are on the southern shore of the Great Bay of Brightmoon, crystal clear\nwaters stretch to the north far across to the other side of the bay. Northwest \nof here you can see the great Sea Gate, and to the east, the sparkling city of\nBrightmoon is visible.\n',135,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(17290,0,0,0,'The Southern Shore of Brightmoon Bay','  You are on the southern shore of the Great Bay of Brightmoon, crystal clear\nwaters stretch to the north far across to the other side of the bay. Northwest \nof here you can see the great Sea Gate, and to the east, the sparkling city of\nBrightmoon is visible.\n',135,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(17291,0,0,0,'The Southern Shore of Brightmoon Bay','  You are on the southern shore of the Great Bay of Brightmoon, crystal clear\nwaters stretch to the north far across to the other side of the bay. Northwest \nof here you can see the great Sea Gate, and to the east, the sparkling city of\nBrightmoon is visible.\n',135,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(17292,0,0,0,'The Top of a Squat Tower','  From here you can see for miles by peering between arrow slits. West of\nhere the Argorian Sea spreads out, hazed by the perpetual mist and fog that\nshields it. South of here, an ancient lighthouse is visible on the Brightmoon \nSeawall, and east you would be able to see Brightmoon City, but the wall there \nis unbroken by windows in any way. A ladder leads down to the base of the tower.\n',135,131080,55,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(17293,0,0,0,'An Access Chamber','  The use of this access chamber is clear. Any needed adjustments to the Sea\nGate are made in this room. There are no windows, or for that matter, there \nisn\'t any clear wall space to have a window in. Even the west wall is covered \nby a multitude of blueprints and notes in strange cryptic handwriting.\n',135,131080,55,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(17294,0,0,0,'The Top of a Squat Tower','  From here you can see for miles by peering between arrow slits. West of\nhere the Argorian Sea spreads out, hazed by the perpetual mist and fog that\nshields it. South of here, an ancient lighthouse is visible on the Brightmoon \nSeawall, and east you would be able to see Brightmoon City, but the wall there \nis unbroken by windows in any way. A ladder leads down to the base of the tower.\n',135,131080,55,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(17295,0,0,0,'An Access Chamber','  The use of this access chamber is clear. Any needed adjustments to the Sea\nGate are made in this room. There are no windows, or for that matter, there \nisn\'t any clear wall space to have a window in. Even the west wall is covered \nby a multitude of blueprints and notes in strange cryptic handwriting.\n',135,131080,55,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(17296,0,0,0,'A Narrow Spiral Stairway','  The age of this lighthouse is apparent in this tower. You would guess that\nthese walls are nearly a foot and a half thick, and old. Narrow steel steps\nspiral up to the to of the lighthouse, and you can hear the grinding of heavy\nmachinery coming from up there. Small circular windows are spaced along the \nsteps, and despite their scratched surfaces, you can see east into Brightmoon \nBay, west out to the Argorian Sea, and north to the Sea Gate. The stairs \ncontinue up and down.\n',135,131080,55,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(17297,0,0,0,'The Lamp Room','  This room echoes continuously with the low grinding of the huge machinery that\nturns the huge lamp in the center of the room. The wind outside adds to the\nbackground noise as it whistles about the lighthouse. The panoramic view from\nthis room is amazing, and you can see for miles in all directions. A steel stair\nspirals down to the building at the base of the lighthouse.\n',135,131080,55,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(17298,0,0,0,'In the Galley of a Merchant Ship','  The galley of this ship is cluttered with a multitude of odds and ends,\nfrom huge bolts of cloth and stacks of fine parchment from the far west, to out \nof date maps and a pile of flour sacks. It is a wonder how the merchant who \nowns this ship can possibly keep organized enough to stay in buisness. A hatch \nleads up to the deck of the ship.\n',135,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(17299,0,0,0,'In the Galley of <W>Elyon\'s Blade<1>','  The galley of Elyon\'s Blade is not as pretty as the sparkling white hull\nof the boat, but the essence of orginization and order is still clear. Casks and\nboxes of supplies take up one wall of the galley, and sleeping quarters for the\ncrew and any warriors take up another. The smell of salt air and damp wood is\nprevailant in the room, and you can feel the gentle rocking of the waves. A\nhatch leads up.\n',135,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(18576,0,0,0,'An Archer\'s Post in the Brightmoon City Walls','  This small room is unfurnished and bare.  The walls are built from a type of\npale rock, set very close together, with very little mortar.  There are a number\nof veritcal arrow slits around the outside wall of the room, looking out into\nthe roads approaching the Brightmoon Gate.  The ceiling is slightly low, and the\nfloor is of the same rock as the walls.\n',149,139592,55,0,0,0,0,-1,0,500,0,'',NULL),
(18577,0,0,0,'An Archer\'s Post in the Brightmoon City Walls','  This small room is unfurnished and bare.  The walls are built from a type of\npale rock, set very close together, with very little mortar.  There are a number\nof veritcal arrow slits around the outside wall of the room, looking out into\nthe roads approaching the Brightmoon Gate.  The ceiling is slightly low, and the\nfloor is of the same rock as the walls.\n',149,139592,55,0,0,0,0,-1,0,500,0,'',NULL),
