(18612,0,0,0,'<k>A Dimly Lit Hallway<1>','<k>  The wooden floor is dusty and dirty and the walls are barren.  Cobwebs\nhang from the rafters.  Doors lead to the north and south.<1>\n',9,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,240,0,'',NULL),
(18624,0,0,0,'<b>A Darkened Workshop<1>','<w>  Swathes of cloth<o> hang from rafters overhead and <p>spools of thread<o> sit\non shelves and work tables all about this workshop.  A few strategically\nplaced <W>candles<o> provide just enough <y>light<o> to navigate by, but much of the\nroom is left in <k>darkness<o>.  Various implements of tailoring lie about in\npiles, from scissors to needles to measuring tapes and other tools that\nare so obscure as to possibly be arcane in nature.  A single large table\nin the center of the room displays a large pile of bags of various styles,\ncolors, shapes and styles, in no particular organization.<1>\n',2,174588,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(18660,0,0,0,'Entrance To The Gatlin Springs And Lodge','This wide flat area serves as a plaza and a gathering area both for visitors\nto the lodge as well as travelers.  The area opens up into a tundra road to\nthe southeast and the lodge itself looms to the northwest.  A small stable\nlies to the west.\n',-1,131072,3,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(18661,0,0,0,'The Stables','These humble stables have several compartments for the steeds of the visitors\nto the lodge and also for travelers for a small fee.  The hay is a little\nmore stale than one might expect, but hay doesn\'t come cheap or easy on the\narctic frontier.  Although sturdy of construction, the stables appear to be\na seperate, newer, addition to the main lodge.  A wide gathering area is\nto the east.\n',-1,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18662,0,0,0,'The Reception Desk','  The entrance of The Gatlin Springs And Lodge is a comforting sight.  A\npleasant warmth emanates from the west, combatting the chilling cold from the\ntundra gusting in from the large doors to the southeast.  A lobby is off to\nthe west.\n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18663,0,0,0,'The Lobby','  This area has been provided for guests to lounge around in and socialize\nduring their stay at the lodge.  The entire lodge is heated by a massive\nfireplace set into the western wall.  The reception area is to the east\nwhile the lodges cafe is to the north.\n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18664,0,0,0,'The Gatlin Cafe And Bar','  While not a full fledged restaurant, the lodges cafe and bar provide a\nvariety of fulfilling meals.  The bar itself is full service and has a large\nnumber of alcholic drinks for the patrons.  The lobby lies to the south and\na staircase is to the west.\n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18665,0,0,0,'A Sweeping Staircase','  This large staircase leads up to the rooms on the second floor.  The cafe\nand bar is to the east and a door leads northward.\n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18666,0,0,0,'A Nondescript Hallway','  This hallway is simple and plain, with a door to a changing room to the north\nand a door leading to the rest of the lodge to the south.\n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18667,0,0,0,'A Changing Room','  Not much privacy is provided in this changing room, with only a few lockers\non the walls and a couple of benches.  A door south leads back out to the\nhallway.  \n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18668,0,0,0,'A Nondescript Hallway','  This hallway is simple and plain, with a door to a changing room to the north\nand a door leading out to the hot springs to the east.\n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18669,0,0,0,'A Changing Room','  Not much privacy is provided in this changing room, with only a few lockers\non the walls and a couple of benches.  A door south leads back out to the\nhallway.  \n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18670,0,0,0,'The Gatlin Hot Springs','  The lodge lies to the west but every other direction is blocked\nonly by large panes of glass.  The cold tundra stretches off to the\nnorth, while a large frost covered rock is eastwards.  Naturally hot\nwater bubbles up from between the rocks submerged in the water,\nproviding a warm, relaxing and steam filled experience.  Several rocks\nhave been arranged for comfortable sitting.\n',154,139592,52,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18671,0,0,0,'The Gatlin Hot Springs','  The lodge lies to the west but every other direction is blocked\nonly by large panes of glass.  A large frost covered rock is\neastwards.  Naturally hot water bubbles up from between the rocks\nsubmerged in the water, providing a warm, relaxing and steam filled\nexperience.  Several rocks have been arranged for comfortable sitting.\n',154,139592,52,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18672,0,0,0,'A Sweeping Staircase','  This large staircase leads up to the rooms on the third floor and down\nto the first.\n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18673,0,0,0,'A Hallway','  Doors lead into several of the lodges rooms from here.  The staircase lies\nto the south.\n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18674,0,0,0,'A Bedroom','  This bedroom is fairly uninteresting, with only the bare essentials.  Most\nguests of the lodge spend their time in the lobby or the hot springs.\n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18675,0,0,0,'A Bedroom','  This bedroom is fairly uninteresting, with only the bare essentials.  Most\nguests of the lodge spend their time in the lobby or the hot springs.\n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18676,0,0,0,'A Bedroom','  This bedroom is fairly uninteresting, with only the bare essentials.  Most\nguests of the lodge spend their time in the lobby or the hot springs.\n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18677,0,0,0,'A Bedroom','  This bedroom is fairly uninteresting, with only the bare essentials.  Most\nguests of the lodge spend their time in the lobby or the hot springs.\n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18678,0,0,0,'Deck','  <o>A sturdy handrail keeps this outdoor deck safe from mishaps.  A nice\nview of the surrounding tundra can be seen from here and by stepping up\nto the railing, one can get a view of the hot springs directly below.\nGatlin\'s penthouse suite is to the west.\n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18679,0,0,0,'A Sweeping Staircase','  These stairs lead down to the second floor, while a hallway leads north\ntowards the rooms on this floor.  A conspicuously secure door lies to the\neast.\n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18680,0,0,0,'A Hallway','  Doors lead into several of the lodges rooms from here.  The staircase lies\nto the south.\n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18681,0,0,0,'A Bedroom','  This bedroom is fairly uninteresting, with only the bare essentials.  Most\nguests of the lodge spend their time in the lobby or the hot springs.\n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18682,0,0,0,'A Bedroom','  This bedroom is fairly uninteresting, with only the bare essentials.  Most\nguests of the lodge spend their time in the lobby or the hot springs.\n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18683,0,0,0,'A Bedroom','  This bedroom is fairly uninteresting, with only the bare essentials.  Most\nguests of the lodge spend their time in the lobby or the hot springs.\n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18684,0,0,0,'Gatlin\'s Penthouse Suite','  Plush comfort is the key descriptive of this penthouse suite.  It is much\nnicer than the other rooms of the lodge and it is obvious that the man who\nis the namesake of the Gatlin Springs and Lodge resides here.  Doors lead\neastward onto an outdoor deck and to a bedroom south.\n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18685,0,0,0,'Gatlin\'s Bedroom','  This entire room is covered in the fur of various tundra animals, mounted\non the walls like wallpaper.  It gives a somewhat unusual feeling of being\ninside of a large bag, but it is cozy and warm.\n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18686,0,0,0,'A Walk-In Closet','  This room is huge for a closet.  There isn\'t much here but a few dressers\nand a rug.\n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18687,0,0,0,'A Torture Chamber','  Several ghastly implements of torture hang from the walls, as well\nas a number of unusual and menacing sex toys.  Dark stains cover the\nwooden floorboards and resin has been used to seal the gaps between\nboards, presumably so that blood does not run through them.\n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18688,0,0,0,'A Bedroom','  Every wall and the ceiling of this room is covered in mirrors.  Thousands\nof reflections of the contents of the room surround you.  Shackles are\nmounted to the walls through holes in the mirrors.  A single door leads\nto the east.\n',154,139592,12,0,0,0,0,-1,0,108,0,'',NULL),
(18689,0,0,0,'<W>A White Marble Fireplace<1>','<W>  This fireplace is so large than you can stand comfortably inside of it,\nas long as you don\'t mind a bit of heat.  A chimney leads upwards while\nthe lobby lies out of the fireplace to the east.  Quite a lot of <1><k>soot<1>\n<W>has built up along the inside of the fireplace.<1>\n',-1,139592,62,0,0,0,0,-1,1,108,0,'',NULL),
(18690,0,0,0,'<k>A Soot Lined Chimney<1>','<k>  Thick soot from the fire below lines this chimney.  There is barely enough\nroom to breathe here and the only air available is tainted by ash and soot.<1>\n',-1,139592,15,0,0,0,0,-1,1,108,0,'',NULL),
(18691,0,0,0,'<k>A Soot Lined Chimney<1>','<k>  Thick soot from the fire below lines this chimney.  There is barely enough\nroom to breathe here and the only air available is tainted by ash and soot.<1>\n',-1,139592,15,0,0,0,0,-1,1,108,0,'',NULL),
(18692,0,0,0,'Above A Chimney','A chimney leads straight down into the heart of the lodge.\n',-1,139584,15,0,0,0,0,-1,1,-1,0,'',NULL),
(18693,0,0,0,'A Mousehole','<k>Various bits and pieces of garbage are strewn about, forming a comfortable\nnest for a family of mice.  Straw from the stable, napkins, bits of torn\ntowels and old chicken bones are just some of the various items the mice\nhave managed to drag in here.<1>\n',-1,139592,13,0,0,0,0,-1,1,2,0,'',NULL),
(18725,0,0,0,'A Shady Trail','This trail is mostly overgrown and is surrounded by heavy brush and\ntrees.  The sky above can barely be seen through the branches and the\nprofusion of plant life encourages claustrophobia.  Heavy roots\ncriss-cross the path, providing uneven footing and pools of mud\nexasperate the problem.  The trail leads off to the west, but a heavy\nthicket blocks passage to the east.\n',-1,139584,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(18726,0,0,0,'A Shady Trail','  This trail is mostly overgrown and is surrounded by heavy brush and\ntrees.  The sky above can barely be seen through the branches and the\nprofusion of plant life encourages claustrophobia.  Heavy roots\ncriss-cross the path, providing uneven footing and pools of mud\nexasperate the problem.  The trail continues both east and west.\n',155,139584,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(18727,0,0,0,'A Shady Trail','  This trail is mostly overgrown and is surrounded by heavy brush and\ntrees.  The sky above can barely be seen through the branches and the\nprofusion of plant life encourages claustrophobia.  Heavy roots\ncriss-cross the path, providing uneven footing and pools of mud\nexasperate the problem.  The trail continues both east and west.\n',155,139584,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(18728,0,0,0,'A Shady Trail','  This trail is mostly overgrown and is surrounded by heavy brush and\ntrees.  The sky above can barely be seen through the branches and the\nprofusion of plant life encourages claustrophobia.  Heavy roots\ncriss-cross the path, providing uneven footing and pools of mud\nexasperate the problem.  The trail continues both east and west.\n',155,139584,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(18729,0,0,0,'A Dusty Shack','  This tiny shack has been roughly put together and leans against a\nlarge barn to the north.  A few bins sit next to one wall and a\nroughly constructed table is in the center of the room.\n',155,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(18730,0,0,0,'A Barn','A musty scent pervades the inside of this storage barn.  Bales of hay are\nstacked up against one wall and the occasional pigeon coo can be heard from\nthe rafters above.  Many crates and barrels are stacked up here, in warehouse\nfashion.\n',-1,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(18731,0,0,0,'Inside A Thicket','  Heavy thicket engulfs the area, picking at articles of clothing and\nscratching at exposed skin.  A heavy iron gate lies to the north.\n',155,139584,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(18732,0,0,0,'A Small Field','  Rich balmy soil covers the ground here, well tilled up by farmers.\nA heavy iron fence runs around the perimeter, keeping out stray\nanimals and trespassers.  The heavy vegetation surrounding the field\nand the large, healthy trees totally surround the area, providing good\ncover from snooping eyes.\n',155,139584,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
