(18750,0,0,0,'A Turbulent Pond','The clear blue waters moil turbulently, frothy whitecaps presented abruptly\non pedestals of peaked waves momentarily before succumbing to the chaotic \nwhims of its aquatic brethren.\n',-1,139584,52,0,0,0,1,3,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
