(18752,0,0,0,'A Sandy Beach','Fine grained white sands compose this glistening beach.  The sand leads off\nto an oddly turbulent pond to the west and north, but a thick stand of\nweeds prevent passage to the north.\n',-1,139584,54,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
