(18861,0,0,0,'Small Ledge','A towering mountain lies directly north and a sheer cliff seperates you\nfrom the rest of it.  The cliff heads straight down without a single\nhandhold,completely unscaleable.  There is a very small ledge here, which a\nskilled climber could grip for a short time.\n',-1,139584,58,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(18862,0,0,0,'A Mountain Passage','Rough mountain terrain surrounds you.  Jagged rocks jut from the ground\nand walls, clawing at clothing and skin.\n',-1,139584,48,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(18863,0,0,0,'A Mountain Passage','Rough mountain terrain surrounds you.  Jagged rocks jut from the ground\nand walls, clawing at clothing and skin.\n',-1,139584,48,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(18864,0,0,0,'A Cramped Mountain Passage','This short tunnel leads through a large rock formation.  Jagged rocks jut\nout from the ground and walls, clawing at clothing and skin.  A boulder\nwedged into the ceiling threatens to brain any explorer who lacks caution.\n',-1,139592,48,0,0,0,0,-1,0,40,0,'',NULL),
(18865,0,0,0,'Bottom Of A Cliff','A sheer cliff leads straight up, next to a rock formation.  No handholds\nor ledges are apparently - it is unclimbable.\n',-1,139584,48,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(18866,0,0,0,'Top Of A Cliff','A sheer cliff leads straight down, with no handholds or ledges.  A rock\nformation lies to the north.\n',-1,139584,57,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(18867,0,0,0,'Over A Chasm','A dark chasm looms below, seemingly going on forever.\n',-1,139584,58,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(18868,0,0,0,'A Rock Formation','This rock pillar provides a stable area to rest momentarily.  Smaller\npillars of rock rise out of the mountain around you, forming strange and\ndisturbing shapes.  Twisted and hideous faces seem to mock you from the\ncorner of your eyes.\n',-1,139584,48,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(18869,0,0,0,'A Mountain Passage','Rough mountain terrain surrounds you.  Jagged rocks jut from the ground\nand walls, clawing at clothing and skin.\n',-1,139584,48,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
