(18872,0,0,0,'Top Of A Cliff','A sheer cliff leads straight down, with no handholds or ledges.  A rock\nformation lies to the south and another cliff base to the east.\n',-1,139584,57,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(18873,0,0,0,'A Mountain Ledge','A huge boulder protrudes from the cliff directly above you, blocking off\nany possible climbing route.  The area above the boulder appears to be\nstable.  A cliff falls away to the west.\n',-1,139584,48,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(18874,0,0,0,'Next To A Huge Boulder','A massive boulder protrudes from the cliff here, blocking off any climbing\nroute.  The bottom of the cliff is directly beneath you, while the top of the\nboulder could be reached above.\n',-1,139584,57,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(18875,0,0,0,'Top Of A Boulder','This massive boulder provides tenuous footing atop a cliff.  More solid\nground can be seen to the east.\n',-1,139584,58,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
