(18975,0,0,0,'A Massive Sewage Pipe','<k>Thick, dark water rushes by at a rapid pace, filled with the sewage and\ndebris of daily life in Grimhaven.  Thick algae lines the sides of the pipe,\nmaking any sort of traction nearly impossible, while various unknown objects\nboth soft and hard bump into you in the current.  Not a glimmer of natural\nlight can be seen in any direction and the sewage fills the entire pipe,\nthreatening to suffocate any air breather foolish enough to be caught here.<1>\n',158,131080,30,0,0,0,1,9,0,50,0,'',NULL),
