(19030,0,0,0,'Sandy Beach','  Fine white sand covers this area and is scattered with seaweed, small\npebbles, abandoned seashells and the occasional unidentifiable garbage the\nocean spits up onto the shoreline.  The ocean breeze is strong in both force\nand aroma here, and sometimes a bit of salty water is deposited on the sand. \n',0,139264,54,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(19031,0,0,0,'Rocky Beach','  The sand peters out here and turns into a mixture of large, rugged rocks and\nsmall, smooth pebbles.  Bits of dead coral and crushed seashells are sprinkled\namong the rocks, and seaweed clings tightly to the more roughly textured\nrocks.  The ocean spray is regular here, and many of the rocks are perpetually\nslick with seawater. \n',164,139264,54,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(19032,0,0,0,'Rocky Beach','  The sand peters out here and turns into a mixture of large, rugged rocks and\nsmall, smooth pebbles.  Bits of dead coral and crushed seashells are sprinkled\namong the rocks, and seaweed clings tightly to the more roughly textured\nrocks.  The ocean spray is regular here, and many of the rocks are perpetually\nslick with seawater. \n',164,139264,54,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
