(19082,0,0,0,'Dock','  The docks stretch from the water to the west to a small marketplace to the\neast, as well as joining up with a sandy path that leads north and south\nacross the island.  The planks are covered in muddy sand, and some moss grows\nhere and there in crevices. \n',164,139264,44,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
