(19104,0,0,0,'Farmland','  This area is well shielded from the rough sea storms by the woods to the\neast and the cathedral to the south.  As a result of the woods, the land here\nis rich in organic matter, wonderfully loamy and perfect for farming.  Rows of\nwell-turned soil and the faint smell of growth and decay greet visitors. \n',164,139520,50,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(19105,0,0,0,'Farmland','  This area is well shielded from the rough sea storms by the woods to the\neast and the cathedral to the south.  As a result of the woods, the land here\nis rich in organic matter, wonderfully loamy and perfect for farming.  Rows of\nwell-turned soil and the faint smell of growth and decay greet visitors. \n',164,139520,50,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(19106,0,0,0,'Airy Woods','  Trees here are tall and skinny, and lots of scrubby underbrush cling to the\nalternatively spongy and rocky soil.  There are many fallen trees and\nscattered branches, leaves and general detritus blown in from storms. \nBrightly colored birds flit from tree to tree, and occasionally a small animal\nrustles in the bushes. \n',164,139520,46,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
