(19132,0,0,0,'Sandy Beach Surrounding a Lake','  Fine white sand covers this area and and is scattered with crushed coral,\nsmall pebbles, abandoned seashells and some odd seaweed here and there.  A\nsmall lake is nearby, and some greenery has taken hold here and there. \n',164,139264,54,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(19133,0,0,0,'Sandy Path','There\'s an obvious path here formed out of compacted sandy dirt andrough-hewn logs.  Small rocks and pebbles are tamped down between and around\nthe logs.  To the west lies a small freshwater lake, and to the east, a tall\ncathedral.',164,139264,44,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(19134,0,0,0,'Abandoned Cathedral','This smaller, darker area here was once the presbytery, where the priests, monks and other clergymembers could make their private devotions. It has fallen into such disrepair, several large breaks in the floorboards furthest to the northwest can be seen, and the dust is suspiciously thinner there.',0,139528,55,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(19135,0,0,0,'Abandoned Cathedral','If there were still pews in this cathedral, this is where the aisles would be. \nThe aisles are marked by lines of rich marble inlaid into the floor, and tall\ncolumns and arches separate this area from the nave.  Richly colored light\nfilters in from the stained glass windows in the nave.\n',0,139528,55,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(19136,0,0,0,'Farmland','  This area is well shielded from the rough sea storms by the woods to the\neast and the cathedral to the south.  As a result of the woods, the land here\nis rich in organic matter, wonderfully loamy and perfect for farming.  Rows of\nwell-turned soil and the faint smell of growth and decay greet visitors. \n',0,139520,50,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(19137,0,0,0,'Farmland','  This area is well shielded from the rough sea storms by the woods to the\neast and the cathedral to the south.  As a result of the woods, the land here\nis rich in organic matter, wonderfully loamy and perfect for farming.  Rows of\nwell-turned soil and the faint smell of growth and decay greet visitors. \n',0,139520,50,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
