(19139,0,0,0,'Farmland','  This area is well shielded from the rough sea storms by the woods to the\neast and the cathedral to the south.  As a result of the woods, the land here\nis rich in organic matter, wonderfully loamy and perfect for farming.  Rows of\nwell-turned soil and the faint smell of growth and decay greet visitors. \n',0,139520,50,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(19140,0,0,0,'Small Freshwater Lake','  A small, warm shallow lake bubbles up here, the result of an unseen spring\nand hearty tropical rains.  It\'s a refreshing and relaxing place to spend a\nlazy afternoon, and it\'s the source of the fresh water for the island\ninhabitants.  Water skimmers scoot across the surface of the water. \n',164,139520,52,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
