(19146,0,0,0,'Lagoon','The coral reef that rings the island breaks slightly here and water laps inland,\nwhere it\'s hugged by a rocky beach to the north and a sandy beach to the south. \nTo the east lie docks, ready to secure boats.\n',164,139264,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
