(20447,90,-138,2,'Northern Sedmar River','  Making its way from some source far to the northeast the Sedmar River\ncuts through the Chaos Plains slowly slicing deeper and deeper into the\nearth.  Occasional beaches line the River as minerals, dirt, and debris\nare deposited along the shores providing fertile soil for lush vegetation.\nWhile the canyon appears to be the only path to follow you occasionally\nconsider the steep walls hoping for some alternative path.\n',113,131072,52,0,0,0,30,2,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
