(20477,88,-144,2,'On Shard Lake','  With a glass-like surface the waters of Shard Lake calmly meander and\nswirl around you.  The water is not exactly clear as a lot of debris is\npoured into the lake by the three rivers which converge here.  Suddenly\nrealizing that 3 rivers merge here and there appears to be no outlet for\nthe waters you wonder where it all must go.\n',113,131072,29,0,0,0,30,6,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
