(20501,90,-139,1,'Beneath the Surface of Shard Lake','  Just below the surface of Shard Lake your eyes continually adjust\nto the murky waters.  Constant debris swirls around you making it\ndifficult to see clearly.  Besides water and whatever wandering local\ninhabitant swims by there is very little here to take notice of.\n',113,131072,53,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(20502,90,-140,1,'Beneath the Surface of Shard Lake','  Just below the surface of Shard Lake your eyes continually adjust\nto the murky waters.  Constant debris swirls around you making it\ndifficult to see clearly.  Besides water and whatever wandering local\ninhabitant swims by there is very little here to take notice of.\n',113,131072,53,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
