(20832,93,-132,2,'On the Plains','  Surrounded by tall vibrant plains grass you feel like you are amid a sea\nof wavy brownish-green dancers with the wind acting as their coordinator.\nThey roll and move in perfect unison appearing to thrive with the life given\nto them by the simplest gust of wind.  The very air seems to delight your\nsenses with its crisp clean fragrance and subtle undertones of life.  Even\nphysically the plains show ample signs of true life with small burrows here\nand there, and the tracks of numerous animals marring the ground beneath your\nfeet.  It seems though that most life seeks the safety of their shelters long\nbefore you arrive where you can feel but not see their ever present eyes\nwatching you.  To the west lies a deep river canyon which cuts its way through\nthe plains while to the east sits the ancient Calcathian mountains, or the\n\"Calcat\'s Spine\" as they are often referred to.\n',147,131072,41,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
