(23051,20,-75,-3,'Deeper Beneath the Surface','  Diving deeper, the water temerature gradually drops. The temperature of the\nwater starts to make your muscles cramp. Vision is impaired as the sun \nabove has almost completely disappeared. The salt content has dramatically\nincreased causing painful vision. The water seems to squeeze your body \ntighter as you go deeper toward the ocean floor.\n',165,131072,30,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23052,20,-76,-3,'Deeper Beneath the Surface','  Diving deeper, the water temerature gradually drops. The temperature of the\nwater starts to make your muscles cramp. Vision is impaired as the sun \nabove has almost completely disappeared. The salt content has dramatically\nincreased causing painful vision. The water seems to squeeze your body \ntighter as you go deeper toward the ocean floor.\n',165,131072,30,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
