(23132,0,0,0,'Above a Pool of Lava','  You are standing in mid-air.  Below you, lava boils up almost touching your\nfeet.  The intensity of the heat in the steam is scalding to the skin and you\nbegin to think of what being burnt to a crisp would feel like.  A narrow ledge\nis to the north and south of here.\n',176,131144,64,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23133,0,0,0,'A Narrow Tunnel','  This narrow tunnel is barely large enough to house two people.  The humid air\nand tight spacing provide for a very uncomfortable surrounding.  Thought not\nunbearable, the heat is extremely intense.  Shards of obsidian cover the porous\nflooring making a small maze to navigate this room without having your feet cut\nopen.  The ceiling is very low and like the walls, is smooth as glass.\n',176,131144,49,0,0,0,0,-1,2,72,0,'',NULL),
(23134,0,0,0,'A Small Tunnel','  This very porous, small tunnel has been carved from the earth by lava.  The\nheat is intense, making it hard to breathe.  Water trickles down the walls\nthrough the ceiling but never reaches the floor.  The humidity in the air is\nevidence of the water evaporating almost as soon as it enters this room.  The\nwalls of the tunnel seem firm and stable, and scalding to the touch.\n',176,131144,49,0,0,0,0,-1,3,120,0,'',NULL),
(23135,0,0,0,'The Edge of a Pool of Lava','  A narrow ledge has been carved here by the flowing magma.  The ground seems to\nbe a bit unstable as you can hear the splashes of what sounds like rocks falling\ninto the pit of boiling lava.  A short ways to the north, barely visible, looks\nto be a small platform in the center of the lake of lava.  A narrow ledge leads\nto the northwest and east of here.\n',176,131144,49,0,0,0,0,-1,3,120,0,'',NULL),
