(23140,0,0,0,'A Narrow Ledge',' A narrow ledge has been carved here by the flowing magma.  The ground seems to\nbe a bit unstable as you can hear the splashes of what sounds like rocks falling\ninto the pit of boiling lava.  Resting against the northeastern wall is a pile\nof obsidian.  To the south, an intense sensation of heat can be felt from the\npool of lava.  To the northwest is another small tunnel.\n',176,131144,49,0,0,0,0,-1,4,120,0,'',NULL),
