(23153,0,0,0,'An Underground Lab','  This room was not carved by the lava, but by some form of very powerful magic.\nThe room is perfectly circular in design.  The ceiling has a dome shape, meeting\nthe smooth walls.  Several work tables, made from obsidian, line the walls.  On\nthe tables, many different test tubes and flasks house chemicals used in the\narts\nof magic.  In the center of the room, perched atop a makeshift platform, is a\nlarge crystal ball that gives off a firey red aura.  On the southwest wall lies\na small pile of loosely stacked obsidian.\n',176,131144,61,0,0,0,0,-1,4,90,0,'',NULL),
(23154,0,0,0,'Above a Pool of Lava','  You are standing in mid-air.  Below you, lava boils up almost touching your\nfeet.  The intensity of the heat in the steam is scalding to the skin and you\nbegin to think of what being burnt to a crisp would feel like.  A small ledge\nis to the southwest.\n',176,131144,64,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
