(23156,0,0,0,'A Narrow Ledge','  This ledge is almost too small for one to stand on.  The heat from the lava\npool to the west, rushes up nearly scalding your skin.  The sounds of falling\nrocks splashing down into the lava might indicate this ledge is about to\ncollapse into the inferno.  To the south, a small tunnels leads into the dark,\nwhile to the west is pool of molten lava.\n',176,131144,49,0,0,0,0,-1,2,120,0,'',NULL),
