(23161,0,0,0,'A Platform of Solid Rock','  Rising up from the pool of lava is a small platform made of solid rock.  The\nground itself is a dark gray and very hot.  Steam rising from the lava makes it\ndifficult to see the surroundings of this area.  You can hear the bubbling of\nthe molten magma in the lava pools which bring thoughts of burning to crisp to\nmind.  The only way off this platform is fly across the pools to the ledges\non the opposite sides of the lava.\n',176,131400,49,0,0,0,0,-1,3,120,0,'',NULL),
