(23171,0,0,0,'The Edge of a Pool of Lava','  A narrow ledge has been carved here by the flowing magma.  The ground seems to\nbe a bit unstable as you can hear the splashes of what sounds like rocks falling\nin the pool of lava.  The rising steam seems to be not as thick here as it is in\nthe other rooms surrounding the lava.  Nearby to the south, an island in the\nmiddle of the lava lake is now fully visible.  Unfortunately, there is no path\nleading to the island.  To the west and east, the ledge continues to circle\naround the magma pool.\n',176,131144,49,0,0,0,0,-1,4,120,0,'',NULL),
(23172,0,0,0,'The Edge of a Pool of Lava','  A narrow ledge has been carved here by the flowing magma.  The ground seems to\nbe a bit unstable as you can hear the splashes of what sounds like rocks falling\ninto the pit of boiling lava.  A short ways to the south, barely visible, looks\nto be a small platform in the center of the lake of lava.  A narrow ledge leads\nto the west and southeast of here.\n',176,131144,49,0,0,0,0,-1,4,120,0,'',NULL),
(23173,0,0,0,'A Pool of Lava','  As you enter this pool of lava, you can feel your skin beginning to melt away.\nThe magma here is boiling and you begin to wonder how long you can stand here\nbefore you perish.  The only way out of this pool up.\n',176,131144,62,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
