(23243,35,43,-2,'Arden Forest','  Your footsteps rustle the dried <o>orange<z> leaves that form a soft mat\non the forest floor.  Tall birch rise around you, holding bright\n<y>yellow<z> leaves aloft like flames on giant torches.  The ground is solid\nfrom the chilly weather, which feels like fall for most of the year.\nThe forest stretches in all directions and you cannot find the end\nof it.\n',166,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23244,36,43,-2,'Arden Forest','  Your footsteps rustle the dried <o>orange<z> leaves that form a soft mat\non the forest floor.  Tall birch rise around you, holding bright\n<y>yellow<z> leaves aloft like flames on giant torches.  The ground is solid\nfrom the chilly weather, which feels like fall for most of the year.\nThe forest stretches in all directions and you cannot find the end\nof it.  To the east you see a small <b>river<z> that cuts through the forest.\n',166,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23245,37,43,-2,'A Stream in Arden Forest','  A <b>stream<z> lazily wanders through the forest, flowing from south to\nthe north.  You can see that it gets much shallower as it heads north.\nThe cold water chills your skin, yet it is not quite cold enough\nto freeze here.  The tall birch trees of the woods lie on the east\nand west banks of the <b>stream<z>, with their leaves in a perpetual\nautumnal <o>orange<z>.\n',166,131072,29,0,0,0,45,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23246,38,43,-2,'Arden Forest','  Your footsteps rustle the dried <o>orange<z> leaves that form a soft mat\non the forest floor.  Tall birch rise around you, holding bright\n<y>yellow<z> leaves aloft like flames on giant torches.  The ground is solid\nfrom the chilly weather, which feels like fall for most of the year.\nThe forest stretches in all directions and you cannot find the end\nof it.  A <b>stream<z> cuts through the forest to the west of you.  It flows\nfrom the south and takes a sharp turn just to the northwest then flowing\nto the east directly north of here.  \n',166,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23247,39,43,-2,'Arden Forest','  Your footsteps rustle the dried <o>orange<z> leaves that form a soft mat\non the forest floor.  Tall birch rise around you, holding bright\n<y>yellow<z> leaves aloft like flames on giant torches.  The ground is solid\nfrom the chilly weather, which feels like fall for most of the year.\nThe forest stretches in all directions and you cannot find the end\nof it.  To the north you see a <b>stream<z> which runs down the incline\non which you are situated -- from west to east.  Further east down the\nhill you can see a pond.\n',166,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23248,40,43,-2,'A Pond in Arden Forest','  You are at the bottom of a small hill on the edge of some small mountains,\nwhich are to the east.  The mountain range extends from the north by\nAmber to the distant south.  A pond has formed at the bottom of the hill\ndue to collected rainwater.  In bright daylight on a clear day the\n<o>orange<z> leaves of the birch trees reflect off the waters of the pond\nand create a stunning view.  The pond continues north and east, where it\nmeets a mountain range.  From this vantage you can look up into the birch \nforest to the west and south.\n',166,131072,29,0,0,0,0,1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23249,41,43,-2,'A Pond in Arden Forest','  You are at the bottom of a small hill on the edge of some small mountains,\nwhich are to the east.  The mountain range extends from the north by\nAmber to the distant south.  A pond has formed at the bottom of the hill\ndue to collected rainwater.  In bright daylight on a clear day the\n<o>orange<z> leaves of the birch trees reflect off the waters of the pond\nand create a stunning view.  The pond continues to the north and west.\nYou can leave the pond and enter the birch forest that lies up\na gentle slope to the south.\n',166,131072,29,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23250,32,42,-2,'Arden Forest','  Your footsteps rustle the dried <o>orange<z> leaves that form a soft mat\non the forest floor.  Tall birch rise around you, holding bright\n<y>yellow<z> leaves aloft like flames on giant torches.  The ground is solid\nfrom the chilly weather, which feels like fall for most of the year.\nThe forest stretches in all directions and you cannot find the end\nof it.  A sharp cliff face shoots up through the ground here, but\nit gets much lower to the north.\n',166,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23251,33,42,-2,'Arden Forest','  Your footsteps rustle the dried <o>orange<z> leaves that form a soft mat\non the forest floor.  Tall birch rise around you, holding bright\n<y>yellow<z> leaves aloft like flames on giant torches.  The ground is solid\nfrom the chilly weather, which feels like fall for most of the year.\nThe forest stretches in all directions and you cannot find the end\nof it.\n',166,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
