(23346,0,0,0,'The Antrider Living Area','  This area seems to be the corner where the antriders change clothes\nand use as a bathroom during the night when they do not wish to walk\nto the surface.  Some scraps of food have also been tossed on the\ndirt floor.  The reference of some objects on the ground is a\nrefreshing change from the usual tunnels, which are confusing and\nuniform.\n',129,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,85,0,'',NULL),
(23347,0,0,0,'The Antrider Living Area','  A wide open area extends south and east, and a small corner room lies\nto the west.  Through a passage north you see some plain dirt tunnels,\nwith walls, floor and ceiling similar to the ones in here.  Further\nsouth you see what appears vaguely to be a chair.\n',129,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,85,0,'',NULL),
(23348,0,0,0,'The Antrider Living Area','  The gnome antriders use this space to sleep and rest during their\ninactive hours.  The floor, walls, and ceiling are plain dirt clumps.\nHow they can live in this banal decor is beyond you; the sense of\nisolation is terrifying after an extended period of time.  Surely\nthe gnomes must visit the surface often to retain their sanity.\n',129,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,85,0,'',NULL),
(23349,0,0,0,'Dark Ant Tunnels','  The walls, floor, and low ceiling here are made of chunks loose dirt.\nThe tunnel is round in shape rather than square like most normal\nconstructions, which makes it somewhat difficult to walk, although the\nsoft nature of the floor aids in stabilizing your steps.  The darkness,\nbizarreness, and uniform nature of this tunnel system is confusing and\nyou are easily lost and disoriented.  One twisting passageway leads up.\n',129,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,85,0,'',NULL),
(23350,0,0,0,'Dark Ant Tunnels','  The walls, floor, and low ceiling here are made of chunks loose dirt.\nThe tunnel is round in shape rather than square like most normal\nconstructions, which makes it somewhat difficult to walk, although the\nsoft nature of the floor aids in stabilizing your steps.  The darkness,\nbizarreness, and uniform nature of this tunnel system is confusing and\nyou are easily lost and disoriented.\n',129,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,85,0,'',NULL),
