(23353,0,0,0,'Dark Ant Tunnels','  The walls, floor, and low ceiling here are made of chunks loose dirt.\nThe tunnel is round in shape rather than square like most normal\nconstructions, which makes it somewhat difficult to walk, although the\nsoft nature of the floor aids in stabilizing your steps.  The darkness,\nbizarreness, and uniform nature of this tunnel system is confusing and\nyou are easily lost and disoriented.\n',129,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,85,0,'',NULL),
(23354,0,0,0,'The Antrider Living Area','  The gnome antriders use this space to sleep and rest during their\ninactive hours.  The floor, walls, and ceiling are plain dirt clumps.\nHow they can live in this banal decor is beyond you; the sense of\nisolation is terrifying after an extended period of time.  Surely\nthe gnomes must visit the surface often to retain their sanity.  To\nthe south you see a small chair made of what appears to be dirt or\nclay.\n',129,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,85,0,'',NULL),
