(23361,0,0,0,'The Gnome Queen\'s Throne','  This is where the queen gnome rules from.  She has absolute power over\nthe antrider males, as hers is a matriarchal society.  Despite the fact\nthat this is where a queen rules from, the area is plain dirt.  No lights\nare to be found anywhere.\n',129,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,85,0,'',NULL),
