(23383,0,0,0,'The Queen Ant\'s Chamber','  The queen ant\'s chamber is quite impressive.  The ceiling here is a foot\nor two higher than in most of the tunnels that connect the chamber to the\nrest of the anthill complex.  Ant larvae are strewn throughout the room,\nand drone ants are constantly coming to bring food and trinkets from the\nsurface to their queen.\n',129,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23384,0,0,0,'Center of the Queen Ant\'s Chamber','  This is where the queen ant rests during the day to command her minions\nand to spawn new ant larvae.  It is the center of a large chamber made of\nplain dirt chunks, with uneven rounded edges.  The chamber almost seems\nof natural origin, yet retains too much order to have come about by\naccident.  The communal intelligence of the ants strikes you most when\nstanding in this area.\n',129,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23385,0,0,0,'The Queen Ant\'s Chamber','  The queen ant\'s chamber is quite impressive.  The ceiling here is a foot\nor two higher than in most of the tunnels that connect the chamber to the\nrest of the anthill complex.  Ant larvae are strewn throughout the room,\nand drone ants are constantly coming to bring food and trinkets from the\nsurface to their queen.\n',129,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23386,0,0,0,'Dark Ant Tunnels','  To the west you see a large chamber, and to the east the plain dirt\ntunnels in which you find yourself continue into darkness.  The tunnel\nis round in shape rather than square like most normal constructions,\nwhich makes it somewhat difficult to walk, although the soft nature of\nthe floor aids in stabilizing your steps.  The darkness, bizarreness,\nand uniform nature of this tunnel system is confusing and you are\neasily lost and disoriented.\n',129,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,90,0,'',NULL),
