(23399,0,0,0,'A Tiny Cramped Casting Chamber','  Already considerably small, this tiny cavern is covered top to bottom\nwith spider webs!  Everywhere you look the webs cover the stonework and\nmake the cavern even smaller.  Directly within the center of the chamber\na casting circle fashioned with webbing lies, a coating of some blackish\nresin making it a permanent addition to the floor.  The only apparent exit\nseems to be a heavy looking panel made of resin and webbing to the north.\n',158,141640,33,0,0,0,0,-1,5,85,0,'',NULL),
(23400,0,0,0,'Lost in Lethargica','This pillowy pastel place is making you very sleepy...........\n',123,139273,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,29,'',NULL),
