(23599,0,0,0,'Control Room','   This is the control center of the game.  Each exit will take you to\na different corner of the playing area.  But the only way in is if\na god brings you here.\n',123,139273,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,28,'',NULL),
(23600,-3,40,-1,'Dusty Trail','  You are on a wide dust covered trail.  It has been very heavily worn and\ntraveled.  If at one time vegetation grew here, all evidence has long since\ndisappeared.  To the north the massive structure of an arena can be seen.\n',124,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23601,-3,41,-1,'Dusty Trail','  You are on a wide dust covered trail.  It is obvious from the state of the\ntrail that it has been very heavily traveled.  Years of overuse have left it\nbarren and eroded.  To the north the massive structure of an arena can be seen.\n',124,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23602,-3,42,-1,'Dusty Trail','  This is a wide dust covered trail.  Years of overuse have taken their toll,\nthe trail is eroded and completely devoid of life.  The only sound to be heard is\nthe occasional whistling of the wind.  Directly to the north is a stone pathway.\nThe dusty trail continues to the south.  The massive structure of an arena looms\ninto view from the north.\n',124,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23603,-3,43,-1,'Stone Path','  You are on a smooth path of precisely cut and fitted stones.  Directly to the\nnorth is a large triumphal arch, welcoming you to the arena.  The stone path\ncontinues east and west.  A dusty trail leads off to the south.\n',124,131072,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23604,-3,44,-1,'Beneath the Arch','  You are beneath a large arch.  It is covered with carvings depicting days of\npast glory, magnificent battles, and arena champions of years past.  The stone\npath continues north and south.  The base of the arch blocks off travel to\neither the east or west.\n',124,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23605,-3,45,-1,'Stone Path','  You are on a smooth path of precisely cut and fit stones.  To the south is\na large arch.  To the north the magnificent sight of the arena overpowers you.\nYour emotions contradict themselves, as you are filled with both an\nanticipation of victory and glory, yet at the same time a fear of defeat,\nhumiliation, and death.\n',124,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23606,-5,43,-1,'Stone Path','  You are on a smooth path of precisely cut and fit stones.  Directly to\nthe northeast is the base of a large arch.  The stone path continues\nnorth and east.\n',124,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23607,-5,44,-1,'Stone Path','  You are on a smooth path of precisely cut and fit stones.  Directly to\nthe east is the base of a large arch.  The stone path continues north\nand south.\n',124,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23608,-5,45,-1,'Stone Path','  You are on a smooth path of precisely cut and fit stones.  Directly to\nthe southeast is the base of a large arch.  The stone path continues\neast and south.\n',124,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23609,-4,43,-1,'Stone Path','  You are on a smooth path of precisely cut and fit stones.  Directly to\nthe north is the base of a large arch.  The stone path continues east\nand west.\n',124,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23610,-4,44,-1,'Base of the Arch','  You are inside the base of a large arch.  At first you had thought the place\nto be abandoned, but as you slowly look around you realize someone has been\nliving in here.  The floor is covered with bits of candle wax, but the room\nhas been kept clean of dust and cobwebs.  A ramshackle wooden staircase\nleads upward.\n',124,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23611,-4,45,-1,'Stone Path','  You are on a smooth path of precisely cut and fit stones.  Directly to\nthe south is the base of a large arch.  The stone path continues east\nand west.\n',124,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23612,-2,43,-1,'Stone Path','  You are on a smooth path of precisely cut and fit stones.  Directly to\nthe north is the base of a large arch.  The stone path continues east\nand west.\n',124,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23613,-2,44,-1,'Base of the Arch','  You are inside the base of a large arch.  The place looks like it has been\nabandoned for a long time.  The floor is covered with a thick layer of dust\nand the entire room is full of cobwebs.  A spiral stone staircase leads up.\n',124,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23614,-2,45,-1,'Stone Path','  You are on a smooth path of precisely cut and fit stones.  Directly to\nthe south is the base of a large arch.  The stone path continues east\nand west.\n',124,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23615,-1,43,-1,'Stone Path','  You are on a smooth path of precisely cut and fit stones.  Directly to\nthe northwest is the base of a large arch.  The stone path continues\nnorth and west.\n',124,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23616,-1,44,-1,'Stone Path','  You are on a smooth path of precisely cut and fit stones.  Directly to\nthe west is the base of a large arch.  The stone path continues north\nand south.\n',124,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23617,-1,45,-1,'Stone Path','  You are on a smooth path of precisely cut and fit stones.  Directly to\nthe southwest is the base of a large arch.  The stone path continues\nwest and south.\n',124,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23618,-4,44,0,'Inside the Arch','  You are inside a large stone arch.  The place has obviously been abandoned\nfor a long time.  The floor is covered with a thick layer of dust and the\nentire room is full of cobwebs.  A ramshackle wooden staircase leads downwards.\n',124,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23619,-3,44,0,'Inside the Arch','  You are inside a large stone arch.  The place has obviously been abandoned\nfor a long time.  The floor is covered with a thick layer of dust and the\nentire room is full of cobwebs.\n',124,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23620,-2,44,0,'Inside the Arch','  You are inside a large stone arch.  The place has obviously been abandoned\nfor a long time.  The floor is covered with a thick layer of dust and the\nentire room is full of cobwebs.  There is a stone staircase leading downwards.\n',124,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23621,-3,46,-1,'Before The Arena','  You stand before the massive gate of the arena.  The size and structure of\nthe arena is astounding.  The immense blocks that make up the wall appear to\nbe held in place by gravity alone.  The blocks have been cut perfectly, making\nthe seams between them almost undetectable.  You can only begin to imagine how\nthis magnificent structure was constructed.  To the south lies a stone path.\nA gatehouse lies to the west, the ticket house is to the east.  Directly to the\nnorth is the entrance to the arena.\n',124,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23622,-4,46,-1,'Gatehouse','  You are in the guard station just before the arena.  The quarters are very\ntight and cramped, the entire room smells of sweat.  This is obviously not the\nchoice post of the arena guards.\n',124,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23623,-3,47,-1,'Entrance to the Arena','  You are standing just inside the arena.  The solid stone floor is smooth and\nwell worn from the numerous people that have tread this path before you.  A\nlarge set of double doors leads into the arena to the north.  A set of gates to\nthe south leads out.\n',124,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23624,-2,46,-1,'Tickethouse','  This is where visitors to the arena purchase tickets to view the matches.\nThe room is really nothing more than a small shack, the walls are undecorated,\nand other than the counter, there is not a single piece of furniture in the\nroom.\n',124,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23625,-3,48,-1,'Inside the Arena Walls','  You are standing in a passageway that makes its way through the inside of\nthe arena.  The solid stone walls, floor, and ceiling give the arena a feeling\nof stability.  A large staircase leads up into the arena stands.  To the north\na pit leads into the arena.  To the south is the entrance to the arena.\n',124,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23626,-2,48,-1,'Inside the Arena Walls','  You are standing in a passageway that makes its way through the inside of\nthe arena.  The solid stone walls, floor, and ceiling give the arena a feeling\nof stability.\n',124,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23627,-1,48,-1,'Inside the Arena Walls','  You are standing in a passageway that makes its way through the inside of\nthe arena.  The solid stone walls, floor, and ceiling give the arena a feeling\nof stability.  To the east is the arena sharpening shop.\n',124,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23628,0,49,-1,'Inside the Arena Walls','  You are standing in a passageway that makes its way through the inside of\nthe arena.  The solid stone walls, floor, and ceiling give the arena a feeling\nof stability.  To the east lies the arena armory.\n',124,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
