(23636,0,57,-1,'Inside the Arena Walls','  You are standing in a passageway that makes its way through the inside of\nthe arena.  The solid stone walls, floor, and ceiling give the arena a feeling\nof stability.  A stone door lies to the east.\n',124,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23637,-1,58,-1,'Inside the Arena Walls','  You are standing in a passageway that makes its way through the inside of\nthe arena.  The solid stone walls, floor, and ceiling give the arena a feeling\nof stability.  There is a door with an insignia inscribed upon it to the east.\n',124,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
