(23641,-5,58,-1,'Inside the Arena Walls','  You are standing in a passageway that makes its way through the inside of\nthe arena.  The solid stone walls, floor, and ceiling give the arena a feeling\nof stability.  A carving of a lion is on the door to the west.\n',124,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23642,-6,57,-1,'Inside the Arena Walls','  You are standing in a passageway that makes its way through the inside of\nthe arena.  The solid stone walls, floor, and ceiling give the arena a feeling\nof stability.  A wooden door fortified with metal bands lies to the west.\n',124,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
