(23649,-7,50,-1,'Inside the Arena Walls','  You are standing in a passageway that makes its way through the inside of\nthe arena.  The solid stone walls, floor, and ceiling give the arena a feeling\nof stability.  To the west lies the local arena inn.\n',124,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23650,-6,49,-1,'Inside the Arena Walls','  You are standing in a passageway that makes its way through the inside of\nthe arena.  The solid stone walls, floor, and ceiling give the arena a feeling\nof stability.  To the west lies the food stand.\n',124,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23651,-5,48,-1,'Inside the Arena Walls','  You are standing in a passageway that makes its way through the inside of\nthe arena.  The solid stone walls, floor, and ceiling give the arena a feeling\nof stability.  To the west lies the arena repair shop.\n',124,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23652,-4,48,-1,'Inside the Arena Walls','  You are standing in a passageway that makes its way through the inside of\nthe arena.  The solid stone walls, floor, and ceiling give the arena a feeling\nof stability.\n',124,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23653,-3,59,-1,'The Arena Owners Quarters','  The arena owner\'s quarters are dark and unlit.  The walls are painted solid\nblack.  The decoration of the room reflects the morbid tastes of its owner.\nA strange red symbol has been painted in blood on the floor.  Occasional wisps\nof green light flicker in and out of existence along the length of the symbol.\nAs you look around the room you feel an overpowering urge to leave this place,\nthinking back to the stories you have heard about the arena owner\'s lack of\nhospitality.  There are rooms to the east and west.  A very wide ornate door is\nto the south.\n',124,131084,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23654,-2,59,-1,'A Cozy Bedroom','  This is a very comfortable looking room.  The chairs and couch are very soft\nand appealing.\n',124,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23655,-4,59,-1,'A Luxurious Study','  This room is well appointed, the furniture and adornments look very\nexpensive.  A strong smell of recently burned incense pervades the room.  The\nceiling is obscured by a think layer of smoke.  The air here has a sort of\ntexture, every movement you make is done with extra effort.  The room hums with\nmagical power, from time to time a ball of fire will appear and explode in the\nmiddle of the air.\n',124,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23656,0,58,-1,'Head Guard\'s Quarters','  You are in a very official and important-looking room.  It is neat and clean,\nlarge red banners hang from the wall.  There is a door to the west.\n',124,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23657,1,57,-1,'Thieves\' Den','  This room is in complete disarray.  Papers, chairs, and bits of trash lie\nstrewn out all over the room.  A nicked and beaten old table occupies the\ncenter of the room, and an old tattered rug lies on the floor.  From looking\nover the assorted papers lying about, you get the idea that this room was once\nused as the base for a thieving operation.\n',124,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23658,2,56,-1,'Gambling Office','  You are in the arena gambling office.  As you notice the luxurious\nappointments of this room, you begin to wonder about the legitimacy of this\nestablishment.  There is a small door set into the northwest corner of the room.\n',124,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23659,-6,58,-1,'Animal Keeper\'s Quarters','  This is the animal trainers quarters.  The room smells horrible.  Some type of\nfood has been spilt and trampled into the ground.  Bits of fur and hair lie\nabout.  On the walls are assorted animal heads and skins.  There is a door to\nthe east.\n',124,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23660,-7,57,-1,'Gladiator Trainer\'s Quarters','  This room is kept perfectly clean and neat.  It is for the most part very\nSpartan, however numerous trophies, medallions, and awards abound.  A wooden\ndoor fortified with metal bands lies to the east.\n',124,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23661,-8,56,-1,'Accountant\'s Office','  You are in the arena accounting office.  This room is very simple, lacking\nany furniture except for a small desk and chair used by the accountant.\n',124,131081,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23662,-8,50,-1,'Arena Inn','  This is the arena inn.  The room is completely stark and lacking of any\ndecoration what so ever.  The atmosphere is cold and uninviting.  The beds\nlook rock hard.  You doubt you would want to stay here for long.\n',124,164029,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23663,-7,49,-1,'Food Stand','  This is the arena food stand.  It is a cozy little place where you can grab\nsomething to eat before the big battles.  The snacks look almost appealing\nand the sky high prices are almost believable.\n',124,164025,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23664,2,50,-1,'Arena Weapon Supplies','  This is the arena weaponry.  It is the most popular shop in the arena and is\nalways busy.  A wide variety of exotic weaponry can be obtained here, as many\nof the gladiators are willing to try just about anything to obtain an\nadvantage over their opponents.  Finding a better stocked weapon shop would\nbe a truly surprising occurrence.\n',124,164029,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23665,1,49,-1,'Arena Armory','  This is the arena armory.  The gladiators come here to find the protection\nthey need for their deadly sport.  A large anvil and hammer are evident near\nthe back of the room.\n',124,164029,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23666,-4,49,-1,'Staging Area','  You are in a small dirt covered room.  Bones and animal droppings litter the\nfloor.  It is here that the arena animals are held before they are released\ninto battle.\n',124,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23667,-3,49,-1,'Arena Pit','  You are in a shallow pit just before the arena floor.  To the east and west\nare areas used to prepare for battles.  To the north is the floor of the\narena.\n',124,131084,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23668,-2,49,-1,'Staging Area','  You are in a small dirt covered room.  Bones and animal droppings litter the\nfloor.  It is here that the arena animals are held before they are released\ninto battle.\n',124,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23669,1,52,-1,'Staging Area','  You are in a small dirt covered room.  Bones and animal droppings litter the\nfloor.  It is here that the arena animals are held before they are released\ninto battle.\n',124,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23670,1,53,-1,'Arena Pit','  You are in a shallow pit just before the arena floor.  To the north and south\nare areas used to prepare for battles.  To the west is the floor of the\narena.\n',124,131084,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23671,1,54,-1,'Staging Area','  You are in a small dirt covered room.  Bones and animal droppings litter the\nfloor.  It is here that the arena animals are held before they are released\ninto battle.\n',124,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23672,-2,57,-1,'Staging Area','  You are in a small dirt covered room.  Bones and animal droppings litter the\nfloor.  It is here that the arena animals are held before they are released\ninto battle.\n',124,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,176,0,'',NULL),
