(23678,-5,50,-1,'Arena Floor','You are standing on the sand covered arena floor.  Scraps of armor and rusty\ndiscarded weapons lie half buried in the sand.  To the south and southwest the\nthick stone walls of the arena block off your exit.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23679,-4,50,-1,'Arena Floor','You are standing on the sand covered arena floor.  Scraps of armor and rusty\ndiscarded weapons lie half buried in the sand.  To the south the thick stone\nwall of the arena blocks off your exit.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23680,-3,50,-1,'Arena Floor','  You are standing on the arena floor.  The roar of the crowd and your pounding\nheart urge you into battle.  But as you look at the blood tinted sand and\nbegin to think, your fear and common sense tell you to leave this place while\nyou still can.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23681,-2,50,-1,'Arena Floor','  You are standing on the sand covered arena floor.  Scraps of armor and rusty\ndiscarded weapons lie half buried in the sand.  To the south the thick stone\nwall of the arena blocks off your exit.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23682,-1,50,-1,'Arena Floor','  You are standing on the sand covered arena floor.  Scraps of armor and rusty\ndiscarded weapons lie half buried in the sand.  To the south and southeast the\nthick stone walls of the arena block off your exit.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23683,-6,51,-1,'Arena Floor','  You are standing on the sand covered arena floor.  Scraps of armor and rusty\ndiscarded weapons lie half buried in the sand.  To the west and southwest the\nthick stone walls of the arena block off your exit.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23684,-5,51,-1,'Arena Floor','  As you enter this area of the arena, you feel a sense of calm overcome you.\nThe world doesn\'t seem like such a bad place anymore, you almost feel like\nit\'s worth it to go on living.  The air above you glows softly yellow.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23685,-4,51,-1,'Arena Floor','  The arena stretches out in all directions here.  The sand has a faint reddish\ntinge.  As you look up into the stands, you see the crowd urging you on into\nbattle.  You try to restrain yourself, but bloodlust slowly begins to overpower\nyou.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23686,-3,51,-1,'Arena Floor','  The arena stretches out in all directions here.  The sand has a faint reddish\ntinge.  As you look up into the stands, you see the crowd urging you on into\nbattle.  You try to restrain yourself, but bloodlust slowly begins to overpower\nyou.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23687,-2,51,-1,'Arena Floor','  This part of the arena seems to be neater than the rest.  There are no bone\nfragments, armor bits, or destroyed weapons.  However, the sand appears to be\na darker shade of red.  A large skull inside a circle has been drawn into the\nsand here.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23688,-1,51,-1,'Arena Floor','  As you walk along the arena floor you peer about and witness the bloodshed\nsurrounding you.  In the distance you hear the clashing of steel, cries of\nbattle, and the wild cheering of the crowd.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23689,0,51,-1,'Arena Floor','  You are standing on the sand covered arena floor.  Scraps of armor and rusty\ndiscarded weapons lie half buried in the sand.  To the east and southeast the\nthick stone walls of the arena block off your exit.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23690,-6,52,-1,'Arena Floor','  You are standing on the sand covered arena floor.  Scraps of armor and rusty\ndiscarded weapons lie half buried in the sand.  To the west the thick stone\nwall of the arena blocks off your exit.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23691,-5,52,-1,'Arena Floor','  The arena stretches out in all directions here.  The sand has a faint reddish\ntinge.  As you look up into the stands you see the crowd urging you on into\nbattle.  You try to restrain yourself, but bloodlust slowly begins to overpower\nyou.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23692,-4,52,-1,'Arena Floor','  As you enter this area of the arena your thirst for blood becomes insatiable.\nYou desperately look around for something, anything, to kill.  Blood, blood,\nblood, and more blood, you feel the need to paint the arena floor a darker\nshade of crimson.  Slowly you come to your senses and realize you just weren\'t\nquite feeling yourself for a moment there.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23693,-3,52,-1,'Arena Floor','  This looks to be the death spot of a recently slain gladiator.  A partially\ncomplete skeleton lies prone in the sand.  Several bones have been broken and\ndisplaced, but you can make out a roughly humanoid form.  Something has been\nwritten in the sand, probably by the gladiator just before he perished.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23694,-2,52,-1,'Arena Floor','  The arena floor here differs little from the rest of the arena.  The sand\nis stained red from spilt blood.  Pieces of rotten flesh and splintered\nbones cover the floor.  Rusty scraps of weapons and armor lie half buried\nin the sand.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23695,-1,52,-1,'Arena Floor','  The arena stretches out in all directions here.  The sand has a faint reddish\ntinge.  As you look up into the stands you see the crowd urging you on into\nbattle.  You try to restrain yourself, but bloodlust slowly begins to overpower\nyou.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23696,0,52,-1,'Arena Floor','  You are standing on the sand covered arena floor.  Scraps of armor and rusty\ndiscarded weapons lie half buried in the sand.  To the east the thick stone\nwall of the arena blocks off your exit.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23697,-6,53,-1,'Arena Floor','  You are standing on the arena floor.  The roar of the crowd and your pounding\nheart urge you into battle.  But as you look at the blood tinted sand and\nbegin to think, your fear and common sense tell you to leave this place while\nyou still can.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23698,-5,53,-1,'Arena Floor','  The arena stretches out in all directions here.  The sand has a faint reddish\ntinge.  As you look up into the stands, you see the crowd urging you on into\nbattle.  You try to restrain yourself, but bloodlust slowly begins to overpower\nyou.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23699,-4,53,-1,'Arena Floor','  You look around the arena and see the results of unrestrained bloodshed.\nThere is carnage everywhere, splintered bones, severed limbs, pools of blood,\nand bits of flesh.  You begin to wonder what kind of kill happy people enjoy\nthis sport and come to the realization that you find it quite appealing.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23700,-3,53,-1,'Center of the Arena','  You have reached the center of the arena.  The roar of the crowd is deafening,\nyour adrenaline is flowing in quantities you had though impossible.  The sand\nis dark red here, thoroughly soaked by untold amounts of blood.  Smashed bits of\narmor and splintered remains of bones cover the ground.  Someone has erected a\nsmall pyramid of human skulls.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23701,-2,53,-1,'Arena Floor','  The sand here is moist with fresh blood.  The owner of the blood is nowhere\nto be seen, having fled the scene, and most likely the arena if they made it\nthat far.  As you wonder what happened to this individual you begin to ponder\nyour own fate.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23702,-1,53,-1,'Arena Floor','  The arena stretches out in all directions here.  The sand has a faint reddish\ntinge.  As you look up into the stands, you see the crowd urging you on into\nbattle.  You try to restrain yourself, but bloodlust slowly begins to overpower\nyou.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
