(23706,-4,54,-1,'Arena Floor','  You look around the arena and witness the results of unrestrained bloodshed.\nThere is carnage everywhere, splintered bones, severed limbs, pools of blood,\nand bits of flesh.  You begin to wonder what kind of kill happy people enjoy\nthis sport and come to the realization that you find it quite appealing.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23707,-3,54,-1,'Arena Floor','  The stench of rotting flesh is overpowering in this part of the arena.  You\nhold your nose and do you best not to vomit.  As you walk along you take each\nstep with care, avoiding the decaying remains of human and animal carcasses\nthat cover the floor.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
