(23717,0,55,-1,'Arena Floor','  As you walk along the arena floor you see a translucent shadowy figure out\nof the corner of your eye, you whip around to investigate, but whatever was\nthere is gone.  As you slowly turn back around a deep rumbling laughter shakes\nthe ground.  The air itself seems to take form and suck the strength out\nof your body.  Struggling the entire time, you manage to keep walking and\navoid fleeing in terror.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23718,-5,56,-1,'Arena Floor','  The sand here seems to be coarser than in the rest of the arena.  As you walk\nalong you hear several loud snaps, you look down and realize that what you are\nwalking on is not sand, but splintered fragments of bone.  The broken remains\nof several weapons lie strewn about on the ground.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23719,-4,56,-1,'Arena Floor','  You are standing on the sand covered arena floor.  Scraps of armor and rusty\ndiscarded weapons lie half buried in the sand.  To the north the thick stone\nwall of the arena blocks off your exit.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
