(23723,-3,48,0,'Staircase','  You are at the top of a staircase leading to the arena stands.  To the north\nis a downward sloping ramp leading to the lower section of stands.  Perhaps\nif you move quickly you can find a good seat.\n',124,131076,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23724,-2,48,0,'Upper Stands','    You are in the upper section of the arena stands.  The view from here is\ndecent, if not great.  The floor is sticky and covered with pieces of trash.\nThe janitor obviously hasn\'t come around for quite a while.\n',124,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
