(23751,-3,49,0,'Lower Stands','  You are in the lower section of the arena stands, they are obviously much\nbetter taken care of than the upper section.  To the south a ramp leading to\nthe upper section slopes up.  The lower section continues to the east and\nwest.\n',124,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(23752,-2,49,0,'Lower Stands','  You are in the lower section of the arena stands.  The view from here is\nsimply amazing, you can almost make out the individual grains of sand.  The\nfloor is clean, and the entire area appears to be very well kept.\n',124,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
