(23775,-8,56,-2,'Narrow Damp Tunnel','  You are at the end of a narrow tunnel.  The walls are damp and in the\ndistance you can hear the sound of water dripping.  The tunnel continues to the\nnortheast and a trapdoor is in the ceiling.\n',124,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,3,100,0,'',NULL),
(23776,-7,57,-2,'Narrow Damp Tunnel','  This tunnel is barely wide enough for you to walk through.  The walls are\ncovered with a slick slimy substance.  All of a sudden, a strong draft blows a\nblast of moist air in your face.  You can make out a dripping sound in the\ndistance.\n',124,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23777,-6,56,-2,'Narrow Damp Tunnel','  This tunnel is barely wide enough for you to walk through.  The walls are\ncovered with a thick slimy substance.  Water drips from the ceiling, rolling\ninto a thin crack stretching the length of the tunnel floor.\n',124,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23778,-5,55,-2,'Narrow Damp Tunnel','  This tunnel is barely wide enough for you to walk through.  The walls are\ncovered with a thick slimy substance.  Water drips from the ceiling, rolling\ninto a thin crack stretching the length of the tunnel floor.  To the northeast\nis a narrow fissure just wide enough for you to walk through.\n',124,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(23779,-4,54,-2,'Narrow Damp Tunnel','  This tunnel is barely wide enough for you to walk through.  The walls are\ncovered with a thick slimy substance.  Water drips from the ceiling, rolling\ninto a thin crack stretching the length of the tunnel floor.\n',124,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
