(24728,0,0,0,'A Fishing Spot','  Huge vine-strangled trees loom overhead and thick mist swirls all around,\nbut the air is cool and refreshing.  Water gushes upward from a massive \ncracked boulder and falls back down to form a wide stream that runs towards \na thick stand of rushes to the south.  Small, dark forms flit beneath the \nclear surface of the water.\n',183,131072,52,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
