(24754,0,0,0,'A Hot and Humid Swamp','  Huge, vine-strangled trees loom overhead, and the thick mist that swirls\nabout their trunks obscures the ground.  The heavy air is laden with the scent\nof decaying vegetation.\n',183,131072,50,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
