(24758,0,0,0,'A Stagnant Pool in a Swamp','  Huge, vine-strangled trees loom overhead, and the thick mist that swirls\nabout their trunks obscures the ground.  The heavy air is laden with the scent\nof decaying vegetation.  Sporadic burbling sounds draw attention to\noccasional large bubbles that burst when they reach the surface film\nof this stagnant pool.  Some vines to the north appear to have been disturbed.\n',183,131072,52,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(24759,0,0,0,'A Stagnant Pool in a Swamp','  Huge, vine-strangled trees loom overhead, and the thick mist that swirls\nabout their trunks obscures the ground.  The heavy air is laden with the scent\nof decaying vegetation.  Sporadic burbling sounds draw attention to\noccasional large bubbles that burst when they reach the surface film\nof this stagnant pool.\n',183,131072,52,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(24760,0,0,0,'A Stagnant Pool in a Swamp','  Huge, vine-strangled trees loom overhead, and the thick mist that swirls\nabout their trunks obscures the ground.  The heavy air is laden with the scent\nof decaying vegetation.  Sporadic burbling sounds draw attention to\noccasional large bubbles that burst when they reach the surface film\nof this stagnant pool.\n',183,131072,52,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(24761,0,0,0,'A Pool by the Base of a Huge Tree','  The mist here swirls about the base of a gigantic tree.  The heavy air is\nladen with the scent of decaying vegetation.  Sporadic burbling sounds draw\nattention to occasional large bubbles that burst when they reach the surface\nfilm of this stagnant pool.  Branches have been lashed to the tree to form what\nappears to be the rungs of a ladder.\n',183,131080,52,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(24762,0,0,0,'A Tidy Shack','A small treehouse has been built on a platform over the branches here.  The\nwalls and roof are woven from sticks and packed with peat.  The ceiling is at\nabout hobbit height.\n',-1,131080,55,0,0,0,0,-1,3,60,0,'',NULL),
(24763,0,0,0,'Up a Huge Tree','  Myriad leafy offshoots extend from the ancient branches of the tree, \nsmacking against anything that disturbs them.  The foliage rustles in a\nlight and fresh breeze, which carries with it a faint odor of the sea.\n',183,131072,58,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(24764,0,0,0,'Up a Huge Tree','  Myriad leafy offshoots extend from the ancient branches of the tree, \nsmacking against anything that disturbs them.  The foliage rustles in a\nlight and fresh breeze, which carries with it a faint odor of the sea.\n',183,131072,58,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
