(24768,0,0,0,'On a Platform','  A platform has been built over the branches here.  The branches and vines\nhave been cleared to about hobbit height, above which they have been woven\ninto a makeshift ceiling.\n',183,131080,55,0,0,0,0,-1,3,40,0,'',NULL),
(24769,0,0,0,'Up a Huge Tree','  Myriad leafy offshoots extend from the ancient branches of the tree, \nsmacking against anything that disturbs them.  The foliage rustles in a\nlight and fresh breeze, which carries with it a faint odor of the sea.\n',183,131072,58,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(24770,0,0,0,'Out on a Limb','  A massive limb extends from the trunk here.  The vines and branches\nhave been cleared away, and the open sky stretches out above.  This spot is\na welcome haven from the fetid heat below.\n',183,131072,50,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(24771,0,0,0,'An Old Grave','  Mud and grime seep from the walls of this partially unearthed grave.\nBones protrude here and there, white and well-polished by time.\n',183,139264,45,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(24775,0,0,0,'A Small Pathway','  This small pathway has been concealed by lush green trees.  The\ndirt is packed down tightly indicating frequent travel. Some tree\nroots along the path have been exposed by wear in the path.  The \ntrees surrounding the pathway provide shade during the daytime\nhours, and concealment during the night.\n',180,131072,36,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(24776,0,0,0,'A Small Pathway','  This small pathway has been concealed by lush green trees.  The\ndirt is packed down tightly indicating frequent travel. Some tree\nroots along the path have been exposed by wear in the path.  The \ntrees surrounding the pathway provide shade during the daytime\nhours, and concealment during the night.\n',180,131072,36,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(24777,0,0,0,'A Small Pathway','  This small pathway has been concealed by lush green trees.  The\ndirt is packed down tightly indicating frequent travel. Some tree\nroots along the path have been exposed by wear in the path.  The \ntrees surrounding the pathway provide shade during the daytime\nhours, and concealment during the night.\n',180,131072,36,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(24778,0,0,0,'A Small Hut','  This small hut has clutter covering most of the floor. Various\nremains and skeletons of creatures hang from the ceiling and walls. \nOn a small mural made of hide a veive\' protects the owner of the\nhut and wards off bad spirits. The hut is in surprisingly good \ncondition. It was constructed of various sticks and vines found\nin the surrounding vegetation.\n',180,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,80,0,'',NULL),
(24779,0,0,0,'A Clearing in the Woods','  Small trees have been cut down to the ground leaving the trunks\nexposed but not much taller than the roots exposed in the tightly\npacked ground.  The area is surrounded by trees tall and short \nproviding concealment to outsiders.\n',180,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(24780,0,0,0,'A Clearing in the Woods','  Small trees have been cut down to the ground leaving the trunks\nexposed but not much taller than the roots exposed in the tightly\npacked ground.  The area is surrounded by trees tall and short \nproviding concealment to outsiders. Heat radiates from a small hole\nin the ground.\n',180,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
