(24785,0,0,0,'A Dark Cavern','  This cavern has been carved out of the dirt to allow secrecy\nin the rituals of the shaman that inhabit the small village\nabove the surface. The floor has been packed with stones to \nprovide a more solid walking surface.\n',180,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,80,0,'',NULL),
