(25254,-53,-5,0,'A Wagon Rutted Trail Through the Prairie','  Deep ruts cover the prairie here, the product of countless caravans\nof wagons that have passed this way.  The scars of the numerous\nwagon wheels show the direction of the main trail across the prairie.\nAlthough there is plant growth in the ruts, the indentations made by\nthe wheels are still quite visible leading northwest and southeast.\n',138,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(25255,-54,-4,0,'A Wagon Rutted Trail Through the Prairie','  Deep ruts cover the prairie here, the product of countless caravans\nof wagons that have passed this way.  The scars of the numerous\nwagon wheels show the direction of the main trail across the prairie.\nAlthough there is plant growth in the ruts, the indentations made by\nthe wheels are still quite visible leading northwest and southeast.\n',138,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(25256,-55,-4,0,'Junction of Fences','  Two fences meet here, anchored by a post dug deep into the ground,\nstretching to the east and south.  The fences are made of split rails.\nTo the north you can see an ominous forest with vegetation so thick\nthat you can hardly see more than thirty feet into it.  The\nprairie grazing land seems to taper off here, no doubt due to the\nclose proximity to such tall trees.\n',138,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(25257,-53,-4,0,'Near the Forest','  A deep, thick, ominous looking forest lies north of the fence\nhere.  Full of thick vegetation and trees, this forest looks\npractically impassable.  The prairie\'s lushness seems to taper off\nnear the boundary to the forest.  Vague sounds of rustling in the\ntrees nearby can barely be made out.\n',138,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(25258,-52,-4,0,'Near the Forest','  A deep, thick, ominous looking forest lies north of the fence\nhere.  Full of thick vegetation and trees, this forest looks\npractically impassable.  The prairie\'s lushness seems to taper off\nnear the boundary to the forest.  Vague sounds of rustling in the\ntrees nearby can barely be made out.\n',138,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(25259,-51,-4,0,'Near the Forest','  A deep, thick, ominous looking forest lies north of the fence\nhere.  Full of thick vegetation and trees, this forest looks\npractically impassable.  The prairie\'s lushness seems to taper off\nnear the boundary to the forest.  Vague sounds of rustling in the\ntrees nearby can barely be made out.\n',138,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL);
INSERT INTO `room` VALUES (25260,-50,-4,0,'Near the Forest','  A deep, thick, ominous looking forest lies north of the fence\nhere.  Full of thick vegetation and trees, this forest looks\npractically impassable.  The prairie\'s lushness seems to taper off\nnear the boundary to the forest.  Vague sounds of rustling in the\ntrees nearby can barely be made out.\n',138,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(25261,-49,-4,0,'Junction of Fences','  The north and east fence meet here, grounded by a lichen and\nmoss covered post.  Tiny bits of rock lie all around.  To the\nsouthwest is a lush prairie, and to the north is a thick forest.\nLooming on the horizon to the east is an unbroken chain of\nmountains.\n',138,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(25262,-55,-5,0,'Surrounded by Prairie','  From every direction you look you see a lush green prairie\nof giant proportions.  Small clumps of clover and other\nwildflowers dot the landscape.  Scattered about on the ground are\nsmall holes with little piles of dirt near them.  Likely the\nproduct of a prairie dog digging to seek refuge the holes could\neasily cause damage to your ankles if you stepped in them the wrong\nway.  A split rail fence blocks your way to the west.\n',138,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(25263,-54,-5,0,'Surrounded by Prairie','  Thick lush prairie lies in every direction.  Various assorted\nwildflowers and prairie grasses are scattered about along the\nground.  Small patches of worn prairie dot the landscape, the result\nof the grazing animals that use this area to feed.  The vegetation\nflourishes all around.\n',138,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(25264,-52,-5,0,'Surrounded by Prairie','  Thick lush prairie lies in every direction.  Various assorted\nwildflowers and prairie grasses are scattered about along the\nground.  Small patches of worn prairie dot the landscape, the result\nof the grazing animals that use this area to feed.  The vegetation\nflourishes all around.\n',138,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(25265,-51,-5,0,'Surrounded by Prairie','  Thick lush prairie lies in every direction.  Various assorted\nwildflowers and prairie grasses are scattered about along the\nground.  Small patches of worn prairie dot the landscape, the result\nof the grazing animals that use this area to feed.  The vegetation\nflourishes all around.\n',138,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(25266,-50,-5,0,'Surrounded by Prairie','  Thick lush prairie lies in every direction.  Various assorted\nwildflowers and prairie grasses are scattered about along the\nground.  Small patches of worn prairie dot the landscape, the result\nof the grazing animals that use this area to feed.  The vegetation\nflourishes all around.\n',138,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(25267,-49,-5,0,'Downslope From the Mountains','  Tiny bits of rock lie all around.  To the west is a lush prairie\nand to the east a well built split rail fence blocks your way.\nUsed to keep the grazing animals from wandering off, the\nfence looks like it has seen its fair share of weathering.\n',138,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(25268,-55,-6,0,'Surrounded by Prairie','  From every direction you look you see a lush green prairie\nof giant proportions.  Small clumps of clover and other\nwildflowers dot the landscape.  Scattered about on the ground are\nsmall holes with little piles of dirt near them.  Likely the\nproduct of a prairie dog digging to seek refuge the holes could\neasily cause damage to your ankles if you stepped in them the wrong\nway.  A split rail fence blocks your way to the west.\n',138,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(25269,-54,-6,0,'Surrounded by Prairie','  Thick lush prairie lies in every direction.  Various assorted\nwildflowers and prairie grasses are scattered about along the\nground.  Small patches of worn prairie dot the landscape, the result\nof the grazing animals that use this area to feed.  The vegetation\nflourishes all around.\n',138,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
