(25283,-52,-8,0,'Campsite on the Prairie','  Thick lush prairie surrounds this island of refuge for\nthe hardworking cattlehands.  A large tent and a campfire\nadorn the ground.  This is where the hard working men come\nto relax after a hard day of work.  Spirals of smoke\nstretch up into the sky.\n',138,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(25284,-51,-8,0,'Surrounded by Prairie','  Thick lush prairie lies in every direction.  Various assorted\nwildflowers and prairie grasses are scattered about along the\nground.  Small patches of worn prairie dot the landscape, the result\nof the grazing animals that use this area to feed.  The vegetation\nflourishes all around.  A campsite is west.\n',138,131072,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
