(25549,-51,-61,-1,'Outside the Entrance of the Temple of Synjilla','  Towering in front you you to the northwest is a pyramid constructed of\npure marble.  The product of countless hours of enslaved workmanship, the\npyramid is the home of Synjilla.  Buried deep within the depths of the\npyramid are the horrors that Synjilla has created for his amusement, and\nthe sacrificial lairs of despair.  A solid bronze gate lies to the\nnorthwest.\n',142,141632,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
