(25621,0,0,0,'A Fork in a Mist Filled Hallway','  A strange mist fills the room making visibility extremely difficult.  The\nwhite marble walls of this hallway seem to pulse with energy the longer you\nstand in one place.  Echoes of pain and laughter fill the air, almost as if\nsomeone was watching you from a concealed place.\n',142,142664,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25622,0,0,0,'A Mist Filled Hallway','  A strange mist fills the room making visibility extremely difficult.  The\nwhite marble walls of this hallway seem to pulse with energy the longer you\nstand in one place.  Echoes of pain and laughter fill the air, almost as if\nsomeone was watching you from a concealed place.\n',142,142664,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25623,0,0,0,'A Mist Filled Hallway','  A strange mist fills the room making visibility extremely difficult.  The\nwhite marble walls of this hallway seem to pulse with energy the longer you\nstand in one place.  Echoes of pain and laughter fill the air, almost as if\nsomeone was watching you from a concealed place.  Strange markings on the\nwall to the southwest dance in the light from the torches on the west wall.\n',142,142664,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25624,0,0,0,'Lair of the Sphinx','  The marble walls are polished and cleaned remarkably well.  Not a speck\nof dust can be seen.  Strange writings on the east wall stand out.  Hollow\nlaughter seems to echo through the room, but pinpointing an origin is\ndifficult.  In the corner of the room a grate is locked tight with a lock.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25625,0,0,0,'Juncture of Hallways','  White marble hallways extend to the north east and northeast.  Far off to\nthe northeast the altar of Synjilla hovers above the ground.  Tortured\nscreams fill the air, and the odor of rotting flesh permeates the air.\nThis place is remarkably well kept.  Not a speck of dust can be seen.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25626,0,0,0,'Hallway of Lost Souls','  A white marble hallway extends to the north and south.  The screams of\ntorture are not as piercing here as in other places, but the scent of\nrotting flesh is just as strong.  An eerie moan of pain and pleasure all\nwrapped up into one seems to be coming from far off to the north.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25627,0,0,0,'Hallway of Lost Souls','  A white marble hallway extends to the north and south.  The screams of\ntorture are not as piercing here as in other places, but the scent of\nrotting flesh is just as strong.  An eerie moan of pain and pleasure all\nwrapped up into one seems to be coming from far off to the north.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25628,0,0,0,'Hallway of Lost Souls','  A white marble hallway extends to the north and south.  The screams of\ntorture are not as piercing here as in other places, but the scent of\nrotting flesh is just as strong.  An eerie moan of pain and pleasure all\nwrapped up into one seems to be coming from far off to the north.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25629,0,0,0,'Bend in the Hallway of Lost Souls','  A white marble hallway extends to the north and south.  The screams of\ntorture are not as piercing here as in other places, but the scent of\nrotting flesh is just as strong.  To the east lie the crypts of past\nreligious leaders.  The hallway continues to the south.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25630,0,0,0,'Bend in the Hallway of Lost Souls','  A white marble hallway extends to the north and west.  The screams of\ntorture are not as piercing here as in other places, but the scent of\nrotting flesh is just as strong.  To the east lie the crypts of past\nreligious leaders.  The hallway continues to the south.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25631,0,0,0,'Hallway of Lost Souls','  A white marble hallway extends to the north.  The screams of torture are\nnot as piercing here as in other places, but the scent of rotting flesh is\njust as strong.  An eerie moan of pain and pleasure all wrapped up into one\nseems to be coming from far off to the north.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25632,0,0,0,'Crypt of Lahtnero','  Vats of herbs and blood fill this crypt.  This room is filthy with dust\nand other particulate matter.  Although the room was once beautiful, it is\nlooks to be quite disheveled.  Hanging on the east wall is a painting of\nLahtnero, holding a small heart.  More than likely that of his wife that he\nsenselessly murdered when she gazed upon another man by accident.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25633,0,0,0,'Crypt of Aktid','  The white marble walls are more clean here than the rest of the\nsurroundings.  Hanging from the west wall, a large painting of Aktid is\nplaced.  Vats of ceremonial burial fluids are placed along the floor.\nHanging from the ceiling is what appears to be a human heart.  Rumor has it\nthat Aktid had one of his general\'s hearts ripped out after he refused to\nobey his orders to the letter.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25634,0,0,0,'Crypt of Grebnas','  Seemingly endless vats of sacrificial wine fills this room.  The white\nmarble walls are dulled by years of neglect.  Strangely, the smell of fresh\ncut grass and leather seem to fill this room, replacing the smell of the\nrotting flesh that permeates almost every other part of this deity forsaken\npyramid.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25635,0,0,0,'Scourge of Lamentation','  The hallway narrows the further east you go.  Dark shadows dance along\nthe walls, and the screams intensify the more you concentrate on making\nthem go away.  The white marble is kept clean and shiny here.  No dust can\nbe seen.  The smell of rotting flesh seems to intensify the further east\nyou go.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25636,0,0,0,'Scourge of Lamentation','  The hallway narrows the further east you go.  Dark shadows dance along\nthe walls, and the screams intensify the more you concentrate on making\nthem go away.  The white marble is kept clean and shiny here.  No dust can\nbe seen.  The smell of rotting flesh seems to intensify the further east\nyou go.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25637,0,0,0,'Scourge of Lamentation','  The hallway narrows the further east you go.  Dark shadows dance along\nthe walls, and the screams intensify the more you concentrate on making\nthem go away.  The white marble is kept clean and shiny here.  No dust can\nbe seen.  The smell of rotting flesh seems to intensify the further east\nyou go.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25638,0,0,0,'Scourge of Lamentation','  The hallway reaches an abrupt stop here.  The odor of rotting flesh seems\nto have given way to the smells of incense.  The white marble walls and\nfloors are clean and well kept here.  Strange markings mark almost all of\nthe walls in this room.  There are no visible sources of light, but the\nwalls seem to glow in a way that has not been encountered before inside the\npyramid.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25639,0,0,0,'Monks Quarters','  The monks of pyramid are the unsung heroes.  Their quarters are even\nmore sparse than those of the clerics.  White marble walls are all that are\nfound here, the result of the monks refusal of material things.  The monks\nare responsible for the everyday maintenance of the pyramid.  The monks\nhave all taken solemn vows to protect their master, Synjilla, at all costs.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25640,0,0,0,'Clerical Quarters','  This is the office where the clerics can come and meet and plan how they\nwill do the many tasks that they are assigned from the high priests.  No\nfurniture is here, only mats on the ground.  Sigil markings cover the\nwalls, and parchments are held up on the walls by delicate holders.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25641,0,0,0,'Host of Repentance','  Holy relics line the walls here.  Ranging from holy symbols to\nsacrificial knifes, this room is where the high priests come to plan\nthe sacrifices to Synjilla.  Sparsely furnished, the white marble room\nis cleaned well, and not a speck of dust can be found.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25642,0,0,0,'Quarters of Amun Alsiph','  The quarters of Amun Alsiph are kept clean by the clerics.  Spotless\nfloors and walls of white marble are accented by a majestic oak desk.  A\nsmall bed lies in the corner, and next to the bed a spare vat of blood\nsits, waiting for Amun to draw his lips near.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25643,0,0,0,'The Forbidden Passage','  This forbidden passage is used only by Amun Alsiph.  Used as a quick\nmeans of access to the vats of blood that are saved for his consumption\nonly, this passage way is kept clean and tidy.  The smell of rotting flesh\nfills the room, and echoes of tortured screams reverberate off the white\nmarble walls.  Amun\'s guardian is sworn to keep any and all people away\nfrom this passage to assure that when Amun is in need of blood he will\nhave no obstructions.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25644,0,0,0,'Pathway of Synjilla','  This hallway is the final passage to the sacred altar of Synjilla.  Those\nwho will be sacrificed are allowed to rest here on occasion in order to\nallow them to regain their composure before their vital organs are ripped\nfrom their bodies.  Amazingly, the halls are kept clean.  The hallway\ncontinues to the northeast and southwest.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25645,0,0,0,'Pathway of Synjilla',' This hallway is the final passage to the sacred altar of Synjilla.  Those\nwho will be sacrificed are allowed to rest here on occasion in order to\nallow them to regain their composure before their vital organs are ripped\nfrom their bodies.  Amazingly, the halls are kept clean.  The hallway\ncontinues to the northeast and southwest.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25646,0,0,0,'Host of Meditation','  These open air meditation chambers were ordered built by Synjilla to\nassure that he could keep a watchful eye on his subjects.  Due to the fact\nthat most of the time that the high priests spent was isolated, meditating\nbefore a sacrifice was one of the few times the priests could socialize.\nAfter Synjilla stopped coming out of his lair, however, the new high\npriests allowed for socializing only during non-sacrifice days.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25647,0,0,0,'Host of Meditation','  These open air meditation chambers were ordered built by Synjilla to\nassure that he could keep a watchful eye on his subjects.  Due to the fact\nthat most of the time that the high priests spent was isolated, meditating\nbefore a sacrifice was one of the few times the priests could socialize.\nAfter Synjilla stopped coming out of his lair, however, the new high\npriests allowed for socializing only during non-sacrifice days.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25648,0,0,0,'Host of Meditation','  These open air meditation chambers were ordered built by Synjilla to\nassure that he could keep a watchful eye on his subjects.  Due to the fact\nthat most of the time that the high priests spent was isolated, meditating\nbefore a sacrifice was one of the few times the priests could socialize.\nAfter Synjilla stopped coming out of his lair, however, the new high\npriests allowed for socializing only during non-sacrifice days.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25649,0,0,0,'Altar of Synjilla','  Hovering above the ground, the sacred altar of Synjilla bears witness to\nthe pain and suffering that is required of those who will come to see it.\nBlood pools around almost every part of the floor, and a long spear to the\nleft of the altar holds the hearts of those who are sacrificed.  A large\nvat of blood sits near the altar, waiting for Amun Alsiph.  Most of the\nsacrifices are made here, but on occasion, when Synjilla deems it\nnecessary, the sacrifices are taken to the top floor of the pyramid for\nSynjilla to assist in their brutalization.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25650,0,0,0,'Entryway of the Ancients','  This is the holiest of rooms in the pyramid.  Only the highest ranking\nof priests are even allowed to enter here.  Although the majority of the\nsacrifices take place below at the altar of Synjilla, occasionally the high\npriests bring their victims to this level of the pyramid and offer them.\nThe scents and odors of the rotting flesh have been replaced by a more\nacceptable scent.  Rotting flesh smells have been replaced by incense.\n',142,141644,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25651,0,0,0,'Host of Anguish','  The final of the hosts, the host of anguish is where only a select few of\nthe sacrificed are allowed to come to.  Strange racks on opposite walls of\nthe room are used to hold the victims up in compromising positions, to gain\nthe acceptance of Synjilla.  When the priests feel it necessary, they\nremove the feet and hands of the sacrificed, force them to eat them, and\nleave them on the racks.  Eventually Synjilla will come from his lair,\ntorture, and finally eliminate the sacrificial beings.\n',142,174408,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25652,0,0,0,'Host of Anguish','  The final of the hosts, the host of anguish is where only a select few of\nthe sacrificed are allowed to come to.  Strange racks on opposite walls of\nthe room are used to hold the victims up in compromising positions, to gain\nthe acceptance of Synjilla.  When the priests feel it necessary, they\nremove the feet and hands of the sacrificed, force them to eat them, and\nleave them on the racks.  Eventually Synjilla will come from his lair,\ntorture, and finally eliminate the sacrificial beings.\n\n',142,174408,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25653,0,0,0,'Host of Synjilla','  Designed to be the guard post before the lair of Synjilla is entered,\nthis room holds is the eternal home of Synjilla’s guard.  Synjilla,\nalthough some believe him to be dead, has been known to wander these halls\nin search of fresh blood.  The white marble floors and walls all bear the\nscrape marks made by an incredibly powerful being.  The gouges in the\nmarble must have been made by very powerful claws.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25654,0,0,0,'The Lair of Synjilla','  Half rotten corpses of elves, dwarves and ogres line the walls of this\nlair.  Some of the corpses are hung by their own bowels, while others are\nheld up by spikes through their heads.  The walls are covered in a thin\nlayer of pure gold.  Vats of various bodily fluids and excrement line the\nwalls.  Hovering in the middle of the room, an orb that allows one to see\nthe Atakaji Desert rests.  The east wall has a strange sigil scratched\ninto the gold film.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25655,0,0,0,'Vortex of Time and Space','  Flickering in and out of existence, this room promises to be a gateway\naway from this place of sacrifice, pain and anguish.  The walls pulsate\nwith the power of another dimension.  The walls themselves do not look to\nbe made out of anything that is real, yet there is a substance to them, to\nbe sure.\n',142,141640,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,250,0,'',NULL),
(25656,-47,-60,0,'Observation Deck','  This room gives a perfect view of the surrounding desert.  Perfect for\nthe master archer to snipe those who are deemed dangerous to the relative\npeace of the Atakaji.  Four slits are cut into the walls to allow for the\narcher to see his victims before they see him.\n',142,131144,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(25657,-49,-58,-2,'An Ancient Staircase','A narrow spiral staircase extends into the darkness below.  The staircase\nis old and dilapidated but appears strong enough to support the weight of\nseveral people.  Sounds echo and reverberate off of the marble walls.  A\nstrange stench of sulphur fills the room.  The stairway extends down and up.\n',-1,139592,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(25658,-49,-58,-3,'An Ancient Staircase','A narrow spiral staircase extends into the darkness below.  The staircase\nis old and dilapidated but appears strong enough to support the weight of\nseveral people.  Sounds echo and reverberate off of the marble walls.  A\nstrange stench of sulphur fills the room.  The stairway extends down and up.\n',-1,139592,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(25659,-49,-58,-4,'An Ancient Staircase','A narrow spiral staircase extends into the darkness below.  The staircase\nis old and dilapidated but appears strong enough to support the weight of\nseveral people.  Sounds echo and reverberate off of the marble walls.  A\nstrange stench of sulphur fills the room.  The stairway extends down and\nup.\n',-1,139592,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(25660,-49,-58,-5,'An Ancient Staircase','A narrow spiral staircase extends upwards into the darkness.  The\nstaircase is old and dilapidated but appears strong enough to support the\nweight of several people.  Sounds echo and reverberate off of the marble\nwalls.  A strange stench of sulphur fills the room.  The stairway extends\nupwards, and a white marble hallway stretches to the northwest.\n',-1,139592,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(25661,-50,-57,-5,'A White Marble Hall','Noise seems to echo throughout this hall.  The white marble walls echo\nevery sound that is made.  The walls were once polished and clean but are\nnow dirty and dusty.  A strange smell of sulphur is everpresent.\n',-1,139592,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(25662,-51,-58,-5,'A White Marble Hall','Noise seems to echo throughout this hall.  The white marble walls echo\nevery sound that is made.  The walls were once polished and clean but are\nnow dirty and dusty.  A strange smell of sulphur is everpresent.\n',-1,139592,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(25663,-50,-59,-5,'A White Marble Hall','Noise seems to echo throughout this hall.  The white marble walls echo\nevery sound that is made.  The walls were once polished and clean but are\nnow dirty and dusty.  A strange smell of sulphur is everpresent.\n',-1,139592,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(25664,-50,-58,-5,'A Mirrored Room','This room is dominated by a large dais.  This large dais is covered in\ndifferent holy manuscripts and ceremonial herbs.  An empty mounting for\nwhat appears to be a gem sits in the center of the dais.  The mounting lies\ndirectly below a hole in the ceiling that is covered in cobwebs.  The walls\nare polished black marble that reflect the little amount of light in this\nroom in all ways imagineable.  A doorway leads to the south.\n',-1,139592,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(25665,-48,-63,0,'Observation Deck','  This room gives a perfect view of the surrounding desert.  Perfect for\nthe master archer to snipe those who are deemed dangerous to the relative\npeace of the Atakaji.  Four slits are cut into the walls to allow for the\narcher to see his victims before they see him.\n',142,141632,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(25666,-49,-64,0,'Observation Deck','  This room gives a perfect view of the surrounding desert.  Perfect for\nthe master archer to snipe those who are deemed dangerous to the relative\npeace of the Atakaji.  Four slits are cut into the walls to allow for the\narcher to see his victims before they see him.\n',142,141632,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(25667,-47,-64,0,'Observation Deck','  This room gives a perfect view of the surrounding desert.  Perfect for\nthe master archer to snipe those who are deemed dangerous to the relative\npeace of the Atakaji.  Four slits are cut into the walls to allow for the\narcher to see his victims before they see him.\n',142,141632,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(25668,-48,-65,0,'Observation Deck','  This room gives a perfect view of the surrounding desert.  Perfect for\nthe master archer to snipe those who are deemed dangerous to the relative\npeace of the Atakaji.  Four slits are cut into the walls to allow for the\narcher to see his victims before they see him.\n',142,141632,40,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(26650,76,-19,0,'Under a Black Marble Arch','  This mighty arch serves as the entry point to the Cult of Logrus\ncompound.  It is constructed from rich black marble and looms overhead\nlike a starless night sky.  This imposing work of architecture effectively\nseparates the compound from the bustling traffic of the city itself.\n<C>Silver runes <1>etched at the top welcome all those brave enough to\nenter the headquarters of the Cult of Logrus.  To the west lies an\nimposing black iron gate that keeps unwanted people from entering\nthe compound.  To the east you spy a massive courtyard.\n',148,131181,21,0,0,0,0,0,8,150,0,'',NULL),
(26651,77,-19,0,'<g>West Courtyard<1>','  Expertly trimmed hedges and <g>bushes <1>have been carefully placed to\ngive a sense of peace and rigid order.  Mystical enchantments keep the\nshrubbery lush and green year round.  The sounds of warriors training and\nmages chanting seem to echo all around.  To the west looms a great\n<b>black marble archway<1>.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26652,77,-18,0,'<g>Northwest Courtyard<1>','  Surprisingly sparse on shrubbery, this part of the courtyard is\ndedicated to contemplative meditation and focused prayer.  The\nair is brisk and light and the reigning silence makes it much\neasier to focus.\n',148,140648,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26653,77,-20,0,'<g>Southwest Courtyard<1>','  Surprisingly sparse on shrubbery, this part of the courtyard is\ndedicated to contemplative meditation and focused prayer.  The air\nis brisk and light and the reigning silence makes it much easier\nto focus.\n',148,140648,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26654,78,-19,0,'<g>Central Courtyard<1>','  Expertly trimmed hedges and <g>bushes<z> have been carefully\nplaced here to give a sense of unity of strength.  The mystical\nenchantments flowing throughout the courtyard seem to originate from\nthis point.  A great sense of power and purpose permeates the air\nand fills you with refreshing energy and vigor.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26655,78,-18,0,'<g>North Courtyard<1>','  Expertly trimmed hedges and <g>bushes <1>have been carefully\nplaced to give a sense of peace and rigid order.  Mystical enchantments\nkeep the shrubbery lush and green year round.  The sounds of warriors\ntraining and mages chanting seem to echo all around.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26656,78,-20,0,'<g>South Courtyard<1>','  Expertly trimmed hedges and <g>bushes <1>have been carefully\nplaced to give a sense of peace and rigid order.  Mystical enchantments\nkeep the shrubbery lush and green year round.  The sounds of warriors\ntraining and mages chanting seem to echo all around.\n\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26657,79,-19,0,'<g>East Courtyard<1>','  Expertly trimmed hedges and <g>bushes <1>have been carefully placed to\ngive a sense of peace and rigid order.  Mystical enchantments keep the\nshrubbery lush and green year round.  The sounds of warriors training and\nmages chanting seem to echo all around.  An <d>ornate staircase <1>winds\nup into the next level of the compound.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26658,79,-18,0,'<g>Northeast Courtyard<1>','  Surprisingly sparse on shrubbery, this part of the courtyard is dedicated\nto contemplative meditation and focused prayer.  The air is brisk and light\nand the reigning silence makes it much easier to focus.\n',148,140648,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26659,79,-20,0,'<g>Southeast Courtyard<1>','  Surprisingly sparse on shrubbery, this part of the courtyard is dedicated\nto contemplative meditation and focused prayer.  The air is brisk and light\nand the reigning silence makes it much easier to focus.\n',148,140648,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26660,79,-19,1,'<B>Recruiting Office<1>','  The recruiting office seems spotlessly clean in a cold sterile way.\nPosted along the back wall of this office is a <p>poster <1>entitled \"The\nWay of Logrus.\"  People come from all across The World to join the proud\nranks of the Cult of Logrus.  All those interested in joining the Cult are\nput through a special test to see if they are worthy.  The first step in\nthe initiation process though is to petition the recruiting officer.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26661,78,-19,1,'<B>Black Marble Hallway<1>','  A long black marble hallway stretches out before you.  Specially\nengineered illusions make the floor appear to flow like a long dark river.\nEnergy throbs from beneath the floor causing a steady ordered rhythm.\nElaborate <B>murals <1>adorn the sides of the walls teaching of the Cult\'s\nhistory.  Dark obsidian doors can be barely made out to the north and south.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26662,78,-18,1,'<R>Training Hall<1>','  The smell of sweat and blood fills this room.  The floor is dotted\nwith holes where an errant axeblade or a badly swung sword came\ncrashing down.  Though the floor appears clean, there are a few\n<r>rust-brown stains <1>that must have been impossible to get out.\nThe voices of great warriors long past seem to echo in these walls.\nPosted on some walls are <g>diagrams <1>and <g>charts<1>.  An onyx door\nleads out into the hallway to the south and the training hall continues\nto the west.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26663,78,-20,1,'<R>Chaos Garrison<1>','  Smelling of cold steel and boot polish, this room\'s spotless and\norganized interior reflects the discipline of its soldiers.  This\nsmall garrison plays a chief part in the compound\'s defense.  Having\nsworn blood oaths to the Grandmaster of Logrus, the Chaos Knights\nserve as the elite warriors in the army of Logrus.  This garrison\nnot only houses the compound\'s guards but also stores the provisions,\narmor, and weapons.  An elaborate <g>diagram<z> covers a large portion\nof the walls.  An obsidian door can be seen to the north.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,20,120,0,'',NULL),
(26664,77,-19,1,'<B>Black Marble Hallway<1>','  A long black marble hallway stretches out before you.  Specially\nengineered illusions make the floor appear to flow like a long dark\nriver.  Energy throbs from beneath the floor causing a steady ordered\nrhythm.  Elaborate <B>murals <1>adorn the sides of the walls teaching\nof the Cult\'s history.  Dark obsidian doors can be barely made out to\nthe west and south.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26665,77,-18,1,'<R>Back of Training Hall<1>','  The smell of sweat and blood fills this room.  The floor is dotted\nwith holes where an errant axeblade or badly swung sword came\ncrashing down.  Though the floor appears clean, there are a few\n<r>rust-brown stains <1>that must have been impossible to get out.\nThe voices of great warriors long past seem to echo in these walls.\nPosted on some walls are <g>diagrams <1>and <g>charts<1>.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26666,76,-19,1,'<G>Wyvern Stables<1>','  The pungent smell of wyverns and raw meat hits you.  This stable is\nused to house and feed the specially bred wyverns that the Cult uses\nfor its elite cavalry.  Only a select few are capable of controlling\nthe notably high-strung wyverns, but their ferociousness in battle\nhave won them a place in the army of Logrus.  An obsidian door can\nbe barely made out to the east.  An elaborate and powerful gate to the\nwest prevents the wyverns from leaving the compound unattended.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26667,75,-19,1,'<G>Launching Area<1>','  Outside of the protective walls of the compound, a brisk cool breeze\nwhips about you.  The air carries a scent remarkably like stale blood and\nwyverns.  The city of Logrus stretches out before you in all its glory.\nThe launching area is basically a great slab of black marble jutting out\nfrom the compound.  Several claw marks mar the platform\'s dark <B>surface<1>\nindicating frequent use.  Often patrols can be seen taking off or landing as\ndedicated warriors of Logrus return from a patrol of their city or go out\nto further the glory of Logrus.  An elaborate and powerful gate allows\nentry to the compound to the east.\n',148,139616,21,0,0,0,0,0,6,-1,0,'',NULL),
(26668,77,-20,1,'<G>Wyvern Riders Barracks<1>','  Cluttered with cavalry equipment, this room houses the Chaos Knights\nwho have the special talent of handling the fierce wyverns of Logrus.\nPossessing not only an affinity for mounted combat, but also minor\nclerical powers, the wyvern riders are greatly respected in the Cult.\nAn orderly <g>schedule<z> is tacked to the far wall.  An obsidian\ndoor to the north leads back out into the hallway.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,20,120,0,'',NULL),
(26669,78,-20,2,'<B>Dormitory<1>','  Defended by the garrison below, the general populace of this compound\nrests here at the end of each fulfilling day.  Though crowded at times by\nthe sheer number of people, there always seems to be room for a visiting\nmember of the Enlightened.  Though defended by the compound\'s guards, this\narea also serves as a fallback point should the lower levels be overrun.\nThough not all are official members of the Logrus military, every Cultist is\nskilled in the arts of combat and possessed with an almost fanatical devotion\nto the Cult.  A sturdy onyx door leads out into the hallway to the north.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,20,120,0,'',NULL),
(26670,78,-19,2,'<B>Black Marble Hallway<1>','  A long black marble hallway stretches out before you.  Specially\nengineered illusions make the floor appear to flow like a long dark\nriver.  Energy throbs from beneath the floor causing a steady ordered\nrhythm.  Elaborate <B>murals <1>adorn the sides of the walls teaching\nof the Cult\'s history.  Sturdy onyx doors can be seen to the north,\nsouth, and east.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26671,79,-19,2,'<R>Martial Arts Dojo<1>','  Exotic oriental decorations adorn the compound\'s training dojo.  Many of\nthe Cult\'s martial artists come here to train and gain membership into the\n<B>Order of the Black Rose<z>, the Cult\'s elite group of fighting monks and ninja\nassassins.  Exotic <r>symbols<z> are carved into the nearby walls and a great\n<r>banner<z> dominates the far wall.  A strong sense of purpose fill this room.\nA sturdy onyx door can be seen to the west.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26672,78,-18,2,'<B>Library<1>','  The compound\'s library holds a vast store of knowledge including a great\ndeal of the Cult\'s most treasured literary works.  Cultivating not just\nphysical superiority but also mental prowess, cultists often spend many\nhours in this library expanding their knowledge.  Cult mages also give\ntheir precious spellbooks and scrolls into the safe hands of the Librarian.\nPeople interested in joining the Cult can also study the Cult\'s philosophy\nby perusing the \"Way of Logrus\" on display in the library.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26673,77,-19,2,'<B>Black Marble Hallway<1>','  A long black marble hallway stretches out before you.  Specially\nengineered illusions make the floor appear to flow like a long dark\nriver.  Energy throbs from beneath the floor causing a steady ordered\nrhythm.  Elaborate <B>murals<1> adorn the sides of the walls teaching\nof the Cult\'s history.  A sturdy onyx door can be seen to the south.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26674,77,-20,2,'<B>Lecture Hall<1>','  This chamber seems to lack any warmth.  Cold black walls curve around in\na circular design so that all attention is drawn to the center of the room\nwhere the instructor would stand.  This room has almost perfect symmetry\nand fluidness of design.  Though this room is used mostly for the\ninstruction of mages, the lecture hall is also the forum for religious\nindoctrination and philosophical debate.  A sturdy onyx door can be seen\nto the north.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(26675,76,-19,2,'<B>Black Marble Hallway<1>','  A long black marble hallway stretches out before you.  Specially\nengineered illusions make the floor appear to flow like a long dark\nriver.  Energy throbs from beneath the floor causing a steady ordered\nrhythm.  Elaborate <B>murals <1>adorn the sides of the walls teaching\nof the Cult\'s history.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26676,77,-18,2,'<Y>Archives<1>','  This back-room often holds the Cult\'s most vital <g>reports<z>, <g>maps<z>,\n<g>records<z>, and <g>research material<z>.  Kept under the watchful eye\nof the Librarian and the black-cowled monks of the Order of the Black Rose,\nthis room is a virtual treasure trove of knowledge.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26677,76,-19,3,'<B>Black Marble Hallway<1>','  A long black marble hallway stretches out before you.  Specially\nengineered illusions make the floor appear to flow like a long dark\nriver.  Energy throbs from beneath the floor causing a steady ordered\nrhythm.  Elaborate <B>murals<z> adorn the sides of the walls teaching of the\nCult\'s history.  A beautiful black marble staircase leads to the next\nlevel of the compound and allows a way down to the lower levels.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26678,77,-19,3,'<B>Black Marble Hallway<1>','  A long black marble hallway stretches out before you.  Specially\nengineered illusions make the floor appear to flow like a long dark\nriver.  Energy throbs from beneath the floor causing a steady ordered\nrhythm.  Elaborate <B>murals<z> adorn the sides of the walls teaching\nof the Cult\'s history.  Jet black doors can be seen to the north\nand south.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26679,78,-19,3,'<B>Black Marble Hallway<Z>','  A long black marble hallway stretches out before you.  Specially\nengineered illusions make the floor appear to flow like a long dark\nriver.  Energy throbs from beneath the floor causing a steady ordered\nrhythm.  Elaborate <B>murals<z> adorn the sides of the walls teaching of the\nCult\'s history.  Jet black doors can be seen to the north and east.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26680,77,-18,3,'<B>Spellcasting Chamber<1>','  This shadowy chamber provides a safe environment for the practicing\napprentices and masterful mages of Logrus.  The sickly sweet smell of\ndecaying spell components clings to your nostrils as the fumes from\nrecently cast spells bring tears to your eyes.  The warped <p>walls<z>\nand cracked <p>ceiling<z> indicate that many powerful spells have been\ncast in this room.  An aura of power tinged with death pervades this\nchamber.  A jet black door to the south leads back into the hall.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,8,120,0,'',NULL),
(26681,77,-20,3,'<R>Logrus Intelligence Center<1>','  This is the main headquarters for Logrus Intelligence.  Regular <g>updates<z>\nand <g>reports<z> are examined by trained agents of Logrus and the files are\nkept in the compound\'s archives.  This center also handles internal matters\nsuch as dissidents, traitors, and rebellions.  Though the clerics of Talana\nhelp enforce the laws set down by the Cult, it is Logrus Intelligence that\nperforms most of the covert operations.  Legendary in this center are the\nShadow Walkers.  The Shadow Walkers are an elite squad of Cult assassins\nand dark rangers skilled in the art of spycraft.  This room seems to be in\nconstant use.  A jet black door to the north leads back out into the hall.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26682,78,-18,3,'<B>Dark Lab<1>','  This shadowy lab is used by the Cult\'s mages and clerics to help create\nuseful potions and salves.  The smell of bubbling concoctions fills this\nchamber.  Though many of these exotic mixtures are stored here for use by\nthe Cult, many go to the shops of Logrus to help raise money for the Cult\nand for the betterment of the city.  A jet black door to the south leads\nback into the hall.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26683,79,-19,3,'<R>War Room<1>','  This conference room serves as the meeting place for Logrus\'s top\nofficials in times of crisis.  In times of peace this room also serves\nas the staging ground for the planning of covert operations, trade\nmissions, and other missions of faith.  A complex <g>diagram<z> and\na beautifully crafted <c>map<z> take up a large portion of the walls.\nA jet black door to the west leads back out into the hall.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26684,78,-20,3,'<C>Viewing Chamber<1>','  This special section of the Logrus Intelligence Center is used to\nmagically spy on the realm to ensure the loyalty of its followers and to\nkeep a watchful eye on their sworn enemies the Galekians.  The light is\nthis room is dimmer to allow for clear observations from the crystal ball\nand to help focus the mages who come here to scry.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(26685,76,-19,4,'<B>Black Marble Hallway<1>','  A long black marble hallway stretches out before you.  Specially\nengineered illusions make the floor appear to flow like a long dark\nriver.  Energy throbs from beneath the floor causing a steady ordered\nrhythm.  Elaborate <B>murals<1> adorn the sides of the walls teaching of\nthe Cult\'s history.  A mysterious aura can be felt to the east yet not\na whisper can be heard in that direction.  A beautiful black marble\nstaircase leads up to the top level of the compound and back down to the\nlower levels.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26686,77,-19,4,'<G>Shrine Entrance<1>','  A feeling of solemnity fills you as you take in the silent beauty of\nthis shrine dedicated to the memory of Logrus and honoring the might of\nthe Cult\'s deities.  A <Y>plaque<z> along the wall greets all those\nwishing to enter the Shrine of Logrus.\n',148,173544,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26687,77,-18,4,'Bathing Chamber','  The bathing chamber is a very large pool of cool clear water.  The water\nis constantly being emptied and refilled by a series of nozzles and drains\nhidden beneath the pool\'s surface.  The first step in the cleansing ritual\nis the washing of the body.  When properly cleaned the faithful continue on\nto the chamber to the east.\n',148,173544,28,0,0,0,0,0,20,120,0,'',NULL),
(26688,77,-20,4,'Bathing Chamber','  The bathing chamber is a very large pool of cool clear water.  The water\nis constantly being emptied and refilled by a series of nozzles and drains\nhidden beneath the pool\'s surface.  The first step in the cleansing ritual\nis the washing of the body.  When properly cleaned the faithful continue\non to the chamber to the east.\n',148,173544,28,0,0,0,0,0,20,120,0,'',NULL),
(26689,78,-18,4,'<B>Meditation Chamber<1>','  This chamber is deathly quiet and specially laid enchantments seem to\nwipe your mind of extraneous thoughts aiding in meditation and the\nachievement of focus.  When focus has been achieved, the faithful proceed\nto the final cleansing chamber to the south.\n',148,140776,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26690,78,-20,4,'<B>Meditation Chamber<1>','  This chamber is deathly quiet and specially laid enchantments seem\nto wipe your mind of extraneous thoughts aiding in meditation and the\nachievement of focus.  When focus has been achieved, the faithful proceed\nto the final cleansing chamber to the north.\n',148,173544,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26691,78,-19,4,'<G>Purification Chamber<1>','  This chamber glows with an almost <Y>divine light<1>.  Here the\nfaithful commune with the deities of Logrus and ask for their favor\nbefore continuing on to the east to behold the reliquary of Logrus.\n',148,173544,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26692,79,-19,4,'<Y>Radiating Chapel<1>','  The radiating chapel of this shrine houses the reliquary of Logrus.\nThough his body was never recovered, it is said that members of the Cult\nlater recovered the garments that Logrus wore to his final confrontation\nwith Galek Brightmoon.  It is said that the reliquary houses this holiest\nCult artifact.  A sense of strength and power fills this room and seems\nmagnified by the reliquary of Logrus.\n',148,173544,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(26693,76,-19,5,'<B>Black Marble Hallway<1>','  A long black marble hallway stretches out before you.  Specially\nengineered illusions make the floor appear to flow like a long dark\nriver.  Energy throbs from beneath the floor causing a steady ordered\nrhythm.  Elaborate <B>murals<1> adorn the sides of the walls teaching of\nthe Cult\'s history.  To the east you see a wide open chamber.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26694,77,-19,5,'<B>Receiving Chamber<1>','  All those wishing an audience with the Grandmaster of Logrus make\nappointments here with the receptionist.  Those invited to meet the\nGrandmaster await him at his leisure within this room.  Judging by the\nsmall amount of paperwork cluttering the room, the Grandmaster must not\ntake too kindly to being bothered with trifles.  The room itself seems\nto have a Gothic design with imposing statues embedded in the walls giving\nthe place a mysterious atmosphere.  Black diamond doors to the east and\nsouth add an exotic touch to the room.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(26695,77,-20,5,'<B>Judgment Chamber<z>','  This austere chamber is the forum in judging major crimes against the\nCult of Logrus.  It is the duty of a cleric of Talana to preside over\nsuch matters.  Cult justice is swift and harsh, for the Cult has no time\nfor criminals or traitors.  If found guilty, the judge will carry out the\nexecution immediately.  A black diamond door to the north gleams ominously\nin this chamber.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26696,78,-19,5,'<B>Audience Chamber<1>','  This brightly lit chamber is heavily decorated and provides a sharp\ncontrast to the rest of the compound.  Following the dictates of the\nWay of Logrus, this chamber\'s beauty reflects the power of its master.\nThis lavish room is where the Grandmaster of Logrus grants audience to\nhis followers and visitors of state.  A great ominous power fills this\nchamber making all else seem small and insignificant.  Screams can be\nheard to the south.  Black diamond doors to the north and south add to\nthe magnificence of this chamber.\n',148,139625,21,0,0,0,0,0,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(26697,77,-18,5,'<G>Induction Chamber<1>','  This secret chamber is the sacred site for the induction of new\nCult members.  The spirits of great leaders and visionaries reside\nwithin these walls.  The induction ceremony is the first step in a\nlong journey to enlightenment.  One of the panels along the southern\nwall appears oddly placed.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,6,100,0,'',NULL),
(26698,78,-18,5,'Grandmaster\'s Bedchambers','  This lavish bedroom is the private chambers of the Grandmaster.  Like\nthe audience chamber, this room is rich in decorations.  The black marble\nwalls in this chamber are magnificent.  Scented draperies and foreign rugs\ngive the chamber an exotic atmosphere.  This beautifully crafted illusion\nhides a deadly reality.  This room screams in agony from the countless\nmurders and interrogations that various grandmasters of the past have\nperformed to maintain their position within the Cult.  Countless military\nmaps are scattered about, providing the Grandmaster with tactical information.\nA black marble door to the south allows for privacy within the bedroom.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,8,120,0,'',NULL),
(26699,78,-20,5,'<R>Interrogation Room<1>','  Various <r>implements<z> of torture hang from the walls.  Trails of blood\ntravel down the sloping floor to drains conveniently placed at the far\nend.  The smell of death hangs all about this room and the very walls\nscream out in agony.  Though this room has often been referred to as\nthe interrogation room, reality shows it to be nothing more than a torture\nchamber.  A black diamond door to the north hides the carnage from those\nwho may be standing in the audience chamber.\n',148,139624,21,0,0,0,0,0,12,120,0,'',NULL),
(26700,0,0,0,'Versilard\'s Highway','  Constructed during the reign of Emperor Versilard during the Third Age, this\nancient highway was once the main route between Logrus and Amber over the\nSympathians, but as Grimhaven grew as the center of trade, fell into disuse. \nNow, it is little more than a rocky path displaying the effects of time and\nthe weather.  Somewhere south of here lies the town of Logrus, while north\nlies the Badlands and finally the pass through the mountains that rise\nmajestically to the west.  \n',197,131072,22,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(26701,0,0,0,'Versilard\'s Highway','  Constructed during the reign of Emperor Versilard during the Third Age, this\nancient highway was once the main route between Logrus and Amber over the\nSympathians, but as Grimhaven grew as the center of trade, fell into disuse. \nNow, it is little more than a rocky path displaying the effects of time and\nthe weather.  Somewhere south of here lies the town of Logrus, while north\nlies the Badlands and finally the pass through the mountains that rise\nmajestically to the west.  \n',197,131072,22,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(26702,0,0,0,'Versilard\'s Highway','  Constructed during the reign of Emperor Versilard during the Third Age, this\nancient highway was once the main route between Logrus and Amber over the\nSympathians, but as Grimhaven grew as the center of trade, fell into disuse. \nNow, it is little more than a rocky path displaying the effects of time and\nthe weather.  Somewhere south of here lies the town of Logrus, while north\nlies the Badlands and finally the pass through the mountains that rise\nmajestically to the west.  \n',197,131072,22,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
