(26707,0,0,0,'Versilard\'s Highway','  Constructed during the reign of Emperor Versilard during the Third Age, this\nancient highway was once the main route between Logrus and Amber over the\nSympathians, but as Grimhaven grew as the center of trade, fell into disuse. \nNow, it is little more than a rocky path displaying the effects of time and\nthe weather.  Somewhere south of here lies the town of Logrus, while north\nlies the Badlands and finally the pass through the mountains that rise\nmajestically to the west.  \n',197,131072,22,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
