(27123,-12,32,-1,'Shallow Grave','  The forest is held at bay by some unseen force.  Looking closer, you see that\nthe graveyard just stops all forms of life larger than a small shrub.  A\nshallow grave has been recently dug by someone.  The grave is around 4 feet\ndeep and you can see the dark black rich earth clearly.  A slow cool breeze\ncaresses your body.\n',166,131072,41,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27124,-17,31,-1,'Corner of a Desolate Graveyard','  The forest is held at bay by some unseen force.  Looking closer, you see that\nthe graveyard just stops all forms of life larger than a small shrub.  A\nwind eroded gravestone juts upwards from ground, an epitaph barely visible.\nThe forest seemingly has never been able to reclaim this land as only shrub\ngrass and weeds exist to the grave.\n',166,131072,41,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,4,'',NULL),
