(27130,-14,32,-2,'Crypt Sarcophagus','  A great sarcophagus is placed in the center of the room.  It is smooth on the\noutside with no visible markings.  In fact, there seems to be no visible seal\nto show where the lid even is.  To the left of the sarcophagus there is a small\nstatue.\n',166,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27131,-15,32,-2,'Crypt','  This room is completely empty.  Only a thick layer of dust covers the floor.\nMaybe in a time long past it was filled with opulent furniture and decorations\nbut only stale air greets you now.\n',166,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27132,-14,33,-2,'Crypt','With the exception of a stone staircase leading up, this room lacks decoration.  The path through the crypt leads \nto the west.\n',0,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27133,-15,33,-2,'Crypt','  This room is completely empty.  Only a thick layer of dust covers the floor.\nMaybe in a time long past it was filled with opulent furniture and decorations\nbut only stale air greets you now.\n',166,131080,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27134,-14,35,-2,'Grave','  The bottom of the grave is a bit dank and smells strongly of the earth.\nThe odd absence of bugs and earthworms, in the exposed ground, makes you wonder\nwhat is buried here.  A coffin awaits your attention.\n',166,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,4,'',NULL),
(27135,-13,35,-2,'Grave','  The bottom of the grave is a bit dank and smells strongly of the earth.\nThe odd absence of bugs and earthworms, in the exposed ground, makes you wonder\nwhat is buried here.  A coffin awaits your attention.\n',166,131080,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,4,'',NULL),
