(27270,0,0,0,'Rapids on the River Kranor','  You are at a parting of the waters on the River Kranor.  The flow is more\nrapid here than elsewhere on the river, and the river is shallow enough that\nsome rocks are exposed to create a minor rapids as the chilly waters pull from\nthe north toward the southeast and especially the southwest.  \n',204,139337,29,0,0,0,18,9,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27271,0,0,0,'Rapids on the River Kranor','  You are on the River Kranor.  The flow is more rapid here than elsewhere on\nthe river, and the river is shallow enough that some rocks are exposed to\ncreate a minor rapids as the chilly waters pull to the south.  \n',204,139337,29,0,0,0,18,2,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27272,0,0,0,'Rapids on the River Kranor','  You are on the River Kranor.  The flow is more rapid here than elsewhere on\nthe river, and the river is shallow enough that some rocks are exposed to\ncreate a minor rapids as the chilly waters pull to the south.  \n',204,139337,29,0,0,0,18,2,0,100,0,'',NULL),
