(27277,0,0,0,'Rapids on the River Kranor','  You are at a merging of waters on the River Kranor.  The flow is more rapid\nhere than elsewhere on the river, and the river is shallow enough that some\nrocks are exposed to create a minor rapids as the chilly waters pull from the\nnortheast and northwest toward the south.  \n',204,139337,29,0,0,0,18,2,0,100,0,'',NULL),
