(27551,0,0,0,'A White Silt Beach','  Beautiful, soft white sands stretch to the south and east on the edge of a\ncrystal clear turquoise-watered cove.  Bordering the beach to the north and\nwest is a dense, verdant rain forest.  You see large insects crawling in the\nsilt near the forest line, and you hear hollers and chatter from a multitude\nof animals from the trees above.  In the middle of the cove, to the east, is a\nsmall islet.\n',168,131072,54,200,27551,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27552,0,0,0,'A White Silt Beach','  Beautiful, soft white sands stretch to the north and west on the edge of a\ncrystal clear turquoise-watered cove.  Bordering the beach to the northwest is\na dense, verdant rain forest.  You see large insects crawling in the silt near\nthe forest line, and you hear hollers and chatter from a multitude of animals\nfrom the trees above.  In the middle of the cove, to the east, is a small\nislet.\n',168,131072,54,200,27552,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27553,0,0,0,'Shallows in a Cove','  This is the western part of a cove sheltered by a lush jungle-covered\nisland.  A beautiful white beach is to the west, and you can see an\nislet in the center of the cove to the southeast.\n',168,131072,51,0,0,0,100,3,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27554,0,0,0,'An Island Cove','  Surrounding you on all sides of the cove is beach, and then a dense green\nrain forest.  The mouth of the cove, and beyond it the vast fog-covered ocean,\nis off to the east.  You are able to see down to the bottom of this shallow\narea through crystal clear turquoise water, all the way to a white silt floor.\nA cool breeze arrives from the direction of the ocean.  To the southeast\nis a small islet in the center of the cove.\n',168,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27555,0,0,0,'An Island Cove','  Surrounding you on all sides of the cove is beach, and then a dense green\nrain forest.  The mouth of the cove, and beyond it the vast fog-covered ocean,\nis off to the east.  You are able to see down to the bottom of this shallow\narea through crystal clear turquoise water, all the way to a white silt floor.\nA cool breeze arrives from the direction of the ocean.  To the south\nis a small islet in the center of the cove.\n',168,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
