(27558,0,0,0,'An Island Cove','  On all sides of the cove to the west is beach, and then a dense green\nrain forest.  You are in the mouth of the cove, and a vast fog-covered ocean\nstretches out to the east.  You are able to see down to the bottom of this\nshallow area through crystal clear turquoise water, all the way to a white\nsilt floor.  A cool breeze arrives from the direction of the ocean.  To the\nsouthwest is a small islet in the center of the cove, and another tiny\nislet lies to the northeast.\n',168,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27559,0,0,0,'An Island Cove','  On all sides of the cove to the west is beach, and then a dense green\nrain forest.  You are in the mouth of the cove, and a vast fog-covered ocean\nstretches out to the east.  You are able to see down to the bottom of this\nshallow area through crystal clear turquoise water, all the way to a white\nsilt floor.  A cool breeze arrives from the direction of the ocean.  To the\nsouthwest is a small islet in the center of the cove, and another tiny\nislet lies to the northeast.\n',168,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27560,0,0,0,'East of an Island Cove','  Just to the west is a beautiful turquoise-watered cove surrounded by\na dense jungled island.  To the north sits a small islet, battered by\nthe waves of the fog-blanketed ocean in which you are situated,\nand which stretches out to the east.\n',168,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27561,0,0,0,'<D>A Triad of Stones<z>','  This is a clearing on the west coast of an island covered in rain forest.\nTo the east is the dense green forest; you see insects crawling around\nthe edge of the clearing and hear hollers of animals from within the thick\nforest.  Occasionally you hear something thrashing in the brush near the\nedge of the clearing.  Large waves crash against the rocky coast to the\nwest, shoved against the island by the fog-covered ocean which spreads out\nto the horizon.  In the center of the clearing stand three massive grey\nstones set in a circle.  The stones are roughly rectangular, with\nsmoothed and weathered edges.  Grasses that cover most of the clearing\nturn to plain dirt in the middle of the triad of standing stones.\n',168,163844,44,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27562,0,0,0,'A Rain Forest','  You are in the depths of a rain forest -- you cannot tell exactly how\nfar in you are due to the amazing density of the foliage.  The leaves\nare so thick that even in the height of the afternoon no light is able\nto penetrate through the trees to the ground.  All about you are twisted\nvines and sounds of creatures walking, climbing, and thrashing about the\nbrush.  The humid air sticks to you and seems to suffocate you.  Sweat\nis barely permitted to escape your pores to cool your body.\n',168,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
