(27568,0,0,0,'Shallows in a Cove','  This is the western part of a cove sheltered by a lush jungle-covered\nisland.  A beautiful white beach is to the northwest, and you can see an\nislet in the center of the cove to the east.\n',168,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27569,0,0,0,'An Island Cove','  Surrounding you on all sides of the cove is beach, and then a dense green\nrain forest.  The mouth of the cove, and beyond it the vast fog-covered ocean,\nis off to the east.  You are able to see down to the bottom of this shallow\narea through crystal clear turquoise water, all the way to a white silt floor.\nA cool breeze arrives from the direction of the ocean.  Directly to the\neast is a small islet in the center of the cove.\n',168,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27570,0,0,0,'An Engraved Stone Portal','  You stand on a jungle-covered islet in the center of a cove.  Surrounding\nthe cove is more of the dense foliage that covers this islet.  To the east\nyou can see the interface between the cove and the vast fog-covered ocean\nbeyond.  The surface of the islet is a dark, jagged rock and it is blanketed\nin grasses and weeds.  Several trees grow from the fertile underbrush.  The\nislet extends east and south, and on all other sides are the clear waters\nof the cove.\n',168,131072,59,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27571,0,0,0,'An Islet in a Cove','  You stand on a jungle-covered islet in the center of a cove.  Surrounding\nthe cove is more of the dense foliage that covers this islet.  To the east\nyou can see the interface between the cove and the vast fog-covered ocean\nbeyond.  The surface of the islet is a dark, jagged rock and it is blanketed\nin grasses and weeds.  Several trees grow from the fertile underbrush.  The\nislet extends west, and on all other sides are the clear waters of the cove.\n',168,131072,59,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27572,0,0,0,'An Island Cove','  Surrounding you on all sides of the cove is beach, and then a dense\ngreen rain forest.  The mouth of the cove, and beyond it the vast fog-covered\nocean, is off to the east.  You are able to see down to the bottom of this\nshallow area through crystal clear turquoise water, all the way to a white\nsilt floor.  A cool breeze arrives from the direction of the ocean.  Directly\nto the west is a small islet in the center of the cove.\n',168,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
