(27574,0,0,0,'An Island Cove','  On all sides of the cove to the west is beach, and then a dense green\nrain forest.  You are in the mouth of the cove, and a vast fog-covered ocean\nstretches out to the east.  You are able to see down to the bottom of this\nshallow area through crystal clear turquoise water, all the way to a\nwhitesilt floor.  A cool breeze arrives from the direction of the ocean.\nTo the west is a small islet in the center of the cove, and another tiny\nislet lies to the northeast.\n',168,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27575,0,0,0,'West Coast of an Island','  A dense rain forest stretches east of here, and a vast fog-covered\nocean extends to the west.  The forest is thick with leaves,\ntrunks, and vines, and the air is dense with animal sounds.  The waves\nof the ocean to the west occasionally smash against the rocky cliffs of\nthe western coast of this island, and marine birds are forced to\ntemporarily flee their rocky perches or be crushed against the jagged\nstones of the coast.  You are glad to be above the dangerous looking\nwaters, although the rain forest does not seem much more inviting.  The\nforest opens up a little to the north.\n',168,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27576,0,0,0,'A Rain Forest','  You are in the depths of a rain forest -- you cannot tell exactly how\nfar in you are due to the amazing density of the foliage.  The leaves\nare so thick that even in the height of the afternoon no light is able\nto penetrate through the trees to the ground.  All about you are twisted\nvines and sounds of creatures walking, climbing, and thrashing about the\nbrush.  The humid air sticks to you and seems to suffocate you.  Sweat\nis barely permitted to escape your pores to cool your body.\n',168,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27577,0,0,0,'Edge of a Cliff in a Rain Forest','  A dense rain forest stretches out to the north and south.  To the\neast the moist earth drops away sharply and allows you to see over the\ntop of the forest and into a cove at the center of the island.  The cliff\nto the east seems too precarious to navigate despite the vines and roots\ngrowing out of it.  The forest is thick with leaves, trunks, and vines,\nand the air is dense with animal sounds.\n',168,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27578,0,0,0,'Base of a Cliff in a Rain Forest','  To the west a tall, sharp cliff rises menacingly out of the moist\nearth of a dense green rain forest.  The forest itself stretches in all\nother directions, and its suprising density makes it impossible to see far.\nLeaves and vines twist around you and seem to grab at you like soft hands.\nFrom within the forest come occasional hollers and thrashing of the\nunderbrush.  A swarm of gnats buzzes around your head, and a bead of sweat\ndrips from your eyelid.  During the day, the canopy of leaves provides a\nwelcome respite from the intense sun, though it is impossible to evade the\nsweltering heat entirely.\n',168,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27579,0,0,0,'A Rain Forest','  You are in the depths of a rain forest -- you cannot tell exactly how\nfar in you are due to the amazing density of the foliage.  The leaves\nare so thick that even in the height of the afternoon no light is able\nto penetrate through the trees to the ground.  All about you are twisted\nvines and sounds of creatures walking, climbing, and thrashing about the\nbrush.  The humid air sticks to you and seems to suffocate you.  Sweat\nis barely permitted to escape your pores to cool your body.  You faintly\nhear a sound like waves crashing on a beach to the east.\n',168,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27580,0,0,0,'A White Silt Beach','  Beautiful, soft white sands stretch to the north and south on the edge of a\ncrystal clear turquoise-watered cove.  Bordering the beach to the west is a\ndense, verdant rain forest.  You see large insects crawling in the silt near\nthe forest line, and you hear hollers and chatter from a multitude of animals\nfrom the trees above.  In the middle of the cove, to the east, is a small\nislet.\n',168,131072,54,200,27580,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27581,0,0,0,'Shallows in a Cove','  This is the western part of a cove sheltered by a lush jungle-covered\nisland.  A beautiful white beach is to the west, and you can see an\nislet in the center of the cove to the east.\n',168,131072,51,0,0,0,100,3,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27582,0,0,0,'An Island Cove','  Surrounding you on all sides of the cove is beach, and then a dense green\nrain forest.  The mouth of the cove, and beyond it the vast fog-covered ocean,\nis off to the east.  You are able to see down to the bottom of this shallow area\nthrough crystal clear turquoise water, all the way to a white silt floor.\nA cool breeze arrives from the direction of the ocean.  Nearby to the\neast is a small islet in the center of the cove.\n',168,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27583,0,0,0,'An Island Cove','  Surrounding you on all sides of the cove is beach, and then a dense green\nrain forest.  The mouth of the cove, and beyond it the vast fog-covered ocean,\nis off to the east.  You are able to see down to the bottom of this shallow\narea through crystal clear turquoise water, all the way to a white silt\nfloor.  A cool breeze arrives from the direction of the ocean.  Directly\nto the east is a small islet in the center of the cove.\n',168,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27584,0,0,0,'An Islet in a Cove','  You stand on a jungle-covered islet in the center of a cove.  Surrounding\nthe cove is more of the dense foliage that covers this islet.  To the east\nyou can see the interface between the cove and the vast fog-covered ocean\nbeyond.  The surface of the islet is a dark, jagged rock and it is blanketed\nin grasses and weeds.  Several trees grow from the fertile underbrush.  The\nislet extends north, and on all other sides are the clear waters of the cove.\n',168,131072,59,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27585,0,0,0,'An Island Cove','  Surrounding you on all sides of the cove is beach, and then a dense\ngreen rain forest.  The mouth of the cove, and beyond it the vast fog-\ncovered ocean, is off to the northeast.  You are able to see down to the\nbottom of this shallow area through crystal clear turquoise water, all\nthe way to a white silt floor.  A cool breeze arrives from the direction\nof the ocean.  Directly to the north, west, and northwest is a small\nislet in the center of the cove.  Some bright green weeds grow among\nthe rocks along the side of the islet here.\n',168,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27586,0,0,0,'An Island Cove','  This is the eastern part of a cove, and the mouth is to the east.\nBeyond that, further east, is a great fog-covered ocean.  To the\nnorthwest is a small islet situated in the center of the cove.  To\nthe southeast is a patch of thin rain forest.  Surrounding the cove\non all sides is a soft beach, and beyond that a dense and imposing\nrain forest.\n',168,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27587,0,0,0,'An Island Cove','  This is the mouth of a cove, and further east is a great fog-covered\nocean.  To the northwest is a small islet situated in the center of the\ncove.  To the south is a patch of thin rain forest.  Surrounding the cove\non all sides is a soft beach, and beyond that a dense and imposing\nrain forest.\n',168,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27588,0,0,0,'An Island Cove','  This is the mouth of a cove, and to the east is a great fog-covered\nocean.  To the west is a small islet situated in the center of the cove.\nTo the southwest is a patch of thin rain forest.  Across the mouth of\nthe cove to the north you see another tiny islet.  Surrounding the cove\non all sides is a soft beach, and beyond that a dense and imposing\nrain forest.\n',168,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27589,0,0,0,'West Coast of an Island','  A dense rain forest stretches east of here, and a vast fog-covered\nocean extends to the west.  The forest is thick with leaves,\ntrunks, and vines, and the air is dense with animal sounds.  The waves\nof the ocean to the west occasionally smash against the rocky cliffs of\nthe western coast of this island, and marine birds are forced to\ntemporarily flee their rocky perches or be crushed against the jagged\nstones of the coast.  You are glad to be above the dangerous looking\nwaters, although the rain forest does not seem much more inviting.\n',168,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27590,0,0,0,'A Rain Forest','  You are in the depths of a rain forest -- you cannot tell exactly how\nfar in you are due to the amazing density of the foliage.  The leaves\nare so thick that even in the height of the afternoon no light is able\nto penetrate through the trees to the ground.  All about you are twisted\nvines and sounds of creatures walking, climbing, and thrashing about the\nbrush.  The humid air sticks to you and seems to suffocate you.  Sweat\nis barely permitted to escape your pores to cool your body.\n',168,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
