(27623,0,0,0,'A White Silt Beach','  Beautiful, soft white sands stretch to the north and south on the edge of a\ncrystal clear turquoise-watered cove.  Bordering the beach to the west is a\ndense, verdant rain forest.  You see large insects crawling in the silt near\nthe forest line, and you hear hollers and chatter from a multitude of animals\nfrom the trees above.  In the middle of the cove, to the northeast, is a small\nislet.\n',168,131072,54,200,27623,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27624,0,0,0,'Shallows in a Cove','  This is the southwest part of a cove sheltered by a lush jungle-covered\nisland.  A beautiful white beach is to the southwest, and you can see an\nislet in the center of the cove to the northeast.\n',168,131072,51,0,0,0,100,2,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27625,0,0,0,'Shallows in a Cove','  This is the south part of a cove sheltered by a lush jungle-covered\nisland.  A beautiful white beach is to the south, and you can see an\nislet in the center of the cove to the northeast.\n',168,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27626,0,0,0,'Shallows in a Cove','  This is the southern part of a cove sheltered by a lush jungle-covered\nisland.  A beautiful white beach is to the south, and you can see an\nislet in the center of the cove to the north.\n',168,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27627,0,0,0,'Shallows in a Cove','  This is the southern part of a cove sheltered by a lush jungle-covered\nisland.  A beautiful white beach is to the southeast, and you can see an\nislet in the center of the cove to the north.\n',168,131072,51,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27628,0,0,0,'A White Silt Beach','  Beautiful, soft white sands stretch to the south and east on the edge of a\ncrystal clear turquoise-watered cove.  Bordering the beach to the southeast is\na dense, verdant rain forest.  You see large insects crawling in the silt near\nthe forest line, and you hear hollers and chatter from a multitude of animals\nfrom the trees above.  In the middle of the cove, to the northwest, is a small\nislet.\n',168,131072,54,200,27628,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27629,0,0,0,'A White Silt Beach','  Beautiful, soft white sands stretch to the north and west on the edge of a\ncrystal clear turquoise-watered cove.  Bordering the beach to the southeast is\na dense, verdant rain forest.  You see large insects crawling in the silt near\nthe forest line, and you hear hollers and chatter from a multitude of animals\nfrom the trees above.  In the middle of the cove, to the northwest, is a small\nislet.\n',168,131072,54,200,27629,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27630,0,0,0,'East Coast of an Island','  A dense rain forest stretches south of here, and a vast fog-covered\nocean extends to the east.  The forest is thick with leaves,\ntrunks, and vines, and the air is dense with animal sounds.  The waves\nof the ocean to the east occasionally smash against the rocky cliffs of\nthe eastern coast of this island, and marine birds are forced to\ntemporarily flee their rocky perches or be crushed against the jagged\nstones of the coast.  You are glad to be above the dangerous looking\nwaters, although the rain forest does not seem much more inviting.\n',168,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27631,0,0,0,'<B>Pool<G> on the Southwest Coast of an Island<z>','  To the south and west stretches a fog-covered ocean, and waves crash against\nthe rocky cliffs of the coast, scattering perching marine birds on the rocks\nbelow.  Rain forest stretches in every direction east, and from this vantage\nyou can down over a lower area of forest to the east.  A sharp cliff drops\nto the east, leading a rush of cool water over its edge.  A pool near the\nedge of the cliff feeds the waterfall and looks to be a fresh source of\nwater.  Small animals occasionally approach the edge of the water to drink\nand clean themselves.\n',168,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27632,0,0,0,'Base of a <B>Waterfall<z> in a Rain Forest','  A pool has formed here at the base of a soothing rush of clear water\nthat falls in from the top of the cliff to the west.  The pool flows south\ntowards the coast of the small island on which you are situated.  To the\neast stretches a dense and active rain forest.  The cliff face continues\nsouth and northeast.\n',168,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27633,0,0,0,'A Rain Forest','  To the northwest you see a  sharp cliff rising menacingly out of the moist\nearth of a dense green rain forest.  The forest itself stretches in all\nother directions, and its suprising density makes it impossible to see far.\nLeaves and vines twist around you and seem to grab at you like soft hands.\nFrom within the forest come occasional hollers and thrashing of the\nunderbrush.  A swarm of gnats buzzes around your head, and a bead of sweat\ndrips from your eyelid.  During the day, the canopy of leaves provides a\nwelcome respite from the intense sun, though it is impossible to evade the\nsweltering heat entirely.  To the west you hear the sound of water splashing.\n',168,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27634,0,0,0,'A Rain Forest','  You are in the depths of a rain forest -- you cannot tell exactly how\nfar in you are due to the amazing density of the foliage.  The leaves\nare so thick that even in the height of the afternoon no light is able\nto penetrate through the trees to the ground.  All about you are twisted\nvines and sounds of creatures walking, climbing, and thrashing about the\nbrush.  The humid air sticks to you and seems to suffocate you.  Sweat\nis barely permitted to escape your pores to cool your body.\n',168,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
