(27640,0,0,0,'A White Silt Beach','  Beautiful, soft white sands stretch to the west and east on the edge of a\ncrystal clear turquoise-watered cove.  Bordering the beach to the south is a\ndense, verdant rain forest.  You see large insects crawling in the silt near\nthe forest line, and you hear hollers and chatter from a multitude of animals\nfrom the trees above.  In the middle of the cove, to the north, is a small\nislet.  To the east you can see a path running from the waters of the cove\ninto the rain forest south.\n',168,131072,54,200,27640,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27641,0,0,0,'A White Silt Trail on a Beach','  Beautiful, soft white sands stretch to the west and east on the edge of a\ncrystal clear turquoise-watered cove.  Bordering the beach to the south is a\ndense, verdant rain forest.  You see large insects crawling in the silt near\nthe forest line, and you hear hollers and chatter from a multitude of animals\nfrom the trees above.  In the middle of the cove, to the northeast, is a small\nislet.  A trail of footprints has been beaten into the sands here and runs\nsouth into the rain forest.\n',168,131072,59,200,27641,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27642,0,0,0,'A White Silt Beach','  Beautiful, soft white sands stretch to the north and west on the edge of a\ncrystal clear turquoise-watered cove.  Bordering the beach to the southeast is\na dense, verdant rain forest.  You see large insects crawling in the silt near\nthe forest line, and you hear hollers and chatter from a multitude of animals\nfrom the trees above.  In the middle of the cove, to the northwest, is a small\nislet.  To the west you can see a path running from the waters of the cove\ninto the rain forest south.\n',168,131072,54,200,27642,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
