(27645,0,0,0,'<B>Pool<G> on the Southwest Coast of an Island<z>','  You are at the base of a cliff in a dense rain forest, and a soft white\nmist has descended from the tops of the trees down to the ground level.  A\nsmall pool of clear water flows in from the north and then off the southern\ncoast of the island into the vast fog-covered ocean.  To the west a cliff\nrushes menacingly out of the soft ground.\n',168,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27646,0,0,0,'Southwest Coast of an Island','  A dense rain forest stretches northeast of here, and a fog-covered\nocean extends to the southwest.  The forest is thick with leaves,\ntrunks, and vines, and the air is dense with animal sounds.  The waves\nof the ocean to the southwest occasionally smash against the rocky\ncliffs of the southwestern coast of this island, and marine birds\nare forced to temporarily flee their rocky perches or be crushed against\nthe jagged stones of the coast.  You are glad to be above the dangerous\nlooking waters, although the rain forest does not seem much more inviting.\nThe forest opens up a little to the north.  To the west you hear the\nsound of rushing water.\n',168,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
