(27654,0,0,0,'A White Silt Trail in a Rain Forest','  Fine white sand trodden with many footprints makes an easy path\nleading north and south here.  Dense rain forest lines either side\nof the path to the west and east.  To the north you can hear the\nsound of waves crashing on a beach, and sounds of activity to the\nsouth.  Within the forest you hear an occasional holler from the\ntrees and thrashing in the brush.\n',168,131072,59,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
