(27664,0,0,0,'Small Village in a Rain Forest','  This is the edge of a small group of huts in the middle of a dense rain\nforest.  Huts spread out to the east and southeast, while to the west is\nthe imposing darkness of the forest.  You hear occasional hollers from\nthe trees and thrashing in the brush.  Near the center of the village,\nto the southeast, you see a thin tendril of smoke rising.\n',168,131072,43,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27665,0,0,0,'Small Village in a Rain Forest','  This is the edge of a small group of huts in the middle of a dense rain\nforest.  Huts spread out to the east and southeast, while to the north is\nthe imposing darkness of the forest.  You hear occasional hollers from\nthe trees and thrashing in the brush.  Near the center of the village,\nto the southeast, you see a thin tendril of smoke rising.\n',168,131072,43,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27666,0,0,0,'Small Village in a Rain Forest','  This is the edge of a small group of huts in the middle of a dense rain\nforest.  Huts spread out all to the south, while to the north is the\nimposing darkness of the forest.  You hear occasional hollers from\nthe trees and thrashing in the brush.  Near the center of the village,\nto the south, you see a thin tendril of smoke rising.  To the north you\nsee a silt-covered trail leading into the rain forest.\n',168,131072,43,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27667,0,0,0,'Small Village in a Rain Forest','  This is the edge of a small group of huts in the middle of a dense rain\nforest.  Huts spread out to the south and west, while to the northeast is\nthe imposing darkness of the forest.  You hear occasional hollers from\nthe trees and thrashing in the brush.  Near the center of the village,\nto the southwest, you see a thin tendril of smoke rising.\n',168,131072,43,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27668,0,0,0,'A Rain Forest','  You are in the depths of a rain forest -- you cannot tell exactly how\nfar in you are due to the amazing density of the foliage.  The leaves\nare so thick that even in the height of the afternoon no light is able\nto penetrate through the trees to the ground.  All about you are twisted\nvines and sounds of creatures walking, climbing, and thrashing about the\nbrush.  The humid air sticks to you and seems to suffocate you.  Sweat\nis barely permitted to escape your pores to cool your body.  You hear\nsounds of activity to the south and west.\n',168,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27669,0,0,0,'East Coast of an Island','  A dense rain forest stretches south of here, and a fog-covered ocean\nextends to the east.  The forest is thick with leaves, trunks, and vines,\nand the air is dense with animal sounds.  The waves of the ocean to the\neast occasionally smash against the rocky cliffs of the eastern coast\nof this island, and marine birds are forced to temporarily flee their\nrocky perches or be crushed against the jagged stones of the coast.\nYou are glad to be above the dangerous looking waters, although the\nrain forest does not seem much more inviting.  You hear sounds of\nactivity to the south and southwest.\n',168,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27670,0,0,0,'Southwest Coast of an Island','  A dense rain forest stretches north of here, and a fog-covered\nocean extends to the horizon to the southwest.  The forest is thick\nwith leaves, trunks, and vines, and the air is dense with animal sounds.\nThe waves of the ocean to the south occasionally smash against the\nrocky cliffs of the southwestern coast of this island, and marine birds\nare forced to temporarily flee their rocky perches or be crushed against\nthe jagged stones of the coast.  You are glad to be above the dangerous\nlooking waters, although the rain forest does not seem much more inviting.\n',168,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27671,0,0,0,'Southwest Coast of an Island','  A dense rain forest stretches north of here, and a fog-covered\nocean extends to the horizon to the southwest.  The forest is thick\nwith leaves, trunks, and vines, and the air is dense with animal sounds.\nThe waves of the ocean to the south occasionally smash against the\nrocky cliffs of the southwestern coast of this island, and marine birds\nare forced to temporarily flee their rocky perches or be crushed against\nthe jagged stones of the coast.  You are glad to be above the dangerous\nlooking waters, although the rain forest does not seem much more inviting.\n',168,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27672,0,0,0,'Southwest Coast of an Island','  A dense rain forest stretches north of here, and a fog-covered\nocean extends to the horizon to the southwest.  The forest is thick\nwith leaves, trunks, and vines, and the air is dense with animal sounds.\nThe waves of the ocean to the south occasionally smash against the\nrocky cliffs of the southwestern coast of this island, and marine birds\nare forced to temporarily flee their rocky perches or be crushed against\nthe jagged stones of the coast.  You are glad to be above the dangerous\nlooking waters, although the rain forest does not seem much more inviting.\nYou hear the sounds of activity to the northeast.\n',168,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27673,0,0,0,'Southwest Coast of an Island','  A dense rain forest stretches north of here, and a fog-covered\nocean extends to the horizon to the southwest.  The forest is thick\nwith leaves, trunks, and vines, and the air is dense with animal sounds.\nThe waves of the ocean to the southwest occasionally smash against the\nrocky cliffs of the southwestern coast of this island, and marine birds\nare forced to temporarily flee their rocky perches or be crushed against\nthe jagged stones of the coast.  You are glad to be above the dangerous\nlooking waters, although the rain forest does not seem much more\ninviting.  You hear the sounds of activity to the north and east.\n',168,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27674,0,0,0,'Small Village in a Rain Forest','  This is the edge of a small group of huts in the middle of a dense rain\nforest.  Huts spread out to the south and east, while to the west is\nthe imposing darkness of the forest.  You hear occasional hollers from\nthe trees and thrashing in the brush.  Near the center of the village,\nto the east, you see a thin tendril of smoke rising.\n',168,131072,43,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27675,0,0,0,'Small Village in a Rain Forest','  This is the center of a small group of huts in the middle of a dense rain\nforest.  The area here is mostly open and seems to be where most of the\nvillagers congregate.\n',168,131072,43,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27676,0,0,0,'Small Village in a Rain Forest','  This is the edge of a small group of huts in the middle of a dense rain\nforest.  Huts spread out to the south and west, while to the northeast is\nthe imposing darkness of the forest.  You hear occasional hollers from\nthe trees and thrashing in the brush.  Near the center of the village,\nto the west, you see a thin tendril of smoke rising.\n',168,131072,43,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27677,0,0,0,'Small Village in a Rain Forest','  This is the edge of a small group of huts in the middle of a dense rain\nforest.  Huts spread out to the south and west, while to the north is\nthe imposing darkness of the forest.  You hear occasional hollers from\nthe trees and thrashing in the brush.  Near the center of the village,\nto the west, you see a thin tendril of smoke rising.\n',168,131072,43,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27678,0,0,0,'Small Village on the East Coast of an Island','  This is the edge of a small group of huts in the middle of a dense rain\nforest.  Huts spread out to the south and west, while to the north is\nthe imposing darkness of the forest.  To the east, waves from a fog-covered\nocean crash against the rocky coast.  You hear occasional hollers from\nthe trees and thrashing in the brush.  Near the center of the village,\nto the west, you see a thin tendril of smoke rising.\n',168,131072,43,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27679,0,0,0,'South Coast of an Island','  A dense rain forest stretches north of here, and a fog-covered\nocean extends to the horizon to the southwest.  The forest is thick\nwith leaves, trunks, and vines, and the air is dense with animal sounds.\nThe waves of the ocean to the south occasionally smash against the\nrocky cliffs of the south coast of this island, and marine birds are\nforced to temporarily flee their rocky perches or be crushed against\nthe jagged stones of the coast.  You are glad to be above the dangerous\nlooking waters, although the rain forest does not seem much more\ninviting.  You hear the sounds of activity to the northeast and east.\n',168,131072,46,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27680,0,0,0,'Small Village on the South Coast of an Island','  This is the edge of a small group of huts in the middle of a dense rain\nforest.  Huts spread out to the north and east, while to the west is\nthe imposing darkness of the forest.  To the south, powerful ocean waves\ncrash against the rocky coast.  You hear occasional hollers from\nthe trees and thrashing in the brush.  Near the center of the village,\nto the northeast, you see a thin tendril of smoke rising.\n',168,131072,43,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27681,0,0,0,'Small Village on the South Coast of an Island','  This is the edge of a small group of huts in the middle of a dense rain\nforest.  Huts spread out to the north and east, while to the south powerful\nocean waves crash against the rocky coast.  Near the center of the village,\nto the north, you see a thin tendril of smoke rising.\n',168,131072,43,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27682,0,0,0,'Small Village on the South Coast of an Island','  This is the edge of a small group of huts in the middle of a dense rain\nforest.  Huts spread out to the north and east, while to the south powerful\nocean waves crash against the rocky coast.  Near the center of the village,\nto the northwest, you see a thin tendril of smoke rising.\n',168,131072,43,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27683,0,0,0,'Small Village on the South Coast of an Island','  This is the edge of a small group of huts in the middle of a dense rain\nforest.  Huts spread out to the north and east, while to the south powerful\nocean waves crash against the rocky coast.  Near the center of the village,\nto the northwest, you see a thin tendril of smoke rising.\n',168,131072,43,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27684,0,0,0,'Small Village on the Southeast Coast of an Island','  This is the edge of a small group of huts in the middle of an island rain\nforest.  This is the corner of the small village, where powerful ocean waves\ncrash against the rocky coast.  The group of houses lie to the north and west,\nand you see a thin tendril of smoke rising from near the center of the\nvillage to the northwest.\n',168,131072,43,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27685,0,0,0,'North End of a Damp Cave','  This cave has limestone walls, slick with moisture and cool water that\ndrips from the ceiling.  The top of the cave is about three meters above\nthe ground, and small stalactites are beginning to form there.  You are\ncareful to watch your footing on the slippery floor, and to avoid any\npuddles of water that have formed there.\n',168,131080,56,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27686,0,0,0,'North End of a Damp Cave','  This cave has limestone walls, slick with moisture and cool water that\ndrips from the ceiling.  The top of the cave is about three meters above\nthe ground, and small stalactites are beginning to form there.  You are\ncareful to watch your footing on the slippery floor, and to avoid any\npuddles of water that have formed there.\n',168,131080,56,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27687,0,0,0,'West Wall of a Damp Cave','  This cave has limestone walls, slick with moisture and cool water that\ndrips from the ceiling.  The top of the cave is about three meters above\nthe ground, and small stalactites are beginning to form there.  You are\ncareful to watch your footing on the slippery floor, and to avoid any\npuddles of water that have formed there.\n',168,131080,56,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27688,0,0,0,'Just Inside a Damp Cave','  This cave has limestone walls, slick with moisture and cool water that\ndrips from the ceiling.  The top of the cave is about three meters above\nthe ground, and small stalactites are beginning to form there.  You are\ncareful to watch your footing on the slippery floor, and to avoid any\npuddles of water that have formed there.  To the east, some moss grows\naround an opening that leads out into a rain forest.\n',168,131080,56,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27689,0,0,0,'West Wall of a Damp Cave','  This cave has limestone walls, slick with moisture and cool water that\ndrips from the ceiling.  The top of the cave is about three meters above\nthe ground, and small stalactites are beginning to form there.  You are\ncareful to watch your footing on the slippery floor, and to avoid any\npuddles of water that have formed there.\n',168,131080,56,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27690,0,0,0,'East Wall of a Damp Cave','  This cave has limestone walls, slick with moisture and cool water that\ndrips from the ceiling.  The top of the cave is about three meters above\nthe ground, and small stalactites are beginning to form there.  You are\ncareful to watch your footing on the slippery floor, and to avoid any\npuddles of water that have formed there.\n',168,131080,56,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27691,0,0,0,'West Wall of a Damp Cave','  This cave has limestone walls, slick with moisture and cool water that\ndrips from the ceiling.  The top of the cave is about three meters above\nthe ground, and small stalactites are beginning to form there.  You are\ncareful to watch your footing on the slippery floor, and to avoid any\npuddles of water that have formed there.\n',168,131080,56,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27692,0,0,0,'Southeast Wall of a Damp Cave','  This cave has limestone walls, slick with moisture and cool water that\ndrips from the ceiling.  The top of the cave is about three meters above\nthe ground, and small stalactites are beginning to form there.  You are\ncareful to watch your footing on the slippery floor, and to avoid any\npuddles of water that have formed there.\n',168,131080,56,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27693,0,0,0,'South End of a Damp Cave','  This cave has limestone walls, slick with moisture and cool water that\ndrips from the ceiling.  The top of the cave is about three meters above\nthe ground, and small stalactites are beginning to form there.  You are\ncareful to watch your footing on the slippery floor, and to avoid any\npuddles of water that have formed there.  The east wall is not as\nsmooth as the other walls, and almost seems broken up.\n',168,131080,56,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27694,0,0,0,'A Damp Rocky Cave','  There is a perpetual dripping noise as drops of water fall from the\nceiling into what seems to be a fairly <b>deep pool<z> in the center of the\nroom.  The walls are smooth limestone, and seem to be naturally carved\nfrom the surroundings by years of erosion.  You can faintly see some\nstalactites on the ceiling above.  On the west side of the room you\nsee a pile of rocks against the wall.\n',168,131080,56,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27695,0,0,0,'A Small Hut','  This is one of the messiest abodes that you have seen.  Broken clay pots and\ncooking utensils are scattered on the dirt floor along with woven mats made of\nleaves and wood strips.  The thatched roof has several holes in it, and it\nseems that it would be easy for rain to leak through.  However, it does provide\nsome protection from the elements.\n',168,131081,55,0,0,0,0,0,6,100,0,'',NULL),
(27696,0,0,0,'A Small Hut','  A thatched roof protects you from the elements outside.  The hut has thin\nwood walls and a plain dirt floor covered with mats made of leaves and wood\nstrips.\n',168,131081,55,0,0,0,0,0,6,100,0,'',NULL),
(27697,0,0,0,'A Small Hut','  This is a simple abode made of wood and leaves strapped together.  The\nthatched roof is ample protection from the elements outside.  Dirty mats made\nof leaves and wood strips lie on the floor so that one does not have to sleep\nor sit directly on the dirt floor.\n',168,131081,55,0,0,0,0,0,6,100,0,'',NULL),
(27698,0,0,0,'A Small Hut','  This is a simple abode made of wood and leaves strapped together.  The\nthatched roof is ample protection from the elements outside.  Dirty mats made\nof leaves and wood strips lie on the floor so that one does not have to sleep\nor sit directly on the dirt floor.\n',168,131081,55,0,0,0,0,0,6,100,0,'',NULL),
(27699,0,0,0,'A Small Hut','  Empty clay pots with leaves in them have been tossed in the corner.  Mats\nwoven from leaves and wood strips are covered with some dark, fresh leaves for\ncomfort.  During the day, sunlight can filter through the cracks in the\nthatched roof, and during a rainstorm water leaks through.\n',168,131081,55,0,0,0,0,0,6,100,0,'',NULL),
(27700,0,0,0,'A Small Hut','  Small carved statuettes lie in neat piles on the floor, carved into shapes of\njungle animals such as panthers and birds, as well as mightier creatures such\nas dragons and sea serpents.  The walls of the hut are made of thin wood, and\nthe floor is the soft, cool dirt of the rain forest outside.\n',168,131081,55,0,0,0,0,0,6,100,0,'',NULL),
(27701,0,0,0,'A Small Hut','  Empty clay pots with leaves in them have been tossed in the corner.  Mats\nwoven from leaves and wood strips are covered with some dark, fresh leaves for\ncomfort.  During the day, sunlight can filter through the cracks in the\nthatched roof, and during a rainstorm water leaks through.\n',168,131081,55,0,0,0,0,0,6,100,0,'',NULL),
(27702,0,0,0,'A Small Hut','  The thin wooden walls of this hut support several tapestries with harsh, dark\nimages painted on them.  The images seem to be of disturbing animal spirits and\nare written with a thick brush that makes them appear distorted and unfocused.\nOrnaments made from dried organic matter litter the floor and walls.\n',168,131081,55,0,0,0,0,0,6,100,0,'',NULL),
(27703,0,0,0,'A Small Hut','  The smell of rotting fruits meets your nose here.  A pile of dried and\nhalf-rotted organics lies strewn on the dirt floor carelessly.  There is also a\nsmell of fish, and you can see some piscine bones on the ground.\n',168,131081,55,0,0,0,0,0,6,100,0,'',NULL),
(27704,0,0,0,'A Small Hut','  Empty clay pots with leaves in them have been tossed in the corner.  Mats\nwoven from leaves and wood strips are covered with some dark, fresh leaves for\ncomfort.  During the day, sunlight can filter through the cracks in the\nthatched roof, and during a rainstorm water leaks through.\n',168,131081,55,0,0,0,0,0,6,100,0,'',NULL),
(27705,0,0,0,'A Small Hut','  A set of odd, blocky runes are drawn into the ground here, surrounded by a\ncircle of small rocks.  A small pile of white silt lies off to the side.  An\nassortment of dyes and brushes are also strewn about on the floor, and you can\nsee that these tools were used to paint some letters on the thin wooden walls\nof the hut.\n',168,131081,55,0,0,0,0,0,6,100,0,'',NULL),
(27706,0,0,0,'A Small Hut','  This is a very plain room with a dirt floor and thin wooden walls.  Small\nmats lie on the ground so that one might sit or sleep off of the cool dirt of\nthe jungle outside.\n',168,131081,55,0,0,0,0,0,6,100,0,'',NULL),
(27707,0,0,0,'A Small Hut','  This is a simple abode made of wood and leaves strapped together.  The\nthatched roof is ample protection from the elements outside.  Dirty mats made\nof leaves and wood strips lie on the floor so that one does not have to sleep\nor sit directly on the dirt floor.\n',168,131081,55,0,0,0,0,0,6,100,0,'',NULL),
(27708,0,0,0,'A Small Hut','  The dirt ground here has several sets of footprints tread into it.  The\nwalls are made of simple wooden strips and the roof is a weave of long,\ndried leaves.  The air is humid and you cannot evade the swarms of insects\nthat hover around.\n',168,131081,55,0,0,0,0,0,6,100,0,'',NULL),
(27709,0,0,0,'A Small Hut','  This is one of the most disorganized homes that you have ever seen.  Rocks,\ntwigs, glass vials, sheets of parchment, feathers, bones, and other assorted\nmess lies all over.  From outside you can occasionally hear a large roar as\nwaves crash upon a nearby rock or cliff face.  The scent of salt water is in\nthe air.\n',168,131081,55,300,27709,0,0,0,10,100,0,'',NULL),
(27715,0,0,0,'A Cool Pool','  You are submerged in a cool, dark pool of water.  The liquid feels soothing\npressed against your skin.  The pool seems to be contained in some sort of\nnatural cave -- the walls and smooth floor appear to be limestone.  The\nsilvery reflection of the surface of the pond is just above you, or you\ncan follow under water to the north where a small opening in the rock leads\nslightly further down.\n',168,131080,30,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27716,0,0,0,'A Submerged Tunnel','  You are submerged in a cool, dark pool of water.  The liquid feels soothing\npressed against your skin.  The pool seems to be contained in some sort of\nnatural cave -- the walls and smooth floor appear to be limestone.  The\nsmall, dark tunnel that you are in has a gradient tilting upwards to the\nsouth and down to the north.\n',168,131080,30,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27717,0,0,0,'A Submerged Tunnel','  You are submerged in a cool, dark pool of water.  The liquid feels soothing\npressed against your skin.  The pool seems to be contained in some sort of\nnatural cave -- the walls and smooth floor appear to be limestone.  The\nsmall, dark tunnel that you are in has a gradient tilting upwards to the\nsouth and down to the north.\n',168,131080,30,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27718,0,0,0,'A Submerged Tunnel','  You are submerged in a cool, dark pool of water.  The liquid feels soothing\npressed against your skin.  The pool seems to be contained in some sort of\nnatural cave -- the walls and smooth floor appear to be limestone.  The\nsmall, dark tunnel that you are in has a gradient tilting upwards to the\nsouth, and it also leads straight up.\n',168,131080,30,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27719,0,0,0,'A Submerged Tunnel','  You are submerged in a cool, dark pool of water.  The liquid feels soothing\npressed against your skin.  The pool seems to be contained in some sort of\nnatural cave -- the walls and smooth floor appear to be limestone.  The\nsmall, dark tunnel that you are in leads straight up or down.\n',168,131080,30,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27720,0,0,0,'A Cool Pool','  You are submerged in a cool, dark pool of water.  The liquid feels soothing\npressed against your skin.  The pool seems to be contained in some sort of\nnatural cave -- the walls and smooth floor appear to be limestone.  The\nsmall, dark tunnel leads straight down or up toward the silvery reflection\nof the surface above you.\n',168,131080,30,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27721,0,0,0,'A Wide, Low Cave','  This cave is barely higher than your average gnome.  A complex series of\nnatural pillars make movement very difficult.  The limestone walls are\nslick and the faint sound of dripping water laden with minerals echoes\naround you.  You think you could make your way northeast through the\nmaze of rock.  A small, cool <b>pool of water<z> opens up in the floor\nhere.\n',168,131080,56,0,0,0,0,0,0,40,0,'',NULL),
(27722,0,0,0,'A Wide, Low Cave','  This cave is barely higher than your average gnome.  A complex series of\nnatural pillars make movement very difficult.  The limestone walls are\nslick and the faint sound of dripping water laden with minerals echoes\naround you.  You think you could make your way southeast through the\nmaze of rock, or east where the columns seem to disperse.\n',168,131080,56,0,0,0,0,0,0,40,0,'',NULL),
(27723,0,0,0,'A Wide Natural Cave','  This is a natural limestone cave whose ceiling is about as high as a\nlong spear.  The ceiling has several stalactites hanging from it, but the\nfloor is relatively free of any rock formations.  To the west you see the\nceiling lower greatly and many natural columns formed where the stalactites\nmeet stalagmites.  In the southeast of the room you see a small opening\nleading to darkness.\n',168,131080,56,0,0,0,0,0,0,85,0,'',NULL),
(27724,0,0,0,'A Small Natural Alcove','  This is a small, dark, intensely shadowed alcove molded from the rock by\nyears of erosion.  A small nook has formed in the side of the wall, and you\nsee some sort of leafy growth there.  To the northwest you see a short\ntunnel leading out to what seems like a larger cave.\n',168,131080,56,0,0,0,0,0,0,80,0,'',NULL),
(27740,0,0,0,'Off the Northeast Coast of an Island','    This is a precarious area of water where the ocean waves smash up\nagainst the northeastern coast of a jungle-covered island.  The coast of\nthe island curves to the northwest, and dense fog extends to the northeast.\nA small rocky islet sits to the southeast, battered by frothy sea water.\nMarine birds perched on the rocks are forced to take flight when a powerful\nwave sweeps against the coast.\n',168,131072,51,200,27740,0,100,8,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27741,0,0,0,'Off the Northeast Coast of an Island','    This is a precarious area of water where the ocean waves smash up\nagainst the northeastern coast of a jungle-covered island.  The coast of\nthe island curves to the northwest, and dense fog extends to the northeast.\nA small rocky islet sits a short distance to the southeast, battered by\nfrothy sea water.  Marine birds perched on the rocks are forced to take\nflight when a powerful wave sweeps against the coast.\n',168,131072,51,200,27741,0,100,8,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27742,0,0,0,'Off the North Coast of an Island','    This is a precarious area of water where the ocean waves smash up\nagainst the northeastern coast of a jungle-covered island.  The coast of\nthe island curves to the west and southeast, and dense fog extends to the\nnorth and northeast.  Marine birds perched on the rocks are forced to take\nflight when a powerful wave sweeps against the coast.\n',168,131072,51,200,27742,0,100,8,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27743,0,0,0,'Off the North Coast of an Island','    This is a precarious area of water where the ocean waves smash up\nagainst the northeastern coast of a jungle-covered island.  The coast of\nthe island stretches to the west and east, and dense fog extends to the\nnorth.  Marine birds perched on the rocks are forced to take\nflight when a powerful wave sweeps against the coast.\n',168,131072,51,200,27743,0,100,1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27744,0,0,0,'Off the North Coast of an Island','    This is a precarious area of water where the ocean waves smash up\nagainst the northeastern coast of a jungle-covered island.  The coast of\nthe island stretches to the west and east, and dense fog extends to the\nnorth.  Marine birds perched on the rocks are forced to take\nflight when a powerful wave sweeps against the coast.\n',168,131072,51,200,27744,0,100,1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27745,0,0,0,'Off the North Coast of an Island','    This is a precarious area of water where the ocean waves smash up\nagainst the northeastern coast of a jungle-covered island.  The coast of\nthe island stretches to the west and east, and dense fog extends to the\nnorth.  Marine birds perched on the rocks are forced to take\nflight when a powerful wave sweeps against the coast.\n',168,131072,51,200,27745,0,100,1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27746,0,0,0,'Off the North Coast of an Island','    This is a precarious area of water where the ocean waves smash up\nagainst the northeastern coast of a jungle-covered island.  The coast of\nthe island stretches to the west and east, and dense fog extends to the\nnorth.  Marine birds perched on the rocks are forced to take\nflight when a powerful wave sweeps against the coast.\n',168,131072,51,200,27746,0,100,1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
