(27780,0,0,0,'At the Mouth of an Island Cove','  This is the mouth of a cove, and to the east is an ocean blanketed in\nunnavigable fog.  Far to the west is a small islet situated in the center\nof the cove, and to the south the ocean circles the isle.  Nearby to the\nnorth is a small islet, battered by the ocean waves.\n',168,131072,51,300,27780,0,100,3,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(27781,0,0,0,'At the Mouth of an Island Cove','  On all sides of the cove to the west is beach, and then a dense green\nrain forest.  You are in the mouth of the cove, and a vast ocean blanketed in\ndense fog stretches out to the east.  A cool, humid breeze arrives from the direction of the ocean.  To the west is a small islet in the center of the cove,\nand another tiny islet lies to the north.\n',168,131072,51,0,0,0,100,3,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
