(27790,0,0,0,'A Swirl of Dark Space','  This place is disorienting and causes a headache after a short period of\ntime.  Occasional swirling threads of rainbow-color magic pulse by, appearing\nand disappearing in complete silence.  Depth is extremely difficult to gauge,\nand the lack of ambient noise is oddly disturbing.\n',168,131072,60,200,27790,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
