(27820,59,58,-3,'Pass between the Walls','  This wide gape within the earthen retaining walls to the north and south\nallows passage between the bay to the west and the Sea of Sorrows to the\neast.  Looking out towards the Sea you see a frigid looking landscape of\nhigh waves and strong winds, while within the bay the earthen retaining\nwalls help to keep the waters fairly calm for small local craft.\n',186,131072,9,0,0,0,40,3,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
