(27872,54,55,-3,'Gangway','  The broad boards of this gangway give you a good feeling of security.  It\nalso makes a great place to stop and take a break.  The ship\'s gangplank is\nup so you see no way of getting aboard.  The shouted orders of someone waft\ndown to you on the sea winds.  Try as you might, noone responds to your\nefforts to get attention.  You can make out the ships anchor chain to the\nnorth.\n',186,131072,2,0,0,0,40,7,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
