(27971,0,0,0,'Gargantuan\'s Throat','  Entering his throat, you feel fear constrict tightly on your heart.  Small\nrubbery protrusions wiggle about as they try to force you deeper down the\nthroat passage.  A slick covering of his saliva covers you from head to toe.\n',188,139592,50,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27972,0,0,0,'Gargantuan\'s Throat','  Entering his throat, you feel fear constrict tightly on your heart.  Small\nrubbery protrusions wiggle about as they try to force you deeper down the\nthroat passage.  A slick covering of his saliva covers you from head to toe.\n',188,139592,50,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27973,0,0,0,'Inside a Shack','  This shack has been crudely made from pieces of ships and driftwood that\nthe Gargantuan has swallowed.  The floor is uneven and rough but at least\nyou\'re not on that repulsive stomach lining.  A large hammock hangs from\nthe wall and the room is otherwise bereft of furnishings.\n',188,139592,50,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27974,0,0,0,'Gargantuan\'s Intestines','  This small corridor is tight and confining.  Similar protrusions to\nthose you encountered in the throat try to force you deeper into the\nintestines.  The floor here is spongy and gives off a slight odor of\nsewers and grime.\n',188,139592,50,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27975,0,0,0,'Gargantuan\'s Intestines','  This small corridor is tight and confining.  Similar protrusions to\nthose you encountered in the throat try to force you deeper into the\nintestines.  The floor here is spongy and gives off a slight odor of\nsewers and grime.\n',188,139592,50,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27976,0,0,0,'Gargantuan\'s Intestines','  This small corridor is tight and confining.  Similar protrusions to\nthose you encountered in the throat try to force you deeper into the\nintestines.  The floor here is spongy and gives off a slight odor of\nsewers and grime.\n',188,139592,50,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27977,0,0,0,'Gargantuan\'s Esophagus','  This muscular tube propels you deeper into the depths of the Gargantuan.\nYou stand upon the mighty muscle that will allow you to enter into the deep\npit of his stomach.  Your only hope is that you can find egress quickly\nenough so that his digestive juices don\'t make quick work of you.\n',188,139592,50,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27978,0,0,0,'Gargantuan\'s Intestines','  This small corridor is tight and confining.  Similar protrusions to\nthose you encountered in the throat try to force you deeper into the\nintestines.  The floor here is spongy and gives off a slight odor of\nsewers and grime.\n',188,139592,50,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27979,0,0,0,'Gargantuan\'s Sphincter','  The intestinal track ends here at large muscular circular opening that is\ncurrently closed.  Try as you might you cannot force it open, large piles\nof excrement lie all about you.  This places stench is enough to make you\nwant to retch, what HAS this beast been eating?\n',188,139596,50,100,100,1,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(27980,70,45,-4,'Massive Cavern','  As you step foot into this massive cavern your senses reel.  The expansive\nstone floor has been worn almost smooth, slight scratch marks can be seen\nhere and there etched deeply into the stones surface.  The air temperature\nhere is much warmer than that of outside.  Footsteps echo off the walls\nsending icy tendrils running up your spine.  The echos bounce about and the\nonly direction you know they are not coming from is the way you came in, or\nworse yet, perhaps you are surrounded!  A strong breeze wafts in from the\neast bringing fresh air into the cavern.\n',188,131080,5,0,0,0,0,-1,0,720,0,'',NULL),
(27981,65,44,-4,'Massive Cavern','  As you step foot into this massive cavern your senses reel.  The expansive\nstone floor has been worn almost smooth, slight scratch marks can be seen\nhere and there etched deeply into the stones surface.  The air temperature\nhere is much warmer than that of outside.  Footsteps echo off the walls\nsending icy tendrils running up your spine.  The echos bounce about and the\nonly direction you know they are not coming from is the way you came in, or\nworse yet, perhaps you are surrounded!  A strong breeze wafts in from the\neast bringing fresh air into the cavern.\n',188,131080,5,0,0,0,0,-1,0,720,0,'',NULL),
(27982,66,44,-4,'Massive cavern','  As you step foot into this massive cavern your senses reel.  The expansive\nstone floor has been worn almost smooth, slight scratch marks can be seen\nhere and there etched deeply into the stones surface.  The air temperature\nhere is much warmer than that of outside.  Footsteps echo off the walls\nsending icy tendrils running up your spine.  The echos bounce about and the\nonly direction you know they are not coming from is the way you came in, or\nworse yet, perhaps you are surrounded!  A strong breeze wafts in from the\neast bringing fresh air into the cavern.\n',188,131080,5,0,0,0,0,-1,0,720,0,'',NULL),
(27983,67,44,-4,'Massive Cavern','This central part of the cavern has many, many stalagmites and stalactites\nthat seem to almost form a wall around the very center of the cavern.  You\ncan hear a deep rumble that shakes the very rock you stand upon.  The sound\nof dripping water can be faintly heard.  The air is humaid and thick, the\nsmell of decay and rot almost overwhelms you.\n',-1,131080,5,50,27983,0,0,0,0,720,0,'',NULL),
