(27991,67,43,-4,'Massive Cavern','  Entering through the shattered remains of the stalagmites and stalactites\nyou view a large pile of treasure.  Three large chests have been placed\nneatly next to each other and a few broken weapons are scattered about the\nfloor.  A medium sized bed sits in one corner next a writing table and chair,\nlanterns decorate the room casting light that gleams and glints off the\nchests.  Shattered bones lie strewn about and the smell of death makes you\ngag.\n',188,131080,5,0,0,0,0,-1,0,720,0,'',NULL),
(27992,68,43,-4,'Massive Cavern','  This central part of the cavern has many, many stalagmites and stalactites\nthat seem to almost form a wall around the very center of the cavern.  You\ncan hear a deep rumble that shakes the very rock you stand upon.  The sound\nof dripping water can be faintly heard.  The air is humaid and thick, the\nsmell of decay and rot almost overwhelms you.  A large opening to your west\nshows that something of great strength has broken the stalagmites and\nstalactites into small shards of stone.\n',188,131072,5,50,27992,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
