(28010,68,39,-4,'Mining Tunnel','  This area of the tunnel is less finished than anything you have come across\nso far.  The beams supporting the roof are still dripping sap and it looks\nas if many that would make this a safe place to walk in are missing.  A\ncave-in could occur at anytime here.  The walls are rich with terbium,\npeering about you can see the raw, silver-grey material running along in deep\nveins.  A massive cavern opens up to your north.\n',188,131080,5,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28011,68,38,-4,'Mining Tunnel','  This area of the tunnel is less finished than anything you have come across\nso far.  The beams supporting the roof are still dripping sap and it looks\nas if many that would make this a safe place to walk in are missing.  A\ncave-in could occur at anytime here.  The walls are rich with terbium,\npeering about you can see the raw, silver-grey material running along in deep\nveins.\n',188,131080,5,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28012,68,48,0,'Vertical Shaft','  This shaft descends deep into the bowels of the earth, as you climb down\nechos of the noises from your scrambling echo back to you.  You watch in\ntrepidation as a small rock you have knocked free tumble into the depths, it\ntakes a long time for the noise of its striking the bottom to reach your\nears.\n',188,131080,15,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28013,68,48,-1,'Vertical Shaft','  This shaft descends deep into the bowels of the earth, as you climb down\nechos of the noises from your scrambling echo back to you.  You watch in\ntrepidation as a small rock you have knocked free tumble into the depths, it\ntakes a long time for the noise of its striking the bottom to reach your\nears.\n',188,131080,15,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
