(28016,71,41,-4,'Massive Tunnel','  This tunnel is massive, the rock floor looks jagged and rough as if the\nrock from the ceiling had been melted away.  Large clumps of some type of\nguano litter the floor.  In some you can see brief flashes as if they had\nsomething metallic in them.  A dim light can be seen far off to the\nnortheast while darkness emanates from the west.\n',188,131080,5,0,0,0,0,-1,0,720,0,'',NULL),
