(28041,73,53,-3,'Deep Pit','  This central part of the island has a large, deep hole dug into it.  A\nlarge box-like structure supports a massive transom, multiple hoists hang\nfrom it.  Many different sized ropes hang from the various hoists, the\nropes from three hoists hang down separate shafts.  The main shaft is much\nlarger than the the ones the hoists descend into.  The ground here is free\nfrom any of debris you have noticed in the other parts of this island.\n',188,131081,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
