(28048,77,48,-3,'On an Iceberg','  This small iceberg is rooted in spot, for some reason its not floating\nabout as most icebergs you\'ve seen.  The bright glare of the light makes\nyou wish you had some sort of protection for your eyes.  The ever-present\nsounds of the ice shifting and groaning makes sends tendrils of fear up\nand down your spine.\n',188,131072,11,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28049,76,47,-3,'On an Iceberg','  This small iceberg is rooted in spot, for some reason its not floating\nabout as most icebergs you\'ve seen.  The bright glare of the light makes\nyou wish you had some sort of protection for your eyes.  The ever-present\nsounds of the ice shifting and groaning makes sends tendrils of fear up\nand down your spine.\n',188,131072,11,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28050,77,47,-3,'Hole in an Iceberg','  This small iceberg is rooted in spot, for some reason its not floating\nabout as most icebergs you\'ve seen.  The bright glare of the light makes\nyou wish you had some sort of protection for your eyes.  The ever-present\nsounds of the ice shifting and groaning makes sends tendrils of fear up\nand down your spine.  You can see tendrils of steam rising up from a large\nopening in the center of this section of the iceberg.  You gaze at the\nsteam astounded that the ice is not melting.\n',188,131072,11,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28051,78,47,-3,'On an Iceberg','  This small iceberg is rooted in spot, for some reason its not floating\nabout as most icebergs you\'ve seen.  The bright glare of the light makes\nyou wish you had some sort of protection for your eyes.  The ever-present\nsounds of the ice shifting and groaning makes sends tendrils of fear up\nand down your spine.\n',188,131072,11,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
