(28063,58,66,-3,'Living Quarters','  This massive room has been carved from the iceberg itself.  The living\nquarters of some huge being.  Small replicas of the cisterns sit here casting\nthe same eerie light.  The air here is fresh and a slight breeze wafts through\nthe air.  A small window has been carved out of the ice in the western wall.\nA large terbium door lies to your east.\n',188,131080,11,0,0,0,0,-1,0,240,0,'',NULL),
(28064,59,66,-3,'Icy Cavern','  This icy cavern is huge!  Large metal cisterns are spread all about this\ncavern.  The light cast from these cisterns make the shadows move as if alive.\nThe floor is smooth and even, as if it was made that way.  The walls reflect\nthe light in a strange way, making different colors stand out in stark contrast\nto the dull, lifeless white that permeates the area.  A large terbium door lies\nto your west.\n',188,131144,11,0,0,0,0,-1,0,240,0,'',NULL),
