(28068,63,66,-3,'Spiral Stairway','  A spiral staircase has been carved out of the ice here.  The stairs lead\nupwards into darkness.  The air here is chill and damp.  The stairs centers\nhave a slight indentation.  The light jumps off of the ice stairs as if alive.\nThis small room is slightly more cramped than the rest of the area you have\nbeen in.  A small window is set in the eastern wall.  A large terbium door lies\nto your west.\n',188,131144,11,0,0,0,0,-1,0,240,0,'',NULL),
