(28164,57,67,-3,'Around an Iceberg','  The waters here send off brilliant lights in all directions as it\nstrikes against the sides of this iceberg.  You can faintly hear the\ncries of an ocean bird from far above.  It seems that life does thrive\neven in the most hostile of climates.  The iceberg\'s surface is slick\nand treacherous you can see no way of ascending to its peak.\n',188,131072,9,0,0,0,50,7,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
