(28297,72,56,-3,'Around an Island','  The waters here cascade gently on a small breaker line.  This small\nisland refuge is a welcome break from your sea going voyages.  Large\nchunks of ice have cluttered the shore.  With the bleak flatness of this\nterrain you can make out a vague structure near the center of the island.\n',188,131072,9,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
