(28303,60,55,-3,'Around a Trawler','  The waves rock this small ship hither and yon and small chunks of ice\nbatter the hull.  You can see people on the deck of this small fishing\ntrawler.  Shouting and waving until your lungs are raw doesn\'t seem to be\nworking to get their attention.  The sea seems to be much calmer here then\nwhere you were, and you wonder if trying to get aboard this ship is wise\nsince you have heard multiple rumors of pirates on these seas.\n',188,131072,9,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
