(28391,61,50,-3,'Sea of Sorrows','  The frigid water that surrounds you makes you shiver in trepidation.  Small\nicebergs float by you on their ocean journey.  All the rumors you have heard\nabout this forbidding place are true.  Fraught with danger and peril this\nsea is not a place for the wary.  True explorers have found unheard of wealth\nand power here, while the timid perish quickly.  Bright sunlight reflects\noff the large ice chunks and water.  Your visibility is cut to almost\nnothing.\n',188,131072,9,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
