(28445,75,47,-3,'Around an Iceflow','  The waters are still around this small ice flow.  Made from solid ice,\nthis flow is cold and uninviting but seems like the only place for\nbrief break from the hazards of the sea.  Looking at it closer you can\nsee that it descends deeply into the water.  A small land mass sits under\nthis flow holding it in place.\n',188,131072,9,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
