(28450,61,65,-2,'Leaders Quarters','  This massive room has been carved from the iceberg itself.  The living\nquarters of some huge being.  A small window has been carved out of the ice in\nthe eastern wall.  Tapestries decorate the walls here, a small throw rug helps\nto insulate the floor from the cold of the ice.  This room shows a very spartan\nlifestyle.  A huge bed sits here alongside of a stone fireplace.\n',188,131144,11,0,0,0,0,-1,0,240,0,'',NULL),
(28451,61,64,-2,'Leaders Quarters','  This massive room has been carved from the iceberg itself.  The living\nquarters of some huge being.  A small window has been carved out of the ice in\nthe eastern wall.  Tapestries decorate the walls here, a small throw rug helps\nto insulate the floor from the cold of the ice.  This room shows a very spartan\nlifestyle.  This room has a slight draft in it, the bottom of the tapestry\nflutters slightly.  The breeze seems to be coming from your southwest.\n',188,131144,11,0,0,0,0,-1,0,240,0,'',NULL),
(28452,60,63,-2,'Prison Cell','  This cell is dank with a moldy quality in the air.  The many implements of\ntorture scattered about the room send a jolt up your spine.  A large iron\nmaiden stands in one corner.  The entire southern wall is taken up by an immense\nrack.  A small brazier casts light about the room and is filled with many tools\nand brands.  The trapdoor snaps closed, your exit to the northeast is gone!\n',188,131144,11,0,0,0,0,-1,0,240,0,'',NULL),
(28453,70,46,-3,'Sea of Sorrows','  The frigid water that surrounds you makes you shiver in trepidation.  Small\nicebergs float by you on their ocean journey.  All the rumors you have heard\nabout this forbidding place are true.  Fraught with danger and peril this\nsea is not a place for the wary.  True explorers have found unheard of wealth\nand power here, while the timid perish quickly.  Bright sunlight reflects\noff the large ice chunks and water.  Your visibility is cut to almost\nnothing.\n',188,131072,9,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
