(28464,0,0,0,'Gargantuan\'s Stomach','  The surface you stand upon is soft and giving, a slight squish can be\nheard with every step you take.  Looking about, you can see that the\nceiling here is rough and grey.  A slight residue of the Gargantuan\'s\nstomach acids puddle about here and there.  The floor undulates softly\nunderfoot, it might be in your best interest to vacate this area and FAST!\nA small shack made from assorted pieces of driftwood lies to your east\nand west.\n',188,139592,50,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28465,0,0,0,'Inside a Shack','  This shack has been crudely made from pieces of ships and driftwood that\nthe Gargantuan has swallowed.  The floor is uneven and rough but at least\nyou\'re not on that repulsive stomach lining.  A large hammock hangs from\nthe wall and the room is otherwise bereft of furnishings.\n',188,139592,50,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28466,0,0,0,'Inside a Shack','  This shack has been crudely made from pieces of ships and driftwood that\nthe Gargantuan has swallowed.  The floor is uneven and rough but at least\nyou\'re not on that repulsive stomach lining.  A large hammock hangs from\nthe wall and the room is otherwise bereft of furnishings.\n',188,139592,50,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
