(28478,71,55,-4,'Water Filled Corridor','  This large corridor is carved from solid ice.  Lichen grows in some cracks in\nthe ice casting an eerie green light.  There are deep nicks and scratches from\nthe tools used to make this corridor.  The creatures who made this place must\nhave used crude tools when making it.  The waters temperature is just above\nfreezing, the cold seeps into your limbs.\n',188,131081,30,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28479,70,56,-4,'Water Filled Corridor','  This large corridor is carved from solid ice.  Lichen grows in some cracks in\nthe ice casting an eerie green light.  There are deep nicks and scratches from\nthe tools used to make this corridor.  The creatures who made this place must\nhave used crude tools when making it.  The waters temperature is just above\nfreezing, the cold seeps into your limbs.\n',188,131081,30,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
