(28487,63,66,-2,'Top of Spiral Stair','  A spiral staircase has been carved out of the ice here.  The stairs lead\ndownwards into darkness.  The air here is chill and damp.  The stairs centers\nhave a slight indentation.  The light jumps off of the ice stairs as if alive.\nThis small room is slightly more cramped than the rest of the area you have\nbeen in.  A small window is set in the eastern wall.  A large terbium door lies\nto your southwest.\n',188,131148,11,0,0,0,0,-1,0,240,0,'',NULL),
(28488,62,65,-2,'Leaders Quarters','  This massive room has been carved from the iceberg itself.  The living\nquarters of some huge being.  A small window has been carved out of the ice in\nthe western wall.  Tapestries decorate the walls here, a small throw rug helps\nto insulate the floor from the cold of the ice.  This room shows a very spartan\nlifestyle.  A large terbium door lies to your northeast.\n',188,131144,11,0,0,0,0,-1,0,240,0,'',NULL),
(28489,62,64,-2,'Leaders Quarters','  This massive room has been carved from the iceberg itself.  The living\nquarters of some huge being.  A small window has been carved out of the ice in\nthe western wall.  Tapestries decorate the walls here, a small throw rug helps\nto insulate the floor from the cold of the ice.  This room shows a very spartan\nlifestyle.\n',188,131144,11,0,0,0,0,-1,0,240,0,'',NULL),
(28499,0,0,0,'Gargantuan\'s Mouth','  Standing on the Gargantuan\'s mighty tongue, surrounded by his teeth that\nloom as large as a hobbit, you wonder how this terrible turn of events\nhas come to pass.  Hot, humid air gusts past you as the Gargantuan\nbreathes.  The rancid smell inside here disgusts you, in between his\nmassive teeth you can see remnants from his last meal and small bits\nof wood from the last ship he had smashed in his mighty jaws.\n',188,139592,50,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28800,80,-12,0,'Cobblestone Path','  This is a wide cobblestone path that leads northwards toward a large temple.\nA large sign etched in blood sits by the path.\n',153,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,22,'',NULL),
(28801,80,-11,0,'Cobblestone Path','  The path continues north towards the large temple.  As you get closer, you\nsee that the temple is extremely large.\n',153,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28802,80,-10,0,'End of Cobblestone Path','  The cobblestone path comes to an end here.  Before you to the north stands\na thick wrought iron gate.  Beyond the gate you notice a large staircase\nleading upwards to a temple.  The sight of the temple sends shivers down\nyour spine!\n',101,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28803,80,-9,0,'Bottom of Stairway to Large Temple','  You are standing at the base of a large staircase.  The stairs are made of a\nblack stone.  To your south stands a thick wrought iron gate.  You may go up\nthe stairs, or retreat through the gate to the south.\n',108,131072,22,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28804,80,-9,1,'Top of Stairs','  You are at the top of a very large staircase.  You may go down the stairs or\nenter the temple to the north.\n',153,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28805,80,-8,1,'The Temple Entrance','  You\'re under a large archway which leads into the Temple of the Undead.\nYou can continue north further into the temple, or head south toward some\nstairs.  To the east and west are small rooms.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28806,79,-8,1,'The West Annex','  This is a small annex which seems to be set up for a guard.  There is a small\nbench made of marble built into the west wall.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28807,81,-8,1,'The East Annex','  This is a small annex which seems to be set up for a guard.  There is a small\nbench made of marble built into the east wall.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28808,80,-7,1,'The Temple Corridor','  This corridor leads north in the Temple and south to the main entrance of the\nTemple.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28809,80,-6,1,'The Temple Corridor','  This corridor continues north and south.  To the east and west are small\ncrawlways.  I wonder where they lead?\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28810,79,-6,1,'A Crawlway','  This narrow passage continues east and west.  You hear a shuffling of feet in\nthe distance.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28811,78,-6,1,'A Crawlway','  This narrow passage continues east and west.  To the west you hear a lot of\ncommotion.  It peaks your curiosity...\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28812,77,-6,1,'Bottom of West Bell Tower','  You notice that you are at the bottom of the bell tower.  A spiral staircase\nalong the wall leads upward.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28814,81,-6,1,'A Crawlway','  This narrow passage continues east and west.  You hear a shuffling of feet in\nthe distance.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28815,82,-6,1,'A Crawlway','  This narrow passage continues east and west.  You hear a shuffling of feet in\nthe distance.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28816,83,-6,1,'Bottom of East Bell Tower','  You notice that you are at the bottom of the bell tower.  A spiral staircase\nalong the wall leads upward.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28817,80,-5,1,'The Temple Corridor','  This corridor continues north and south.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28818,80,-4,1,'The Temple Corridor','  The corridor leads directly into the Temple Sanctuary to the north.  The\ncorridor continues south.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28819,80,-3,1,'The Temple Sanctuary','  You are at the south end of a large sanctuary.  A corridor leads south and\nthe sanctuary expands to the north, the east, and the west.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28820,79,-3,1,'The Temple Sanctuary','  You are in the southwest corner of the sanctuary.  You may go north or east.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28821,81,-3,1,'The Temple Sanctuary','  You are in the southeast corner of the sanctuary.  To the west is the\nentrance and to the north is the Temple Altar.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28822,79,-2,1,'The Temple Sanctuary','  You are on the western edge of the sanctuary.  To the west is a door.  You may\nalso travel north, south, and east.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28823,80,-2,1,'The Temple Sanctuary','  You are in the center of the temple sanctuary.  You may move in any\ndirection.  To the east is the Temple Altar.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28824,81,-2,1,'The Temple Altar','  You are at the Temple Altar.  The Altar is about 4 feet high and made of a\ndark, black stone.  You see traces of blood all about the altar from some of\nthe many sacrifices made here.  There is a door to the east.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28825,78,-2,1,'Storage Closet','  You are in a small storage closet.  There are several ripped up gowns and\nburnt out candles here.  I looks like someone has been here recently.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28826,82,-2,1,'Sacrificial Chamber','  This is the chamber where many of the sacrifices were prepared.  There are\nholes in the wall where manacles once rested.  There is an iron grate in the\nfloor which has a keyhole in it.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28827,79,-1,1,'The Temple Sanctuary','  You are in the northwest corner of the sanctuary.  You may go east or south.\nThere is a wooden door on the north wall.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28828,80,-1,1,'The Temple Sanctuary','  You are on the northern edge of the temple sanctuary.  You may go south,\neast, or west.  There is a door on the north wall.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28829,81,-1,1,'The Temple Sanctuary','  You are in the northeast corner of the sanctuary.  You may go west or south.\nThere is a wooden door on the north wall.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28830,79,0,1,'Meditation Chamber','  You are in a small meditation chamber.  There is a small black altar on the\nnorth wall.  There is a door to the south.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28831,80,0,1,'Path To Graveyard','  You are outside the temple.  The path goes north towards the graveyard and\nthere is a door to the south that leads into the temple.\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28832,81,0,1,'Meditation Chamber','  You are in a small meditation chamber.  There is a small black altar on the\nnorth wall.  There is a door to the south.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28833,80,1,1,'Path To Graveyard','  This path is littered with small stones and sand.  The path leads north\ntowards the graveyard and south towards the temple.\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28834,80,2,1,'Path To Graveyard','  This path is full of debris and dust.  Trampled footprints appear on the\nground.  The pathway continues north to the graveyard, south towards the\nsanctuary and a small building lies to the west of here.\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28835,80,3,1,'Path To Graveyard','  The graveyard entrance is directly north of here.  The path leads south\ntowards the temple.\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28836,79,2,1,'Path To Rectory','  This is the Rectory for the temple.  There are broken bottles and ripped up\nscrolls lying on the ground.  It is obvious that no mortal has been here in\nquite some time.  You notice a door to the west.\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28837,78,2,1,'Doorway To Rectory','  You are in front of the Rectory for the temple.  There is a door to the west,\nor you can go east towards the temple.\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28838,77,2,1,'The Rectory','  This is the Rectory for the temple.  There are broken bottles and ripped up\nscrolls lying on the ground.  It is obvious that no mortal has been here in\nquite some time.  You notice a small door to the south and a large door to the\neast.\n',153,141320,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28839,77,1,1,'Bishop\'s Bedroom','  This is the sleeping room for the Bishop of the temple.  A rotted out bed\nlies in the southwest corner of this room.  Cobwebs dangle from the ceiling.\nYou get an eerie sensation that you are not alone in this room.\n',153,141320,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28840,80,-13,0,'Trail through the Bushes','  This faint trail reveals a cobblestone path to the north, and a very large\ndirt road to the south.  You can hear the sounds of a town to your southwest.\n',153,139264,23,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28841,78,7,1,'Tomb of Derbomon','  This is a frail tombstone with all edges blackened.  You may travel east or\nsouth.\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28842,79,7,1,'The Graveyard','  You are along the northern boundary of the graveyard.  You may travel east,\nwest, and south.\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28843,80,7,1,'Open Grave','  You see an open grave before you.  You can tell it was recently made.  The\ntombstone sitting here is freshly engraved.  Very odd......  What does the\ntombstone read???\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28844,81,7,1,'The Graveyard','  You are along the northern boundary of the graveyard.  You may travel east,\nwest, and south.\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28845,82,7,1,'Tomb of Family Lemonjello','  This is an exotic tombstone over 6 feet high!  All the names of the\nLemonjello family are on the tombstone.\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28846,78,6,1,'The Graveyard','  You are on the western edge of the graveyard.  Exits are north, east, and\nsouth.\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28847,79,6,1,'Grave of Heronatide','  You are at the grave of the great warrior Heronatide.  A humble end to such a\nbrilliant career as first protector of Grimhaven.  Exits are in all directions.\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28848,80,6,1,'The Graveyard','  You are near the center of the graveyard.  You are surrounded by tombs and\ngraves.  You may travel north, east, south, or west.\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28849,81,6,1,'Tomb of Sir Joseph Hardaxe','  This site marks the final resting point for the greatest half-orc to roam\nthis world.  You may travel north, south, east, and west.\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28850,82,6,1,'The Graveyard','  You are on the eastern edge of the graveyard.  Exits are north, west, and\nsouth.\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28851,78,5,1,'Grave of Quazifrene','  You have only heard stories of the great mage Quazifrene.  Times have changed\nsince this powerful sorcerer roamed these parts.  You may go north, south, or\neast.  To the south lies an old shed.\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28852,79,5,1,'The Graveyard','  You are near the center of the graveyard.  You are surrounded by tombs and\ngraves.  You may travel north, east, south, or west.\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28853,80,5,1,'Tomb of Creel','  This is the tomb of the great thief Creel.  Just standing here makes you\ncheck your money pouch...\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28854,81,5,1,'The Graveyard','  You are near the center of the graveyard.  You are surrounded by tombs and\ngraves.  You may travel north, east, south, or west.\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28855,82,5,1,'Grave of Lei Lani Po','  This grave is on the eastern edge of the graveyard.  Obvious exits are north,\nwest, and south.\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28856,78,4,1,'Caretaker\'s Shed','  You are in the Caretaker\'s Shed.  There are rusted shovels and picks here.\nYou can tell that this equipment has not been used in many years.\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28857,79,4,1,'Grave of Rronth Darnth','  Here is the grave of the most charming soul to walk this world.  Directly\nwest of here is the Caretaker\'s Shed.  Other exits are north and east.\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28858,80,4,1,'Entrance To Graveyard','  If front of you lies a very large graveyard.  You see many assorted\ntombstones throughout the graveyard.  You notice a small building off in the\ndistance to the west, and the temple back toward the south.\n',153,139272,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28859,81,4,1,'Tomb of Wreematon','  This tombstone is broken in half.  It seems as if some great battle had  just\noccurred.  Exits are west, north, and east.\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28860,82,4,1,'The Graveyard','  You are in the southeast corner of the graveyard.  You may travel north or\nwest from this point.\n',153,139264,20,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28861,83,-6,2,'Ascent To East Bell Tower','  The stairway continues up and down from here.  You hear the distinct sound of\nbells ringing above you.  All around you, you seem to hear the flapping of\nwings.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28862,83,-6,3,'Top of East Bell Tower','  You are at the top of the bell tower.  There are 4 bells moving from side to\nside making a very loud noise.  It is as if someone has just been ringing all\nof the bells!\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28863,77,-6,2,'Ascent To West Bell Tower','  The stairway continues up and down from here.  All around you, you seem to\nhear the flapping of wings.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28864,77,-6,3,'Top of West Bell Tower','  You are at the top of the bell tower.  There are 4 bells attached to the\nceiling of this room.  There is a small bed and some crumbs on the floor.\n',153,139272,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28865,82,-2,0,'The Catacombs','  Shadows play tricks on your eyes as you survey the grizzly scene about you.\nBody parts in various states of decay lie haphazardly in the ledges dug into\nthe dirt walls.  The stench of death is overwhelming.  You cannot help but\nnotice that someone has been dining on these remains recently.  Rungs in the\nnorth wall lead up to a grating above you.  To the east, cobwebs hang from a\ndark, stone archway.\n',153,141320,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28866,83,-2,0,'The Catacombs','  To the north and south the catacombs continue into the darkness.  Ledges on\nthe eastern wall hold the ancient remains of countless individuals.  To the\nwest, cobwebs hang from a dark, stone archway.  A cold breeze runs blows here.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28867,83,-1,0,'The Catacombs','  You stand in a north-south tunnel of an ancient catacombs system.  The east\nwall holds various bones and skulls, while the west wall\'s ledges are strangely\nempty.  It looks as if there were once bones there, but they have now been\nremoved.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28868,83,0,0,'The Catacombs','  The catacombs twist here, their dark and foreboding tunnels stretching to the\neast and south.  The skeletal remains here are covered by layers of dust and\ncobwebs.  The dirt floor bellow, however, suggests someone has been here\nrecently.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28869,84,0,0,'The Catacombs','  This is an east-west tunnel of an ancient catacombs system.  A fresh trail of\nblood from the east leads towards a red pool at your feet.  A severed eye lies\nin the center of the pool.  Your breakfast is moving around in your stomach.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28870,85,0,0,'The Catacombs','  The catacombs continue to the north and to the west, as does a trail of\nblood.  A discarded limb lies in the north-east corner of the room, its\nfreshness in sharp contrast to the ancient bones which line the walls.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28871,85,1,0,'The Catacombs','  Ancient catacombs stretch to the south while a stone archway frames the\ndarkness to the north.  A trail of blood runs from the north to the south.  The\nsmell of death fills the air.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28872,85,2,0,'The South-East Corner','  You stand in the south-east corner of a large, underground room.  In the\ncenter of the room lies a large pit.  To the north and west, ledges lead along\nthe edge of the pit.  To the east and south lie archways into darkness.  A trail\nof blood from the south ends here abruptly.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28873,84,2,0,'The Southern Ledge','  You stand on a narrow ledge, just south of a large, dark pit.  The wall to\nthe south is made of stone, and provides some hand-holds to help your passage.\nThe safety of the corners of this large room, which lie to your east and west,\nbeckon you.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28874,83,2,0,'The South-West Corner','  You stand in the south-west corner of a large room.  In the center of room\nlies a wide, dark pit.  A small ledge circles the pit to the east and to the\nnorth.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28875,83,3,0,'The Western Ledge','  You stand on a narrow ledge, just west of a large, dark pit.  The wall to the\nwest is made of stone, and provides some hand-holds to help your passage.  The\nsafety of the corners of this large room, which lie to your north and south,\nbeckon you.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28876,83,4,0,'The North-West Corner','  You stand in the north-west corner of a large room.  In the center of room\nlies a wide, dark pit.  A small ledge circles the pit to the east and to the\nsouth.  A small archway leads into the darkness to the north.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28877,83,5,0,'The Undertakers Room','  You stand in the humble abode of a slightly deranged Undertaker.  Various\nimplements for preparing bodies for burial lie strewn about the room.  The smell\nof formaldehyde fills the air.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28878,84,4,0,'The Northern Ledge','  You stand on a narrow ledge, just north of a large, dark pit.  The wall to\nthe north is made of stone, and provides some hand-holds to help your passage.\nThe safety of corners of this large room, which lie to your east and west,\nbeckon you.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28879,85,4,0,'The North-East Corner','  You stand in the north-west corner of a large room.  In the center of room\nlies a wide, dark pit.  A small ledge circles the pit to the west and to the\nsouth.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28880,85,3,0,'The Eastern Ledge','  You stand on a narrow ledge, just east of a large, dark pit.  The wall to the\neast is made of stone, and provides some hand-holds to help your passage.  The\nsafety of the corners of this large room, which lie to your north and south,\nbeckon you.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28881,83,-3,0,'The Catacombs','  The catacombs stretch before you into the darkness.  Bones litter the east\nand west walls while darkness invites you to the north and south.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28882,83,-4,0,'The Catacombs','  The catacombs turn here, continuing to the north and the east.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28883,84,-4,0,'The Catacombs','  The catacombs extend here from the east to the west.  The ceiling is quite\nlow,  forcing you to crouch.  Passage is possible, but quite uncomfortable.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28884,85,-4,0,'The Catacombs','  The catacombs continue onward.  To the east is a dark pool of liquid.  It\ndoesn\'t look easy to pass.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28885,86,-4,0,'Pool of Dark Water','  You are in the middle of a large pool of water.  The water looks deep and\ncold!\n',153,141320,29,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28886,87,-4,0,'The Catacombs','  The catacombs narrow at this point.  To the west is a dark pool of liquid.  It\nlooks very hard to pass.\n',153,141320,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28887,88,-4,0,'The Catacombs','  The catacombs twist here, extending into the darkness to the north and west.\nA small rut in the floor would suggest at one time water flowed westward from\nthe north.  The remains in the eastern and southern walls appear to be\nrelatively undisturbed.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28888,88,-3,0,'The Catacombs','  A small cave-in here makes passage difficult.  The ceiling above has\npartially collapsed, allowing moisture to drip in.  This moisture has collected\nin a small puddle on the floor.  The catacombs continue into the darkness to\nthe north and  south.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28889,86,2,0,'The Catacombs','  This east-west tunnel is quite narrow.  To the west is a high, stone archway,\nwhile the catacombs continue to the east.  The dirt floor here is covered with\nblood.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28890,87,2,0,'The Catacombs','  The east-west tunnel is quite narrow here, with the catacombs continuing into\nthe darkness.  A freshly severed head hangs from the ceiling here, its mouth\ngaped open as if caught in a scream.  The face looks familiar.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28891,88,2,0,'The Catacombs','  The catacombs twist here, stretching to the west and to the south, where the\ntunnel appears to widen.  There seems to be a strong otherworldly force present\nin this room.  The hair on the back of your neck stands on end as the walls\nbegin to glow in a faint blue light.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28892,88,1,0,'The Catacombs','  You are standing in a huge north-south tunnel of the catacombs.  The remains\nof forgotten souls lie in the alcoves of the east and west walls.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28893,88,0,0,'The Catacombs','  Moisture drips from the ceiling here, creating a small puddle on the ground.\nBlood smears on the floor create an evil pattern, perhaps used for some hideous\nrite.  The bones on the east and west walls lie in piles, as if sorted based on\ntheir type.  White powder, perhaps from ground bone, lies neatly in piles on\nthe floor.  To the north and south the catacombs continue into the darkness.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28894,88,-1,0,'The Catacombs','  Various bones and skulls lie scattered here on the floor, impeding your\nprogress.  They appear to have been forcibly thrown from the ledges in the east\nand west walls.  To the north and south, the catacombs continue into the\ndarkness.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28895,88,-2,0,'The Catacombs','  While the huge north-south tunnel of the catacombs continues here, a small\nbranch extends to the west.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28896,87,-2,0,'The Catacombs','  The catacombs end here.  Both the east and west offer you more darkness.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28897,0,0,0,'Small Room','  You stand in a small room between two doors.  There is an iron door to the\nwest.  Something has been carved into the iron door in a language you have\nnever seen before.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28898,0,0,0,'The Crypt','  This ancient room appears to be the crypt of a long forgotten king.  Partially\ndisintegrated tapestries hang from the walls depict the kings life from\nchildhood until his death in a great battle.  The thick, dusty odor of this\nroom would suggest it has been left untouched.  It would appear, however, that\nthe coffin of the deceased is open and empty.  There is a strong iron door on\nthe east wall.\n',153,141320,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28899,0,0,0,'The Pool','  You are in the pool of water.  You find it difficult to see and the water is\nvery cold!  Numbness starts to take over your body!\n',153,141320,30,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28900,0,0,0,'The Bottom of the Stairs','  Deep red stains cover the stairs, still wet enough to cause traversing them \nto be dangerous.  Small pieces of bone and skin litter the floor, along with \nthe odd limb.  Looking through the carnage you cannot seem to find a single \nhuman body or limb amidst those of the slain trollocs.\n',202,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,150,0,'',NULL),
(28901,0,0,0,'The Parlor','  What was once the parlor of a small family has now been turned into the \nsleeping quarters of some trollocs.  Pallets of various defiled materials lie \nrandomly upon the floor and the horrid stench of decaying flesh is strong in \nthe air.\n',202,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,150,0,'',NULL),
(28902,0,0,0,'A Large Barn','  You stand inside a barn, or at least what was once a barn.  Small walls, from \nstalls that used to hold various animals, have been ripped from the structure\nto create a wide open space.  Hay is scattered wildly over the floor, very \npossibly covering blood and other stains created in the destruction of the \nbarn.\n',202,131081,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28903,0,0,0,'A Ruined Field','  What was once a large well cared for field is now a mass of churned dirt.  \nThe odd bone protrudes from the churned dirt, bones large enough to be human.\n',202,131072,23,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28904,0,0,0,'The Kitchen','  Blood now soaks the walls and floors of what was once a clean kitchen.  It \nseems that whatever it was that attacked this small farmstead met up with some\nresistance upon entering the house.  Small pieces of bone and skin along with\nthe odd arm and leg lie scattered on the floor, left to rot.  To the east is\na pile a rubble which used to be a door.\n',202,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,150,0,'',NULL),
(28905,0,0,0,'The Dining Room','  Upturned tables and the odd broken dish upon the floor are the only signs\nof struggle within this room.  Either this room avoided any real violence or \nit was cleaned thoroughly for some unknown reason.  To the west a doorway is \nfull of rubble.\n',202,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,150,0,'',NULL),
(28906,0,0,0,'A Small Path','  A small dirt path surrounds a nearby house, blood has soaked deep into the \nsoil.  Rocks of various shapes and sizes make the path dangerous to traverse \nat night, if you do not know exactly where the rocks are.  Chopped wood has \nbeen piled alongside the house and to the north is a large barn.\n',202,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28907,0,0,0,'A Ruined Field','  What was once a large well cared for field is now a mass of churned dirt.  \nThe odd bone protrudes from the churned dirt, bones large enough to be human.\n',202,131072,23,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28908,0,0,0,'A Ruined Field','  What was once a large well cared for field is now a mass of churned dirt.  \nThe odd bone protrudes from the churned dirt, bones large enough to be human.\n',202,131072,23,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
