(28926,0,0,0,'Storage Shed','  You Are Surrounded in large amounts of unrefined wool.  Whether this wool\nhas been discarded or stored is hard to tell.  Within the center of the\nroom a spinning wheel is gathering dust.\n',202,131081,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28927,0,0,0,'Shearing Shed','  You stand within a large barn-like structure.  Small stalls have been placed \nalong the northern wall for people to shear sheep within.  Hay has been left \nupon the floor to cover any accidents left by the sheep, and the odd piece of \nstray wool lies discarded on the floor.\n',202,131081,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(28928,0,0,0,'A Dirt Road','  You are standing on a well used dirt road, large enough for a horse and cart \nto easily travel upon.  Large ruts along the path give proof that the path is \nused often by carts that carry heavy loads.  Rocks randomly protrude from the\nground here and there.\n',202,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28929,0,0,0,'A Large Overgrowth','  Trees and brush have overgrown the path you are currently on, making escape \nin any direction but back the way you came impossible.  The surrounding grass \nis high enough to hide a small hobbit.\n',202,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28930,0,0,0,'A Small Trail','  You are upon a small dirt path, used by woodcutters to bring wood back to \nthe warehouse for refining.  Surrounding trees make travel in any direction \nbut along the current path impossible.\n',202,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28931,0,0,0,'A Dirt Road','  You are standing on a well used dirt road, large enough for a horse and cart \nto easily travel upon.  Large ruts along the path give proof that the path is \nused often by carts that carry heavy loads.  Rocks randomly protrude from the\nground here and there.  To the east is a gate.\n',202,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28932,0,0,0,'A Large Pasture','  The surrounding area is devoid of rock, it has been removed by the owners \nof the field so there will be no chance of an animal injuring itself.  Grass \ngrows all around you, waiting to be trimmed by sheep.  A gate lies to the \nwest.\n',202,131072,23,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28933,0,0,0,'A Large Pasture','  The surrounding area is devoid of rock, it has been removed by the owners \nof the field so there will be no chance of an animal injuring itself.  Grass \ngrows all around you, waiting to be trimmed by sheep.  To the north is a \nshed, possibly for shearing.\n',202,131072,23,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
