(28935,0,0,0,'An Overgrown Path','  You are standing on a rarely used dirt path which is slowly being taken over \nby the surrounding forest.  Too small for carts, the only sign that the path \nis ever used is the mass of animal tracks.  To the east is what looks like a \nsmall cave entrance.\n',202,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(28936,0,0,0,'A Cave Entrance','  You are in a cave too smooth to be natural.  There are neither stalagmites\nlittering the floor nor are there stalactites protruding from above.  To the\neast a path leads deeper into the cavern while to the west is an exit from\nthe cave.\n',202,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,35,0,'',NULL),
