(30756,0,0,0,'Second Ring of the Stone Circle','  The second ring consists of uniformly grey stones of similar height and\ncut.  They are arrayed a few feet apart and line up perfectly with some \ninvisible line encircling the ring.  The ground here remains unblemished \nby any form of life or scuff in the dirt.  The stone in the center of the \ncircle is still blocked by the inner rings, but the throbbing of the runes \nseems to be growing stronger as you approach the center stone.\n',76,131072,42,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(30757,0,0,0,'Third Ring of the Stone Circle','  The third ring of the stone circle is the middle ring.  Here the pull of the \noutside world is balanced by the tugging of the central stone.  The runes on the\njet black stones of the third ring glow continuously now with a powerful hum. \nThe center stone is finally visible over the next set of stones.  It is a large\nwhite stone, square cut, with a faint bluish glow.  The stone is still not close\nenough to see any fine details.\n',76,131072,42,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
