(30763,0,0,0,'Fourth Ring of the Stone Circle','  The fourth set of rings is made up of a grey and yellow speckled stone.\nThe runes on these stones glow brightly, filling the air with a magical buzz.\nThe center stone is clearly visible now, its pristine white surface covered\nwith a spiderweb of intricate runes which are the source of the blue glow\nsurrounding the stone. A small path to the south leads to the center stone.\n',76,131072,42,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
