(30770,0,0,0,'The Center Stone','   Blue light fills the air in this small clearing as the runes on the center\nstone hum with magical energy.  The vibrations fill your core with the rhythm\nof the cosmos.  You feel your soul chiming in tune to the music of the stone.\nThe runes covering the slick white surface begin to beat in rhythm with your\nown heart.  The pulses seem to be building to some glorious crescendo, but \nsomething is missing, a note in the symphony of your being and the universe.\nHere the skein of reality can be shaped and reformed by unleashing the torrent\nof energy in the stone, but you need the key.\n',76,131073,60,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
