(30790,0,0,0,'Spirit World','  You stand in some bizarre hall.  The walls, ceiling and floor of this place \nare all made out of an ethereal substance.  Everything has a diffuse look, but \nis smooth as polished marble and hard as granite.  Light seems to emanate from \nevery surface, giving you a good look at the utter emptiness of this place.  \nAt the end of the hallway lies a large archway .\n',76,174585,60,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(30791,0,0,0,'Spirit World','  You stand in some bizarre hall.  The walls, ceiling and floor of this place \nare all made out of an ethereal substance.  Everything has a diffuse look, but \nis smooth as polished marble and hard as granite.  Light seems to emanate from \nevery surface, giving you a good look at the utter emptiness of this place.  \nAt the end of the hallway lies a large archway .\n',76,174585,60,1,30793,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(30792,0,0,0,'Spirit World ','  This room is tiny, there is a small circle in the middle of the room,\nand you are standing right in the middle.  A slight hum began to eminate\nfrom the walls when you entered, and it builds as you stand here.\n',76,174585,60,5,30770,1,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
