(30796,0,0,0,'Spirit World','  You stand in some bizarre hall.  The walls, ceiling and floor of this place \nare all made out of an ethereal substance.  Everything has a diffuse look, but \nis smooth as polished marble and hard as granite.  Light seems to emanate from \nevery surface, giving you a good look at the utter emptiness of this place.  \nAt the end of the hallway lies a large archway .\n',76,174585,60,1,30798,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(30797,0,0,0,'Spirit World','  You stand in some bizarre hall.  The walls, ceiling and floor of this place \nare all made out of an ethereal substance.  Everything has a smokey look, but \nis smooth as polished marble, and hard as granite.  Light seems to emanate \nfrom the walls, floors, and ceilings, giving you a good look at the emptiness \naround you.  A large archway permits entry into the room to the north.\n',76,174585,60,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(30798,0,0,0,'Spirit World','  This small room is molded from the same material as the hallway.  It\nis hard to say how large it is as any sense of depth perception is lost\nin the shifting of the ether, but you do notice an exit to the north. You\ncan see nothing in the room, except for what appears to be a blob of \ncoalescing ethereal matter in the center of the room.\n',76,174585,60,0,30798,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(30900,0,0,0,'Rocky Cavern','A large staircase, designed for creatures with long legs and large feet, has\nbeen carved into the side of the rock outcropping here.  High above, a large\nwhite structure spans out in all directions, with six large oak support beams\nspindling out from its base to the ground below.  The white structure sways\nslightly, creaking and popping as it moves.  Thin trails of dust snow down from\nbetween the oak beams.\n',0,131072,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(30901,0,0,0,'<W>Hall of Bones<1>','<W>The walls, ceiling and floor of this structure have been fashioned together\nfrom small humanoid bones, which have been adhered together with a fleshly\nstring and a foul smelling paste.  Small piles of dust flit about in the wind,\nslowly seeping down between the cracks in the floor.  <1>\n',0,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(30902,0,0,0,'<W>Hall of Bones<1>','<W>The walls, ceiling and floor of this structure have been fashioned together\nfrom small humanoid bones, which have been adhered together with a fleshly\nstring and a foul smelling paste.  Small piles of dust flit about in the wind,\nslowly seeping down between the cracks in the floor. <1>\n',0,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(30903,0,0,0,'Slave Pen','This small staging area is where the trolls corral the gnomes who are not\nhard at work.  Here the gnomes are allowed small periods of rest, socialization,\nand food.  Shredded bits of clothing litter the area.\n',0,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(30904,0,0,0,'Storage Area','  Numerous rotting gnome corpses have been thrown here, discarded by the trolls\nafter they have worked the poor gnomes to death.   The floor is covered with a\nmixture of rotting parts, maggots, and a slurry of various bodily fluids.  The\ncorpses are riddled with claw and bite marks, suggesting the trolls frequently\ncome here to feed. \n',0,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(30905,0,0,0,'Makeshift Stockyard','  Small steel pegs have been mashed into the shape of a horseshoe and driven\ninto the ground.  Broken leather straps litter the ground, which is covered with\ndecomposing animal waste.  Pieces of straw have been scattered about, both to\nsoak up animal waste and to feed the livestock. \n',0,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(30906,0,0,0,'Partially Constructed Shrine','  The air in this room is heavy with a strange green mist.  The walls and\nceiling are fashioned from small humanoid bones, causing the air to whistle as\nit slips through their uneven joints.  A large altar, shaped like a troll\'s head\nis propped against the wall, not yet completed and installed.\n',0,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(30907,0,0,0,'Partially Constructed Shrine','  The air in this room is heavy with a strange green mist.  The walls and\nceiling are fashioned from small humanoid bones, causing the air to whistle as\nit slips through their uneven joints.  A large altar, shaped like a troll\'s head\nis propped against the wall, not yet completed and installed. \n',0,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
