(30910,0,0,0,'Small Passage','  The walls, ceiling and floor of this structure have been fashioned together\nfrom small humanoid bones, which have been adhered together with a fleshly\nstring and a foul smelling paste.  Small piles of dust flit about in the wind,\nslowly seeping down between the cracks in the floor.  \n',0,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
