(30930,0,0,0,'A Slaughtering Spot','The walls, ceiling and floor of this structure have been fashioned together from\nsmall humanoid bones, which have been adhered together with a fleshly string and\na foul smelling paste.  The frequent slaughters have left the walls stained red.\nSmall piles of rotting flesh and shredded clothes are scattered throughout the\narea.  The walls are covered with streams of blood.\n',0,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(30931,0,0,0,'A Pile of Rotting Flesh','The walls, ceiling and floor of this structure have been fashioned together from\nsmall humanoid bones, which have been adhered together with a fleshly string and\na foul smelling paste.  Small piles of rotting flesh and shredded clothes are\nscattered throughout the area.\n',0,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(30932,0,0,0,'Processing Center','A large workstation consisting of a long table and several tools has been set up\nto allow the trolls to strip the flesh from gnomes, in order to continue\nprocessing bones to build their temple.  At the end of the table is a large vat\nfilled with acid, used to bleach the bones and strengthen them for use in\nconstruction.  Scattered haphazardly throughout the room are rotting piles of\njellied flesh.\n',0,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(30933,0,0,0,'Partially Constructed Hall','The walls, ceiling and floor of this structure have been fashioned together from\nsmall humanoid bones, which have been adhered together with a fleshly string and\na foul smelling paste.  Small piles of dust flit about in the wind, slowly\nseeping down between the cracks in the floor.\n',0,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(30934,0,0,0,'Partially Constructed Hall','The walls, ceiling and floor of this structure have been fashioned together from\nsmall humanoid bones, which have been adhered together with a fleshly string and\na foul smelling paste.  Small piles of dust flit about in the wind, slowly\nseeping down between the cracks in the floor.\n',0,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(30935,0,0,0,'Supply House','The walls, ceiling and floor of this structure have been fashioned together from\nsmall humanoid bones, which have been adhered together with a fleshly string and\na foul smelling paste.  Small piles of dust flit about in the wind, slowly\nseeping down between the cracks in the floor.  Large piles of bleached bones and\nbags containing a powder that when mixed with water turns into a quick setting paste are piled\nin the corner.\n',0,163864,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
