(30970,0,0,0,'Rocky Cavern','A large staircase, designed for creatures with long legs and large feet, has\nbeen carved into the side of the rock outcropping here.  High above, a large\nwhite structure spans out in all directions, with six large oak support beams\nspindling out from its base to the ground below.  The white structure sways\nslightly, creaking and popping as it moves.  Thin trails of dust snow down from\nbetween the oak beams.\n',0,131072,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
