(31039,0,0,0,'Versilard\'s Highway Near the Badlands ','  The desolate terrain of the Badlands stretches away to the south, while the\nancient highway of Emperor Versilard heads north towards a pass in the\nSympathian Mountains, which loom to the northwest.  The road is quite worn\ndown and large rocks lie in the way.  Few travelers come this way anymore.  \n',222,131072,22,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31040,0,0,0,'A Path Through the Scrub','  Piles of rocks and thick low-lying scrub cover the terrain as far as the eye\ncan see in all directions.  Here, however, the larger rocks and some of the\nvegetation have been cleared to make a narrow trail.  The trail continues to\nthe east.  To the west is a larger road.  \n',222,131072,22,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31041,0,0,0,'A Path Through the Scrub','  Piles of rocks and thick low-lying scrub cover the terrain as far as the eye\ncan see in all directions.  Here, however, the larger rocks and some of the\nvegetation have been cleared to make a narrow trail.  The trail continues to\nthe east and west.  \n',222,131072,22,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31042,0,0,0,'A Path Through the Scrub','  Piles of rocks and thick low-lying scrub cover the terrain as far as the eye\ncan see in all directions.  Here, however, the larger rocks and some of the\nvegetation have been cleared to make a narrow trail.  The trail continues to\nthe southeast and west.  \n',222,131072,22,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31043,0,0,0,'Top of a Cliff','  A path through the piles of rocks and thick low-lying scrub that cover the\nwestern terrain ends here at a cliff.  The sounds of waves meeting shoreline\nfill the air.  To the northeast, a path with a <o>rope<z> hung for support\nthat winds down the side of the cliff.  \n',222,131072,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31044,0,0,0,'A Path Leading down a Cliff','  The sounds of waves meeting shoreline fill the air.  This path follows a\nrocky ledge that stretches from the top of the cliff down to the ocean.  A\nsturdy <o>rope railing<z> has been attached to the rock face for support.  The\npath extends up to the southwest and down to the southeast.  \n',222,131072,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31045,0,0,0,'A Rocky Beach','  The percussive sounds of thousands of small stones being swept into each\nother in the swirl of the waters overcomes the dull roar of the ocean.  The\nsmell of brine is in the air.  An ocean stretches as far as the eye can see to\nthe east.  A path leads up a cliff to the northwest.  \n',222,131072,31,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31046,0,0,0,'The Piscean Sea','Clear waters allow a clear view of the ocean floor in this bay, which\nconsists of a myriad of small stones of every color of the rainbow.  The\nstones shift with the waters in an almost hypnotic pattern.  To the east, the\nocean stretches as far as the eye can see.  There is a small beach to the\nwest. \n',-1,131072,28,0,0,0,9,2,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31047,0,0,0,'The Piscean Sea','Clear waters allow a clear view of the ocean floor in this bay, which\nconsists of a myriad of small stones of every color of the rainbow.  The\nstones shift with the waters in an almost hypnotic pattern.  To the east, the\nocean stretches as far as the eye can see.  There is a small beach to the\nwest. \n',-1,131072,28,0,0,0,9,9,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31048,0,0,0,'The Piscean Sea','Clear waters allow a clear view of the ocean floor in this bay, which\nconsists of a myriad of small stones of every color of the rainbow.  The\nstones shift with the waters in an almost hypnotic pattern.  To the east, the\nocean stretches as far as the eye can see.  \n',-1,131072,28,0,0,0,9,2,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31049,0,0,0,'The Piscean Sea','Clear waters allow a clear view of the ocean floor in this bay, which\nconsists of a myriad of small stones of every color of the rainbow.  The\nstones shift with the waters in an almost hypnotic pattern.  To the east, the\nocean stretches as far as the eye can see.  \n',-1,131072,28,0,0,0,9,6,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31050,0,0,0,'Drossway Road','  A wide road of pebble and cinder runs to the south here.  The gatehouse of a\nlarge city towers overhead.  Far to the south, a hill bulges from the sparsely\ntreed plains.  \n',223,131072,22,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31051,0,0,0,'Drossway Road','  A wide road of pebble and cinder runs north and south.  To the north it\nleads to the base of a fortified gatehouse.  Far to the south, a hill bulges \nfrom the sparsely treed plains.  \n',223,131072,22,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31052,0,0,0,'Drossway Road','  A wide road of pebble and cinder runs north and south.  To the north it\nleads to the base of a fortified gatehouse.  Far to the south, a hill bulges \nfrom the sparsely treed plains.  \n',223,131072,22,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
