(31072,0,0,0,'Drossway Road','A wide road of pebble and cinder runs north and southwest.  The dull walls\nof a fortified city rise above the plain to the north and a hill bulges from\nthe sparsely treed plains to the south.  An old country barn lies to the east.\n',-1,131072,22,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31073,0,0,0,'Drossway Road','  A wide road of pebble and cinder runs northeast and south.  To the south the\nroad splits the face of a hill.  The dull walls of a fortified city rise above\nthe plain to the north.  \n',223,131072,22,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
