(31370,0,0,0,'In a Dream State of Battle','A strange mist envelops you as you walk through what is\nnot a reality nor total sleep.  The remains of past gladiators\nlitter the area and the smell of death lingers in the air.\n',216,139625,21,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31399,0,0,0,'Inside a Small Hut','  The construction of this well made hut is apparent from the inside.\nThe sticks that make up the frame have been carved for a smoother\nfinish and attached together in a meticulous manner. The grass that \nmakes up the walls and ceiling looks to be quite old however the \ncondition of the grass is surprisingly excellent.\n',217,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,80,0,'',NULL),
(31400,0,0,0,'A Smoky Cavern','A small cave has been mined out of <k>solid black granite<1>, which\n<W>sparkles<1> intermittently. <R>Tiny veins of ruby<1> streak through the\ngranite, forming a strange pattern.  A cool mist wisps down from the ceiling,\nfreezing instantly when it impacts the walls and floor.  A sheen of <k>smooth\nblack ice<1>  covers the floor.\n',0,139528,13,0,0,0,0,-1,30,500,0,'',NULL),
(31401,0,0,0,'Suspended Above A Pool of Lava','  This platform, which is actually a small spindle of rock growing up from \na <o>pool of lava,<1> trembles and sways continuously, as if it is moments from \ncrumbling into the <R>lava<1> below.  The lava is burping gases, releasing\nsulphur\ninto the humid air.  A rickety wooden bridge extends east to a cliff face.  Far\nabove,\na circular opening in the volcano reveals the outside sky. \n',0,139521,40,0,0,0,0,-1,30,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31402,0,0,0,'On A Rickety Wooden Bridge','  Rotted wooden planks have been laced together with some strange fiber\nto form this precarious bridge.  The planks are uneven, rotting, and do\nnot appear capable of supporting much weight.  The bridge sways back\nand forth from the swirling winds coming off the lava pool below.\n',0,139521,40,0,0,0,0,-1,15,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31403,0,0,0,'A Small Cave','  A small cave has been created in the granite rock by some large explosion.\nLarge jagged fragments of granite splinter from the walls, ceiling and floor,\ndangerously protruding from the surfaces. \n',0,139529,56,0,0,0,0,-1,30,250,0,'',NULL),
(31404,0,0,0,'Adjacent to a Dark Pool','  The ceiling of this small cave droops down above the center of the pool,\ncasting eerie shadows along the dark water.  Small drops of water fall from the\ncenter of the drooping ceiling, splashing into the water, sending ripples\ntoward the edge of the pool.  The water laps at the shore, soaking a dark ring\ninto the sand.\n',0,139528,10,0,0,0,0,-1,20,250,0,'',NULL),
(31405,0,0,0,'A Dark Pool','  The ceiling of this small cave droops down above the center of the pool,\ncasting\neerie shadows along the dark water.  Small drops of water fall from the center of\nthe drooping ceiling, splashing into the water, sending ripples toward the\nedge of the pool.\n',0,139528,8,0,0,0,0,0,50,250,0,'',NULL),
(31406,0,0,0,'Bottom of a Dark Pool','  The water in this pool is icy cold and eerily still.  The blackness of the\nwater\nblots out the surface, almost totally obscuring images on the surface of the\npool.  The pool itself is entirely devoid of any wildlife.\n',0,139528,53,0,0,0,0,0,20,250,0,'',NULL),
(31407,0,0,0,'Adjacent to a Dark Pool','  The ceiling of this small cave droops down above the center of the pool, \ncasting shadows along the dark water.  Small drips of water fall from the center\nof\nthe drooping ceiling, splashing into the water, sending ripples toward the\nedge of the pool.  The water laps at the shore, soaking a dark ring into the\nsand.\n',0,139528,10,0,0,0,0,-1,30,250,0,'',NULL),
(31408,0,0,0,'Smoky Cave','A small tunnel has been dug out of the granite rock, creating a slick and icy\ncave.  The walls, ceiling, and floor are covered with a slick ice.\n',0,139528,13,0,0,0,0,-1,25,250,0,'',NULL),
(31409,0,0,0,'Smoky Cave','A small tunnel has been dug out of the granite rock, creating a slick and icy\ncave.  The walls, ceiling, and floor are covered with a slick ice.\n',0,139528,13,0,0,0,0,-1,25,250,0,'',NULL),
(31410,0,0,0,'Smoky Chamber','  A small tunnel has been dug out of the granite rock, creating a slick and icy\ncave.  The walls, ceiling, and floor are covered with a slick ice.  Small wisps \nof smoke waft down from the glistening ceiling.\n',0,139528,13,0,0,0,0,-1,25,250,0,'',NULL),
(31411,0,0,0,'Volcanic Tube','  A broad lava flow stream drained slowly downward, leaving behind this wide\n\ntube.  The walls of the tube are marked with steps, revealing where the lava\nhas flown through the tube.  The floor and ceiling of the tube are perfectly\nflat, except for short lavacicles hanging from the ceiling, formed when the lava\nslowly dripped down as it cooled.\n',0,139529,49,0,0,0,0,-1,30,100,0,'',NULL),
(31412,0,0,0,'Volcanic Tube','  A broad lava flow field drained slowly downward, leaving behind this wide\ntube.  The walls of the tube are marked with steps, revealing where the lava\nhas flown through the tube.  Surprisingly, the floor and ceiling of the tube are\nperfectly flat, except for short lavacicles handing from the ceiling, formed\nwhen \nthe lava on the ceiling slowly dripped down as it cooled.\n',0,139529,49,0,0,0,0,-1,30,100,0,'',NULL),
(31413,0,0,0,'Volcanic Tube','  A broad lava flow field drained slowly downward, leaving behind this wide\ntube.  The walls of the tube are marked with steps, revealing where the lava\nhas flown through the tube.  Surprisingly, the floor and ceiling of the tube are\nperfectly flat, except for short lavacicles handing from the ceiling, formed\nwhen \nthe lava on the ceiling slowly dripped down as it cooled.\n',0,139529,49,0,0,0,0,-1,30,100,0,'',NULL),
(31414,0,0,0,'Dried Volcanic Flow','  A broad lava flow field drained slowly downward, leaving behind this wide\ntube.  The walls of the tube are marked with steps, revealing where the lava\nhas flown through the tube.  Surprisingly, the floor and ceiling of the tube are\nhas flown through the tube.  Surprisingly, the floor and ceiling of the tube are \nperfectly flat, except for short lavacicles handing from the ceiling, formed\nwhen \nthe lava on the ceiling slowly dripped down as it cooled.\n',0,139529,49,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31415,0,0,0,'Underneath an Ice Cap','  Frigid viscous water, full of small slivers of ice suspended in the tranquil\nwater, sit beneath an icecap.  All around the water has frozen, except to the\nnortheast where there is still a small section of unfrozen water that appears fluid enough to allow passage.\n',0,140552,53,0,0,0,0,-1,25,100,0,'',NULL),
(31416,0,0,0,'Atop an Icecap','  A small hole in the icecap leads to the treacherous water to the southwest.\nAround the hole, tiny waves have frozen in mid air, giving the appearance\nthat the deep has extended a clawed hand out of the water.  The air is crisp, \nchilled, and smells slightly of ozone. \n',0,139520,11,0,0,0,0,-1,30,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31417,0,0,0,'Underneath an Icy Overhang','  The tip of a large glacier has broken through the ground, curving slightly to\nthe west as it rises up, creating a natural ice cave.  The walls of the cave are\na clear solid ice, speckled with air bubbles.  The floor is slick and smooth.\n',0,139528,1,0,0,0,0,-1,30,100,0,'',NULL),
(31418,0,0,0,'Barren Pathway','  A frozen path meanders from underneath the glacier to a desolate cave. \nA frigid wind whips down off the glacier and blasts toward the cave, \nhurtling debris into the cave.\n',0,139520,1,0,0,0,0,-1,100,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31419,0,0,0,'Frigid Cave','  A frigid blast of wind continually swirls into the cave from the outside,\nswirling dust and debris, rendering this cave not much of a shelter.  The cave\nextends into the mountain to the west.  Waves of ice cover the floor, where the\nwind surged some water forward, instantly freezing it.\n',0,139528,13,0,0,0,0,-1,30,100,0,'',NULL),
(31420,0,0,0,'Eerie Cave','  This formerly desolate cave shows signs of recent activity.  Sections of the\nwall and floor have recently been mined and gutted, with the resulting rubble\npiled high along the northern wall.\n',0,139528,13,0,0,0,0,-1,30,100,0,'',NULL),
(31421,0,0,0,'Unholy Chapel','  A black altar, depicting a woman lying before a dragon\'s skeleton dominates\nthis small room.  The skeleton appears to be in the process of rising up from\nthe ground, while the woman has a look of terror on her face.  The room itself\nis jet black, and covered with ice.\n',0,139528,13,0,0,0,0,-1,30,100,0,'',NULL),
(31422,0,0,0,'Supply Room','  This portion of the cave has been cleaned up and is presently being used for\nstoring tools, food, and other necessities.  Strange runes have been etched into\nthe wall.\n',0,139528,13,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31423,0,0,0,'Smoky Hallway','  This jet black hallway is lined with life size statues of dragons, vampires,\nand skeletons.  The well shined surfaces of the hallway act as perfect mirrors,\nreflecting images.  Black tiles are adhered to the surfaces of the hallway,\nwhich extends to the south.  \n',0,8456,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(31424,0,0,0,'Smoky Hallway','  This smoky hallway abruptly dead ends before a swirling black archway.  From\nbeyond the archway, the sounds of screaming and suffering can be heard.  Above\nthe archway is a sign.\n',0,8456,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,100,0,'',NULL),
(31425,0,0,0,'Before a Wrought Iron Gate','  In the midst of this desolate field, <k>a spindly black tree<1>, barren of any\nleaves, \nhas erupted up from the thick black clay that coats the ground.  Excluding \nthe tree, this field lacks any other signs of vegetation.  To the north, a smoky \nblack archway hovers above the ground.  To the south, a wrought iron fence\nsurrounds a decayed cemetery.  The gate hangs precariously on its hinges,\nrusted and slightly bowed outwards, as if rammed from within. \n',0,139520,66,0,0,0,0,-1,50,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31426,0,0,0,'Entrance to a Graveyard','  A black stone archway spans over the entrance to the graveyard, shielding this\nsmall area from the elements.  Dead spindles of ivy cling to the archway,\nembedded in the stone.   Blood drips down from the archway, pooling in a tiny\nchannel in the ground, before seeping out of the cemetery towards the deadwood\ntree.\n',0,139528,32,0,0,0,0,-1,15,100,0,'',NULL),
(31427,0,0,0,'Graveyard','  The cemetery has recently been gutted.  Gravestones have been haphazardly\nthrown into a large pile, while the graves themselves have been ripped up. \nSplintered fragments of caskets are everywhere, scattered among the desecrated\ncorpses and mold covered bones.\n',0,139520,27,0,0,0,0,-1,50,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31428,0,0,0,'Graveyard','The cemetery has recently been gutted.  Gravestones have been haphazardly\nthrown into a large pile, while the graves themselves have been ripped up.\nSplintered fragments of caskets are everywhere, scattered among the\ndesecrated corpses and mold covered bones.\n',0,139520,27,0,0,0,0,-1,25,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31429,0,0,0,'Martyrium','This dark room, covered with strange symbols, is the final resting place of some\nhighly revered person.  Red brick walls have been constructed with a fine white\nmortar adhering them together.  The crosses that once adorned the walls have\nbeen ripped down and lay broken in the far corner.  The stone lid of the tomb\nitself lies at its base, shattered.  Except for a shredded gown, the tomb lies\nempty.\n',0,139528,32,0,0,0,0,-1,15,100,0,'',NULL),
(31430,0,0,0,'Outside a Desolate Cave','  A wall of spindly black trees surrounds a large opening before a desolate\ncave opening on the side of a small hill.  Scattered about the area are \nlarge bones that have been gnawed on, along with large piles of rock which\nlook to have been thrown out of the cave.  \n',0,139520,66,0,0,0,0,-1,40,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31431,0,0,0,'A Black Underwater River','  A raging river bubbles up from below and blasts further into the cave.  The\nwater rages against the cave walls and against rock formations that protrude up\nfrom the cave floor.  The walls are slick with perspiration.  Small crystals\nthat glisten and sparkle adorn the cave walls.  Strange rocks hang down from the\nceiling. \n',0,139528,29,0,0,0,8,9,25,250,0,'',NULL),
(31432,0,0,0,'A Black Underwater River','  A raging river bubbles up from below and blasts further into the cave.  The\nwater rages against the cave walls and against rock formations that protrude up\nfrom the cave floor.  The walls are slick with perspiration.  Small crystals\nthat glisten and sparkle adorn the cave walls.  Strange rocks hang down from the\nceiling. \n',0,139528,29,0,0,0,5,7,25,250,0,'',NULL),
(31433,0,0,0,'Under A Black River','  A raging river bubbles up from below and blasts further into the cave.  The\nwater rages against the cave walls and against rock formations that protrude up\nfrom the cave floor.  The walls are slick with perspiration.  Small crystals\nthat glisten and sparkle adorn the cave walls.  Strange rocks hang down from the\nceiling. \n',0,139528,30,0,0,0,8,0,25,250,0,'',NULL),
(31434,0,0,0,'Fiery Path','  A hollowed out lava tube serves as a passage through the dense mountain. \nSharp fragments of rock jut out from the tube, threatening to snag loose\narticles of clothing.  Sporadic jets of steam burst up from below, demonstrating\nthe volatile nature of this volcano.  A dense layer of ash covers the floor. \n',0,139529,49,0,0,0,0,-1,25,250,0,'',NULL),
(31435,0,0,0,'Fiery Path','  A hollowed out lava tube serves as a passage through the dense mountain. \nSharp fragments of rock jut out from the tube, threatening to snag loose\narticles of clothing.  Sporadic jets of steam burst up from below, demonstrating\nthe volatile nature of this volcano.  A dense layer of ash covers the floor. \n',0,139528,49,0,0,0,0,-1,25,250,0,'',NULL),
(31436,0,0,0,'Fiery Path','  A hollowed out lava tube serves as a passage through the dense mountain. \nSharp fragments of rock jut out from the tube, threatening to snag loose\narticles of clothing.  Sporadic jets of steam burst up from below, demonstrating\nthe volatile nature of this volcano.  A dense layer of ash covers the floor. \n',0,139528,49,0,0,0,0,-1,25,250,0,'',NULL),
(31437,0,0,0,'Fiery Path','  A hollowed out lava tube serves as a passage through the dense mountain. \nSharp fragments of rock jut out from the tube, threatening to snag loose\narticles of clothing.  Sporadic jets of steam burst up from below, demonstrating\nthe volatile nature of this volcano.  A dense layer of ash covers the floor. \n',0,139528,49,0,0,0,0,-1,25,250,0,'',NULL),
(31438,0,0,0,'Before a Fiery Gate','  A hollowed out lava tube serves as a passage through the dense mountain. \nSharp fragments of rock jut out from the tube, threatening to snag loose\narticles of clothing.  Sporadic jets of steam burst up from below, demonstrating\nthe volatile nature of this volcano.  A dense layer of ash covers the floor. A\nsmoky gate is to the east.\n',0,139528,49,0,0,0,0,-1,25,250,0,'',NULL),
(31439,0,0,0,'Temple Entrance','  The air in this hall is heavy with a strange green mist.  The walls and\nceiling of the halls are fashioned from a dark marble, causing sounds to\nreverberate off them, making it difficult to determine their origin.  Two large\npots of oil burn along the walls, providing light and covering the walls and\nceiling with a sooty sludge. \n',0,139529,55,0,0,0,0,-1,25,250,0,'',NULL),
(31440,0,0,0,'Penance Chamber','  The air in this hall is heavy with a strange green mist.  The walls and\nceiling of the halls are fashioned from a dark marble, causing sounds to\nreverberate off them, making it difficult to determine their origin.  Two large\npots of oil burn along the walls, providing light and covering the walls and\nceiling with a sooty sludge.  Various holes, about three feet off the ground\nsporadically shoot flames from them. \n',0,139528,32,0,0,0,0,-1,25,250,0,'',NULL),
(31441,0,0,0,'Bottom of a Large Evaporated Pool','The water in this pool is has evaporated and left dark rings around the cave. \nThe rings are each spaced about half a foot apart and are etched into the wall\nof the cave.  Small partially exposed fossils are suspended in the walls.  A\nthin haze of sand floats down from above, impeding vision and rapidly covering\nany tracks made in the ground.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,25,100,0,'',NULL),
(31442,0,0,0,'Before A Large Altar','  The air in this hall is heavy with a strange green mist.  The walls and\nceiling of the halls are fashioned from a dark marble, causing sounds to\nreverberate off them, making it difficult to determine their origin.  Two large\npots of oil burn along the walls, providing light and covering the walls and\nceiling with a sooty sludge.  A large altar, shaped like a dragon\'s head is\npropped against the wall.  Various sacrificial offerings have been placed in the\ngaping mouth of the dragon. \n',0,139529,55,0,0,0,0,-1,25,100,0,'',NULL),
(31443,0,0,0,'Behind the Altar','This is a oddly shaped room behind the dragon head altar.  The room is actually\nframed by the torso of the dragon, with its tail curling up into the ceiling. \nThe torso of the dragon is completely barren, except for a solitary scale\naffixed to a rib bone.  The walls and ceiling curve up and over, wrapping around\nthe room, following the frame of the dragon\'s body.\n',0,139592,55,0,0,0,0,-1,25,100,0,'',NULL),
(31444,0,0,0,'Laboratory','  A long table has been butted up against the west wall of this room.  A\nmummified corpse has been placed on the table and looks as if various\nexperiments have been performed on it.  The head of the corpse has been severed\nand is resting in a large metal tray.  From the state of the corpse, it appears\nthat rodents have been gnawing at the decayed flesh.  A strange chemical smell\nhangs in the air.\n',0,139592,55,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31445,0,0,0,'Path of the Doomed','Large skulls adorn the walls and ceiling of this narrow pathway.  Each of the\nskulls glows from the eyes and mouth sockets with a glowing red light.  The\nteeth of the skulls are elongated and sharper then the normal humanoid, with\nincisors that extend out of the mouth and above the nasal cavity.  The floor is\ncovered with powdered and splintered bones.\n',0,139593,55,0,0,0,0,-1,30,250,0,'',NULL),
(31446,0,0,0,'Doomed Path Through the Temple','  Large skulls adorn the walls and ceiling of this narrow pathway.  Each of the\nskulls glows from the eyes and mouth sockets with a glowing red light.  The\nteeth of the skulls are elongated and sharper then the normal humanoid, with\nincisors that extend out of the mouth and above the nasal cavity.  The floor is\ncovered with powdered and splintered bones.\n',0,139593,55,0,0,0,0,-1,30,250,0,'',NULL),
(31447,0,0,0,'Corpse Storage Room','  Numerous rotting corpses have been thrown here, discarded by the scientist\nafter his experimentations are complete.  The floor is covered with a mixture of\nrotting parts, maggots, and a slurry of various bodily fluids.  \n',0,139592,55,0,0,0,0,-1,30,1000,0,'',NULL),
(31448,0,0,0,'Altar of the Undead','  Large skulls adorn the walls and ceiling of this narrow room.  Each of the\nskulls glows from the eyes and mouth sockets with a glowing red light.  The\nteeth of the skulls are elongated and sharper then the normal humanoid, with\nincisors that extend out of the mouth and above the nasal cavity.  The floor is\ncovered with powdered and splintered bones.  A large altar is here, soaked in\nblood.\n',0,139593,55,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31449,0,0,0,'The Lair of the Dracolich','  Large skulls adorn the walls and ceiling of this narrow lair.  A <r>bright red\nlight<1> glows from each of the skulls, which have elongated pointy teeth.  The\nincisors of the skulls protrude out of the mouth, curling outward.  The floor is\ncovered with powdered and splintered bones. \n',0,139593,55,0,0,0,0,-1,30,500,0,'',NULL),
(31450,0,0,0,'Pass in the Parnithian Mountains','  The trail leads east-west through a seldom-used pass high in the mountains. \nTall, snow-covered peaks prevent travel to the north and south.  The trail\nitself is solid rock and the footing can be precarious.  \n',230,131072,22,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
