(31475,0,0,0,'A Travelers\' Shelter','  This cavern has been carved out of rock and frozen earth.  There is a fairly\nthick coating of dust covering most of the floor except along the southern\nwall, where the wind has stirred the dust into complex patterns.  Many cobwebs\nline the jagged edges of the walls.  There is a pile of stones on the floor to\nthe south.  \n',230,131080,13,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31480,0,0,0,'<o>Brightmoon Outpost<1>','This large room is at the base of the Brightmoon Outpost observation\ntower and serves as the principle meeting room for the paladins\nstationed here.  Although roughly constructed, the thick stone walls\nare impenetrable to any attack lesser than a siege engine.  The wood\nfloors are well worn from paladin boots and the ceiling is marred by\ndagger marks.  A cozy fireplace in the corner provides heat, although\nthe lack of chimney causes the smoke to flow freely up the staircase.\n',231,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,180,0,'',NULL),
(31481,0,0,0,'Winding Staircase','This staircase winds it\'s way up the tower, clinging to the stone walls.  The\nsteps are steep and narrow.\n',231,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,180,0,'',NULL),
(31482,0,0,0,'Top of Observation Tower','No door seperates this room for the outside, which allows cold drafts\nto sweep in.  paladins on watch use the observation deck to the south\nto keep an eye on the surrounding roads and come in here to get in\nfrom the elements.  The ceiling is black with soot from the fire\nbelow.\n',231,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,180,0,'',NULL),
(31483,0,0,0,'Observation Deck','This wide wooden deck juts out precariously from the Brightmoon Outpost tower.\nJust at the level of the treetops, it nonetheless provides a good view of the\nsurrounding roads.  On a clear day, one can even see Brightmoon and Grimhaven\noff in the distance.\n',231,131072,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31484,0,0,0,'Equipment Room','Heavy racks and lockers line the walls here, holding the equipment for the\npaladins stationed at the outpost.\n',231,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,180,0,'',NULL),
(31485,0,0,0,'Practice Field','This field has been swept free of debris to provide a safe area for paladins\nto work out.  A fence around the perimeter of the practice area keeps out\nwildlife.  A few practice dummies have been erected here and there, and\nthere is an archery target off to the side.\n',231,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31486,0,0,0,'Practice Field','This field has been swept free of debris to provide a safe area for paladins\nto work out.  A fence around the perimeter of the practice area keeps out\nwildlife.  A few practice dummies have been erected here and there, and\nthere is an archery target off to the side.\n',-1,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31487,0,0,0,'Practice Field','This field has been swept free of debris to provide a safe area for paladins\nto work out.  A fence around the perimeter of the practice area keeps out\nwildlife.  A few practice dummies have been erected here and there, and\nthere is an archery target off to the side.\n',-1,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31488,0,0,0,'Practice Field','This field has been swept free of debris to provide a safe area for paladins\nto work out.  A fence around the perimeter of the practice area keeps out\nwildlife.  A few practice dummies have been erected here and there, and\nthere is an archery target off to the side.\n',-1,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31489,0,0,0,'Barracks','Narrow cots are lined up in a row, rudimentary sleeping quarters for the\npaladins.  It is clear from the lack of space and decoration that the troops\ncome here only to sleep.\n',231,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,180,0,'',NULL),
(31490,0,0,0,'Cellar','Snaking roots break through cracks of stone in the glistening wet walls of this\ndark and dank cellar.  Even a paladin contingent can\'t function without a\nhealthy supply of rations and alcohol and this cellar serves as the store\nroom for the outpost.\n',231,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,180,0,'',NULL),
(31491,0,0,0,'Interrogation Room','Iron shackles have been mounted into the stone here and a few sturdy chairs\nare bolted to the floor.  While no implements of torture are to be seen,\npaladin interrogations of unbelievers are not known to be gentle.\n',231,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,180,0,'',NULL),
(31492,0,0,0,'<G>Field Hospital<1>','<g>  A hastily erected green pavilion leans out from the Brightmoon Outpost,\nprovided shelter for a field hospital.  A great deal of <o>mud<1><g> has been\ntracked in from the road to the south, dirtying the <Y>straw<1><g> that makes\nup the floor here.  Additional <Y>bales of hay<1><g> have been set out for use\nas benches and seats, while crude handmade tables have been setup to hold\noperating instruments as well as prone patients.  A door leading into the\noutpost is to the north.<1>\n',231,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,144,0,'',NULL),
(31493,0,0,0,'Open Air','An observation deck lies directly below, and open air is all around.\n',231,131072,34,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31750,-7,1,-1,'Grimhaven First Kingdom Bank','A brightly lit, clean lobby surrounds you, inviting and yet not\noverly comfortable.  Various banking supplies are available here for\ncustomers to prepare for their financial transactions.  A well kept\nplant stands next to the wall, adding a certain peaceful element to\nthe atmosphere.  The teller counter is to the west, ready to service\ncustomers with their banking transactions.\n',-1,166073,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31751,-8,1,-1,'Banking Window','A large thick <w>window<1> blocks access to the west, protecting the bank \ntellers while providing face to face contact.  Small slats in the glass\nallow sound to pass through.  A complex drawer system allows you to pass\nobjects to and from the teller.  There is a sign on the wall to assist you.\n',-1,401737,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,7,'',NULL),
(31752,-9,1,-1,'Teller Area','  Everything a bank teller would need to conduct financial transactions\ncan be found here, including large amounts of talens.  A thick secure\n<w>window<1> looks out into the lobby to the east.\n',223,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31753,-10,1,-1,'Hallway','  This is a nondescript hallway inside of the Grimhaven First Kingdom Bank.\nIt is well lit here and very clean.\n',223,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31754,-10,2,-1,'Hallway','  This is a nondescript hallway inside of the Grimhaven First Kingdom Bank.\nIt is well lit here and very clean.\n',223,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31755,-9,2,-1,'Teller Area','  Everything a bank teller would need to conduct financial transactions\ncan be found here, including large amounts of talens.  A thick secure\n<w>window<1> looks out into the lobby to the east.\n',223,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31756,-8,2,-1,'Banking Window','  A large thick <w>window<1> blocks access to the west, protecting the bank \ntellers while providing face to face contact.  Small slats in the glass\nallow sound to pass through.  A complex drawer system allows you to pass\nobjects to and from the teller.  There is a sign on the wall to assist you.\n',223,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,7,'',NULL),
(31757,-7,2,-1,'Small Business Alliance Kiosk','A brightly lit, clean lobby surrounds you, inviting and yet not\noverly comfortable.  Various banking supplies are available here for\ncustomers to prepare for their financial transactions.  A well kept\nplant stands next to the wall, adding a certain peaceful element to\nthe atmosphere.  The teller counter is to the west, ready to service\ncustomers with their banking transactions.\n',-1,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31758,-7,3,-1,'Grimhaven Corporate Offices','This area has been provided by the King of Grimhaven and the Grimhaven\nBank for local corporations to conduct business.  A number of\ncluttered desks are layed out in rows and the walls are covered in\ncharts and graphs.  Large accounting books are stacked up both on\ndesks and in corners and messengers run in and out with packages and\nnotes.  All of the tools a corporate officer would need to run a\ncorporation are available here.  A well kept plant stands next to the\nwall, adding a certain peaceful element to the atmosphere.  The teller\ncounter is to the west, ready to service customers with their banking\ntransactions.\n',-1,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31759,-8,3,-1,'Loan Office','A bank of filing cabinets on the north wall hold detailed records of\nloans to various merchants in Grimhaven.  While the bank itself does\nnot provide these loans, it has made this office space available to a\nprivate lender who works in conjunction with the bank to offer\nfinancing.\n',-1,174589,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31760,-9,3,-1,'Real Estate Office','Maps of varying sizes and shapes cover the walls, some heavily marked and\nothers pristine.  The usual filing cabinets stand up against one wall and\nseveral artistic sketches of apartments and houses are on display.\n',-1,174589,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31761,-10,3,-1,'Hallway','This is a nondescript hallway inside of the Grimhaven First Kingdom Bank.\nIt is well lit here and very clean.\n',-1,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31762,-10,4,-1,'Hallway','  This is a nondescript hallway inside of the Grimhaven First Kingdom Bank.\nIt is well lit here and very clean.\n',223,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31763,-9,4,-1,'Hallway','  This is a nondescript hallway inside of the Grimhaven First Kingdom Bank.\nIt is well lit here and very clean.\n',223,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31764,-7,4,-1,'Small Side Room','This room is fairly non-descript, aside from a secure looking door to\nthe north and a well kept plant attached to the south wall.\n',-1,401737,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,2,'',NULL),
(31765,-9,5,-1,'Hallway','  This is a nondescript hallway inside of the Grimhaven First Kingdom Bank.\nIt is well lit here and very clean.\n',223,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31766,-8,5,-1,'Hallway','  This is a nondescript hallway inside of the Grimhaven First Kingdom Bank.\nIt is well lit here and very clean.\n',223,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31767,-7,5,-1,'Hallway','  This is a nondescript hallway inside of the Grimhaven First Kingdom Bank.\nIt is well lit here and very clean.\n',223,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31768,-8,6,-1,'Break Room','  An odor of food and coffee permeates the air of this nondescript room.  A\nfew memos and clippings from the Grimhaven newspaper are tacked to the walls.\n',223,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31769,-7,6,-1,'Hallway','  This is a nondescript hallway inside of the Grimhaven First Kingdom Bank.\nIt is well lit here and very clean.\n',223,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31770,-7,7,-1,'Hallway','  This is a nondescript hallway inside of the Grimhaven First Kingdom Bank.\nIt is well lit here and very clean.\n',223,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31771,-6,7,-1,'Hallway','  This is a nondescript hallway inside of the Grimhaven First Kingdom Bank.\nIt is well lit here and very clean.\n',223,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31772,-5,7,-1,'Manager\'s Office','  This is the office of the bank\'s manager.  Plain grey walls border this\ntotally unadorned room, save for a single desk stacked with papers.  The\noffice extends its way to the east.\n',223,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31773,-4,7,-1,'Manager\'s Storage Area','  All of the transactions of the bank, as well as daily, monthly and yearly\nbalances, are stored here in large lockers for all time.\n',223,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31774,-2,7,-1,'Commodity Vault','  Stark and imposing, the bank\'s vault is as quiet as a tomb and twice as\nbleak.  The sheer mass of heavy metal and powerful magic crush down on\nyou, inspiring claustrophobia and panic.  Heavy cabinets line the walls,\nno doubt holding a large amount of the world\'s wealth.  A thieves paradise,\nor perhaps a thieves doom.\n',223,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,3,'',NULL),
(31775,-1,7,-1,'Commodity Vault','  Stark and imposing, the bank\'s vault is as quiet as a tomb and twice as\nbleak.  The sheer mass of heavy metal and powerful magic crush down on\nyou, inspiring claustrophobia and panic.  Heavy cabinets line the walls,\nno doubt holding a large amount of the world\'s wealth.  A thieves paradise,\nor perhaps a thieves doom.\n',223,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,3,'',NULL),
