(31782,-4,9,-1,'Guard Room','  Various weapons and pieces of armor hang on the walls, ready for emergency\nuse, or just left there casually.  The bank guards are usually busy\npatrolling the hallways of the bank, but they come here to fill out routine\nreports and to relax briefly.\n',223,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31783,-3,9,-1,'Hallway','  This is a nondescript hallway inside of the Grimhaven First Kingdom Bank.\nIt is well lit here and very clean.\n',223,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31784,-4,10,-1,'Emergency Armed Response Room','  A large raised oval platform occupies almost the entire room, labeled in\nsmall letters as \'Emergency Armed Response Transporter\'.  Although normally\ndormant, you can almost feel the magical energy waiting to spring into\naction like a coiled snake.  While an on-site security force is always\nnecessary with any bank, the ability to bring in additional troops on a\nmoments notice is unique to Grimhaven First Kingdom.\n',223,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31785,-3,10,-1,'Hallway','  This is a nondescript hallway inside of the Grimhaven First Kingdom Bank.\nIt is well lit here and very clean.\n',223,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31786,-2,10,-1,'Talen Vault','Stark and imposing, the bank\'s vault is as quiet as a tomb and twice as\nbleak.  The sheer mass of heavy metal and powerful magic crush down on\nyou, inspiring claustrophobia and panic.  Heavy cabinets line the walls,\nno doubt holding a large amount of the world\'s wealth.  A thieves paradise,\nor perhaps a thieves doom.\n',-1,139592,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,3,'',NULL),
