(31788,1,15,-1,'Petunia\'s Plant Shop','  <g>Many types of plants and flowers are arrayed around this small shop.\nA rack full of seed bags for gardeners stands against one wall.  Various\ngardening implements sit in buckets and racks along the other walls, along\nwith a bookshelf holding \"how to\" guides and flower arranging advice.\n',2,166077,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31789,-7,1,0,'Grimhaven Tax Office','This somber room serves as the office of the Royal tax collector, where all\ntaxes are received and tallied.  A deposit slot built into the floor allows\nthe tax man to send talens directly down to the bank tellers below for\nstorage.\n',-1,174589,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31800,0,0,0,'Underwater','  All around, as far as the eye can see, is a vast expanse of water.  Murky\ndeep blue surrounds you, as swirls of sand stir up from the current and\nthe pulsing of the ocean pushes and pulls you in rhythm.\n',229,139585,53,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(31801,0,0,0,'Vast Expanse Of Water','  All around, as far as the eye can see, is a vast expanse of water.  Choppy\nwaves lap quietly in a gentle wind.  The water is both fresh and clear, and\nbelow the surface lies smooth pebbles and sand that make up the riverbed\nof this unusual body of water.  A steep riverbank, too steep to climb,\nblocks passage in some directions.\n',229,139585,52,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
