(31818,0,0,0,'A Fishing Shack','  This quaint little shack sits alone on a small island with a view out to\nthe waters.  No living accomodations of any sort exist here, there are only\nhooks and drawers and cupboards and shelves for various fishing supplies.\n',229,172365,55,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
