(31890,0,0,0,'Underwater','  All around, as far as the eye can see, is a vast expanse of water.  Murky\ndeep blue surrounds you, as swirls of sand stir up from the current and\nthe pulsing of the ocean pushes and pulls you in rhythm.\n',229,139585,53,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
