(31904,0,0,0,'Prison Sewage Pipe','<k>  Thick, dark water rushes by at a rapid pace, filled with the sewage and\ndebris of daily life in the Prison.  Thick algae lines the sides of the pipe,\nmaking any sort of traction nearly impossible, while various unknown objects\nboth soft and hard bump into you in the current.  Not a glimmer of natural\nlight can be seen in any direction and the sewage fills the entire pipe,\nthreatening to suffocate any air breather foolish enough to be caught here.\nSharp metal spikes extend from the walls of the pipe, tearing to shreds\nany animal or man.  A few errant bones and scraps of cloth can be seen\nclinging to the spikes.  A heavy steel grate is in the ceiling,\nthrough which garbage is dumped<1>\n',-1,139272,30,0,0,0,1,3,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(31905,0,0,0,'Garbage Chute','This room stands above a sewage pipe full of rushing fetid water.  A thick\nsteel grate installed in the floor provides room to drop garbage through,\nbut not enough room for a human body.  At least not it one piece.  Scraps\nof trash cling to the bars of the grate, rotting in the moisture and\na foul stench rises from the water below.  The rest of the prison lies\nto the south.\n',-1,139273,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,26,'',NULL),
(31906,-5,-2,0,'Overstock Room','Occasionally the ration factory produces an excess of rations, usually\nresulting from a particularly vicious prison riot, or a local catastrophy.\nWhen this happens, the overstock is held in this room for wholesale to\nindividual traders or adventurers looking for a deal.\n',0,166077,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(32750,0,0,0,'A Path Cutting Through the Forest','Though this path is extremely narrow, it seems to be perfect for the tiny\nfeet that travel it.  All around there is dense brush and massive trees with\nroots protruding everywhere.  While traversing the path the chirping of birds\nand rustling leaves softly fill the air with song. \n',0,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(32751,0,0,0,'A Path Cutting Through the Forest','  Though this path is extremely narrow, it seems to be perfect for the tiny\nfeet that travel it.  All around there is dense brush and massive trees with\nroots protruding everywhere.  While traversing the path the chirping of birds\nand rustling leaves softly fill the air with song. \n',0,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(32752,0,0,0,'A Path Cutting Through the Forest','  Though this path is extremely narrow, it seems to be perfect for the tiny\nfeet that travel it.  All around there is dense brush and massive trees with\nroots protruding everywhere.  While traversing the path the chirping of birds\nand rustling leaves softly fill the air with song. \n',0,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(32753,0,0,0,'A Narrowing Path Leading to a Camp','  The path is well beaten with apparent regular use, though it is still very\nnarrow as branches of trees and protruding roots sometimes find their way in.  A\nbreak in the thick canopy of trees overhead has allowed a small portion of the\nsky to be visible.\n',0,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(32754,0,0,0,'Path through the Camp','  The path is well beaten with apparent regular use, though it is still very\nnarrow as branches of trees and protruding roots sometimes find their way in. \nOn each side of the trail, almost overcome by the surrounding vegetation, are\nsmall tents.  The fabric from which they are made has suffered some damage\nfrom being out in the weather for so long.  They are covered in leaves and\ndirt and are almost imperceptible due to their diminished size. \n',0,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(32755,0,0,0,'Path through the Camp','  The path is well beaten with apparent regular use, though it is still very\nnarrow as branches of trees and protruding roots sometimes find their way in. \nOn each side of the trail, almost overcome by the surrounding vegetation, are\nsmall tents.  The fabric from which they are made has suffered some damage\nfrom being out in the weather for so long.  They are covered in leaves and\ndirt and are almost imperceptible due to their diminished size. \n',0,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(32756,0,0,0,'Path through the Camp','  The path is well beaten with apparent regular use, though it is still very\nnarrow as branches of trees and protruding roots sometimes find their way in. \nOn each side of the trail, almost overcome by the surrounding vegetation, are\nsmall tents.  The fabric from which they are made has suffered some damage\nfrom being out in the weather for so long.  They are covered in leaves and\ndirt and are almost imperceptible due to their diminished size. \n',0,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,255,-1,0,'',NULL),
(32757,0,0,0,'At a Small Well','The path widens here as the several footprints on the moist ground suggest it\'s a busy spot. The smell of the\nforest is fragrant as the winds pass through the trees. Puddles of mud with small \ntwigs and leaves floating about cover the ground.  A faint dripping can be \nheard as water falls from a leak in a bucket. \n',0,131072,36,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(32758,0,0,0,'Through the Thicket','  The undergrowth has thickened to the point where no trail is visible.  The\ntall\ntrees and heavy vegetation block sight in almost every direction.  Not even the\nwind finds its way through.  The ground is moist and covered with leaves and\nprotruding roots.\n',0,131080,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,20,0,'',NULL),
(32759,0,0,0,'A Secluded Clearing','The heavy undergrowth suddenly opens up revealing a large natural clearing. Tall\ntrees border the area, providing great isolation from unwanted elements and\ninvaders. The ground is grassy and moist, carpeted with leaves. Overhead the sky\nis visible in small doses through the canopies.\n',0,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(32760,0,0,0,'An Elegant Bedroom','  The most vibrant colors cover this bedroom. <r>Soft reds<z>, <O>soothing\noranges<o><z> and soft light make the room very warm and comfortable. The \nperfect balance of colors and light would seem to dazzle the minds of the \nmost sophisticated of sorts. Unlike the rest of the rooms in this cave, no \namount of stone is visible to the eye.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(32761,0,0,0,'A Make-shift Treasure Room','  Old, worn tapestries hang from the walls. There are no furs covering the floor\nwhich has been smoothed out from the constant pacing of feet. The smell of\nsweat is a constant and contrasts with the incense from the west. The room seems\nsweat is a constant and contrasts with the incense from the west. The room seems \nof very little significance in comparison to the rest of the cave due to the\nlack \nof adornments.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(32762,0,0,0,'A Hollowed-out Vault','Large chunks of cracked rocks cover the walls.  Here and there tapestries have\nbeen hung as an attempt to cover the cracks and make the room look cozier.  The\nair is cold and damp, not a breeze can be felt.  The same cracked rocks cover\nthe ground.  Incomprehensive faint sounds echo through the room, but the source\ncan\'t be distinguished.\n',0,145736,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(32780,0,0,0,'A Large Gaping Cavern','  This large stone cavern has been very elegantly designed. Hung from the\nwalls are rich tapestries and a large exotic fur from a distant creature \nblankets the cool stone floor. The scent from the finest incense from across \nthe world \nfills the cavern with a calming aroma.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(32781,0,0,0,'A Small Dining Area','\n  The walls in this cave are kept very smooth and clean with one lonely mural\nhanging from it.  Beautiful furs cover the stone floor, although they have been\ntorn up a little from the constant movement of chairs.  Many meals have been\nserved to important people here, and the impotence of the small-sized furniture\nshows that influence does not come with size.  The faint smell of rabbit stew\ncoming from above mingles with a strong aroma of incense coming from the north.\nDark clouds cover the sky.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(32782,0,0,0,'The Inside of a Very Small Tent','  The small tent has been constructed of a plain fabric that has become\ndamaged with the effects of weather and time.  When rain falls, tiny droplets\nof water seem to find their way in, though not enough to bother any that\nsleep.  Tiny knapsacks are leaning against the wall.  These tents are\nspecifically designed for sleeping arrangements only. \n',0,131072,32,0,0,0,0,-1,3,40,0,'',NULL),
(32783,0,0,0,'The Inside of a Very Small Tent','  The small tent has been constructed of a plain fabric that has become\ndamaged with the effects of weather and time.  When rain falls, tiny droplets\nof water seem to find their way in, though not enough to bother any that\nsleep.  Tiny knapsacks are leaning against the wall.  These tents are\nspecifically designed for sleeping arrangements only. \n',0,131072,32,0,0,0,0,-1,3,40,0,'',NULL),
