(32788,0,0,0,'A Small Grassy Break in the Trees','Tall trees border this open space. Around the grassy break the forest is too\nthick to allow passage in any direction other than where the trees have been\nchopped up. The smell of the forest is fragrant as the winds pass through the\ntrees. Various wildlife noises can be heard from nearby. The grassy break\nextends to the north, east and west.\n',0,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(32789,0,0,0,'A Small Grassy Break in the Trees','  Tall trees border this open space.  Around the grassy break the forest is too\nthick to allow passage in any direction other than where the trees have been\nchopped up.  The smell of the forest is fragrant as the winds pass through the\ntrees.  Various wildlife noises can be heard from nearby.  The grassy break\nextends to the north and east.\n',0,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(32790,0,0,0,'A Small Grassy Break in the Trees','  Tall trees border this open space.  Around the grassy break the forest is too\nthick to allow passage in any direction other than where the trees have been\nchopped up.  The smell of the forest is fragrant as the winds pass through the\ntrees.  Various wildlife noises can be heard from nearby.  The grassy break\nextends to the north and west\n',0,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(32791,0,0,0,'A Small Grassy Break in the Trees','Tall trees border this open space.  Around the grassy break the forest is too\nthick to allow passage in any direction other than where the trees have been\nchopped up.  The smell of the forest is fragrant as the winds pass through the\ntrees.  Various wildlife noises can be heard from nearby.  The grassy break\nextends to the south, west, and southwest.\n',0,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(32792,0,0,0,'A Small Grassy Break in the Trees','  Tall trees border this open space.  Around the grassy break the forest is too\nthick to allow passage in any direction other than where the trees have been\nchopped up.  The smell of the forest is fragrant as the winds pass through the\ntrees.  Various wildlife noises can be heard from nearby.  The grassy break\nextends to the south, east and west.\n',0,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(32793,0,0,0,'A Small Grassy Break in the Trees','  Tall trees border this open space.  Around the grassy break the forest is too\nthick to allow passage in any direction other than where the trees have been\nchopped up.  The smell of the forest is fragrant as the winds pass through the\ntrees.  Various wildlife noises can be heard from nearby.  The grassy break\nextends to the south and east.\n',0,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(32800,0,0,0,'Twist on a Wooded Lane','  The lane continues to wind between the trunks of trees, with the faint sign\nof wheel tracks still visible in the grass that has been crushed down.  On\neither side of the path are small bushes intermingled with wildflowers in\nvarying colors.  A few birds fly from tree to tree, the gentle sound of\nflapping wings echoes through. \n',0,131072,36,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(32801,0,0,0,'A Wooded Lane','   The dirt lane winds between massive trees, which provide a covering for the\nroad here.  Scattered amongst the trunks of the trees are small clusters of\nwildflowers, in just about any color imaginable.  A few birds fly from tree to\ntree, the gentle sound of flapping wings echoes through.\n',0,131072,36,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(32802,0,0,0,'A Wooded Lane','   Massive trees line the lane here, providing shade as it winds between the\ntrunks.  On either side of the path are small bushes intermingled with\nwildflowers in varying colors, while from the trees, the sound of a bird\'s \nsong can be heard.\n',0,131072,36,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(32803,0,0,0,'A Wooded Lane','Massive trees line the lane here, providing shade as it winds between the\ntrunks.  On either side of the path are small bushes intermingled with\nwildflowers in varying colors, while from the trees, the sound of a bird\'s \nsong can be heard.\n',0,131072,36,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
