(32836,0,0,0,'Trail Through the Grassland','  A beautiful light green grassy land stretches in every direction.  The\nvegetation is no more than a foot tall, except for the taller shrubs of colorful\nwildflowers sprinkled about.  A faint sign of wheel tracks is still visible in\nthe grass that has been crushed down.\n',0,131072,23,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(32837,0,0,0,'Trail Through the Grassland','  A beautiful light green grassy land stretches in every direction.  The\nvegetation is no more than a foot tall, except for the taller shrubs of\ncolorful wildflowers sprinkled about.  A faint sign of wheel tracks is still\nvisible in the grass that has been crushed down.  The ground starts to slope up\na bit to the east toward the imposing Sympathian Mountains.\n',0,131072,23,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(32838,0,0,0,'Grassland Near the Mountains','While off to the west a vast green grassy field can be seen, to the east the\nlandscape looks desolate. The green grass and colorful wildflowers give way to\nbrown dirt and very little vegetation as the Sympathian Mountains start to rise.\nA faint sign of wheel tracks heads off to the grassland, but toward the\nmountains no impression is visible.\n',0,131072,23,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(32839,0,0,0,'The Base of the Sympathian Mountains','  While off to the west a vast green grassy field can be seen, to the east the\nlandscape looks desolate.  The green grass and colorful wildflowers give way to\nbrown dirt and very little vegetation.\n',0,131072,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(32840,0,0,0,'The Base of the Sympathian Mountains','  While off to the west a vast green grassy field can be seen, to the east the\nlandscape looks desolate.  The green grass and colorful wildflowers give way to\nbrown dirt and very little vegetation.\n',0,131072,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(32841,0,0,0,'The Sympathian Mountains','  Very little vegetation grows here.  Dotting the landscape are small clusters\nof discolored grass.  The ground is brown dirt with protruding rocks tripping\nthe unwary.  The air gets cloudy as the wind blows and picks up dust.\n',0,131072,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(32842,0,0,0,'The Sympathian Mountains','  Very little vegetation grows here.  Dotting the landscape are small clusters\nof discolored grass.  The ground is brown dirt with protruding rocks tripping\nthe unwary.  The air gets cloudy as the wind blows and picks up dust.\n',0,131072,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
