(33340,0,0,0,'In the Undergrowth','  The trees grow closely together here, their branches forming a tight canopy\noverhead.  A heavy growth of bushes and seedlings fills much of the remaining\nspace.\n',242,131080,26,0,0,0,0,-1,1,200,0,'',NULL),
(33341,0,0,0,'A Secluded Glade','  Ancient branches heavily loaded with broad green leaves arch overhead,\nspreading inward from a wide circle of thick-boled trees.  A thick carpet\nof soft light green moss covers the floor of the glade.  A faint path leads\nnorth into a thicket of bushes and seedlings.\n',242,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33342,0,0,0,'The Haon-Dor Forest','  Old stands of tall white birch trees add splashes of white to a backdrop of\ndark green pines.  The many trees and dense undergrowth occlude sight of all\nbut the nearest parts of the forest.  A faint path continues to the northwest\nand south.\n',242,131072,36,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33343,0,0,0,'The Haon-Dor Forest','  Old stands of tall white birch trees add splashes of white to a backdrop of\ndark green pines.  The many trees and dense undergrowth occlude sight of all\nbut the nearest parts of the forest.  A faint path continues to the north and\nsoutheast.\n',242,131072,36,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33344,0,0,0,'A Dead End','Old stands of tall white birch trees add splashes of white to a backdrop of\ndark green pines.  The many trees and dense undergrowth occlude sight of all\nbut the nearest parts of the forest.  A faint path extends to the northwest, but\nis blocked to the south by a stand of extremely large trees.  A few old axe\nmarks on the trees suggest that someone once tried to extend the path, but gave\nup.\n',-1,131072,36,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33345,0,0,0,'The Haon-Dor Forest','  Old stands of tall white birch trees add splashes of white to a backdrop of\ndark green pines.  The many trees and dense undergrowth occlude sight of all\nbut the nearest parts of the forest.  A faint trail continues to the north and\nsouth.\n',242,131072,36,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33346,0,0,0,'End of a Faint Trail','  Old stands of tall white birch trees add splashes of white to a backdrop of\ndark green pines.  The many trees and dense undergrowth occlude sight of all\nbut the nearest parts of the forest.  A faint trail extends to the north, but\ndisappears to into the vegetation to the south.\n',242,131072,36,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33347,0,0,0,'A Clearing in the Forest','  Large slabs of bedrock are exposed here, preventing the growth of anything\nother than various white, grey, and green lichens.  The clearing is surrounded\nby dense growth that occludes sight of all but the nearest parts of the forest.\nThere is a path to the north and west.\n',242,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33348,0,0,0,'A Clearing in the Forest','Large slabs of bedrock are exposed here, preventing the growth of anything\nother than various white, grey, and green lichens.  The clearing is surrounded\nby dense growth that occludes sight of all but the nearest parts of the forest.\nThere is a path to the north and a small cabin to the south.\n',-1,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33349,0,0,0,'A Clearing in the Forest','Large slabs of bedrock are exposed here, preventing the growth of anything\nother than various white, grey, and green lichens.  The clearing is surrounded\nby dense growth that occludes sight of all but the nearest parts of the forest.\nA tree near the edge of the clearing has a few planks nailed to it, allowing\naccess to a trapdoor leading to a treehouse.  There is a path to the northwest.\n',-1,131072,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33400,0,0,0,'A Misty Trail','  A small trail twists and turns about on itself in a feeble attempt to\nprovide passage through the dense forest.  Small tremors shake the ground\ncausing a few frail trees to plummet to the ground.  A strange mist floats about\neverywhere, blanketing the area completely.\n',244,131072,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
