(33425,0,0,0,'On The Kranor River','  You are on the River Kranor.  This wide, flowing river is deep and cold, and\nruns from its spring, deep in the Parnithian Mountains all the way to the Myrian\nOcean.\n',244,131072,29,0,0,0,36,1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
