(33450,0,0,0,'Outside a Stone Archway','Buried under centuries of rubble and vegetation, a huge stone archway\nstands to the east. Ancient writing covers the frame of the arch, and\nalthough you cannot decipher their meaning, you get the feeling that it is\na warning of some kind. Apparently, whatever lies beyond this room is not\nonly old, but deadly. There is a rusting iron gate to the east.\n',0,131328,45,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33451,0,0,0,'Atop an Old Stone Staircase','The air is thick and musty inside the stone arch. The sound of the wind\noutside can no longer be heard. In fact, you can hear almost nothing from\ninside the arch. Even the sounds of your own breath seem to be sucked\naway into the room below.\nA rusting iron gate stands to the west.\n',0,132360,56,0,0,0,0,-1,11,100,0,'',NULL),
(33452,0,0,0,'A Silent Hall','There is absolutely no noise in this hall. While the craftsmanship of the\nstone work would suggest it to be centuries old, the\nfloor is completely devoid of any dust or signs of aging. Above you, a\nstone stair leads up and out of the eerie silence.\n',0,132360,61,0,0,0,0,-1,11,100,0,'',NULL),
(33453,0,0,0,'Unearthed Ruins','This area has recently been uncovered in an archaeological dig. Given\nthe overwhelming amount of broken stone and the short amount of time in\nwhich it was unearthed, it does not appear to have been uncovered with\nmuch care. There are several larger, solid looking stones that jut out\nfrom the dirt walls and others that poke up out of the ground. Mostly\neverything is covered with a fresh looking black soot.\n',0,131072,45,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33454,0,0,0,'Unearthed Ruins','This area has recently been uncovered in an archaeological dig. Given\nthe overwhelming amount of broken stone and the short amount of time in\nwhich it was unearthed, it does not appear to have been uncovered with\nmuch care. There are several larger, solid looking stones that jut out\nfrom the dirt walls and others that poke up out of the ground. Mostly\neverything is covered with a fresh looking black soot.\n',0,131072,45,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33455,0,0,0,'Unearthed Ruins','This area has recently been uncovered in an archaeological dig. Given\nthe overwhelming amount of broken stone and the short amount of time in\nwhich it was unearthed, it does not appear to have been uncovered with\nmuch care. There are several larger, solid looking stones that jut out\nfrom the dirt walls and others that poke up out of the ground. Mostly\neverything is covered with a fresh looking black soot.\n',0,131072,45,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33456,0,0,0,'Unearthed Ruins','This area has recently been uncovered in an archaeological dig. Given\nthe overwhelming amount of broken stone and the short amount of time in\nwhich it was unearthed, it does not appear to have been uncovered with\nmuch care. There are several larger, solid looking stones that jut out\nfrom the dirt walls and others that poke up out of the ground. Mostly\neverything is covered with a fresh looking black soot.\n',0,131072,45,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33457,0,0,0,'A Silent Hall','There is absolutely no noise in this hall. While the craftsmanship of the\nstonework would suggest it to be centuries old, the floor is completely devoid\nof any dust or signs of aging.\n',0,132360,61,0,0,0,0,-1,11,100,0,'',NULL),
(33458,0,0,0,'Before an Ancient Vault','In the wall to the east is what used to be an enormous vault door, leading\ninto the ossuary. The door has since been walled over and various potent\nmagics have been cast to prevent anyone from entering. However, it is\nunlikely that the wizard who created this barrier would have left himself\nwithout a way to get in, if what they say about the contents of the room\nis true.\n',0,131336,61,0,0,0,0,-1,11,100,0,'',NULL),
(33459,0,0,0,'Before the Ossuary','Surely, this is a place the gods have forgotten. The air is heavy and oppressive.\nYet, still it is chilly and the carved stone walls are cool to the touch and\nslightly damp. \nLight seems weaker here. Lanterns and torches flicker and almost go out.\nEven the glow of magical enchantments is subdued. Dark as it may be, the shadows\nare not as threatening as the silence.\nThe walls here steal noise where they should echo. Excepting an intermitten\nsound of a distant drip,\nnothing here is making a sound. There is not even the familiar scuttle of\nvermin. However,\nthere is the feeling somewhere deep inside that many things are moving and even\nmore are watching.\nPerhaps it would be best not to stay.\n',0,131080,61,0,0,0,0,-1,11,100,0,'',NULL),
(33460,0,0,0,'The Ossuary','Nothing in this room has been touched by living hands in well over a thousand\nyears. It has been longer still since they were touched by the light of the\nsun. The stone floors lack signs of any wear or use and there is even a lack\nof natural deterioration that stone this old ought to have. The ceilings are\nstill\nintact and have not yet begun to crack from strain. Most of the sounds in this room\nare stolen by the shadows, which are numerous. However, the distinct sound\nof voices echoes about. Apparently, whatever was buried here ages ago is awake.\n',0,139272,61,0,0,0,0,-1,11,100,0,'',NULL),
(33461,0,0,0,'The Ossuary','Nothing in this room has been touched by living hands in well over a thousand\nyears. It has been longer still since they were touched by the light of the\nsun. The stone floors lack signs of any wear or use and there is even a lack\nof natural deterioration that stone this old ought to have. The ceilings are\nstill\nintact and have not yet begun to crack from strain. Most of the sounds in this room\nare stolen by the shadows, which are numerous. However, the distinct sound\nof voices echoes about. Apparently, whatever was buried here ages ago is awake.\n',0,139272,61,0,0,0,0,-1,8,100,0,'',NULL),
