(33503,0,0,0,'An Upstairs Hallway','  This is a spotless hallway that leads to the upstairs bedrooms.  The solid\nplank floorboards are kept immaculately clean and shine with regular waxing. \nThere is a yellow door to the north, a purple door to the east and a white\ndoor to the south. \n',-1,172221,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
