(33516,0,0,0,'A Little Path','  A little path extends south to the road and north towards a farmhouse.  The\npath is littered with leaves, sticks and other debris, the rose beds are in\nare in deplorable shape. \n',-1,131072,22,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33517,0,0,0,'Inside a Farmhouse','  Smoke fouled and dingy, the walls in this large room could use a fresh\nwhite- washing.  Only barely visible are the pitted and stained plank\nfloorboards which are quite caked with filth and debris.  There is a blue door\nto the north, a green door to the east and a red door to the west. \n',-1,172221,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(33518,0,0,0,'A Bedroom','  This is a small private room.  The walls might have once been white but have\nbecome dingy over time.  The dirty wood floor is at least made from sturdy\nwood planks. \n',-1,172221,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(33519,0,0,0,'A Bedroom','  This is a small private room.  The walls might have once been white but have\nbecome dingy over time.  The dirty wood floor is at least made from sturdy\nwood planks. \n',-1,172221,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
