(33521,0,0,0,'An Upstairs Hallway','  This is a dingy hall that leads to the upstairs bedrooms.  The solid plank\nfloorboards have become badly stained and pitted through neglect, they are\nalso quite caked with filth and debris.  There is a white door to the north, a\npurple door to the east and a yellow door to the west. \n',-1,172221,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
