(33650,0,0,0,'Norman\'s Road','  A packed dirt road runs northwest and southeast through a sparse wood. \nThorny brush blocks passage in other directions.  To the southeast, the forest\ngives way to open farmland.  The trees get older and larger to the northwest. \n',251,131072,36,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33651,0,0,0,'Norman\'s Road','  A packed dirt road runs northwest and southeast through a sparse wood. \nThorny brush blocks passage in other directions.  Not far to the southeast,\nthe forest gives way to open farmland.  To the northwest the trees get older\nand larger. \n',251,131072,36,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33652,0,0,0,'Norman\'s Road','  A packed dirt road runs northwest and southeast through a sparse wood. \nThorny brush blocks passage in other directions.  Not far to the southeast,\nthe forest gives way to open farmland.  To the northwest the trees get older\nand larger. \n',251,131072,36,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33653,0,0,0,'Norman\'s Road','  A packed dirt road runs north and southeast through a sparse wood.  Thorny\nbrush blocks passage in other directions.  Not far to the southeast, the\nforest gives way to open farmland.  To the north the trees get older and\nlarger.\n',251,131072,36,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33654,0,0,0,'Norman\'s Road','  A packed dirt road runs north and south through a forest.  A thicket of\nscrub limits passage beyond the path.  The woods thin out to the south. \n',251,131072,36,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33655,0,0,0,'Norman\'s Road','  A packed dirt road runs northwest and south through a forest.  A thicket of\nscrub limits passage beyond the path.  The woods thin out to the south. \n',251,131072,36,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
