(33725,0,0,0,'Mountain Pass','  The path here is littered with rocks and boulders.  Surrounded on all sides\nby mountains, your view is quite limited.  You stand amid some of the tallest\nmountains your eyes have ever seen.  To the west, a mammoth snow capped summit\ndwarfs all of its neighbors.  Wind whips snow of the nearby peaks, and \nevidence of recent avalanches can be seen along the tree line above this pass.\n',255,131072,5,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
