(33735,0,0,0,'Mountain Pass','  The narrow path winds its way through the mountains.  The peaks grow taller\nand steeper toward the west where they practically scratch against the sky.\nTo the east the peaks gradually grow smaller, but they continue to obscure\nthe horizon.  The path here is difficult to travel as you must navigate\naround ancient rockslides and in between natural crevices.\n',255,131072,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33736,0,0,0,'Mountain Pass','  The narrow path winds its way through the mountains.  The peaks grow taller\nand steeper toward the west where they practically scratch against the sky.\nTo the east the peaks gradually grow smaller, but they continue to obscure\nthe horizon.  The path here is difficult to travel as you must navigate\naround ancient rockslides and in between natural crevices.\n',255,131072,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33737,0,0,0,'Mountain Pass','  The narrow path winds its way through the mountains.  The peaks grow taller\nand steeper toward the west where they practically scratch against the sky.\nTo the east the peaks gradually grow smaller, but they continue to obscure\nthe horizon.  The path here is difficult to travel as you must navigate\naround ancient rockslides and in between natural crevices.\n',255,131072,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33738,0,0,0,'Mountain Pass','  The narrow path winds its way through the mountains.  The peaks grow taller\nand steeper toward the west where they practically scratch against the sky.\nTo the east the peaks gradually grow smaller, but they continue to obscure\nthe horizon.  The path here is difficult to travel as you must navigate\naround ancient rockslides and in between natural crevices.\n',255,131072,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33739,0,0,0,'Mountain Pass','  The narrow path winds its way through the mountains.  The peaks grow taller\nand steeper toward the west where they practically scratch against the sky.\nTo the east the peaks gradually grow smaller, but they continue to obscure\nthe horizon.  The path here is difficult to travel as you must navigate\naround ancient rockslides and in between natural crevices.\n',255,131072,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33740,0,0,0,'Mountain Pass','  The narrow path winds its way through the mountains.  The peaks grow taller\nand steeper toward the west where they practically scratch against the sky.\nTo the east you can see the mountains drop away revealing a narrow mesa that\nappears to function as a natural land bridge as part of this route through\nthe mountains.  The mesa appears to lead southeast toward a huge crevasse.\n',255,131072,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33741,0,0,0,'Mountain Pass','  The narrow path winds its way through the mountains.  The peaks grow taller\nand steeper toward the west where they practically scratch against the sky.\nTo the east you can see the mountains drop away revealing a narrow mesa that\nappears to function as a natural land bridge as part of this route through\nthe mountains.  The mesa appears to lead southeast toward a huge crevasse.\n',255,131072,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33742,0,0,0,'A Narrow Path','  The narrow path here has spilled out of the mountains onto a narrow mesa.\nThe ground drops off steeply on each side into the mist covered valleys on\neither side of this land bridge.  This peculiar natural landform is known\nas the \"Devil\'s Backbone\" by the locals, and is said to bring misfortune to\nall those who dare to traverse its narrow breadth.  To the west the mountains\ngradually grow taller, and to the east the land bridge leads to a huge\nnatural crevasse that bores into the face of a mountain.\n',255,131072,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33743,0,0,0,'A Narrow Path','  The narrow path here has spilled out of the mountains onto a narrow mesa.\nThe ground drops off steeply on each side into the mist covered valleys on\neither side of this land bridge.  This peculiar natural landform is known\nas the \"Devil\'s Backbone\" by the locals, and is said to bring misfortune to\nall those who dare to traverse its narrow breadth.  To the west the mountains\ngradually grow taller, and to the east the land bridge leads to a huge\nnatural crevasse that bores into the face of a mountain.\n',255,131072,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33744,0,0,0,'A Narrow Path','  The narrow path here has spilled out of the mountains onto a narrow mesa.\nThe ground drops off steeply on each side into the mist covered valleys on\neither side of this land bridge.  This peculiar natural landform is known\nas the \"Devil\'s Backbone\" by the locals, and is said to bring misfortune to\nall those who dare to traverse its narrow breadth.  To the west the mountains\ngradually grow taller, and to the east the land bridge leads to a huge\nnatural crevasse that bores into the face of a mountain.\n',255,131072,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33745,0,0,0,'A Narrow Path','  The narrow path here has spilled out of the mountains onto a narrow mesa.\nThe ground drops off steeply on each side into the mist covered valleys on\neither side of this land bridge.  This peculiar natural landform is known\nas the \"Devil\'s Backbone\" by the locals, and is said to bring misfortune to\nall those who dare to traverse its narrow breadth.  To the west the mountains\ngradually grow taller, and to the east the land bridge leads to a huge\nnatural crevasse that bores into the face of a mountain.\n',255,131072,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33746,0,0,0,'Mountain Pass','  The narrow path winds its way through the mountains in a natural crevasse\nthat is surrounded by huge cliff walls.  The path continues east into the\ncrevasse, and to the west the path leads onto a narrow land bridge that snakes\nnorthwest between huge valleys on each side and continues westward toward\nhuge snow capped peaks which dominate the horizon.\n',255,131072,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33747,0,0,0,'Mountain Pass','  The narrow path winds its way through the mountains in a natural crevasse\nthat is surrounded by huge cliff walls.  The cliff walls tower so high that\nthe sky can barely be seen overhead.  The pathway continues through the\nnarrow chasm as far as the eye can see in either direction.\n',255,131072,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33748,0,0,0,'Mountain Pass','  The narrow path winds its way through the mountains in a natural crevasse\nthat is surrounded by huge cliff walls.  The cliff walls tower so high that\nthe sky can barely be seen overhead.  The pathway continues through the\nnarrow chasm as far as the eye can see in either direction.\n',255,131072,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33749,0,0,0,'Mountain Pass','  The narrow path winds its way through the mountains in a natural crevasse\nthat is surrounded by huge cliff walls.  The cliff walls tower so high that\nthe sky can barely be seen overhead.  The pathway continues through the\nnarrow chasm as far as the eye can see in either direction.\n',255,131072,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33750,0,0,0,'Mountain Pass','  The path narrows as it winds its way through the mountains.  Cliffs tower\nto both sides and you hope you nothing starts a rock slide for there is little\nroom to run.\n',255,131072,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33751,0,0,0,'Mountain Pass','  The path narrows as it winds its way through the mountains.  Cliffs tower\nto both sides and you hope you nothing starts a rock slide for there is little\nroom to run.\n',255,131072,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33756,0,0,0,'A Snowy Rock-Strewn Hillside','  Loose rocks and deep snow make normal travel up this steep hillside quite \ndifficult.  To the west can be seen a wide featureless plain, while the view\nto the east is blocked by the slope that continues upwards.  There is a trail\nto the southwest.\n',256,131072,5,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33757,0,0,0,'A Snowy Rock-Strewn Hillside','  Loose rocks and deep snow make normal travel up this steep hillside quite \ndifficult.  To the west can be seen a wide featureless plain, while the view\nto the east is blocked by the slope that slants up to the northeast.\n',256,131072,15,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33758,0,0,0,'A Snowy Rock-Strewn Hillside','  Loose rocks and deep snow make normal travel up this steep hillside quite \ndifficult.  To the west can be seen a wide featureless plain, while the view\nto the east is blocked by the slope that continues upwards.  The base of the\nhill is down to the southwest.\n',256,131072,5,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33759,0,0,0,'A Snowy Rock-Strewn Hillside','  Loose rocks and deep snow make normal travel up this steep hillside quite \ndifficult.  To the west can be seen a wide featureless plain, while the view\nto the east is blocked by the slope that slants up to the northeast.\n',256,131072,15,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33760,0,0,0,'A Polished Granite Slab','  The loose rocks and deep snow that cover this hill are absent on its top.\nInstead, the entire area is occupied by a single flat slab of <W>polished granite<Z>.\nIt looks almost as though the top of the hill was removed with great precision,\nexposing the underlying bedrock.  Remarkably, the slab is completely devoid of\nsnow.  To the west can be seen a wide featureless plain, while to the east are\nthe walls and the towers of the city of Amber in the distance.  To the \nnortheast you can just catch a glimpse of the cold grey waters of an arctic\nsea.  To the south, past the tundra, lies a forest, and, beyond the forest, \na range of mountains.\n',256,131072,5,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33775,0,0,0,'A Small Hole','Several huge, misshapen rocks have fallen against each other here,\nleaving a large gap between them and creating a small hole almost\ncave-like in shape. The floor of the hole is lined with accumulated\ndirt and dried brush free of frost.\n',0,131080,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(33776,0,0,0,'An Opening Through the Mountains','The majesty of the ice-capped mountains parts just enough here\nto show a hint of a faint trail, which curves to the southwest\nand disappears into the shadows of the mountains.  Two slender\npillars of rough-hewn stone, a couple of hundred feet tall and\ncovered in a thick carpet of ice-bitten moss, frame the opening\nto a mountain pass.  The ground leading to the trail is rough\nand uneven, covered with small, jagged rocks that reveal no\nfootsteps, animal or otherwise.\n',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33777,0,0,0,'A Narrow, Rock-Strewn Pass Through the Mountains','The sheer rock face of the mountains rises on both sides of the trail, tall and looming. Short, stubby crabgrass protrudes through the gravelly surface in clumps scattered about, the edges of their leaves shriveled and slick with frost. Large chunks of rock lay randomly strewn across the trail. The sound of more rock groaning in the bitterly cold wind as the chill sets in and begins to crack its surface sends eerie echoes whispering along the length of the pass.\n',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33778,0,0,0,'A Narrow, Rock-Strewn Pass Through the Mountains','The sheer rock face of the mountains rises on both sides of the trail, tall and looming. Short, stubby crabgrass protrudes through the gravelly surface in clumps scattered about, the edges of their leaves shriveled and slick with frost. Large chunks of rock lay randomly strewn across the trail. The sound of more rock groaning in the bitterly cold wind as the chill sets in and begins to crack its surface sends eerie echoes whispering along the length of the pass.',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33779,0,0,0,'A Rock Ledge','The rocky, gravelly ground drops sharply, revealing a wide ledge that overlooks an expansive landscape of sheer desolation. Like arms encircling a babe, the mountain range continues wide to the northwest and northeast, guarding a valley filled with huge rocks and boulders, and very little else. From this distance, there seems to be no signs of life -- nothing stirs except for the bitterly cold wind that howls through the rocky crevices of this desolate valley. To the northwest and northeast, rubble spilling from the edges of the ledge creates hand- and foot-holds along a gently sloping incline that allow passage between the ledge and the floor of the valley.',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33780,0,0,0,'The Edge of a Desolate Valley','A bitter, ice-cold wind relentlessly buffets the sparse and desolate landscape, filled mostly with large rocks and boulders. Here and there, a naked tree stands lonely against the sky, sharing the hard-packed, frozen ground with stunted-looking sagebrush bare of foliage, silvered by frost. The floor of this desolate valley stretches to the west, a yawning sea of grays and whites, as the ice-capped mountains rim the edge of the valley in a wide arc along the south, the east and the north.',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33781,0,0,0,'The Floor of a Desolate Valley','A bitter, ice-cold wind relentlessly buffets the sparse and desolate landscape, filled mostly with large rocks and boulders. Here and there, a naked tree stands lonely against the sky, sharing the hard-packed, frozen ground with stunted-looking sagebrush bare of foliage, silvered by frost. The floor of this desolate valley stretches to the northwest, a yawning sea of grays and whites.',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33782,0,0,0,'The Edge of a Desolate Valley','A bitter, ice-cold wind relentlessly buffets the sparse and desolate landscape, filled mostly with large rocks and boulders. Here and there, a naked tree stands lonely against the sky, sharing the hard-packed, frozen ground with stunted-looking sagebrush bare of foliage, silvered by frost. The floor of this desolate valley stretches to the north and east, a yawning sea of grays and whites, as the ice-capped mountains guard the edge of the valley in a line of solemn peaks along the south, southwest and west.',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33783,0,0,0,'The Edge of a Desolate Valley','A bitter, ice-cold wind relentlessly buffets the sparse and desolate landscape, filled mostly with large rocks and boulders. Here and there, a naked tree stands lonely against the sky, sharing the hard-packed, frozen ground with stunted-looking sagebrush bare of foliage, silvered by frost. The floor of this desolate valley stretches to the west and south, a yawning sea of grays and whites, as the ice-capped mountains guard the edge of the valley in a line of solemn peaks along the north, northeast and east.',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33784,0,0,0,'The Floor of a Desolate Valley','A bitter, ice-cold wind relentlessly buffets the sparse and desolate landscape, filled mostly with large rocks and boulders. Here and there, a naked tree stands lonely against the sky, sharing the hard-packed, frozen ground with stunted-looking sagebrush bare of foliage, silvered by frost. The floor of this desolate valley stretches to the northwest and southeast, a yawning sea of grays and whites.',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33785,0,0,0,'The Edge of a Desolate Valley','A bitter, ice-cold wind relentlessly buffets the sparse and desolate landscape, filled mostly with large rocks and boulders. Here and there, a naked tree stands lonely against the sky, sharing the hard-packed, frozen ground with stunted-looking sagebrush bare of foliage, silvered by frost. The floor of this desolate valley stretches to the northwest, north and east, a yawning sea of grays and whites, as the ice-capped mountains rim the edge of the valley in a gentle arc along the south and southwest.',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33786,0,0,0,'The Edge of a Desolate Valley','A bitter, ice-cold wind relentlessly buffets the sparse and desolate landscape, filled mostly with large rocks and boulders. Here and there, a naked tree stands lonely against the sky, sharing the hard-packed, frozen ground with stunted-looking sagebrush bare of foliage, silvered by frost. The floor of this desolate valley stretches toward the northern directions, a yawning sea of grays and whites, as the ice-capped mountains guard the edge of the valley in a line of solemn peaks along the southeast, south and southwest.',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33787,0,0,0,'The Edge of a Desolate Valley','A bitter, ice-cold wind relentlessly buffets the sparse and desolate landscape, filled mostly with large rocks and boulders. Here and there, a naked tree stands lonely against the sky, sharing the hard-packed, frozen ground with stunted-looking sagebrush bare of foliage, silvered by frost. The floor of this desolate valley stretches to the north and northeast, a yawning sea of grays and whites, as the ice-capped mountains rim the edge of the valley in a wide arc along the west and the southern directions.',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33788,0,0,0,'The Edge of a Desolate Valley','A bitter, ice-cold wind relentlessly buffets the sparse and desolate landscape, filled mostly with large rocks and boulders. Here and there, a naked tree stands lonely against the sky, sharing the hard-packed, frozen ground with stunted-looking sagebrush bare of foliage, silvered by frost. The floor of this desolate valley stretches to the west, a yawning sea of grays and whites, as the ice-capped mountains guard the edge of the valley in a line of solemn peaks along the north, northeast and east.',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33789,0,0,0,'The Floor of a Desolate Valley','A bitter, ice-cold wind relentlessly buffets the sparse and desolate landscape, filled mostly with large rocks and boulders. Here and there, a naked tree stands lonely against the sky, sharing the hard-packed, frozen ground with stunted-looking sagebrush bare of foliage, silvered by frost. The floor of this desolate valley stretches to the west and southeast, a yawning sea of grays and whites.',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33790,0,0,0,'The Floor of a Desolate Valley','A bitter, ice-cold wind relentlessly buffets the sparse and desolate landscape, filled mostly with large rocks and boulders. Here and there, a naked tree stands lonely against the sky, sharing the hard-packed, frozen ground with stunted-looking sagebrush bare of foliage, silvered by frost. The floor of this desolate valley stretches to the east and west, a yawning sea of grays and whites.',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33791,0,0,0,'The Floor of a Desolate Valley','A bitter, ice-cold wind relentlessly buffets the sparse and desolate landscape, filled mostly with large rocks and boulders. Here and there, a naked tree stands lonely against the sky, sharing the hard-packed, frozen ground with stunted-looking sagebrush bare of foliage, silvered by frost. The floor of this desolate valley stretches to the east, a yawning sea of grays and whites, while to the west, the valley seems to become narrower.',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33792,0,0,0,'The Edge of a Desolate Valley','A bitter, ice-cold wind relentlessly buffets the sparse and desolate landscape, filled mostly with large rocks and boulders. Here and there, a naked tree stands lonely against the sky, sharing the hard-packed, frozen ground with stunted-looking sagebrush bare of foliage, silvered by frost. The floor of this desolate valley stretches to the east, a yawning sea of grays and whites, as the ice-capped mountains rim the edge of the valley in a wide arc, curving from the south to the southwest. To the west, the valley looks to become a little narrower.',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33793,0,0,0,'The Edge of a Desolate Valley','A bitter, ice-cold wind relentlessly buffets the sparse and desolate landscape, filled mostly with large rocks and boulders. Here and there, a naked tree stands lonely against the sky, sharing the hard-packed, frozen ground with stunted-looking sagebrush bare of foliage, silvered by frost. The desolate valley is narrower here, providing more protection from the wind. The ice-capped mountains rim the edge of the valley in a wide arc, curving from the southeast to the southwest and to the northwest.',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33794,0,0,0,'The Edge of a Desolate Valley','A bitter, ice-cold wind relentlessly buffets the sparse and desolate landscape, filled mostly with large rocks and boulders. Here and there, a naked tree stands lonely against the sky, sharing the hard-packed, frozen ground with stunted-looking sagebrush bare of foliage, silvered by frost. The floor of this desolate valley stretches to the southwest, a yawning sea of grays and whites, as the ice-capped mountains rim the edge of the valley in a wide arc, curving from the southwest to the north and to the west.',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33795,0,0,0,'The Edge of a Desolate Valley','A bitter, ice-cold wind relentlessly buffets the sparse and desolate landscape, filled mostly with large rocks and boulders. Here and there, a naked tree stands lonely against the sky, sharing the hard-packed, frozen ground with stunted-looking sagebrush bare of foliage, silvered by frost. The floor of this desolate valley stretches to the southern directions, a yawning sea of grays and whites, as the ice-capped mountains guard the edge of the valley in a line of solemn peaks along the northwest, north and northeast. Boulders of various sizes and shapes have tumbled down to rest against the north wall of the mountains.',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33796,0,0,0,'The Edge of a Desolate Valley','A bitter, ice-cold wind relentlessly buffets the sparse and desolate landscape, filled mostly with large rocks and boulders. Here and there, a naked tree stands lonely against the sky, sharing the hard-packed, frozen ground with stunted-looking sagebrush bare of foliage, silvered by frost. The floor of this desolate valley stretches to the south and southeast, a yawning sea of grays and whites, as the ice-capped mountains guard the edge of the valley in a line of solemn peaks along the northwest, north and northeast.',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33797,0,0,0,'The Edge of a Desolate Valley','A bitter, ice-cold wind relentlessly buffets the sparse and desolate landscape, filled mostly with large rocks and boulders. Here and there, a naked tree stands lonely against the sky, sharing the hard-packed, frozen ground with stunted-looking sagebrush bare of foliage, silvered by frost. The floor of this desolate valley stretches to the southeast, a yawning sea of grays and whites, as the ice-capped mountains guard the edge of the valley in a line of solemn peaks along the northwest, north and northeast. To the west, the valley looks to become a little narrower.',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33798,0,0,0,'The Edge of a Desolate Valley','A bitter, ice-cold wind relentlessly buffets the sparse and desolate landscape, filled mostly with large rocks and boulders. Here and there, a naked tree stands lonely against the sky, sharing the hard-packed, frozen ground with stunted-looking sagebrush bare of foliage, silvered by frost. The desolate valley is narrower here, providing more protection from the wind. The ice-capped mountains rim the edge of the valley to northeast and to the westerly directions, while tall shadows loom from the north.',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33799,0,0,0,'A Niche at the Edge of a Desolate Valley','The mountains close in on all sides except to the south, creating a little niche in the edge of this desolate valley. The area is clear of vegetation, and only a couple of large boulders dare to rest against the northern wall of the mountain. Even the ground has smoothed out into a fine-grained gravel. The bitter, ice-cold wind howls and eddies near the southern edge of the niche, but the northern end is well-protected from its buffetting.',0,131072,1,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33800,0,0,0,'Chief\'s Area','The ground of this small area is covered with hides and mostly free of stray sticker bush vines.  Three shallow sleeping pits have been dug here, and are similarly outfitted with hides.  A few minor embellishments exist here to seperate it from the rest of the encampment; a rusty old lantern hangs from a sticker bush vine, a few boulders have been set up for use as a table and chairs and an extremely crude portcullis to the south keeps out unwanted visitors.',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33801,0,0,0,'Rough Path','Cutting through a rough thicket, this rough, rocky path leads deeper into the hills to the north.  Sticker bushes loom up on each side, threatening to snag clothing and skin.\n',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33802,0,0,0,'Rough Path','Cutting through a rough thicket, this rough, rocky path leads deeper into the hills to the north.  Sticker bushes loom up on each side, threatening to snag clothing and skin.',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
