(33807,0,0,0,'Rough Path','Cutting through a rough thicket, this rough, rocky path leads towards a clearing between some hills to the north.  Sticker bushes loom up on each side, threatening to snag clothing and skin.',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33808,0,0,0,'Rough Path','Cutting through a rough thicket, this rough, rocky path leads towards a clearing between some hills to the north.  Sticker bushes loom up on each side, threatening to snag clothing and skin.',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33809,0,0,0,'A Clearing','Hills and an extreme overgrowth of sticker bushes surround this clearing.  The sticker bushes have overgrown so extremely in this area, that much of the ground is covered with trampled vines, and fresh cut bushes can be seen at the edges of the clearing.',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33810,0,0,0,'A Clearing','Hills and an extreme overgrowth of sticker bushes surround this clearing.  The sticker bushes have overgrown so extremely in this area, that much of the ground is covered with trampled vines, and fresh cut bushes can be seen at the edges of the clearing.  A large firepit is to the north and a rough path through the bushes leads south.',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33811,0,0,0,'A Clearing','Hills and an extreme overgrowth of sticker bushes surround this clearing.  The sticker bushes have overgrown so extremely in this area, that much of the ground is covered with trampled vines, and fresh cut bushes can be seen at the edges of the clearing.',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33812,0,0,0,'A Clearing','Hills and an extreme overgrowth of sticker bushes surround this clearing.  The\nsticker bushes have overgrown so extremely in this area, that much of the ground is covered with trampled vines, and fresh cut bushes can be seen at the edges of the clearing.  A large firepit is to the east and a rough path through the bushes leads west.',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33813,0,0,0,'A Gigantic Firepit','This firepit is truly huge, taking up the entire center of the clearing.  Two and three foot diameter boulders surround the pit, charred black from numerous fires.  A tangled and burnt mass of wood is stacked up in the center, consisting of a variety of burnt objects including trees, railway ties, feces, unrecognizable bodies, bones and trash.',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33814,0,0,0,'A Clearing','Hills and an extreme overgrowth of sticker bushes surround this clearing.  The\nsticker bushes have overgrown so extremely in this area, that much of the ground is covered with trampled vines, and fresh cut bushes can be seen at the edges of the clearing.  A large firepit is to the west and a rough path through the bushes leads east.',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33815,0,0,0,'A Clearing','Hills and an extreme overgrowth of sticker bushes surround this clearing.  The sticker bushes have overgrown so extremely in this area, that much of the ground is covered with trampled vines, and fresh cut bushes can be seen at the edges of the clearing.',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33816,0,0,0,'A Clearing','Hills and an extreme overgrowth of sticker bushes surround this clearing.  The\nsticker bushes have overgrown so extremely in this area, that much of the ground is covered with trampled vines, and fresh cut bushes can be seen at the edges of the clearing.  A large firepit is to the south and a wide path through the bushes leads north.',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33817,0,0,0,'A Clearing','Hills and an extreme overgrowth of sticker bushes surround this clearing.  The sticker bushes have overgrown so extremely in this area, that much of the ground is covered with trampled vines, and fresh cut bushes can be seen at the edges of the clearing.',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33818,0,0,0,'Work Area','Cyclops and monohog hides of various shapes and sizes are hanging on the surrounding sticker bushes here, either drying in preparation for sewing, or as finished products being stored before use.  Many of the hides are slick with blood and the rest are crusted with dried blood.  The sewing work on the finished articles of clothing is extremely primitive, but thick, strong sinew has been used.',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33819,0,0,0,'Food Storage','This area is littered with discarded pieces of meat, bone, fat drippings and other waste products of a primitive meat-based diet.  Clouds of insects buzz around and numerous trails of ants enter and exit the area, carrying away a bountiful harvest.  The area smells quite wretched, and if it were not for the extremely thick walls of sticker bush it would no doubt attract larger scavengers.\n',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33820,0,0,0,'Rough Path','The surrounding sticker bushes have been cut and worn away to provide a path\nleading away from the large clearing to the east.  The path continues westward.\n',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33821,0,0,0,'Butcher\'s Den','<g>A number of large <r>bloodstained<g> boulders have been carefully placed here to provide somewhat level surfaces to butcher animals on.  The ground is stained <r>red with blood<g>, as are much of the surrounding sticker bushes.',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33822,0,0,0,'Rough Path','The surrounding sticker bushes have been cut and worn away to provide a path between a large clearing to the west and a smaller clearing to the east.',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33823,0,0,0,'Sleeping Pits','A number of shallow pits have been dug into the earth here, providing a small amount of shelter for sleeping.  The resemblance to a gravesite is probably lost on the inhabitants, although the smell is similar as well.  A massive thicket of sticker bushes lies to the north, with a tunnel cut into it, while more sleeping pits are to the east and a south.  A path leads to another clearing to the west.',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33824,0,0,0,'Sleeping Pits','A number of shallow pits have been dug into the earth here, providing a small amount of shelter for sleeping.  The resemblance to a gravesite is probably lost on the inhabitants, although the smell is similar as well.',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33825,0,0,0,'Sleeping Pits','A number of shallow pits have been dug into the earth here, providing a small amount of shelter for sleeping.  The resemblance to a gravesite is probably lost on the inhabitants, although the smell is similar as well.',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33826,0,0,0,'Sleeping Pits','A number of shallow pits have been dug into the earth here, providing a small amount of shelter for sleeping.  The resemblance to a gravesite is probably lost on the inhabitants, although the smell is similar as well.',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33827,0,0,0,'Sticker Bush Tunnel','A tunnel has been cut through this huge sticker bush thicket.  While the vines surround you, the sky is still in view above, as the bushes are not thick enough to completely block it.  A small clearing is to the south, and the unnatural tunnel continues northwards.',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33828,0,0,0,'Sticker Bush Cage','This area has been cut out of a huge sticker bush thicket, and is essentially a cave.  The bushes are so thick around the base that it is virtually impassible, but the area above is thin enough to see the sky.  The entire area inside of the bushes is well trampled.\n',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33829,0,0,0,'Crude Portcullis','An extremely crude portcullis has been constructed here.  It is supported mainly by sticker bushes, a dead tree, and several railway ties that have been fastened together with sinew.  The portcullis itself bears the logo of the <w>Grimhaven<o>-<W>Brightmoon<g> trolley - it would appear that this was once the door of the trolley and that it was liberated, probably by force, for this alternate purpose.  The whole portcullis is constructed so poorly that it could not possibly provide any real protection.',0,139584,24,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(33960,0,0,0,'A Winding Road Through the Sympathian Mountains','  This winding road leads east-west through the lower reaches of the\nSympathian Mountain range.  The road is wide and well-maintained.  \n',259,131072,22,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
