(33968,0,0,0,'A Road Through a Long Tunnel','  This tunnel through the Sympathian Mountains was constructed to make trade\non the road much easier, effectively bypassing an otherwise long and\ntreacherous route.  The large tunnel is of a width and breadth to allow two\ncarts to pass side by side.  \n',259,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
