(34013,0,0,0,'A Wooden Porch','  The Blackridge Traveller\'s Lodge is an old, log-cabin style building and\nthis wooden porch looks a little worse for its years.  It seems sturdy enough,\nhowever. The porch continues around the lodge to the east and south.  \n',259,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(34014,0,0,0,'A Wooden Porch','  The Blackridge Traveller\'s Lodge is an old, log-cabin style building and\nthis wooden porch looks a little worse for its years.  It seems sturdy enough,\nhowever. The porch continues around the lodge to the east and west, and large\ndouble doors to the south lead inside the lodge.  \n',259,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(34015,0,0,0,'A Wooden Porch','  The Blackridge Traveller\'s Lodge is an old, log-cabin style building and\nthis wooden porch looks a little worse for its years.  It seems sturdy enough,\nhowever. The porch continues around the lodge to the west.  \n',259,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(34016,0,0,0,'A Cobblestone Pathway','  This cobblestone pathway leads from the road to the west to the Blackridge\nTravellers\' Lodge, which is directly east of here.  \n',259,131072,22,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(34017,0,0,0,'A Wooden Porch','  The Blackridge Traveller\'s Lodge is an old, log-cabin style building and\nthis wooden porch looks a little worse for its years.  It seems sturdy enough,\nhowever. The porch continues around the lodge to the north and there is a\nsmall service door to the south.  A path to the west leads out to the road.  \n',259,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(34018,0,0,0,'The Blackridge Travellers\' Lodge','  The Blackridge Travellers\' Lodge is a large building built in the log-cabin\nstyle. The ceilings are high and arched, and lost in the shadows of the poorly\nlit room.  A fire burns in the fireplace located in the center of the\nbuilding, keeping the Lodge very warm and cozy.  Various stuffed animal heads\nadorn the high walls, a testament to the many hunters who frequent the place. \nThe reception desk is east of here, and the tavern is to the south.  Doors to\nthe north lead out to a wooden porch overlooking the mountains.  \n',259,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,120,0,'',NULL),
(34020,0,0,0,'The Kitchen of the Blackridge Travellers\' Lodge','This kitchen seems to be the most modern part of the lodge, and looks to be\nvery recently refurbished.  Large metal tables are spread through the room,\nwith every imaginable cooking utensil in some cupboard or hanging from some\nrack. A a large range on the west wall is available for cooking.  A small\nservice door to the north leads outside and wide, swinging doors to the east\nlead to the tavern.  \n',-1,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,120,0,'',NULL),
(34021,0,0,0,'The Tavern of the Blackridge Travellers\' Lodge','  The Blackridge Travellers\' Lodge is a large building built in the log-cabin\nstyle. The ceilings are high and arched, and lost in the shadows of the poorly\nlit room.  The tavern is lively, with dim lighting and a festive, drunken\natmosphere. A bar on the south wall of room seems to have an inordinately\nlarge amount of alcohol on hand.  A door to the west leads to the lodge\'s\nkitchen. \n',259,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,120,0,'',NULL),
(34022,0,0,0,'The Tavern of the Blackridge Travellers\' Lodge','  The Blackridge Travellers\' Lodge is a large building built in the log-cabin\nstyle. The ceilings are high and arched, and lost in the shadows of the poorly\nlit room.  The tavern is lively, with dim lighting and a festive, drunken\natmosphere. A bar on the south wall of room seems to have an inordinately\nlarge amount of alcohol on hand.  \n',259,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,120,0,'',NULL),
(34023,0,0,0,'A Small Room in the Blackridge Travellers\' Lodge','  This small room is dimly lit and very rustic looking.  The walls are adorned\nwith tasteful paintings of people killing various animals for sport.  A door\nto the south leads to the hallway.  \n',259,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,5,120,0,'',NULL),
(34024,0,0,0,'A Hallway in the Blackridge Travellers\' Lodge','  This dimly lit hallways leads to the private rooms in the upstairs part of\nthe lodge.  A stairway spirals down to the lower part of the building and the\nhallway continues southwest.  \n',259,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,120,0,'',NULL),
(34025,0,0,0,'A Small Room in the Blackridge Travellers\' Lodge','  This small room is dimly lit and very rustic looking.  The walls are adorned\nwith tasteful paintings of people killing various animals for sport.  A door\nto the east leads to the hallway.  \n',259,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,5,120,0,'',NULL),
(34026,0,0,0,'A Hallway in the Blackridge Travellers\' Lodge','  This dimly lit hallways leads to the private rooms in the upstairs part of\nthe lodge.  The hallways continues northeast and there are doors to the east,\nnorth and west.  \n',259,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,20,120,0,'',NULL),
(34027,0,0,0,'A Small Room in the Blackridge Travellers\' Lodge','  This small room is dimly lit and very rustic looking.  The walls are adorned\nwith tasteful paintings of people killing various animals for sport.  A door\nto the west leads to the hallway.  \n',259,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,5,120,0,'',NULL),
(34028,0,0,0,'An Overgrown Trail','  This faintly visible trail is overgrown with vegetation and sometimes\ntroublesome to follow.  \n',259,131072,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(34029,0,0,0,'An Overgrown Trail','  This faintly visible trail is overgrown with vegetation and sometimes\ntroublesome to follow.  \n',259,131072,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
