(34032,0,0,0,'An Overgrown Trail','  This faintly visible trail is overgrown with vegetation and sometimes\ntroublesome to follow.  \n',259,131072,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(34033,0,0,0,'A Hidden Campsite','  Hidden behind a few large boulders, this small campsite is completely\nconcealed from outsiders.  A trail leads north between the massive rocks.  \n',259,131072,25,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(34034,0,0,0,'Inside a Large Canvas Tent','  The inside of this large tent is filled with an assortment of junk.  Boxes\nfilled with rocks, crates of strange tools and vials, piles of old journals\nand worn notebooks.  Definately not the residence of a terribly organized\nperson. \n',259,131080,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(34035,0,0,0,'Before A Hole In A Large Log','The setting of this clearing seems a little forced to have happened naturally.\nThe\nhusk of a very large tree makes up most of the visible forest floor here. It is\ncovered with a light layer of moss and earth, but not enough to be slippery\nor dangerous. An enormous knot hole in the tree seems to beg travel downward.\nThis\nis most likely not a naturally occuring environment.\n',0,0,60,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(34036,0,0,0,'The End of A Thin Passage','Above you, a hole in the ceiling reveals a forest sky. The walls of this area\nare tightly packed earth, with the occassional root poking through. North of\nhere,\na thin passage winds into the darkness.\n',0,8520,33,0,0,0,0,-1,11,100,0,'',NULL),
(34037,0,0,0,'A Thin Passage','The walls of this tunnel are tightly packed earth. Small root systems poke in\nfrom above,\nbut there is otherwise little to note about this passage. The packed floor\nsuggests\ntraffic. Yet, you feel the tunnel was somehow left unfinished.\n',0,8520,33,0,0,0,0,-1,11,100,0,'',NULL),
(34038,0,0,0,'A Thin Passage','The walls of this tunnel are tightly packed earth. Small root systems poke in\nfrom above,\nbut there is otherwise little to note about this passage. The packed floor\nsuggests\ntraffic. Yet, you feel the tunnel was somehow left unfinished.\n',0,8520,33,0,0,0,0,-1,11,100,0,'',NULL),
