(34084,0,0,0,'<G>Middle of the Maze<z>','<G>Tall, leafy <g>hedges<z><G> come together to form an end here.  Large tangles of\n<g>overgrowth<z><G> flow from one hedge to another, keeping the beginning and\nthe end of each from being found.<z>\n',0,139264,26,0,0,0,0,-1,100,-1,0,'',NULL),
