(34106,0,0,0,'<g>The End of the Maze<z>','<G>Large tangles of <g>overgrowth<z><G> flow from one <g>hedge<z><G> to another,\nclosing off any further progress through the maze.  Large masses of <g>ivy<z><G>\nhave come together to form a huge arch resembling an entrance to somewhere.<z>\n',0,139264,26,0,0,0,0,-1,100,-1,0,'',NULL),
