(34654,0,0,0,'A Thin Trail across the Tundra','  A wide, featureless plain spreads out before you.  Short, stubby crabgrass\nprotrudes through the surface in clumps scattered about.  A mountain range\nlines the horizon to the east, while little can be seen to the west.  A\nbitterly cold wind seems to sweep down from the northeast.\n',56,131072,3,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(34655,0,0,0,'A Thin Trail across the Tundra','  A wide, featureless plain spreads out before you.  Short, stubby crabgrass\nprotrudes through the surface in clumps scattered about.  A mountain range\nlines the horizon to the east, while little can be seen to the west.  A\nbitterly cold wind seems to sweep down from the northeast.\n',56,131072,3,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(34656,0,0,0,'A Thin Trail across the Tundra','  A wide, featureless plain spreads out before you.  Short, stubby crabgrass\nprotrudes through the surface in clumps scattered about.  A mountain range\nlines the horizon to the east, while little can be seen to the west.  A\nbitterly cold wind seems to sweep down from the northeast.\n',56,131072,3,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(34657,0,0,0,'A Thin Trail across the Tundra','  A wide, featureless plain spreads out before you.  Short, stubby crabgrass\nprotrudes through the surface in clumps scattered about.  A mountain range\nlines the horizon to the east, while little can be seen to the west.  A\nlarge jagged outcropping of rock can be seen in the distance to the northeast.\n',56,131072,3,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(34658,0,0,0,'A Thin Trail across the Tundra','  A wide, featureless plain spreads out before you.  Short, stubby crabgrass\nprotrudes through the surface in clumps scattered about.  A mountain range\nlines the horizon to the east, while little can be seen to the west.  A\nlarge jagged outcropping of rock blocks travel to the northeast and the\ntrail makes way around it on the southern side.\n',56,131072,3,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(34659,0,0,0,'A Thin Trail across the Tundra','  A wide, featureless plain spreads out before you.  Short, stubby crabgrass\nprotrudes through the surface in clumps scattered about.  A mountain range\nlines the horizon to the east, while little can be seen to the west.  A\njagged outcropping of rock lies directly north, providing some small amount\nof shelter from the bitterly cold winds of the tundra.\n',56,131072,3,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
