(34680,0,0,0,'Tundra Trail near a ravine','  A wide, featureless plain spreads out before you.  Short, stubby crabgrass\nprotrudes through the surface in clumps scattered about.  A mountain range\nlines the horizon to the east, while little can be seen to the west.  A\nbitterly cold wind seems to sweep down from the northeast.  The towers and\nwalls of the town of Amber lie to the east against a mountainous backdrop.\nA large north-south ravine lies nearby to the east, cutting across the trail.\n',56,131072,3,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(34681,0,0,0,'<o>A Rickety Wooden Bridge Over A Ravine<1>','<o>  Thick wooden timbers embedded in the sides of the ravine form the stout\nsupports of this bridge.  Although securely placed, the bridge itself\nis rather rickety, as though an errant floorboard could go falling\ninto the ravine below at any moment.  The side rails certainly do not\nlook trustworthy.  A mountain range lines the horizon to the east,\nwhile little can be seen to the west.  A bitterly cold wind seems to\nsweep down from the northeast.  The towers and walls of the town of\nAmber lie to the east against a mountainous backdrop.<1>\n',56,131072,3,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(34682,0,0,0,'<o>A Rickety Wooden Bridge Over A Ravine<1>','<o>  Thick wooden timbers embedded in the sides of the ravine form the stout\nsupports of this bridge.  Although securely placed, the bridge itself\nis rather rickety, as though an errant floorboard could go falling\ninto the ravine below at any moment.  The side rails certainly do not\nlook trustworthy.  A mountain range lines the horizon to the east,\nwhile little can be seen to the west.  A bitterly cold wind seems to\nsweep down from the northeast.  The towers and walls of the town of\nAmber lie to the east against a mountainous backdrop.<1>\n',56,131072,3,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
