(34700,0,0,0,'Road Through the Foothills','  Hard packed dirt with two wagon wheel ruts make up this road.  It weaves\nthrough the trees and foothills lazily, as if designed to provide a path\nwith the least amount of labor for travelers.\n',12,131072,24,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
