(34782,0,0,0,'<k>A Granite Grotto<z>','A smaller cave, it is sectioned off from the main cavern.\nSmooth granite walls, floor and ceiling sparkle with small flecks of green and\ngrey stone. Small strands of <g>ivy<z> canopy over the entrance to this grotto.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,50,100,0,'',NULL),
(34783,0,0,0,'<k>A Granite Grotto<z>','<k>A smaller cave, it is sectioned off from the main cavern.\nSmooth granite walls and ceiling sparkle with tiny flecks of green and\ngrey stone. <o>Brown pieces of something<k> are scattered on the floor.  Small\nstrands of <g>ivy<k> canopy over the entrance to this grotto.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,50,100,0,'',NULL),
(34784,0,0,0,'<k>A Granite Grotto<z>','A smaller cave, it is sectioned off from the main cavern.\nSmooth granite walls, floor and ceiling sparkle with small flecks of green and\ngrey stone. Small strands of <g>ivy<z> canopy over the entrance to this grotto.\nA few pieces of <y>parchment<z> line the walls.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,50,100,0,'',NULL),
