(34788,0,0,0,'<k>A Granite Grotto<z>','<k>A smaller cave, it is sectioned off from the main cavern.\nSmooth granite walls, floor and ceiling sparkle with small flecks of green and\ngrey stone. A piece of <o>timber<z><k> is fixed on the north wall. Small strands\nof <g>ivy<z> <k>canopy over the entrance to this grotto.<z>\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,50,100,0,'',NULL),
(34789,0,0,0,'<k>A Granite Grotto<z>','<k>A smaller cave, it is sectioned off from the main cavern.\nSmooth granite walls, floor and ceiling sparkle with small flecks of green and\ngrey stone. Small strands of <g>ivy<z> <k>canopy over the entrance to this\ngrotto.<z>\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,50,100,0,'',NULL),
(34790,0,0,0,'<k>A Granite Grotto<z>','<k>A larger grotto, it is sectioned off from the main cavern.\nSmooth granite walls, floor and ceiling sparkle with small flecks of green and\ngrey stone. Small strands of <g>ivy<z> <k>canopy over the entrance.  Pieces\nof<z> <W>faerie wings<z><k> and <P>pixie dust<k> are littered onto the floor.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,75,150,0,'',NULL),
(34791,0,0,0,'<k>A Tiny Grotto<z>','<k>A tiny space, unlike the rest, was crudely dug.  The walls, floor and ceiling have\nrough and jagged edges.  Pieces of dead <g>ivy<z> <k>lie on the floor; a musty\nsmell\nfills the room.<z>\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,5,50,0,'',NULL),
(34792,0,0,0,'<k>A Granite Grotto<z>','<k>A smaller cave at the back of the cavern, it is sectioned off from the rest.\nSmooth granite walls and ceiling sparkle with small flecks of green and\ngrey stone. For a cave, there is an unusual amount of <o>earth<k> on the floor.\nSmall strands of <g>ivy<k>\ncanopy over the entrance to this grotto.<z>\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,50,100,0,'',NULL),
(34793,0,0,0,'<k>A Passageway to a Granite Grotto<z>','<k>A smooth granite passageway, the walls and floor sparkle with small flecks of\ngreen and grey stone. Large strands of <g>ivy<z> <k>vine through covering\nmost of the ceiling.<z>\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,50,100,0,'',NULL),
(34794,0,0,0,'<k>A Granite Grotto<z>','<k>A smaller cave, it is sectioned off from the main cavern.\nSmooth granite walls, floor and ceiling sparkle with small flecks of green and\ngrey stone. Small strands of <g>ivy<z> <k>canopy over the entrance to this\ngrotto.  Long, <R>feathery scarves<z><k> are draped over the <g>ivy<z><k> and\ndown the walls.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,50,75,0,'',NULL),
(34795,0,0,0,'<k>The Obscure Hole<z>','<z>Tucked away secretly, this tiny carved stone room provides a tiny\n<y>peephole<z> in the west wall.\n',0,140552,33,0,0,0,0,-1,20,75,0,'',NULL),
(34796,0,0,0,'<k>A Granite Grotto<z>','<k>A smaller cave, it is sectioned off from the main cavern with a passageway. \nSmooth granite walls, floor and ceiling sparkle with small flecks of green and\ngrey stone.\nLarge strands of <g>ivy<z> <k>vine through, covering most of the ceiling and\nparts of the walls. Laying on the floor are scattered pieces of <y>parchment<z>.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,50,100,0,'',NULL),
(35400,0,0,0,'A Dusty Path','This wandering path is wide enough to accomodate a fairly good sized party\nof travelers.  The dry cracked dust is heavily rutted, two grooves indicate\nregular wagon travel.  Far to the north a dike is barely discernable.  Fields\nof some grain dominate the lands on either side of the path, though a dense\nthicket of weeds bar exploration into those fields.\n',-1,131076,44,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(35401,0,0,0,'A Dusty Path','  This wandering path is wide enough to accomodate a fairly good sized party\nof travelers, a smaller pathway leads to the west.  The dry cracked dust is\nheavily rutted, two grooves indicate regular wagon travel.  Fields of some\ngrain dominate the lands on either side of the path, though a dense thicket of\nweeds bar exploration into those fields.\n',276,131072,44,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(35402,0,0,0,'A Dusty Path','  The small path is narrow here, the width only enough for one or two.  The\ndry cracked dust is tamped down by foot travel.  Fields of some grain dominate\nthe lands on either side of the path, though a dense thicket of weeds encroach\nthe pathway and bar exploration into those fields.\n',276,131072,44,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(35403,0,0,0,'A Dusty Path','  The small path is narrow here, the width only enough for one or two.  The\ndry cracked dust is tamped down by foot travel.  Fields of some grain dominate\nthe lands on either side of the path, though a dense thicket of weeds encroach\nthe pathway and bar exploration into those fields.\n',276,131072,44,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(35404,0,0,0,'A Dusty Path','  The small path is narrow here, the width only enough for one or two.  The\ndry cracked dust is tamped down by foot travel.  Fields of some grain dominate\nthe lands on either side of the path, though a dense thicket of weeds encroach\nthe pathway and bar exploration into those fields.  A dusty little yard\nsurrounds a tired looking farmhouse to the west.\n',276,131072,44,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(35405,0,0,0,'A Dusty Path','  This wandering path is wide enough to accomodate a fairly good sized party\nof travelers, a smaller pathway leads to the east.  The dry cracked dust is\nheavily rutted, two grooves indicate regular wagon travel.  Fields of some\ngrain dominate the lands on either side of the path, though a dense thicket of\nweeds bar exploration into those fields.\n',276,131072,44,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
