(36395,0,0,0,'The Bottom of a Large Pit','The stone of the floor here has been carved out of solid rock. The face of the rock is smooth and worn, save several gouges which were surely made by bladed weapons. A light detritus covers the floor. Crude torches and makeshift oil lamps have been hung on the wall of the room, providing this area with enough light to allow combatants to see what they might be fighting.\n',0,4105,56,0,0,0,0,-1,11,100,0,'',NULL),
