(36416,0,0,0,'Path Before a Large Tower','This path is narrow, but well-worn. The face of an enormous tower obscures your vision to the south, and a thick forest bars much vision to the north. Just above the treeline, a snow-capped peak is visible.',0,8192,24,0,0,0,0,-1,10,-1,0,'',NULL),
(36417,0,0,0,'Path Between a Large Tower and a Mountain','This path is narrow, but well-worn. Thick forest lines the path and the branches of trees squeeze out the sunlight, creating strange shadows on the ground below. To the south, the trees break, and to the north the path opens revealing the base of a mountain.',0,8200,24,0,0,0,0,-1,10,-1,0,'',NULL),
(36418,0,0,0,'Path Between a Large Tower and a Mountain','This path is narrow, but well-worn. Thick forest lines the path and the branches of trees squeeze out the sunlight, creating strange shadows on the ground below. To the south, the trees break, and to the north the path opens revealing the base of a mountain. To the east, through some branches, a large fallen tree is visible.',0,8200,24,0,0,0,0,-1,10,-1,0,'',NULL),
(36419,0,0,0,'Path Between a Large Tower and a Mountain','This path is narrow, but well-worn. Thick forest lines the path and the branches of trees squeeze out the sunlight, creating strange shadows on the ground below. To the south, the trees break, and to the north the path opens revealing the base of a mountain.',0,8200,24,0,0,0,0,-1,10,-1,0,'',NULL),
(36420,0,0,0,'Path Between a Large Tower and a Mountain','This path is narrow, but well-worn. Thick forest lines the path and the branches of trees squeeze out the sunlight, creating strange shadows on the ground below. To the south, the trees break, and to the northeast the path opens revealing the base of a mountain.',0,8200,24,0,0,0,0,-1,10,-1,0,'',NULL),
(36421,0,0,0,'At the Base of a Mountain','The forest to the south opens up here, revealing the base of a large mountain. The mountain\'s peaks appear to be covered in snow. To the north, the path thins and begins to wind its way up to the top of the mountain.',0,8200,24,0,0,0,0,-1,10,-1,0,'',NULL),
(36422,0,0,0,'Thin Trail at the Base of a Mountain','The trail here is thinner than that to the south. All around are large rocks that seem to have formed walls around the path. In some areas the rocks are so smooth that they look very uch like stones found in riverbeds. Perhaps when the snow melts in the spring, this path is the stream the water uses to reach the bottom.',0,8192,25,0,0,0,0,-1,8,-1,0,'',NULL),
(36423,0,0,0,'Rocky Cliff Face','This portion of the trail is not so much of a path as it is the easiest route to climb. Most of the rocks are only just big enough to be considered hand holds. Even the largest rocks on the face are only occassionally large and flat enough to stand or sit on. And even then, only for a moment for fear of losing balance and falling off. The winds here feel stronger and the air a bit colder.',0,8192,25,0,0,0,0,-1,8,-1,0,'',NULL),
(36424,0,0,0,'Rocky Cliff Face','This portion of the trail is not so much a path as it is the easiest route to climb. Most of the rocks are only just big enough to be considered hand holds. Even the largest rocks on the face are only occassionally large and flat enough to stand or sit on. And even then, only for a moment for fear of losing balance and falling off. The winds here feel stronger and the air a bit colder. Just above is a ledge big enough for a climber to rest on for a moment.',0,8192,35,0,0,0,0,-1,8,-1,0,'',NULL),
(36425,0,0,0,'A Ledge On the Side of a Mountain','This ledge along the face of the mountain has been formed by a single, large stone which has slowly been revealed by hundreds of years of exposure to the elements. Then again, perhaps some god placed this stone here out of benevolence for the sake of some weary traveler. Above looms much of the mountain left to be scaled. ',0,8192,5,0,0,0,0,-1,8,-1,0,'',NULL),
(36426,0,0,0,'Narrow Ascending Ledge','The trail here is thin enough and high enough to be treacherous. Unlike some of the cliff faces below this point, there are hardly any hand holds, and the wind here seems twice as fierce. To traverse this portion by way of walking, one must hug the mountain face and side step for what must be hundreds of yards both up and across.',0,8192,5,0,0,0,0,-1,8,-1,0,'',NULL),
(36427,0,0,0,'Treeline Above A Valley','The trees and brush part here slightly and lead down a rough path\ninto the valley below. The vegetation below looks much more sparse\nthan that along the rim. There is evidence that the lack of vegetation\nis not natural. Among the clues is the faint sound of large scale\nmanual labor eminating from below.\n',0,8,50,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(36428,0,0,0,'A Quiet Home','This home is small and consists of one room which has been formed\nout of living trees. The walls and ceiling are thick, but gaps in the\nbranches let in light and air, which unfortunately smells like a swamp.\nThe room is hardly furnished, save a small stove, a chair, and a bed.\n',0,8,50,0,0,0,0,-1,12,100,0,'',NULL),
(36429,0,0,0,'Break In The Foliage','This small break in the marsh would hardly constitute a path anymore.\nThough there is clearly evidence of trimming on the branches of the\nadjacent trees. To the southwest, the door of a small domecile\nis barely visible.\n',0,0,50,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(36930,0,0,0,'<Y>The Fashion Barn Cloakroom<1>','<o>  A number of hooks have been nailed to the walls here to provide a\nplace for customers to hang up their jackets and cloaks.<1>\n',-1,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,144,0,'',NULL),
(36931,0,0,0,'<Y>Trolley<1>','<o>This converted stall specializes in well-crafted accessories.  Carefully\nmounted shelves display cufflinks, bracelets, wristwatches, handbags\nand sunglasses of all types and styles.<1>\n',-1,174589,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,144,0,'',NULL),
(36932,0,0,0,'<Y>The Brotherhood of the Knot<1>','<o>This shop specializes in fashionable tailored shirts and the finest\nsilk ties and scarves. A small platform for measurements is here, and\nseveral cloth measuring tapes hang from the wall. Several circular\nracks hold hundreds of ties of many different styles.<1>\n',-1,174589,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,144,0,'',NULL),
(36933,0,0,0,'<Y>The Fashion Barn Entrance<1>','<o>  This large country barn has been converted into a modern shopping\ncenter.  Carefully laid tile has replaced the old dirt and straw\nflooring and the ceiling beams have been stained a rich dark brown.\nThe stalls that formerly held farm animals have been converted to\nfashionable clothing shops.<1>\n',-1,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,144,0,'',NULL),
(36934,0,0,0,'<Y>The Fashion Barn<1>','<o>  This large country barn has been converted into a modern shopping\ncenter.  Carefully laid tile has replaced the old dirt and straw\nflooring and the ceiling beams have been stained a rich dark brown.\nThe stalls that formerly held farm animals have been converted to\nfashionable clothing shops.<1>\n',-1,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,144,0,'',NULL),
(36935,0,0,0,'<Y>The Fashion Barn<1>','<o>  This large country barn has been converted into a modern shopping\ncenter.  Carefully laid tile has replaced the old dirt and straw\nflooring and the ceiling beams have been stained a rich dark brown.\nThe stalls that formerly held farm animals have been converted to\nfashionable clothing shops.  A ladder leads upwards.<1>\n',-1,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,144,0,'',NULL),
(36936,0,0,0,'<W>A Mirrored Room<1>','<W>  The walls are covered in mirrors here, providing a view of every\npart of your body.  Standing here, customers may admire every possible\nangle of view of a new piece of clothing.<1>\n',-1,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,144,0,'',NULL),
(36937,0,0,0,'<Y>The Cult of Tailoring<1>','<o>This shop sells the finest custom tailored suits, slacks, skirts and\nformal gowns.  Rolls of fine cloth hang on the back wall and several\nfitting stations are here.  A number of specialized measuring tools\nhang on the walls.<1>\n',-1,174589,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,144,0,'',NULL),
(36938,0,0,0,'<Y>Gnucci<1>','<o>Gnucci specializes in providing high quality personal luxury goods.\nHere you will find only the best belts, hats and shoes, all designed to\nexacting detail.<1>\n',-1,174589,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,144,0,'',NULL),
(36939,0,0,0,'<Y>Storage Area<1>','<o>  This upper floor of the Fashion Barn has been left in its original\nstate.  A few old bales of hay sit next to the walls and the unstained\nfloorboards are covered in old dirt and stray hay.  Heavy storage\ncrates are stacked here and there, bearing the mark of the Fashion Barn.<1>\n',-1,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(36940,0,0,0,'<Y>Storage Area<1>','<o>  This upper floor of the Fashion Barn has been left in its original\nstate.  A few old bales of hay sit next to the walls and the unstained\nfloorboards are covered in old dirt and stray hay.  Heavy storage\ncrates are stacked here and there, bearing the mark of the Fashion Barn.\n<1>\n',-1,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,144,0,'',NULL),
(36941,0,0,0,'<P>Furtive Florimel\'s<1>','<p>Fine undergarments and accessories starkly contrast against the\nbright <1><g>green<1><p> and <W>white<1><p> striped walls.  Sassy shoes, stockings,\nnecklaces, hairpieces and other fancy jewelry rest on <1><g>dark green\nvelvet pillows<1><p>, shining under spotlights.<1>\n',-1,139593,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,144,0,'',NULL),
