(44853,0,0,0,'A Nest of Notable Size','This nest has one purpose, but many uses. Large enough to fit more\nthan several full-grown birdmen at once, this is a favorite midday\nhangout for many of the Treetop citizens. Often, when one of the flock\nhas done something of distinction, the other villagers force the\nbirdman to lie recumbent here, where delicious foods are fed to\nthem. When not used in this fashion, it mostly serves a purely\nslothful purpose.\n',0,164021,26,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(45054,0,0,0,'A Marshy Bank','This area marks where the lake to the west ends. The tide brings\na sizable amount of debris to this location, which brings with it\na sizable amount of insects and other swamp life. Erosion is to\nblame for the uniqueness of this area, and given enough time and\nno outside interruption, this may become the delta that connects \nthe Kranor River to the Lost Lake.\n',0,131104,27,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(45335,0,0,0,'A Kalysian Aqueduct','  The architecture of Kalysians is quite unique and proves to be the\ncase in this Aqueduct. Seemingly thrown together to provide a means\nof allowing fresh water into the city this long aqueduct stretches far\nto the south.\n',0,8,30,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
