(45357,0,0,0,'A Waste Cesspool','  All of Kalysia\'s waste seems to gather in this large cesspool.  When the grime\nand utter filth enters this area an adjoining magical filter cleanses the water \nand makes it habitable once again.\n',0,8,30,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
