(45362,0,0,0,'A Cavern of Waste','Feces and grime lace the walls of this cavern . A lattice of strong material\nis the only thing keeping this pile of waste from collapsing upon itself. Tiny \norganisms keep darting in and out of the putrid filth almost making the walls\nlook alive.\n',0,8,30,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(45363,0,0,0,'A Cavern of Waste','  Feces and grime lace the walls of this cavern .  A lattice of strong material\nis the only thing keeping this pile of waste from collapsing upon itself.  Tiny\norganisms keep darting in and out of the putrid filth almost making the walls\nlook alive.\n',0,8,30,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(45364,0,0,0,'A Cavern of Waste','  Feces and grime lace the walls of this cavern .  A lattice of strong material\nis the only thing keeping this pile of waste from collapsing upon itself.  Tiny\norganisms keep darting in and out of the putrid filth almost making the walls\nlook alive.\n',0,8,30,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(45365,0,0,0,'Gigantic Dig Site','The dig site is massive.  Huge excavated sections of the ground are dug to different depths in a haphazard sort of way that makes no sense, almost as if they were digging for something specific.  The air is thick with floating particulates from all the dust and debris.  Broken tools and various devices are scattered about the area.  The sound of a gigantic rattling contraption echoes loudly in the distance.',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
