(45369,0,0,0,'Muddy Supply Room','This supply room is cluttered and disorganized.  Seepage from a body of water below has mixed with the dirt and rubble in the room to create a muddy mess.  Crates of supplies line the walls but they\'re slowly starting to sink into the ground.  To the south is a gigantic dig site.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45370,0,0,0,'Guard\'s Common Area','The common area is where the guards rest and relax when they are not beating and working slaves to death.  There is a large fire pit in the center of the room surrounded by well worn stone benches.  The ceiling, supported by large wooden beams is scorched black from soot. The walls are jagged and there are small patches of black and green mold growing on the surface. \n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45371,0,0,0,'Troll Barracks','The entrance to the barracks are simple, bare and stripped of any adornments.  The floor is scuffed from many boot marks.  The ceiling, supported by large wooden beams, is anchored to the ground with stacks of neatly squared rocks chiseled out of the earth.  The walls are jagged and there are small patches of black and green mold growing on the surface. To the north is a large iron gate.',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45372,0,0,0,'Reinforced Tunnel','This excavated tunnel is larger than usual and seems sturdier than the others.  The ceiling is supported by large wooden beams anchored to the ground with stacks of neatly squared rocks chiseled out of the earth.  The walls are smoother but there are still patches of black and green mold growing in large colonies on the surface.  To the south is the entrance to the guard barracks.',0,139532,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45373,0,0,0,'Reinforced Tunnel','This excavated tunnel is larger than usual and seems sturdier than the others.  The ceiling is supported by large wooden beams anchored to the ground with stacks of neatly squared rocks chiseled out of the earth.  The walls are smoother but there are still patches of black and green mold growing in large colonies on the surface.  To the north is a gigantic dig site.  The tunnel also continues to the south.',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45374,0,0,0,'Gigantic Dig Site','The dig site is massive.  Huge excavated sections of the ground are dug to different depths in a haphazard sort of way that makes no sense, almost as if they were digging for something specific.  The air is thick with floating particulates from all the dust and debris.  Broken tools and various devices are scattered about the area.  The sound of a gigantic rattling contraption echoes loudly in the distance.',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
