(45387,0,0,0,'Collapsed Cave-In','This excavated tunnel comes to an abrupt halt.  The ceiling which is supported by large wooden beams has caved in on the eastern wall.  A huge pile of debris will need to be cleared and the walls and ceilings shored up again before further digging can continue.',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45388,0,0,0,'Gigantic Dig Site','The dig site is massive.  Huge excavated sections of the ground are dug to\ndifferent depths in a haphazard sort of way that makes no sense, almost as if\nthey were digging for something specific.  The air is thick with floating\nparticulates from all the dust and debris.  Broken tools and various devices\nare scattered about the area.  The sound of a gigantic rattling contraption\nechoes loudly in the distance.  To the south is a makeshift barrier protecting the unwary from stumbling into a gigantic sinkhole.',0,139528,33,0,0,122,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
