(45397,0,0,0,'Reinforced Tunnel','This excavated tunnel is large and spacious.  The ceiling is supported by large wooden beams anchored to the ground with stacks of neatly squared rocks chiseled out of the earth.  The walls are jagged and on their surface are patches of black and green mold growing in large colonies.  The tunnel continues to the northwest and to the east is a gigantic dig site.',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45398,0,0,0,'Reinforced Tunnel','This excavated tunnel is large and spacious.  The ceiling is supported by large wooden beams anchored to the ground with stacks of neatly squared rocks chiseled out of the earth.  The walls are jagged and on their surface are patches of black and green mold growing in large colonies.  The tunnel continues to the east and southwest.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45399,0,0,0,'Fusarium\'s Operating Room','This unsanitary room serves as the main surgery center for the dig site.  Wickedly curved medical devices hang on the walls and some of them have dried flecks of flesh still attached.  Two operating tables are here; one for the dead and one for the soon to be dead.  \n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45400,0,0,0,'Before a Large Structure','A large natural structure is here, modified to accommodate the staff in charge of the excavation dig.  To the south is a health clinic and to the east is a busy engineering department.  There are steps built into the outside of the structure that lead upwards.',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45401,0,0,0,'Reinforced Tunnel','This excavated tunnel is larger than usual and seems sturdier than the others.  The ceiling is supported by large wooden beams anchored to the ground with stacks of neatly squared rocks chiseled out of the earth.  The walls are smoother but there are still patches of black and green mold growing in large colonies on the surface.  The tunnel leads to the east and to the south is a busy administration center.',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45402,0,0,0,'Reinforced Tunnel','This excavated tunnel is large and spacious.  The ceiling is supported by large wooden beams anchored to the ground with stacks of neatly squared rocks chiseled out of the earth.  The walls are jagged and on their surface are patches of black and green mold growing in large colonies.  The tunnel continues to the north and to the southeast.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45403,0,0,0,'Reinforced Tunnel','This excavated tunnel is large and spacious.  The ceiling is supported by large wooden beams anchored to the ground with stacks of neatly squared rocks chiseled out of the earth.  The walls are jagged and on their surface are patches of black and green mold growing in large colonies.  The tunnel continues to the north and south.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45404,0,0,0,'Reinforced Tunnel','This excavated tunnel is large and spacious.  The ceiling is supported by large wooden beams anchored to the ground with stacks of neatly squared rocks chiseled out of the earth.  The walls are jagged and on their surface are patches of black and green mold growing in large colonies.  The tunnel continues to the south and northeast.',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45405,0,0,0,'Waiting Room','The waiting room is small and cramped.  It\'s primary use is as a holding area for those waiting to see the Doctor to treat any illness or injuries they might have sustained on the work site.  Most leave the Doctor in a worse condition than they went in.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,3,120,0,'',NULL),
(45406,0,0,0,'Fusarium\'s Health Clinic','The clinic is used to treat those injured on the work site. There is a sickly smell of gangrene and illness that pervades the air.  For a health clinic, the sanitary conditions are poor at best.  Dried blood is on the floor and a makeshift pair of crutches covered in grime rest against a wall.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45407,0,0,0,'Behind an Altar','The smell of rot and decay is stronger here.  Fresh blood makes the floor slippery and mold is growing on the walls and ceiling in abundance.  A tunnel leads to the west and an outline of something can be seen on the north wall etched into the stone.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45408,0,0,0,'Small Altar','For such a large room, the center piece, a <w>small altar<z>, seems out of place.  Prayer mats made of flesh rest on the floor and the walls and ceiling are in good condition.  There is a smell of rot and decay in the air.',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45409,0,0,0,'Recovery Room','Jagged stone benches line the walls where those administered to by Doctor Fusarium can recover in relative safety and quiet.  Stalactites hang from the ceiling and drip slowly onto the benches causing additional discomfort for anyone unlucky enough to have been a patient of the Doctor. To the south is a sheer panel made of stretched skin. \n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45410,0,0,0,'Fusarium\'s Private Quarters','The stink of decay and rot fill the air in this small room.  Mold growth on the walls and ceilings have bloomed into huge colonies and appear to be moving. The floor is slippery and wet with fresh blood.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,8,120,0,'',NULL),
(45411,0,0,0,'Subterranean Body of Water','The current is fast and turbulent, causing the water to spin in a vortex\npattern.  The passage up is blocked by muck and grime.\n',0,139528,29,0,0,0,5,7,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45412,0,0,0,'Subterranean Body of Water','The current is fast and turbulent, causing the water to spin in a vortex pattern.',0,139528,29,0,0,0,5,0,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45413,0,0,0,'Subterranean Body of Water','The current is fast and turbulent, causing the water to spin in a vortex\npattern.  The passage up is blocked by muck and grime.\n',0,139528,29,0,0,0,5,0,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45414,0,0,0,'Subterranean Body of Water','This body of water is deeper than normal, although the current remains swift and turbulent.\n',0,139532,30,0,0,0,5,1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45415,0,0,0,'Subterranean Body of Water','The current is fast and turbulent, causing the water to spin in a vortex\npattern.\n',0,139532,29,0,0,0,5,2,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45416,0,0,0,'Subterranean Body of Water','This body of water is deeper than normal, although the current remains swift and turbulent.\n',0,139528,30,0,0,0,5,6,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45417,0,0,0,'Subterranean Body of Water','The current is fast and turbulent, causing the water to spin in a vortex pattern.',0,139528,29,0,0,0,5,2,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45418,0,0,0,'Subterranean Body of Water','The current is fast and turbulent, causing the water to spin in a vortex pattern.\n',0,139528,29,0,0,0,5,2,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45419,0,0,0,'Subterranean Body of Water','This body of water is deeper than normal, although the current remains swift and turbulent.\n',0,139532,30,0,0,0,3,2,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45420,0,0,0,'Sunken Hollow','This hollow is filled with muddy water due to an underground spring. The lower portion of the crates from the supply room above protrude from the ceiling.  Other tools, chests and objects have sunk into the murky bottom.',0,139528,30,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45421,0,0,0,'Subterranean Body of Water','The current is fast and turbulent, causing the water to spin in a vortex pattern.\n',0,139528,29,0,0,0,5,0,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45422,0,0,0,'Subterranean Body of Water','The current is fast and turbulent, causing the water to spin in a vortex pattern.',0,139528,29,0,0,0,2,6,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45423,0,0,0,'Submerged Sink Hole','You\'ve fallen into a sink hole! The current is swift, spinning you around in many directions.\n',0,139532,30,0,0,0,3,1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45424,0,0,0,'Rickety Observation Platform','This rickety observation platform overlooks the dig site below.  It\'s official use is to check upon the status of the work being conducted below.  The unofficial use, more often than not,  is used as a launch point to throw slaves and workers who aren\'t performing into the gigantic sink hole below.\n',0,143624,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45425,0,0,0,'Swaying Rope Bridge','The construction of this rope bridge consists of a pair of stone anchors on each side, with tenuous cables of woven moss linking these two pylons together.  Adding to this construction, two additional cables act as guardrails.  The heat from the forge in the dig site is creating a bit of a downdraft which causes the bridge to sway dangerously.  A <W>gust of wind<z> shakes the bridge violently.  This is not a safe place!\n',0,143628,33,120,45434,1,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45426,0,0,0,'Swaying Rope Bridge','The construction of this rope bridge consists of a pair of stone anchors on each side, with tenuous cables of woven moss linking these two pylons together.  Adding to this construction, two additional cables act as guardrails.  The heat from the forge in the dig site is creating a bit of a downdraft which causes the bridge to sway dangerously.  A <W>gust of wind<z> shakes the bridge violently.  This is not a safe place!\n',0,143628,33,120,45434,1,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45427,0,0,0,'Swaying Rope Bridge','The construction of this rope bridge consists of a pair of stone anchors on each side, with tenuous cables of woven moss linking these two pylons together.  Adding to this construction, two additional cables act as guardrails.  The heat from the forge in the dig site is creating a bit of a downdraft which causes the bridge to sway dangerously.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45428,0,0,0,'Overseer\'s Private Quarters','A deep <C>FREEZE<z> has settled into the overseer\'s private quarters.  The source of the cold is unclear and the walls and ceiling are encased in <W>solid ice<z>.  The room is neat, organized and it\'s clear that this room is well used due to the foot traffic apparent on the floor.  Other than his personal bodyguards, the Overseer allows no one to enter these chambers.\n',0,139528,13,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45429,0,0,0,'Overseer\'s Dwelling','This is the entrance to the Overseer\'s personal dwelling.  The room is austere, plain and simple.  There is a frigid cold that permeates the air and it reeks  of unnatural rituals as evidenced by a small supply of bowls and totems pushed into the corner.',0,139528,13,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45430,0,0,0,'Overseer\'s Study','The overseer\'s study is penetrated by the same cold as evidenced in the adjoining rooms, but unlike the other rooms, there is a touch of comfort in an overstuffed chair propped in front of a plain stone table.  Scrolls, parchments and even a journal rest on top of the table. Other than his personal bodyguards, the Overseer allows no one to enter these chambers.\n',0,139528,13,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45431,0,0,0,'Overseer\'s Dwelling','It\'s very cold in these chambers.  This room has some plain furniture and a few wall hangings.  There is a frigid cold that permeates the air and it reeks of unnatural rituals as evidenced by a small supply of flesh wrapped bowls and shattered totems pushed into the northwest corner.',0,139528,13,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45432,0,0,0,'A Messy Clerk-of-the-Works Office','This is a small office carved out of the rock to accommodate the various final designs generated from the planning department.  Small cubby holes are cut into the walls with rolled up parchments tucked neatly within.  A huge L-shaped desk is in the southwest corner.',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45433,0,0,0,'Planning Department','The planning department is a small dirty chamber filled with rolls of parchment, excavation plans and crude tools used for drawing.  There is a huge patch of black mold on the lower eastern wall as water seeps in from an unknown source.',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45434,0,0,0,'Dangerous Sink Hole','<c>The sink hole is huge and extremely<z> <R>dangerous!<z>  <W>Turbulent downdraft\'s of hot gaseous air wreak havoc above.<z>\n',0,144844,29,120,45423,1,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45435,0,0,0,'Escape Tunnel','This narrow tunnel has recently been dug to provide a route of escape for the prisoners.  There is barely enough room to get more than one or two people in to continue the dig process.  Dust and grime is everywhere.  The tunnel  seems to come to an end as a large pile of debris blocks further progress to the east.',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,1,120,0,'',NULL),
(45436,0,0,0,'Escape Tunnel','This narrow tunnel has recently been dug out to provide a route of escape for\nthe prisoners.  There is barely enough room to get more than one or two people\nin it to continue the dig process.  Dust and grime is everywhere.  The tunnel\ncontinues to the east.  A large mine cart hinders access to the west.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,2,120,0,'',NULL),
(45437,0,0,0,'Secret Redoubt','This room is surprisingly neat and orderly. It serves as the last bastion of defense and hope for the resistance and serves a dual purpose as home to Mycotox, the deformed resistance leader.  Crude tools and other items looted from the dig site are neatly organized in a pile to serve as weapons. The walls are jagged and similar to many of the other tunnels. A rusty mine cart is pushed up against the east wall. Small benches are on the south and north walls. The west wall has a bracket attached to it.',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45438,0,0,0,'Resistance Headquarters','This room is the headquarters for the resistance movement; a band of slaves and prisoners desperately trying to escape the squalor and deprivation they endure on a daily basis. A large makeshift table made of chiseled rock serves as the main meeting and planning area. Scraps of parchment are loosely strewn around the table. The walls are jagged and uneven and the ceiling looks dangerously unstable. The walls appear bare. A soiled and filthy mattress covered in feces is propped against a wall  in the northwest corner.',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45439,0,0,0,'Slave Pen','This is the dirtiest section of the Slave Pen.  The living conditions are appalling with buckets filled with a yellow and brown fluid lining the southern wall and a soiled and filthy mattress covered in feces is propped against a wall in the southeast corner.',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45440,0,0,0,'Slave Pen','This is where the those unlucky enough to be captured, exiled or deformed spend their time when not being beaten or worked to death.  The slave pen is covered in muck and the ground appears squishy. The air is dank and the walls are covered in black and green patches of mold.  The living conditions are appalling.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45441,0,0,0,'Slave Pen','This is where the those unlucky enough to be captured, exiled or deformed spend their time when not being beaten or worked to death.  The slave pen is covered in muck and the ground appears squishy. The air is dank and the walls are covered in black and green patches of mold.  The living conditions are appalling.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45442,0,0,0,'Slave Pen','This is where the those unlucky enough to be captured, exiled or deformed spend their time when not being beaten or worked to death.  The slave pen is covered in muck and the ground appears squishy. The air is dank and the walls are covered in black and green patches of mold.  The living conditions are appalling.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45443,0,0,0,'Narrow Jagged Tunnel','This is a narrow and jagged tunnel with chunks of rock protruding from the walls that are sharp enough to draw blood.  Construction efforts were minimal at best.  Patches of black and green mold colonies grow in abundance on the surface of just about everything.  The ground is muddy and the air is dank.  A strong odor drifts in from the south.  The jagged tunnel also leads north.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45444,0,0,0,'Narrow Jagged Tunnel','This is a narrow and jagged tunnel with chunks of rock protruding from the walls that are sharp enough to draw blood.  Construction efforts were minimal at best.  Patches of black and green mold colonies grow in abundance on the surface of just about everything.  The ground is muddy and the air is dank.  From the east comes a powerful stench that smells of decay.  The jagged tunnel continues to the north and south.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45445,0,0,0,'Corpse Pit','A huge pit is here filled with the rotting corpses of broken, beaten and dead slaves that have been worked to death.  The stench can be overpowering enough to make even the most hardened sick to their stomach.  It\'s hard to know how deep the pit is, as some limbs and body parts look like they\'ve been butchered for their skin.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45446,0,0,0,'Narrow Jagged Tunnel','This is a narrow and jagged tunnel with chunks of rock protruding from the walls that are sharp enough to draw blood.  Construction efforts were minimal at best.  Patches of black and green mold colonies grow in abundance on the surface of just about everything.  The ground is muddy and the air is dank.  To the north is the entrance of the dig site.  The jagged tunnel also continues south.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45447,0,0,0,'Excavation Tunnel Entrance','This is the entrance to a recently dug tunnel.  The ceiling is supported by large wooden beams anchored to the ground with stacks of neatly squared rocks chiseled out of the earth.  The walls are jagged; on their surface are patches of black and green mold growing in large colonies.  There is a large gate to the north adorned with the skulls of gnomes, elves, dwarves and surprisingly, even a misshapen troll skull.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45448,0,0,0,'Narrow Jagged Tunnel','This is a narrow and jagged tunnel with chunks of rock protruding from the walls that are sharp enough to draw blood.  Patches of black and green mold colonies grow in abundance on the surface of just about everything.  The ground is muddy and the air is suffocating.  To the east is the entrance of the dig site.  Sounds of construction work come from the southwest. The jagged tunnel also continues to the west.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45449,0,0,0,'Collapsed Sinking Tunnel','This portion of the tunnel is slowly sinking due to the natural limestone rock found in this section of the cave.  Muddy water is seeping up from a subterranean body of water making this a dangerous place to be.  The mold covered ceiling, usually supported by large wooden beams anchored to the ground with stacks of chiseled rocks, is sagging dangerously low as the rocks sink lower and lower.',0,139532,29,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45450,0,0,0,'Collapsed Sinking Tunnel','This portion of the tunnel is slowly sinking due to the natural limestone rock found in this section of the cave.  Muddy water is seeping up from a subterranean body of water making this a dangerous place to be.  The mold covered ceiling, usually supported by large wooden beams anchored to the ground with stacks of chiseled rocks, is sagging dangerously low as the rocks sink lower and lower.\n',0,139532,29,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45451,0,0,0,'Collapsed Sinking Tunnel','This portion of the tunnel is slowly sinking due to the natural limestone rock found in this section of the cave.  Muddy water is seeping up from a subterranean body of water making this a dangerous place to be.  The mold covered ceiling, usually supported by large wooden beams anchored to the ground with stacks of chiseled rocks, is sagging dangerously low as the rocks sink lower and lower.\n',0,139532,29,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45452,0,0,0,'Excavated Tunnel','This excavated tunnel is large and spacious.  The ceiling is supported by large wooden beams anchored to the ground with stacks of neatly squared rocks chiseled out of the earth.  The walls are jagged and on their surface are patches of black and green mold growing in large colonies.  To the northeast is a narrow jagged tunnel.  From the southwest comes the sound of hammers pounding on rock.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45453,0,0,0,'Excavated Tunnel','This excavated tunnel is large and spacious.  The ceiling is supported by large wooden beams anchored to the ground with stacks of neatly squared rocks chiseled out of the earth.  The walls are jagged and on the surface are patches of black and green mold growing in large colonies.  The northeast leads to another excavated tunnel.  From the southwest comes the sound of hammers pounding on rock.',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45454,0,0,0,'Entrance to a Gigantic Dig Site','This excavated tunnel is large and spacious.  The ceiling is supported by large wooden beams anchored to the ground with stacks of neatly squared rocks chiseled out of the earth.  The walls are jagged and on the surface are patches of black and green mold growing in large colonies.  To the west is a vast, gigantic dig site.  The northeast leads to an excavated tunnel and foot prints on the ground leading southeast indicates another tunnel in that direction.',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45455,0,0,0,'Reinforced Tunnel','This excavated tunnel is larger than usual and seems sturdier than the others.  The ceiling is supported by large wooden beams anchored to the ground with stacks of neatly squared rocks chiseled out of the earth.  The walls are smoother but are covered in patches of black and green mold that grow in large colonies on the surface. There is a faint smell of offal to the south.',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45456,0,0,0,'Livestock Pen','This large natural cavern has been converted into a livestock pen in order to feed the upper echelon of the dig site.  The pens are constructed of scrap wood lashed together with twine and the animals are secure within.  Hay carted in from the outside has been stacked in the southeast corner.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45457,0,0,0,'Foreman\'s Hidden Trove','The filth and depravity of the Foreman\'s Hovel was just a cover to keep his superiors from discovering this room.  For years the Foreman has been carefully stealing every item he could possibly find.  Inset upon the walls are ledges filled with miscellaneous trinkets and scraps he\'s collected throughout his tenure as Foreman.  A rusty lever is on the west wall.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45458,0,0,0,'Foreman\'s Hovel','Rank filth is present in every nook and cranny of this room.  Debris is piled waist high along each wall, hiding who knows what.  The ceiling is the only part of the room untouched by the filth and even that is covered in patches of black and green mold.  A gruesome flap made from strips of skin covers the exit to the northwest.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45459,0,0,0,'Reinforced Tunnel','This excavated tunnel is larger than usual and seems sturdier than the others.  The ceiling is supported by large wooden beams anchored to the ground with stacks of neatly squared rocks chiseled out of the earth.  The walls are smoother but are covered in patches of black and green mold that grow in large colonies on the surface.  There is a gruesome flap made from strips of skin covering an entrance to the southeast. The tunnel continues to the northwest.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45460,0,0,0,'Reinforced Tunnel','This excavated tunnel is larger than usual and seems sturdier than the others.  The ceiling is supported by large wooden beams anchored to the ground with stacks of neatly squared rocks chiseled out of the earth.  The walls are smoother but are covered in patches of black and green mold that grow in large colonies on the surface.  To the west is a gigantic dig site. The tunnel also continues to the southeast.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45461,0,0,0,'Gigantic Dig Site','The dig site is massive.  Huge excavated sections of the ground are dug to different depths in a haphazard sort of way that makes no sense, almost as if they were digging for something specific.  The air is thick with floating particulates from all the dust and debris.  Broken tools and various devices are scattered about the area.  The sound of a gigantic rattling contraption echoes loudly in the distance.',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45462,0,0,0,'Gigantic Dig Site','The dig site is massive.  Huge excavated sections of the ground are dug to different depths in a haphazard sort of way that makes no sense, almost as if they were digging for something specific.  The air is thick with floating particulates from all the dust and debris.  Broken tools and various devices are scattered about the area.  The sound of a gigantic rattling contraption echoes loudly in the distance.',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45463,0,0,0,'<R>Sadistic Chamber<z>','This small chamber is filled with every imaginable horror.  Torture devices are scattered about the room.  A jar filled to the brim with <y>gouged out eyeballs<z> and a <o>bowl of flesh<z> filled with <r>severed genitalia<z> rest on a <w>table made of bleached bones<z>. <R>Blood<z> is splattered on the jagged walls and soaks the floor making it slippery.  A <r>bloody<z> <w>meat hook<z> is attached to the northern wall.',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45464,0,0,0,'Aspergillus\'s Quarters','These private quarters belong to Commander Aspergillus the Cruel.  While the room is orderly and spacious like the others, it is different in that it is filled with various devices meant to harm people.  A <r>bloody<z> <w>meat hook<z> hangs on the southern wall.  Mats made from torn and ripped flesh are scattered around the room.',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45465,0,0,0,'<R>Inside an Enclosed Structure<z>','<r>The contraption is a dangerously jury rigged conveyor belt system used to\nspeed up the task of getting rock and debris from below to the surface.  Large\npulley\'s, water wheels and a stoked furnace throwing off tremendous heat powers\nthe crude device.  Nearby is a securely locked mining shaft elevator that leads\ninto the mines.  The conveyor belt takes up most of the space within this room\nmaking it an extremely tight fit and dangerous due to the rattling and rickety\nmoving gears.<z>\n',0,139529,62,600,45466,1,0,-1,4,100,0,'',NULL),
(45466,0,0,0,'Cramped Tunnel','This excavated tunnel, once large and spacious, is now cramped with little room\nto move due to the massive buildup of rock and debris needing to be hauled to\nthe surface.  It\'s so high that it sometimes comes crashing down on the belt\nsystem making it next to impossible to escape that way without serious injury. \nThe tunnel itself has rough hewn walls and sharp jagged protrusions.  The\nceiling, supported by large wooden beams, is anchored to the ground with\nembedded slabs of carved stone.  Well worn tracks have formed on the ground here\nfrom miners hauling dirt and debris to the conveyor belt.  A securely locked\nmine shaft elevator is here for the workers safety and convenience.\n',0,139532,33,600,45465,1,0,-1,8,120,0,'',NULL),
(45467,0,0,0,'Excavated Tunnel','This excavated tunnel has rough hewn walls and sharp jagged protrusions.  The\nceiling, supported by large wooden beams, is anchored to the ground with\nembedded slabs of carved stone.  Well worn tracks have formed on the ground here\nfrom miners hauling dirt and debris to the conveyor belt.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45468,0,0,0,'Sloped Tunnel','The tunnel slopes steeply here in both directions. The ceiling hangs\nprecariously low in some sections as the angle of the slope has interfered with\nthe supporting cross members and unstable footings.  Well worn tracks have\nformed on the ground here from miners hauling dirt and debris to the conveyor\nbelt.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,95,0,'',NULL),
(45469,0,0,0,'Sloped Tunnel','The tunnel slopes steeply here in both directions. The ceiling hangs\nprecariously low in some sections as the angle of the slope has interfered with\nthe supporting cross members and unstable footings.  Well worn tracks have\nformed on the ground here from miners hauling dirt and debris to the conveyor\nbelt.\n',0,139528,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,95,0,'',NULL),
