(45481,0,0,0,'Flooded Sloped Tunnel','This tunnel originally sloped downwards, but a water break from below has\ncollapsed most of the tunnel leaving it partially flooded. The ceiling hangs\nprecariously low in some sections as the angle of the slope has interfered with\nthe supporting cross members and the already unstable footings are now starting\nto sink.  To the southeast the tunnel continues its gradual slope back up to the\nsurface.\n',0,139532,29,0,0,0,0,0,0,95,0,'',NULL),
(45482,0,0,0,'Flooded Tunnel','The tunnel, once fully excavated is now submerged completely underwater.  Rot\nhas set into the support beams and columns that are still in place leaving them\ndangerously unstable.\n',0,140552,30,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45483,0,0,0,'Flooded Tunnel','The tunnel, once fully excavated is now submerged completely underwater.  Rot\nhas set into the support beams and columns that are still in place leaving them\ndangerously unstable.\n',0,140552,30,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45484,0,0,0,'Flooded Tunnel','The tunnel, once fully excavated is now submerged completely underwater.  Rot\nhas set into the support beams and columns that are still in place leaving them\ndangerously unstable.\n',0,140552,30,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45485,0,0,0,'Flooded Tunnel','The tunnel, once fully excavated is now submerged completely underwater.  Rot\nhas set into the support beams and columns that are still in place leaving them\ndangerously unstable.\n',0,140552,30,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45486,0,0,0,'Sloped Flooded Tunnel','The tunnel, once fully excavated is now submerged completely underwater.  Rot\nhas set into the support beams and columns leaving them dangerously unstable. \nConstruction came to an abrupt halt here when there was a breach in the walls\ncausing the lower tunnel system to flood.\n',0,140552,30,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45487,0,0,0,'Flooded Breach','There is a natural fissure between the rocks here created from the pressure of\nwater seeping in from an underground body of water.  It\'s  narrow and cramped\nand there isn\'t much room to maneuver.  The miners digging, created a breach in\nthe rock to the south causing the lower tunnels to flood.  To the northeast is a\nlarge submerged cavern.\n',0,140552,30,0,0,0,0,-1,4,120,0,'',NULL),
(45488,0,0,0,'Submerged Cavern','The cavern is spacious,  vast and utterly devoid of any material possessions. \nIt is one of the last refuges of a dying race and there is little evidence to\nsuggest that any outsiders have ever been here before.  The walls have ancient\ndrawings carved into them .  Although submerged fully, the engravings\n<c>sparkle<z> against the contrast of the dark, murky blue water.\n',0,140552,30,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45489,0,0,0,'An Ancient Guardian\'s Lair','The cavern, wide as it is long, is the seat of Ixeidine Yellowfang, one of the\nlast remaining elders of his kind.  A strange pulsation emanates from an unknown\nsource and sends vibrations through the water.  The floor, once jagged stone,\nhas been rubbed smooth from the prostration and reverence of his followers.\n',0,144648,30,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'',NULL),
(45490,0,0,0,'A Hallow Passage','Long ago this tomb was erected as monument to those who died \nthroughout the world that were worth making note of.  Dwarves\nconstructed this passage, which is evident by the symmetrical lines\nand smoothness of the walls.  Flecks of granite and marble make \nthe walls sparkle.  The passage continues on to the\nsouth.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(45491,0,0,0,'A Hallow Passage','Long ago this tomb was erected as monument to those who died \nthroughout the world that were worth making note of.  Dwarves\nconstructed this passage, which is evident by the symmetrical lines\nand smoothness of the walls.  Flecks of granite and marble make \nthe walls sparkle.  The passage continues on to the\nnorth and south.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(45492,0,0,0,'A Hallow Passage','Long ago this tomb was erected as monument to those who died \nthroughout the world that were worth making note of.  Dwarves\nconstructed this passage, which is evident by the symmetrical lines\nand smoothness of the walls.  Flecks of granite and marble make \nthe walls sparkle.  The passage continues on to the\nnorth and southwest.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(45493,0,0,0,'A Quiet Passage','Complete silence and beauty lace this entire area. Stunning etchings\ncover everything from the floor to the ceiling. The order and positioning\nof the etching appear to be telling some sort of sad story. The passage\ncontinues on to the northeast and southwest.\n',0,132104,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(45494,0,0,0,'A Quiet Passage','Complete silence and beauty lace this entire area.  Stunning etchings cover\neverything from the floor to the ceiling.  The order and positioning of the\netching appear to be telling some sort of sad story.  The passage continues on\nto the northeast and south.\n',0,132104,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(45495,0,0,0,'A Quiet Passage','Complete silence and beauty lace this entire area.  Stunning etchings cover\neverything from the floor to the ceiling.  The order and positioning of the\netching appear to be telling some sort of sad story.  The passage continues on\nto the north and an antechamber opens up to the south.\n',0,132104,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(45496,0,0,0,'The Antechamber','Beautiful tapestries and drawings are very bold in this chamber.  Timeless\nand tasteful the pictures begin to tell a story of some of the realms greatest\nmages, clerics, deikhans, monks, and thieves.  Smooth, dark granite covers \nthe floor which is contrasted by the stark white marble walls.  The drawings can\nbe found deeply embedded in the marvelous marble.  A passage is to the \nnorth and to the northeast a magical hall awaits.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(45497,0,0,0,'A Mystic Hall','Powerful <C>auras<z> are present in this vast hall.  Great and powerful mages\nof the past haunt these halls with their peaceful presence, creating a serene \nenvironment.  The walls are lined with a clear stone that flickers with \nwonderful colors.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(45498,0,0,0,'A Mystic Hall','Powerful <C>auras<z> are present in this vast hall.  Great and powerful mages\nof the past haunt these halls with their peaceful presence, creating a serene \nenvironment.  The walls are lined with a clear stone that flickers with \nwonderful colors.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(45499,0,0,0,'A Mystic Hall','Powerful <C>auras<z> are present in this vast hall.  Great and powerful mages\nof the past haunt these halls with their peaceful presence, creating a serene \nenvironment.  The walls are lined with a clear stone that flickers with \nwonderful colors.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(45500,0,0,0,'A Mystic Hall','Powerful <C>auras<z> are present in this vast hall.  Great and powerful mages\nof the past haunt these halls with their peaceful presence, creating a serene \nenvironment.  The walls are lined with a clear stone that flickers with \nwonderful colors.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(45501,0,0,0,'Path of the Damned','An unshakable chill penetrates the very essence of this passage.  Although \nlit, there is still a darkness in the air, like a black veil over the light. \nThe black\nmarble walls and floors are seamless as if the path was made through a large\nmarble vein.  Silver sconces light the wall carvings.  Through the carvings on\nthe\nwall the damned seem captured in their disgrace.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(45502,0,0,0,'Path of the Damned','An unshakable chill penetrates the very essence of this passage.  Although \nlit, there is still a darkness in the air, like a black veil over the light. \nThe black\nmarble walls and floors are seamless as if the path was made through a large\nmarble vein.  Silver sconces light the wall carvings.  Through the carvings on\nthe\nwall the damned seem captured in their disgrace.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(45503,0,0,0,'Path of the Damned','An unshakable chill penetrates the very essence of this passage.  Although \nlit, there is still a darkness in the air, like a black veil over the light. \nThe black\nmarble walls and floors are seamless as if the path was made through a large\nmarble vein.  Silver sconces light the wall carvings.  Through the carvings on\nthe\nwall the damned seem captured in their disgrace.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(45504,0,0,0,'The Grand Antechamber','Worked ornate stone creates this grand chamber.  Dwarven stone workers\nspent thousands of man hours creating a room which would be more fitting\nin a museum; a true work of art.  The room\'s beauty has taken the breath away\nfrom many admirers.  To the northeast a hall opens and to the southeast is a \nsorrowful path.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(45505,0,0,0,'A Champion\'s Hall','When great games used to be nations pastimes many victorious champions\nrose from the ranks.  Those that did are paid homage here.  Pictures, drawings,\nand etchings cover the walls with pictures of those great heroes.  A thin layer\nof limestone covers the floor.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(45506,0,0,0,'A Champion\'s Hall','When great games used to be nations pastimes many victorious champions\nrose from the ranks.  Those that did are paid homage here.  Pictures, drawings,\nand etchings cover the walls with pictures of those great heroes.  A thin layer\nof limestone covers the floor.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(45507,0,0,0,'A Champion\'s Hall','When great games used to be nations pastimes many victorious champions\nrose from the ranks.  Those that did are paid homage here.  Pictures, drawings,\nand etchings cover the walls with pictures of those great heroes.  A thin layer\nof limestone covers the floor.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(45508,0,0,0,'The Altar of Remembrance','This room presents a mausoleum like atmosphere.  Stark white walls and rugged\nfloors make this large room appear comfortable, yet off-putting at the same \ntime.   An extremely cold draft seems to come up from below.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'',NULL),
(45509,0,0,0,'A Chilled Walkway','Cold gray walls are hidden by plain tapestries showing average scenes of\nships at sea and dogs playing poker.  Frost lines everything, and thick ice\nlayers the floor while a frigid mist envelopes this entire walkway.  The\nwalkway continues on to the north and southwest.\n',0,131080,13,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(45510,0,0,0,'A Chilled Walkway','Cold gray walls are hidden by plain tapestries showing average scenes of\nships at sea and dogs playing poker.  Frost lines everything, and thick ice\nlayers the floor while a frigid mist envelopes this entire walkway.  The\nwalkway continues on to the northeast and a reception area is to the south.\n',0,131080,13,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(45511,0,0,0,'A Reception Area','The walls are a drab off-white and hold nothing spectacular.  This bland room\nis intended to hold those who come to celebrate the dead.  To the southwest \na plethora of halls open waiting to tell their story and a chilly draft is to\nthe north.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(45512,0,0,0,'The Hall of Heroes','Standing still throughout the ages are statues of the bravest of men.  The hall \nis lit by crystal chandeliers and the light reflects off the polished statues. \nUpon \nthe walls, scenes of their bravery are reflected by hanging tapestries.  Gallant\nwarriors and Heroes who have won the hearts of thousands live on forever\nin this great hall.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(45513,0,0,0,'The Hall of Heroes','Standing still throughout the ages are statues of the bravest of men.  The\nhall is lit by crystal chandeliers and the light reflects off the polished\nstatues.  Upon the walls, scenes of their bravery are reflected by hanging\ntapestries.  Gallant warriors and Heroes who have won the hearts of thousands\nlive on forever in this great hall.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(45514,0,0,0,'The Hall of Sins','Blood oozes from deep cracks in the stone walls and is constantly flowing.  The \nblood pools up where the walls and the floor meet, then slowly vanishes. \nMurder,\nRage, Matricide and Corruption are shown on the paintings that were created by \nharsh and frenzied brush strokes.  Whores are depicted as Goddesses while their \nincestuous fathers are made to be Gods.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(45515,0,0,0,'The Hall of Sins','Blood oozes from deep cracks in the stone walls and is constantly flowing.  The \nblood pools up where the walls and the floor meet, then slowly vanishes. \nMurder,\nRage, Matricide and Corruption are shown on the paintings that were created by \nharsh and frenzied brushstrokes.  Whores are depicted as Goddesses while their \nincestuous fathers are made to be Gods.\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(45516,0,0,0,'The Hall of Hope','Plush green carpet covers the entire floor and has a meadow grass appearance.\nSoft yellow walls made of silk tapestries cascade down to the floor.  Flowers \nappear to bloom from the walls.  This hall was made to give one a sense of love\nand hope, almost as if the gods themselves had breathed a sigh of relief\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(45517,0,0,0,'The Hall of Hope','Plush green carpet covers the entire floor and has a meadow grass appearance.\nSoft yellow walls made of silk tapestries cascade down to the floor.  Flowers \nappear to bloom from the walls.  This hall was made to give one a sense of love\nand hope, almost as if the gods themselves had breathed a sigh of relief\n',0,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
(45518,0,0,0,'A Chilled Walkway','Cold gray walls are hidden by plain tapestries showing average scenes \nof ships at sea  and dogs playing poker.  Frost lines everything, and thick ice\nlayers the floor while a frigid mist envelopes this entire walkway. The walkway\ncontinues on to the south.\n',0,131080,13,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'',NULL),
