(19,0,0,0,'The Infinite Expanse','Before you lies the sea of infinity. The calm mirror-like surface stretches out\nas far as the eye can see. Peering down past your own reflection the depths are\nseemingly endless yet you cannot penetrate the boundary between sky and sea.\n',1,131072,60,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'Aion',2),
