(45772,0,0,0,'A Small Bridge Across the Meijin Creek','The path leads you to a small stone bridge that crosses the creek.  The\nmountains give way to a tropical paradise.  A glittering blue lake can be seen\nfurther to the northwest in-between the mountains.  A large estate crests over\nthe trees towards the south.  The sounds of wildlife and the splashes of water\nhitting rocks as it flows downstream can be heard from all around.  The path\ncontinues to the west and northeast.\n  ',0,131072,48,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'Ammanas',1),
(45773,0,0,0,'A Small Dirt Path','A path continues amidst a tropical paradise.  The sounds of wildlife and the\nsplashes of water hitting rocks as it flows downstream can be heard from all\naround.  Birds glide over the lake to the north searching for their next meal. \nTo the south, trees trimmed into large animals can be seen towering over the\nwalls.  The path continues to the west and east.\n  ',0,131072,48,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'Ammanas',1),
(45774,0,0,0,'A Small Dirt Path','The path leads up to an enormous gate to the south.  Tops of a topiary garden\nare seen over a large, gated estate.  Nestled in the mountains next to a lake\nsits a large, beautiful building far to the south.  The dirt path continues to\nthe south and east.\n  ',0,131072,48,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'Ammanas',1),
(45775,0,0,0,'A Bayside Dock','The dock here looks to be in pristine condition.  No barnacles or algae is found\non any of the posts.  Any refuse caused by wildlife has been cleaned from the\ndocks.  No rot is found on the docks.  The sounds of wildlife can be heard from\nall around.  The lake to the north is glittering blue.  There is an occasional\ndisturbance in the water from the fish touching the surface and the occasional\nsplash as birds dive into the water for their next meal.\n  ',0,131072,54,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'Ammanas',1),
(45776,0,0,0,'A Large Topiary Garden','The large open garden is made to perfection.  The trees are carefully trimmed\ninto birds nesting with their little ones.  Other trees have been trimmed to\nmimic squirrels attempting to steal bird seed from the bird feeders.  A small\nbird bath stands amidst the trees, inviting birds to wash and cool off from the\nheat.  The gardens continue to the south.  A dirt road is seen to the east.\n  ',0,131072,43,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'Ammanas',1),
(45777,0,0,0,'Cobblestone Road','The road here has been paved with cobblestones which almost seems out of place\nif it wasn\'t for the immaculate estate towards the south.\n  ',0,131072,59,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'Ammanas',1),
(45778,0,0,0,'A Large Topiary Garden','The large open garden is made to perfection.  The trees are carefully trimmed\ninto large and small creatures.  Giant tree elephants tower over you while\nsmaller ones are shaped into foxes chasing rabbits and other smaller vermin. \nThe gardens continue to the south.  A dirt road is seen to the west.\n  ',0,131072,43,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'Ammanas',1),
(45779,0,0,0,'A Large Topiary Garden','The large open garden is made to perfection.  The trees here are trimmed into\nall sorts of shapes and sizes with winding paths of beauty.  The gardens\ncontinue to the north and south.  A dirt road is seen to the east.\n  ',0,131072,43,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'Ammanas',1),
(45780,0,0,0,'Cobblestone Road','The road here has been paved with cobblestones which almost seems out of place\nif it wasn\'t for the immaculate estate towards the south.\n  ',0,131072,59,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'Ammanas',1),
