(45785,0,0,0,'Tack and Store Room','Lined along the wall is a saddle rack with multiple saddles hanging from posts. \nBits, reins, and harnesses are stacked along the wall.  There is enough horse\nfeed for a dozen horses.  The room is large enough to hold a carriage.\n  ',0,131081,55,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'Ammanas',1),
(45786,0,0,0,'Stables','There are multiple stalls here enough to hold a dozen horses.  The smell of hay\nand horse fills the air.  Some of the stalls look to be cleaned multiple times a\nday.  The hay fresh and the water clean. \n  ',0,131081,55,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'Ammanas',1),
(45787,0,0,0,'Cobblestone Road','The road here has been paved with cobblestones which almost seems out of place\nif it wasn\'t for the immaculate estate towards the south.\n  ',0,131072,59,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'Ammanas',1),
