(45790,0,0,0,'Entryway','The person that owns this place must be obsessed with anything shiny.   Jewelry\nglitters off nearly every surface.  A glittering chandelier brights up the room.\nJeweled candelabras mounted to the wall keep this room well lit.  Two naked\nebony statues of beautiful women welcomes travelers.  A red carpet runs from the\ndoor and continues to the south.  \n  ',0,131081,55,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'Ammanas',1),
(45791,0,0,0,'Kitchen','This bright room is full of expensive cutlery.  Sparkling silverware, plates,\nand bowls all imported from the most exotic of places are stacked here waiting\nto serve someone of great importance.\n  ',0,131081,55,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'Ammanas',1),
(45792,0,0,0,'A Glowing Hallway','Jeweled candelabras mounted to the wall keep this room well lit.  A bright red\ncarpet runs from this room to the east and south.\n  ',0,131081,55,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'Ammanas',1),
