(46406,9,-1,0,'Entrance to a Dark Alcove','You stand at the beginning of a rock outcropping.  Granite has burst through the\nearth and left a hole underneath.  Clearly someone or something has cleared a\nway slightly down into the earth and depths underneath the morass.  Water\ntrickles in and down the slight slope into the darkness. \n',329,8192,27,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Onslaught',1),
