(46432,10,-17,0,'A Thatched Hut','The slope down into the alcove quickly levels out, moisture and the stench of\nrot is thick in the air.  Water drips from the exposed root system overhead\nhelping form the puddle you\'re standing in now. You hear a faint sloughing sound\nfrom the area ahead, on the floor there is bits of fur and bone with bits of\nflesh still attached.\n',329,0,32,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Onslaught',1),
