(8499,76,44,-2,'A Rocky Path Through The Mountains','The ground is littered with rocks and stones, making travel difficult. The view extends far and wide. There is a faint trail, but it does not look to have been used a great deal. Very little life is present.',67,8448,5,0,0,0,0,-1,0,-1,0,'Sidartha',1),
(16700,-34,-13,2,'Cramped Attic','This humble attic space is striking in its stark simplicity. Slanting ceilings meet with the floor, precluding any wall decorations or other adornments. Absent of windows, the room would be pitch black if not for the blinding portal pulsing in the center. Surrounding the portal are scattered various sundry items used to ready again the battle torn.',147,139529,32,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'Sidartha',2),
