(13635,-16,0,-2,'Dimly-Lit Tunnel Beneath Grimhaven','This damp and dimly-lit tunnel is carved through brittle and crumbling shale.\nThe\nuneven floor crunches and scrapes underfoot as the shards of shale slide against\nshale,\nmaking passage hard to go unnoticed.\n',109,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'Therias',1),
(13636,-17,1,-2,'A Dank Underground Hideout','Damp and mouldy bedrolls are scattered around this cavern between broken\ncrates, and a small firepit in this unventilated space makes clear it€s been\nused\nrecently by the smoke in the air. Somehow a slight breeze seems to be blowing\nthe smoke eastwards, nevertheless.\n',109,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'Therias',1),
(13637,0,0,0,'An Abrupt Dead-End at a Stone Wall','The tunnel rises up from shale below into the softer earth and mud here, but\nthen\nabruptly stops at a wall of massive stone blocks. A winch and several pulleys\nseem to\nbe connected to a heavy wooden post fixed to one of the blocks.\n',109,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'Therias',1),
(13638,-1,-1,-2,'A Spacious and Questionably-Reinforced Hall','This extravagantly wide cavern hardly looks like it has the reinforcement to\nhold the\nceilings up. Torches rest in sconces along the wall, and a modest effort has\nbeen put\ninto laying a cobblestone floor. Suits of crude, goblin-sized armor stand\nassembled\nnext to the sconces like an attempt to mimic the decor of a castle.\n',109,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,180,0,'Therias',1),
(13639,-1,0,-2,'A Spacious and Questionably-Reinforced Hall','This extravagantly wide cavern hardly looks like it has the reinforcement to\nhold the\nceilings up. Torches rest in sconces along the wall, and a modest effort has\nbeen put\ninto laying a cobblestone floor. Suits of crude, goblin-sized armor stand\nassembled\nnext to the sconces like an attempt to mimic the decor of a castle.\n',109,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,180,0,'Therias',1),
(13640,-1,1,-2,'A Spacious and Questionably-Reinforced Hall','This extravagantly wide cavern hardly looks like it has the reinforcement to\nhold the\nceilings up. Torches rest in sconces along the wall, and a modest effort has\nbeen put\ninto laying a cobblestone floor. Suits of crude, goblin-sized armor stand\nassembled\nnext to the sconces like an attempt to mimic the decor of a castle.\n',109,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,180,0,'Therias',1),
(13641,-2,1,-2,'Grukk\'s Traditional Goblin BBQ','The aromas wafting from this small cavern are almost appetizing. Almost. It\'s\ngrilled\nprotein, at least, though it might be best remaining ignorant about what kind of\nprotein\nthat happens to be. An exhaust pipe above the grill hardly seems to be doing its\njob.\n',109,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,120,0,'Therias',1),
(13642,-2,2,-2,'Goblintown Square Fountain','It\'s hard not to think this small market square might one day live up to its\ndesigns. For now, it\'s more of an underground mudpit. Wooden planks provide\nsome relief from the mud, but even the roughly-carved marble fountain here is\ncondemned to be undrinkable thanks to the inescapable mud.\n',109,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,240,0,'Therias',1),
(13643,-1,2,-2,'A Primitive Goblin Smithy','This cavern reeks of coal smoke, iron oxides, and fetid body-odor. It appears\nthe\ngutter-goblins are using it as a facility for scrapping metal, and almost\nexclusively from\niron cookware. A deep, coal-fed forge smolders and burns at the far end of the\ncavern,\nbelching out black smoke that is sucked into a chute in the ceiling with\nsurprising\nefficiency.\n',109,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,100,0,'Therias',1),
(13644,0,2,-2,'An Off-Limits Storeroom','This cavern serves as a surprisingly organized storeroom. Shelves line all the\nwalls and\nreach to the ceiling, though the shelves and what crates are on them look mostly\nempty. It is obvious this storeroom is currently meeting needs much smaller than\nthe\nambition that had it built. To the southwest is a large wooden gate. The lowest\nshelf\nalong the opposite wall is kept empty for no apparent reason, and the wall\nbehind it\nlooks different from the board-slat construction used for the two other walls.\n',109,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,216,0,'Therias',1),
(13645,-2,3,-2,'Goblintown Square Stage','A small stage faces the fountain from this part of Goblintown Square, with\nspace between presumably for an audience to gather. It\'s difficult to imagine\nsuch an audience gathering in this dank cave populated only by gutter-goblins,\nbut who knows what the goblins are imagining. For now the room serves as a\nmudpit bridged by long, wooden planks. Peculiar aromas emanate out of a goblin\nbarbeque to the south.\n',109,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,240,0,'Therias',1),
(13646,-1,3,-2,'Wretched, Foul-Smelling Warrens','This muddy chamber looks capable of housing a very large number of goblins in\nclose\nproximity, and it smells like it does. Torches provide just enough light for\nshadows to\ndance across the earthen walls to merge with the shadowy sleeping-alcoves\nstacked\nthree high along either side.\n',109,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,150,0,'Therias',1),
(13647,0,3,-2,'Wretched, Foul-Smelling Warrens','This muddy chamber looks capable of housing a very large number of goblins in\nclose\nproximity, and it smells like it does. Torches provide just enough light for\nshadows to\ndance across the earthen walls to merge with the shadowy sleeping-alcoves\nstacked\nthree high along either side.\n',109,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,150,0,'Therias',1),
(13648,1,3,-2,'A Makeshift Ladder Below a Wooden Platform','This cramped passageway abruptly veers straight up with a makeshift ladder\nleading to a platform above. Fresh air mixes here with the stale air from the\ncaverns beyond.\n',109,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,180,0,'Therias',1),
(13649,0,0,0,'A Platform Halfway Up a Makeshift Ladder','This platform of rough-hewn boards laid on poles or wedged into the sides of the\ntunnel-shaft looks like it could collapse at any minute, but is surprisingly\nsturdy. The\nmakeshift ladder leads onwards to a hatch above.\n',109,131080,33,0,0,0,0,-1,0,240,0,'Therias',1),
(4975,1,-1,0,'Dark Woods','Many large trees of various sizes surround the area with a thick ominous white\nmist.  There is no sign of wildlife nor the rustling of leaves, there\'s a\nfloating image behind the trees making this place quite eerie.\n',44,0,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'Thorkell',1),
(4976,1,-6,0,'Inside a large cave','The cave wall is moist to the touch, as a droplet of water drips from the\nceiling. An eerie moan can be heard from the west as a stench of rotting flesh\ndrifts from the east.',44,8,33,0,0,0,0,0,0,100,0,'Thorkell',1),
(4977,2,-3,0,'Dark Woods','Many large trees of various sizes surround the area with a thick ominous white\nmist.  There is no sign of wildlife nor the rustling of leaves, there\'s a\nfloating image behind the trees making this place quite eerie.\n',44,0,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,-1,0,'Thorkell',1),
(4978,1,-7,0,'Inside a large cave','The cave wall is moist to the touch, as a droplet of water drips from the\nceiling. Screaming and sinister laughter can be heard from the south.',44,8,33,0,0,0,0,0,10,100,0,'Thorkell',1),
