(4989,0,0,0,'A trail to the forgotten woods',' A worn path with thick ominous fog surrounds the area southeast of here. A\nneatly place miniature humanoid statues sit just at the path\'s edge. Two large\never-burning braziers sit at each corner of a large torii with a large braided\nrope barring the path.\n',44,1,36,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thorkell',1),
(4990,2,0,0,'Dark Woods','Many large trees of various sizes surround the area with a thick ominous white\nmist. There is no sign of wildlife nor the rustling of leaves, a blurry image is\nbehind the trees making this place quite eerie.  A large ancient tree just to\nthe southeast.',44,0,26,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thorkell',1),
